window.AKK_SPEND_STEPMOTHER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_SPEND_STEPMOTHER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Real CEO Dad","paragraphs":["Qi Mo came out of the bathroom, his bathrobe loosely wrapped around his body. His broad shoulders and narrow waist, along with his taut abdominal muscles, paired with the dim lighting, exuded an aura of sexuality.","Sheng Mumu was leaning against the edge of the bed, her alluring posture showing off her curves. Her red lips were slightly parted, seeming to pout and complain:","\"Qi Mo, are you not able to perform? Even when I'm like this you still won't touch me?\"","As the words fell, a strange look arose in the man's dark eyes.","Sheng Mumu, who had just transmigrated over, was also shocked by those words. Just now, a blinding white light had flashed before her eyes.","Sheng Mumu had transmigrated into the body of a character in a novel who shared her name, becoming the male lead's evil stepmother.","The handsome man with an elegant aura and striking figure before her eyes was not the male lead Qi Shaobai from the book.","Rather, he was the male lead's father.","The true CEO Daddy - Qi Mo.","Backlit, Sheng Mumu could not see the man's facial features clearly, but it was as if she could hear the solidification of the surrounding air.","The atmosphere had become extremely awkward.","Right before she transmigrated over, the original owner had been complaining that her new husband was unwilling to fulfill his marital duties.","The social death rating was a 10 out of 10!","Qi Mo's sharp and oppressive gaze slowly moved away, turning towards the bedside table.","Next to the wine glass, a conspicuous condom sat.","In Qi Mo's deep eyes, his emotions were indiscernible as he spoke in a low voice:","\"We just signed a prenuptial agreement last month. You're regretting it already and want a divorce so soon?\"","The prenup stated - pretending to be husband and wife, not actually consummating the marriage.","In his eyes, her words were tantamount to wanting to break the agreement prematurely.","Sheng Mumu had just transmigrated into the book and had not yet recovered from the shock.","She did not directly answer his words, and fell into contemplation while biting her fingertips.","The man had mentioned: only signing the prenuptial agreement last month.","So the original owner had married into the Qi family just a month ago.","That meant the male lead of the novel, Qi Shaobai, was only 17 years old now?","This novel started from when Qi Shaobai graduated from university, describing the love-hate entanglement between the gloomy young master of a wealthy family and the optimistic female lead.","The original owner was just a minor character in the book, with only a few hundred words total written about her.","Simply put, she was just a plot device to catalyze the male lead Qi Shaobai's rebelliousness in his youth.","Constantly sabotaging the relationship between father and son in the Qi family, wanting to give birth to her own child to truly become the Qi family matriarch.","The evil stepmother ultimately met a tragic end, being kicked out of the Qi household.","Thinking about that novel she had only read halfway through, Sheng Mumu couldn't help but gasp.","Based on the plot she remembered, the original owner was 28 years old this year.","Which happened to be exactly the same as her own age.","Thinking of this, she froze in astonishment.","Counting it up, the male lead's father Qi Mo should be 38 years old now.","But this man before her eyes didn't look anywhere close to 38 at all?","Before she could think more deeply, Qi Mo had already strode over with his long legs.","The man had a tall and well-proportioned figure, at least 188 cm.","As he walked closer and closer, his distinct and handsome face was carved even more clearly by the interplay of light and shadow.","His nose was straight and high, his deep eyes shrouded in layer upon layer of glistening light.","His skin was a cold pale hue, with a few beads of water lingering on his collarbone.","As he walked, the water droplets disappeared into the depths of his bathrobe, adding a touch of sexiness to his ascetic and aloof aura.","Sheng Mumu unconsciously swallowed, as a line flashed through her mind - a walking hormone.","She was increasingly certain that this definitely wasn't the physique of a 38 year old man.","Both desirous yet prohibitive.","Simply trampling upon her preferences.","The sensual lighting, burning incense in the room, wafting waves of ambiguous sweet fragrance over.","Before Qi Mo could ask again \"do you want an early divorce\", Sheng Mumu pulled over the quilt to cover up her lace negligee with its scarce material, decisively saying:","\"No divorce, no divorce. I drank too much, just drunken rambling.\"","Qi Mo's brow faintly moved, his gaze sweeping over the new wife's face before him, saying:","\"Are you certain?\"","He did not like forcing others.","If she wanted to leave, she could do so anytime.","The man's voice was steady and calm, yet Sheng Mumu felt an innate sense of oppression.","She fell silent for a while before heavily nodding in response.","\"Absolutely, definitely, and certainly!\"","Stumbling into great luck to get a card to experience transmigration and become the wealthy leisurely madam she had dreamed of being.","How could she get a divorce before properly enjoying the rich wife life?","She wouldn't do such an unprofitable deal.","Definitely not because her husband was too handsome.","And not because she could have the male lead of the novel as her son without experiencing the pains of childbirth.","The man gazed at the new wife mumbling to herself before him.","He could sense she was a bit different than before, but did not want to ask too much.","A husband and wife relationship established by just a sheet of paper, was no different than strangers.","He did not care about her abnormal behavior.","As long as she cooperated in playing the role of wife.","Anything else was unimportant.","\"Mm.\" He responded in a low and indifferent voice.","Then unhurriedly undid the tie of his bathrobe, placing the bathrobe to the side.","His naked upper body had taut and smooth musculature. His shoulders were very wide, then tapered sharply at the waist. His proportions could be called perfect.","From the corner of her eye, Sheng Mumu's earlobes couldn't help but turn red.","Soon after, the mattress beside her sank down a few centimeters as Qi Mo lifted up the quilt and got into bed.","The scent of soap mixed with the man's own fresh and clean aroma rushed into her nostrils.","Beneath the hazy bedroom lighting, his handsome eyebrows and eyes carried a hint of casualness.","His tone was low and indifferent.","\"Go to sleep.\"","After speaking, his shapely fingers lightly flipped the bedside lamp switch.","The light and his attractive voice faded away at the same time, instantly plunging the room into darkness.","Sheng Mumu felt complicated.","The palpable presence of the man beside her made her feel tightness in her chest, at a loss for where to place her hands.","Tossing and turning the entire night, she only fell asleep at first light.","When she woke up, it was already nearly 2pm. Qi Mo had long gone to work.","She could finally wander around her new home arranged by fate, without any psychological pressure.","Xiyu Yue Ting was located in the most prime land in the capital, with the Qi residence being the largest standalone villa in this lakeside community.","Altogether there were 8 bedrooms, 12 living rooms, 9 bathrooms, 5 balconies.","Home theater, gym, game room, wine cellar, everything was available.","Outside the villa was also a conservatory, swimming pool, and separate quarters for the domestic helpers.","Sheng Mumu gave it some careful thought - with her salary before transmigrating, she would have had to work hard for at least 3 generations to buy a house like this.","As an executive at a foreign company, her previous annual salary was not considered low, yet housing prices increased faster than her promotions. Right until she transmigrated into this world, she still hadn't saved enough for the down payment on that large apartment she had been eyeing.","However, being unable to afford it also had an advantage of being unable to afford it.","At least whenever her parents nagged her to get married, she could use \"buying a house first, talk about the rest later\" to stall for time.","After wandering around the villa until her legs ached, Sheng Mumu didn't feel tired at all.","The two big problems that had plagued her previously:","Saving up to buy a house, parents urging her to get married.","Were solved all at once!","What was there to be unsatisfied about?","\"Wow.\"","\"So big.\"","\"Oh my gosh!\"","The butler followed behind Sheng Mumu, maintaining a professional calm expression despite the occasional exclamations he heard.","Only when Sheng Mumu returned to sit on the leather sofa in the living room did he speak up to ask:","\"Madam, since you did not specifically instruct yesterday what you wanted to eat, I had the Chinese chef and Western chef both make a little something. Would you like to dine in the formal dining room, or should I bring it up to your room?\"","\"Let's go to the dining room.\"","Only when Sheng Mumu sat down at the long dining table did she realize what the butler meant by \"made a little something\".","Chinese and Western dishes piled up the table, along with exquisitely plated desserts.","Mm, indeed just a bit..."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: Half a million a month Pocket Money","paragraphs":["Reading Tip: To prevent incomplete content, please do not use browser reading mode.","Before picking up her chopsticks, Sheng Mumu sincerely said \"Thank you\" to the housekeeper.","The housekeeper was stunned for a moment.","\"No need to thank me, madam. This is all part of my job.\"","How strange.","The madam seems a little different from usual today.","Usually whether the master is home or not, madam would put on an air of superiority towards the housekeeper and servants.","But today she actually said thank you, and seemed...sincere?","Before the housekeeper could figure out why, he heard Sheng Mumu ask again:","\"Housekeeper Zhang, have you eaten yet? Do you want to eat a little with me?\"","With a full table of dishes, Sheng Mumu felt it would be wasteful to eat alone, so she extended a \"friendly invitation\".","The housekeeper was honored and quickly shook his head.","\"No...no need, madam.\"","Even stranger.","Could it be that the young master, who is going through his rebellious teenage years, did something to drastically change the madam's temperament?","She's like a whole different person.","Oh right, today is Friday. The young master said he was bringing friends over to play tonight.","The madam seems to be in a good mood now. I wonder if she'll get angry and slam doors later?","Thinking of this, Housekeeper Zhang's eyes showed more sympathy and helplessness.","Sympathy for Sheng Mumu's hardship as a stepmother, and helplessness towards the young master's aloof and difficult personality.","The maid saw that Sheng Mumu had finished her meal, bowed her head slightly and came forward.","\"Madam, the bathroom has been prepared according to your instructions yesterday.\"","Sheng Mumu raised her eyes: \"?\"","Yesterday?","That must have been the original host's instructions before she transmigrated here.","The maid led Sheng Mumu into the master bedroom's bathroom.","Just a bathroom, yet bigger than the house she lived in in her previous life, about 200 square meters.","Outside the large floor-to-ceiling windows, trees were lush and green. The glass was one-way, so she could see outside but no one could see in.","The bathtub, about the size of a small swimming pool, was filled with water of a comfortable temperature. Faint steam rose up, and a sweet fragrance lingered in the air.","Next to it was a porcelain plate of fresh seasonal fruits.","There was also a bowl of black liquid that looked like melted turtle jelly.","Sheng Mumu picked up the bowl and sniffed it.","The smell was extremely bitter, like medicine.","After just inhaling half a breath, her eyebrows immediately furrowed as she pinched her nose and held the bowl farther away.","She couldn't figure out what was in the bowl.","Seeing the lady of the house pinching her nose, the maid timely came up, posture respectful.","\"Madam, Chinese medicine is bitter. I've prepared sweet soup for you.\"","She continued in a lowered voice, sounding slightly mysterious:","\"The essential oil used is orange blossom, it has invigorating effects.\"","\"I hope it will help Madam achieve your wish of conceiving an heir soon.\"","After saying her fawning, flattering words, the maid quietly exited the room.","Leaving behind a suddenly enlightened Sheng Mumu, who blinked her eyes awkwardly.","Invigorating???","Conceiving an heir soon???","So this black water was something like fertility medicine from palace struggle novels...","Looks like the original host thought she'd definitely get Qi Mo to sleep with her last night, and had even considered recuperating afterwards.","Who knew there was a change of heart midway.","Sheng Mumu's lips flattened slightly as she poured the medicine into the pool.","She couldn't help but think of the novel's brief description of how this marriage came about -","By chance, the original host had saved Qi Mo's grandmother who fainted on the street. The old lady took a liking to her and strongly matched her with her grandson.","The original host fell in love at first sight, but Qi Mo was uninterested.","The original host approached Qi Mo and proposed the idea of a contract marriage.","For Qi Mo, marrying her could fulfill his grandmother's wish, so he agreed.","The conditions were a monthly allowance of 500,000 yuan, and a peaceful divorce with a huge sum of money after the old lady's passing in a hundred years.","In front of the mirror.","Sheng Mumu stared fixedly at this face that looked exactly like her own, feeling surreal.","In the past, many people had praised her good looks. Seeing her remain single as she struggled in her career for many years, some even joked:","\"With your stunning beauty, you should find and marry a rich man while you're still young, so you can live in comfort for the rest of your life. Working a nine-to-five job when your beauty is a scarce resource is simply not worth it.\"","At that time, she had scoffed at them.","Yet she didn't expect that after transmigrating into a book, she really became the kind of person they described.","In the mirror was a melon-seed shaped face the size of her palm.","Alluring fox-like eyes, a dainty, perky nose.","In the steamy bathroom, her cheeks were slightly flushed, making her snow-white skin even fairer.","When she smiled, her eyebrows arched into a curved slope, and two little pear vortexes sank in, neutralizing the aggressiveness of her stunning looks.","The woman in the mirror knitted her brows slightly.","Thinking of the original host's miserable ending, Sheng Mumu let out a sigh.","\"Alas.\"","The original host's tragedy was because she was blinded by love, and wanted with all her heart to become the real Mrs. Qi.","Fortunately the current her was not lovesick.","As long as she didn't make trouble between her fake husband and stepson,","She should be able to avoid the tragic ending and live an uneventful life as a rich widow, right?","Thinking of her stepson, her expression became more solemn.","She then opened her phone with a serious look on her face.","Cramming hastily, she read various posts to learn knowledge she did not possess.","【The Six Principles to Follow Between Stepmother and Stepson】","【As a Stepmother, How to Handle Family Relations Properly? 】","【How Should a Stepmother Get Along With a Rebellious Child?】","A few hours later.","Sheng Mumu was tired from reading, so she went to the kitchen to get a bowl of bird's nest and returned to her room.","Just as she reached the second floor, she suddenly heard several energetic youthful voices coming from the entrance.","\"Young Master Qi, your house is so big. This is my first time here.\"","\"Young Master Qi, your stepmother isn't home today right?\"","\"I haven't met your stepmother yet. I heard she's only eleven years older than you?\"","Hearing the voices, Sheng Mumu stopped in her tracks, leaning against the railing on the second floor. She stirred the small silver spoon in her hand, curiosity aroused.","She had read many novels and watched lots of TV shows.","She wondered what the male lead of the novel, Young Master Qi, would look like.","The Qi residence was huge. In the time it took the high school students to take off their shoes at the entrance and walk in, they had already made many guesses about Young Master Qi's stepmother.","\"Young Master Qi's stepmother must be very beautiful right.\"","\"I don't know if she's beautiful or not, but she must be very scheming, definitely not someone to provoke easily.\"","\"That's what I think too. Maybe the more beautiful she is, the more vicious.\"","Amidst the idle chatter, a handsome youth appeared in her line of sight.","Among the group of sixteen, seventeen-year-old high school students, Qi Shaobai stood out strikingly.","He had the standard face of a campus novel male lead.","Delicate features with a hint of arrogance and defiance. Cold, piercing eyes. He looked to be at least 183cm tall.","He wore a simple charcoal gray t-shirt with minimalistic branding, a red headband around his forehead. He looked melancholy yet bold, perhaps the trendy Japanese-style fashion for youths in this world.","Ha.","Observing Qi Shaobai, Sheng Mumu laughed silently in her heart.","Looks like not all novel male leads appear in their peak state right from the start.","The male lead in his teens, no matter how good-looking, had a slender figure.","To her he was still just a little rascal.","Amidst her thoughts, another soft, trembling voice floated up:","\"Umm... Young Master Qi, will your stepmother be very fierce? I'm a little scared...\"","Sheng Mumu frowned and looked towards the voice.","The speaker was a girl with long black hair. She had an innocent look but her gaze was not innocent at all. She was timidly wringing her fingers as she looked at Qi Shaobai.","Seeing this, Sheng Mumu's scam radar started beeping, issuing an alert.","Someone replied to the girl:","\"What's there to be scared of? I heard Young Master Qi's stepmother comes from an ordinary family. How dare she yell at Young Master Qi?\"","Another person chimed in:","\"That's right, this is Young Master Qi's home. Does she still want us to watch her face? No way!\"","\"Well said. Later if we run into Young Master Qi's stepmother, I absolutely won't acknowledge her. This shows that I firmly stand with Young Master Qi.\"","\"Me too.\"","\"Me too.\""]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Oh, Want to play the gentle stepmother","paragraphs":["Listening to these young punks talk, Sheng Mumu felt both amused and wistful.","The novel mentioned that Qi Shaobai deliberately behaved rebelliously during high school in order to get adults' attention.","Bringing his classmates home to play today was probably also due to this consideration.","Just then, Qi Shaobai glanced upstairs.","His gaze unexpectedly collided with Sheng Mumu's regretful yet affectionate one.","Their eyes met, and Sheng Mumu pulled up the corners of her mouth in a faint smile.","Qi Shaobai was stunned for a moment, \"?\"","As the central figure of the little clique, Qi Shaobai's every move was closely watched by the others.","Noticing his change in expression, the others followed his gaze and craned their necks to look upstairs, spotting Sheng Mumu.","After all, high schoolers still feared adults. The boys who were just gossiping about Qi Shaobai's stepmother immediately tucked away their brashness when they saw her in person.","Someone patted Qi Shaobai on the shoulder and casually asked:","\"Qi Shaobai, who's this pretty older sister?\"","Qi Shaobai's brows furrowed as he glared at the boy and said coldly:","\"If you can't speak properly, then don't speak at all.\"","The boy covered his mouth in surprise and lowered his voice to ask:","\"She's not your stepmom, is she?\"","Qi Shaobai neither confirmed nor denied it.","He ignored Sheng Mumu's existence and lazily sat down on the sofa.","\"Don't mind her, let's just do our own thing.\"","From Qi Shaobai's reaction, the group could now confirm that this beautiful woman really was his stepmother!","Perhaps because the smiling, gentle woman before them did not fit their imagined image of a vicious stepmother, the high schoolers instantly remembered their manners as guests in someone else's home.","One boy took the lead in calling out, \"Auntie!\"","Loud, crisp shouts of \"Auntie!\" immediately echoed from downstairs.","The address made Sheng Mumu jump in shock.","Although she was only 28 and not exactly young, she had never been called \"Auntie\" before.","The chorus of \"Auntie\" made her suddenly feel 20 years older.","Qi Shaobai leaned lazily on the sofa, his gaze drifting leisurely upstairs.","At that moment, Sheng Mumu got a clear look at Qi Shaobai's face.","His features were cold and aloof, with a nonchalance unique to teenagers.","To describe the feeling abstractly, it was as if every glance conveyed \"How annoying.\"","His features were like an unfinished sculpture, already showing the contours of a future tyrant.","Time would slowly carve this face into an even more exquisite one.","But...","Sheng Mumu's eyes darkened.","A doubt grew stronger and stronger in her heart.","Qi Shaobai looked nothing like Qi Mo.","Were Qi Shaobai and Qi Mo really father and son?","Sheng Mumu suppressed her doubts and smiled at the group of high schoolers downstairs, responding:","\"Hello everyone, welcome to our home. Don't be restrained, make yourselves at home.\"","She made her tone as cheerful and youthful as possible, hoping to dilute the \"Auntie\" blow.","After she spoke, the teenage boys were shocked.","They hadn't expected Qi Shaobai's stepmother to not only be a great beauty, but also a gentle, friendly one.","She was completely unlike the vicious stepmother they had imagined.","The boys who earlier clamored about \"absolutely not acknowledging her\" now scratched their heads sheepishly as they politely responded,","\"Sorry to bother you, Auntie.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","After greeting them, Sheng Mumu returned to the master bedroom.","When she herself was a teenager, she would always shut her bedroom door, unwilling to be disturbed by her parents. Now, in their shoes, she also didn't want to be the nosy stepmother.","It was best to give the downstairs space entirely to them, so they wouldn't feel constrained by an adult presence at home.","In the living room.","Some boys played video games, others played poker.","Qi Shaobai listlessly scrolled through his phone, his eyes seeming to drift upstairs from time to time.","Strange.","Seeing him bring a whole group of people home to play, that woman didn't show a hint of anger at all.","Was she trying to put on an act and play the gentle stepmother?","Ridiculous.","There must be some scheme behind her sudden thoughtfulness.","Just then, two bulging plastic bags full of snacks were set down on the coffee table in front of him.","Maid: \"Young Master, the Madam just told me to go buy these snacks.\"","\"What?\" Qi Shaobai's eyes narrowed as he glanced toward the master bedroom upstairs. \"She told you to go buy snacks for me?\"","What kind of joke was this?","It wasn't April Fool's day today.","The maid nodded firmly.","\"Yes, the Madam told me to go buy all of these. The Madam also said that if you want milk tea, to go buy it for you. Young Master, would you like milk tea?\"","The maid was equally shocked.","The sun was rising in the west today.","The Madam was actually voluntarily showing concern for the Young Master, and while the Master wasn't home at that.","Qi Shaobai was conflicted inside but still wore an impatient expression on the surface:","\"...Don't want it.\"","Wei Zhaonan pulled out a bag of chips from the bag, tore it open, and stuffed it into his mouth:","\"Little Bai, your stepmom's pretty nice, even better than my own mom.\"","Wei Zhaonan had been buddies with Qi Shaobai since middle school. When he learned Qi Shaobai's dad had remarried, he sincerely suggested that Qi Shaobai be wary of the stepmother.","It was rare for even one out of ten stepmothers to be a decent person.","But after seeing her today, Wei Zhaonan's opinion was beginning to change a little.","Qi Shaobai looked away, disdainful of a response: \"You know nothing.\"","Who knew what schemes she had up her sleeve.","Her sudden thoughtfulness must be up to no good.","\"Hey, did you bring the new CD from the Black Train band?\" Qi Shaobai suddenly asked.","Wei Zhaonan: \"Yeah, it's in my bag.\"","\"Put it on to listen.\"","The penetrating German heavy metal blasted at maximum volume. Qi Shaobai deliberately waited for Sheng Mumu to lose her patience and scold him, exposing her true vicious stepmother nature.","It was as if he wanted to prove that his judgment of her would not be wrong.","Upstairs in the master bedroom.","Sheng Mumu was playing on her phone.","Suddenly, deafening music sounded from downstairs.","The ear-piercing noise made her ears hurt, and she sighed helplessly.","Oh well...","It seemed that appeasing rebellious teenagers through a mother's gentle smile and special care and concern, as the internet suggested, didn't actually work.","Those online tips were nonsense.","She might as well act naturally and be herself. Trying to put on a loving stepmom act felt too forced.","Not long after, the master bedroom door was slowly pushed open.","Qi Shaobai sneered when he saw it out of the corner of his eye.","Humph, she finally couldn't stand it huh.","A complicated emotion rose in his heart, though his expression remained indifferent.","He waited for the scolding that was about to come."]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Your stepmother is so hip.","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Sheng Mumu came downstairs, with a calm expression on her face as she walked towards the home theater room on the first floor.","There wasn't the slightest hint of displeasure in her expression.","Qi Shaobai watched her out of the corner of his eye.","Sensing Qi Shaobai's gaze, Sheng Mumu turned her head to the side. When her eyes met Qi Shaobai's, she suddenly held up her hand, extending her index finger and pinky to make the metal horns gesture.","She then casually strolled into the home theater with her hands in her pockets.","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Seeing this scene, Wei Zhaonan was surprised and nudged Qi Shaobai with his shoulder.","\"Damn, your stepmom is so cool, she even knows the metal horns gesture?\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned for half a second before contemptuously spitting out two words from between his teeth:","\"Childish...\"","After Sheng Mumu closed the door of the home theater room, she sighed nostalgically as she looked up.","Back in the day, she was also a rocker girl who loved going to music festivals and watching live performances.","In the blink of an eye she was twenty-eight, finding herself in an unfamiliar world.","It felt so unreal!","The walls of the home theater room were lined with thick soundproofing material. Once the door was closed, the sounds from outside became faint. No matter how loud the music was outside, it could not disturb her.","Thinking back to Qi Shaobai's bewildered gaze as she passed through the living room, she somehow found it rather amusing.","Tsk, a punk kid is still a punk kid, with all his emotions written on his face.","Just thinking that this boy would grow up to become the stoic and taciturn male lead in the future, she suddenly felt a sense of humor that was hard to describe.","The joy of a cultivation-themed story had arrived all at once.","But then her smile froze as her expression became solemn.","She suddenly recalled an important plot point from the book—","When Qi Shaobai first developed feelings for the female protagonist, the first supporting character to come out and stir up trouble was his high school classmate. She kept creating misunderstandings between the male and female leads.","The biggest misunderstanding was that during high school, a group of friends had gone to Qi Shaobai's house to hang out. The supporting character took advantage of Qi Shaobai being unaware to slip something into his drink and get him drunk. She then pretended to have been taken advantage of by his drunken state.","Qi Shaobai was fooled, and from then on felt an inexplicable sense of responsibility towards the supporting character.","Sheng Mumu hadn't finished reading the book. Up until halfway through, the supporting character was still making trouble, constantly using their past to coerce Qi Shaobai into taking responsibility for her.","Sheng Mumu faintly felt that something was off.","Could it be that this plot point that was glossed over in the original book was happening today?","Just now, the black-haired girl with braids who had timidly called Qi Shaobai \"Brother Qi\"—from her appearance, she was a perfect match for the supporting character's description.","As Sheng Mumu thought this, she slowly pressed down on the door handle of the home theater room.","Like a spy, she quietly observed through the crack in the door.","She saw the black-haired girl sneakily take out a packet from her pocket, then cautiously look around.","Even though the home theater room was in a corner that was not easily visible, Sheng Mumu still nervously broke into a sweat.","Shortly after, the girl inconspicuously sat down next to Qi Shaobai.","Just as Qi Shaobai turned his head to chat with Wei Zhaonan, her hand stealthily moved above his glass on the table.","Sheng Mumu's heart tightened.","It really was today!","This dogblood plot point that had caused misunderstandings between Qi Shaobai and his future girlfriend for at least dozens of chapters was happening right before her eyes.","Perhaps in the original storyline, there were no adults home at the Qi house today.","But since she had transmigrated into this world and seen these punk kids, she could not just sit back and do nothing.","Otherwise, people might say that the vicious stepmother had intentionally turned a blind eye and allowed her stepson to do something wrong.","Sheng Mumu suddenly thought of Qi Mo's stern and impressive face that was capable of intimidation without anger.","She could almost see herself being kicked out after this incident came to light.","No way, she had just become a wealthy madame of a prestigious family yesterday!","If she was swept out because of this, wouldn't that be a huge loss?","In the living room.","After finishing his conversation with Wei Zhaonan, Qi Shaobai turned back around.","He casually picked up the glass in front of him and tilted his head back, just about to drink it.","\"Qi Shaobai—\"","A slender figure dashed out from the home theater room, loudly calling out his name to interrupt him.","Qi Shaobai stopped his actions and glanced over, lifting his eyes.","Seeing Sheng Mumu suddenly appear, the corners of his eyebrows ticked up slightly.","Hmph, she's finally unable to keep pretending to be a gentle mother.","Is she going to yell at me in front of everyone?","A self-deprecating yet unsurprised laugh slipped from Qi Shaobai's lips.","His voice was rebellious yet lazy.","\"What is it?\"","Sheng Mumu came up with a clever plan on the spot. As she spoke, she blew out some air as if she had been burnt by something spicy.","\"I just ate spicy duck tongues, my drink is finished. Water, give me your water.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned.","He had been prepared to get chewed out, but had not expected Sheng Mumu to come find him because she needed water after being burnt by spicy food.","Everyone else also focused their attention on Sheng Mumu, completely baffled.","They were a little surprised that Qi Shaobai and his stepmother's relationship didn't seem as bad as they had assumed.","The lady was so cute, like a child she had come to find him for water after being burnt by spicy food. Her manner of speaking to Qi Shaobai seemed natural and casual. The two of them appeared to have quite a good relationship.","Qi Shaobai was awkward for a few seconds, but still handed over the glass that he had not drunk from yet.","As Sheng Mumu took the glass, her peripheral vision drifted towards the black-haired girl.","The girl's hands were clenched tightly into fists. She was biting down hard on her lower lip with her gaze fixed intensely on the glass. She looked extremely nervous.","Sheng Mumu was now mostly certain of her judgment—there must have been drugs put into the glass.","She sniffed at the glass, deliberately putting on a confused expression as she asked Qi Shaobai:","\"Is this beer you're drinking?\"","Hearing this, Qi Shaobai leaned back lazily into the sofa and casually responded:","\"Yeah, what's wrong with that?\"","The Qi family didn't have any rules against 17-year-olds drinking beer, right?","Without answering him, Sheng Mumu waved her hand and walked towards the kitchen, lightly tossing over her shoulder:","\"Your dad doesn't like me drinking, I'll just go to the kitchen and get some iced water.\"","This allowed her to bring the glass to the kitchen in a natural way.","Qi Shaobai was puzzled.","With suspicion, he furrowed his brows.","His dad, who had always been calm, composed, unconcerned with others, and was like a money-making machine without emotions—","Would actually care about such minor issues as whether someone else drank alcohol or not?","Seeing this, the other people in the living room couldn't help but laugh and tease.","\"Qi Shaobai, your stepmom is so interesting. She's a full grown adult but still came to find you for water after being burnt by spicy food, hahaha.\"","\"Your stepmom seems to have a good relationship with your dad. She doesn't drink just because your dad doesn't like her drinking, wow.\"","\"Feels like I just got force-fed dog food?\"","Amidst everyone's back and forth banter, Qi Shaobai gazed at Sheng Mumu's retreating figure with complex emotions.","This time, he did not talk back to their jokes.","Sheng Mumu chose not to expose the truth in front of everyone.","Firstly, because she was worried—since she had transmigrated into the book's world, the storyline might have already changed. She couldn't be certain the plot point would definitely happen, so making false accusations would be bad.","Secondly, she didn't want to put on a detective performance in front of these bratty kids, when she just wanted to be a relaxed and wealthy madame.","It wasn't until Qi Shaobai's friends had left that Sheng Mumu knocked on the door of his room.","Qi Shaobai lazily opened the door to see her standing outside. His brows ticked up.","\"What's up?\""]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Fuck who Fuck her","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu stood outside the door, looking calmly at Qi Shaobai.","\"I know you don't have a good impression of me, but I need to communicate this matter with you to avoid misunderstandings caused by information asymmetry.\"","She was mainly worried that she would be unjustly blamed in the future.","Qi Shaobai was puzzled by Sheng Mumu's words, which were unlike her previous stepmotherly attitude. He slowly opened his mouth:","\"What's the matter?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Someone put something in your drink just now, it was that girl with black hair.\"","Qi Shaobai's expression gradually changed from indifference to surprise.","\"Something was added?\"","Sheng Mumu nodded, \"Yes, I saw it with my own eyes.\"","\"I don't know exactly what it was, but whatever it is, doing something sneaky like that is not right.\"","She paused and thought for a while before deciding to add another sentence:","\"Handsome boys need to learn to protect themselves. You...need to be more careful when you're outside in the future.\"","She spoke very tactfully, afraid of provoking the rebelliousness of the adolescent boy.","The more he is told not to do something, the more he wants to do it.","Finally, she didn't forget to praise him positively:","\"Okay, I won't nag too much. I believe you can handle it well.\"","After all, he is the future male lead, with intelligence and observational skills that are unmatched. There is no need to worry that he will go astray, just steer him back on the right path a little earlier.","Qi Shaobai gazed silently at Sheng Mumu.","He couldn't remember how many times today he had been shocked by Sheng Mumu's bewildering words.","Qi Shaobai slowly nodded, and emitted a muffled \"Mm\" from his chest.","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","She stood there in a daze for a few seconds.","Tilting her head, she chuckled lightly.","Ha.","Awkward and aloof little brat.","He probably wanted to say thank you?","This little interlude did not substantially promote the stepmother-stepson relationship between the two.","But at least Sheng Mumu confirmed one thing -","So far, her impression on Qi Shaobai was not too bad. As long as she didn't make trouble, there shouldn't be serious conflicts leading her to be kicked out of the Qi family.","After settling the most critical issue, she finally had the mind to tidy up the issue she cared most about: her financial situation.","After some investigation, she found that the original owner had two bank cards.","One was a supplementary card given to her by Qi Mo, with no deposits but unlimited spending.","The other was her personal bank card.","\"This should be the card used to deposit the monthly 50,000 living expenses, right?\"","She thought to herself while logging into the banking app with the card number.","When she saw the number displayed on the phone screen, her expression instantly froze.","[Current Balance: $0.50]","Boom-","She seemed to hear the sound of her rich woman dreams shattering.","The balance of fifty cents glared at her.","How could she be so poor?","Could it be that the original owner had some hidden illness and used the money for medical treatment?","That's how those abusive novels usually write it.","Soon, she dismissed this idea.","The original, as a vicious female supporting character described in less than 500 words in the book, was not worth the author spending too much effort on her backstory. Her life would not be so dog-blooded.","Soon, she finally found out where the original owner's deposits had gone.","The bank statement showed that there had been two transfers of 50,000 from Qi Mo into the card.","But shortly after receiving the money, she immediately transferred it out again.","After searching for \"transfer\" in WeChat, a contact named \"Brother\" appeared on the screen.","Sheng Mumu clicked open the chat and scrolled through the phone, her face gradually sinking.","Her expression changed from curiosity to anger to rage.","The \"Brother\" was the original owner's own brother, Sheng Lei.","From the conversation between the two, it could be seen that the original owner was a \"brother-doting\" type.","Before marrying into the Qi family, Sheng Lei would only occasionally ask the original owner for \"loans\" of 5,000 or 10,000.","After the original owner married into the Qi family, he directly made huge demands, not only asking for money more frequently, but also increasingly large sums.","In WeChat, the original owner had repeatedly expressed that she would not give him another penny.","In return, there were repeated threats.","Sheng Lei: \"If you don't give it to me, I'll go ask brother-in-law to borrow.\"","Sheng Lei: \"You married into a wealthy family and don't recognize your own relatives? Heartless profiteer, if mom and dad were still alive, seeing you like this would kill them too.\"","F*ck!","Sheng Mumu swore out loud.","What kind of garbage man is this?","She tapped the screen with her fingers, making a lot of noise, and blocked Sheng Lei in just a few clicks.","Since this body had changed to her, she would naturally act according to her own thinking.","She certainly wouldn't let trash relatives like Sheng Lei endlessly exploit and bleed her dry.","*","In the following week, Sheng Mumu gradually got used to this world.","Including but not limited to realizing just how wealthy the Qi family was.","She felt like she hadn't crossed into a book, but into a sea of money.","From the butler she learned that the villa in Xiyu Yue Ting was just one of Qi Mo's many properties.","In winter and summer, the butler would arrange for the out-of-town villas to be tidied up, for the convenience of the owners to enjoy the snow or escape the heat.","Wave after wave of shocks came one after another.","To the point that when she saw the countless luxurious jewelry and expensive watches in the drawer, she was already numb.","What made her happiest wasn't these things.","But the other two people who lived in this world with her.","Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai.","They perfectly matched her ideal of a good husband and good stepson - invisible.","After that first meeting when she had just arrived, Qi Mo flew to the UK for business the next day and never saw each other again.","Qi Mo lay quietly in her phone contacts like a \"dead man\".","On the other hand, Qi Shaobai was at the end of the second term of his sophomore year of high school.","The school had set up a one-month cram session for them to get an early experience of the intense study pace of senior year.","Sheng Mumu slept late and got up early, barely running into Qi Shaobai at all.","She was living the life she had most wanted to become before.","Rich, beautiful, and ample free time.","Plus a husband who was like \"dead\"!","Who was so damn happy?","She was so damn happy!","However, she was happy too soon.","That day, she was just lying in bed, applying a face mask worth 1,000 yuan per piece, when her phone suddenly rang.","On the screen, the words \"Husband\" stared back at her.","It gave her a shock.","It felt like being suddenly spotted slacking off at work by the boss.","The call connected.","Qi Mo's low voice:","\"Hello?\"","Reading Guide:","1. Clean romance, light and sweet. Fall in love after marriage.","2. Actual age gap between male and female lead is 4 years, male lead changed his age publicly.","3. The son is not the male lead's biological child, his origins will be revealed later.","4. Creating is not easy, if you don't like it please be kind with your words, Fandou still has many good stories, I hope you can find one you like.","Finally, please add this to your library, bowing to express thanks~"]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Appearing as Mrs. Keyes","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu was conflicted. Responding with \"Hello, how are you\" seemed too aloof. Responding with \"Hello, darling\" felt too intimate. Before she could say anything, Qi Mo's magnetic, pleasant voice came through, vibrating her eardrums until they nearly melted.","\"There's a cocktail party the day after tomorrow. Come with me. Dong Tezhu will pick you up then. Get yourself ready.\"","After hanging up, Sheng Mumu pondered for a long time over what Qi Mo meant by \"get yourself ready.\"","What did she need to prepare for?","After some careful consideration, she came to the conclusion—it was time to act.","She had to be ready to perform!","Since they were in a contractual marriage, of course they had the obligation to pretend to be loving in front of others, to avoid revealing any cracks.","In order not to reveal any nervousness at the cocktail party, Sheng Mumu opened her phone and searched for information on Qi Mo online.","As she typed in Qi Mo's name, she gave an embarrassed little laugh.","She had been here for so long, only thinking about eating and drinking, yet hadn't bothered to learn anything about what kind of person Qi Mo was.","How careless. She had forgotten to investigate her food, clothing, and shelter.","What she didn't know shocked her when she found out.","Qi Mo's background was outstanding to the point of eliciting universal envy.","At 23, Qi Mo had shown great talent in IT. The software he wrote himself was purchased at a high price by a foreign company, earning him his first pot of gold.","After that, he started a company focused on computer software. The company gradually developed into a group and became a diversified internet enterprise.","Strangely, during the years the company was rapidly developing, Qi Mo never appeared publicly at any occasion.","It wasn't until he was 32, when the company went public, that he first appeared in front of the media.","After the IPO, the company hit the daily limit 20 days in a row, instantly making him the nouveau riche of the Beijing social scene.","A handsome new tycoon suddenly came into view, attracting endless discussion.","Many elite young ladies of Beijing's prominent families flocked to him, hoping to become the enviable Mrs. Qi.","It was around then that Qi Mo announced to the outside world that he had an 11-year-old son.","Later came the low-key news of his remarriage this year.","The news mentioned that his new Mrs. Qi came from an ordinary family background.","Sheng Mumu scrolled on her screen and opened a discussion thread.","—\"Does anyone have a photo of Mrs. Qi from the second marriage? I'm dying to know what she looks like!\"","—\"There's no information to be found online about Qi's first wife. His second wife probably won't show her face in public either.\"","—\"I just heard that Mrs. Qi is an ordinary nobody. Does the Cinderella story really happen in real life?\"","—\"Get real. Cinderella may have been impoverished, but her father still had a title. Don't be fooled by fairy tales.\"","—\"No matter what she looks like, one thing's for sure—she must have saved the Milky Way in her last life, hahaha.\"","—\"She must be sly, think about it. So many women want to marry Qi Mo, yet an unknown woman with no background or face to show somehow snagged the position. She must be extremely crafty to capture a man's heart like that!\"","—\"It must be a marriage of business and political interests. She probably doesn't want to reveal her background so they say she's a nobody. I bet she's an ugly daughter of some high official. Most likely a fat woman.\"","Sheng Mumu sat up in bed, her expression solemn.","It seemed the cocktail party the day after tomorrow would be her first public appearance as Mrs. Qi.","She must not give these online trash-talkers an opportunity to criticize her.","She had to make a beautiful appearance!","She had to act lovingly with her pretend husband!","The next day, Sheng Mumu had the housekeeper drive her to a beauty salon. She got a full makeover from head to toe.","When she left the beauty salon, her hair to her toenails smelled fragrant.","Qi Mo's assistant Dong Tezhu had contacted Sheng Mumu. From him she learned that this cocktail party was a social gathering for the wealthy with a touch of charity. Many of Beijing's rich would be there with their families.","She had seen this kind of cocktail party before in TV shows and novels.","The men would talk business over drinks while the women competed over beauty and gossiped.","However, to Sheng Mumu, going to the cocktail party was like \"going to work.\"","Qi Mo provided her with a superior material lifestyle, and she simply had to properly play the role of his wife.","It was equivalent to working.","Dong Tezhu said there would be a lot of media there, specifically to take pictures of the legendary mysterious Mrs. Qi.","To firmly rely on her \"boss\", she had to perform well.","Sheng Mumu deeply understood this principle.","Appearing in front of the cameras, she had to look beautiful above all.","Sheng Mumu looked exactly like the original owner, just with a completely different style.","The original owner's wardrobe was mostly filled with gentle, girl-next-door items.","Sheng Mumu preferred the Hong Kong-inspired style of red lips and big waves.","She picked out a flowing dark red dress that highlighted her curves without being overly revealing.","There was some traffic on the way to the cocktail party. By the time she arrived, Qi Mo was already inside.","The grand banquet hall was lavishly decorated in gold and jade.","Men and women dressed in their finest were scattered about in groups of two or three.","Some spoke in hushed voices:","\"Do you think Mrs. Qi will show up today?\"","\"I bet not. Rumor has it she's an ugly nobody. She probably can't even fit into a formal dress.\" The speaker covered her mouth and tittered.","A young woman brushed her hair and said in surprise,","\"Can you really trust rumors? If that's true, I'm going to try my hardest to become Mrs. Qi the third.\"","\"Forget it. So many elite young ladies are waiting for Qi Mo to get divorced. You won't even make the list.\"","\"The version I heard is different. They said she's just an ordinary person.\"","\"If she's not beautiful, yet Qi Mo was still willing to marry her, tsk tsk, that woman must be very skilled in capturing a man's heart.\"","\"Pfft, who doesn't know Qi is a workaholic? She's just a stepmother. How much could he love her? He just picked a random woman to come back and take care of his son.\"","\"Hehehe, possible...\"","The laughter stopped abruptly as everyone's gaze focused in unison toward the banquet hall entrance.","A beautiful woman was standing there, holding up her skirt.","The attendant opened the banquet hall door and walked alongside Sheng Mumu, guiding her, \"Mrs. Qi, Mr. Qi is over there.\"","From afar, Sheng Mumu immediately recognized Qi Mo.","In the crowd, he stood out with the most outstanding temperament and handsomest appearance. Very recognizable.","Qi Mo held a wine glass, surrounded by a group of people flattering him. His expression was aloof and indifferent.","Different from when she had seen him last time.","The Qi Mo today exuded the elite successful businessman vibe from head to toe.","The well-fitted suit highlighted his straight, tall figure even more.","Graceful and refined in speech and movement, yet vaguely emitting a coldness that kept others at arm's length.","Sheng Mumu didn't pause and walked toward Qi Mo.","Along the way, she attracted many gazes.","The long dress accentuated her sensual curves. The neckline wasn't too low, alluring without being vulgar.","Her chestnut hair cascaded down, curled into big waves at the ends, swept to one side to reveal her jade-white neck. Scarlet lips beckoned lusciously, sexy but not cheap.","The banquet hall lights had a built-in soft focus effect that made her seem to glow all over, tiny specks of light glittering in her eyes.","Qi Mo's gaze happened to sweep over.","Their eyes met, and Sheng Mumu slowly raised the corners of her lips.","Dimples appeared as she smiled faintly. Absolutely breathtaking beauty.","Qi Mo's eyes flickered almost imperceptibly.","This was the first time he had seen her dress up like this.","Previously, she had always appeared before him with a gentle image, often wearing light pink, sky blue, or duck yellow.","The Sheng Mumu in the red dress now radiated dazzling brilliance. Captivating from every angle.","Her curled hair ends traced lively arcs through the air as she walked.","Sheng Mumu came over, slipped her snow-white arm around his neck, and called in a sweet voice that even she found saccharine, \"Darling~\""]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Don't give up your little wife.","paragraphs":["Originally, the people standing around Qi Mo unconsciously exchanged glances.","The air froze for a second.","The men around had eyes full of envy.","Admiring that as expected, having money is good, able to marry such a beauty as his wife.","The eyes of the women around were also envious.","Envying Qi Mo, who was usually aloof and abstinent, actually allowing this woman to snuggle up to his neck acting like a spoiled child.","Simply unheard of.","Qi Mo really lived up to being a man who had seen all kinds of occasions, his broad palm easily wrapped around her slender waist.","His voice was low and magnetic:","\"You're here.\"","It was a statement.","Coming from his seductive deep voice, it somehow had a feeling of eagerness in waiting for his new bride.","Sheng Mumu took a light breath, her back stiffening.","The pair of big hands around her waist, separated only by her clothes, gave off a faint warmth.","The palms controlled the distance, appropriately rubbing lightly a few times, as if to soothe her.","Being so close to smell Qi Mo's pleasant scent, she was dizzy and infatuated.","It was unbearable.","Truly unbearable.","This man was constantly seducing her unconsciously.","On occasions like today where they pretended to be a sweet couple, who knows if after a few more times she would truly want to get on his pirate ship.","\"This is Mrs. Qi right? Famous without meeting, truly a great beauty.\"","\"Qi is so fortunate!\"","\"I've never seen Mrs. Qi before, was she a celebrity before?\"","\"Mrs. Qi has to attend more cocktail parties and auctions in the future!\"","\"Hahaha, Qi don't be stingy with your little wife...\"","...","Compliments came flooding towards them like waves.","Qi Mo's lips curved, occasionally answering a couple sentences, but most of the time using a faint smile to respond.","Refined yet aloof.","In the middle of conversing, Sheng Mumu's hand slid down from Qi Mo's neck.","Well, since they were acting, she didn't need to keep hanging on him.","But unexpectedly, after she put her hand down, Qi Mo's hand didn't move from her waist, still gently holding her.","She inconspicuously glanced at him, and saw the handsome face was expressionless as always.","She then psyched herself up.","Alright.","He was the one providing the money afterall.","Since they were husband and wife, it didn't count as taking advantage.","Thinking this, Sheng Mumu's expression gradually became natural.","The few people who were just discussing what Qi Mo's new wife was like, now had their mouths wide open in shock.","Their eyes kept shifting to look at Sheng Mumu.","\"Mrs. Qi is different from the rumors!\"","\"Now I believe those reports saying she was just an ordinary girl. Her looks alone are enough to attract people.\" Someone exclaimed.","\"Tsk, who knows if she's natural or not. She's probably had lots of injections.\"","Someone looked upset, \"It doesn't matter if she's natural or not. What's important is that Qi likes her. Look, ever since Mrs. Qi came, Qi's hand around her waist hasn't let go.\"","\"So envious.\"","...","A middle-aged man holding a wine glass walked to Qi Mo's side.","\"Qi, I'm the new CEO of Maoxing Group, Jack. I've wanted to find an opportunity to chat with you for a while now. Do you mind...?\"","Qi Mo finally let go of her waist, tilted his chin to lightly clink glasses with the man.","Seeing that Qi Mo wouldn't be free for a while, Sheng Mumu turned her attention to the dessert table.","She had rushed out earlier and was feeling a bit hungry now.","Just as she was debating whether to eat the strawberry shortcake or chocolate cake,","A voice came from behind her.","\"Beauty, I haven't seen you around before. Which family's young miss are you?\"","A young man with a tall pompadour hairstyle appeared behind Sheng Mumu.","Based on his actions and tone, he seemed to have just arrived and didn't know she was a married woman. He was trying to hit on her.","Sheng Mumu smiled lightly and introduced herself.","\"Hello, I'm Sheng Mumu, Qi Mo's wife.\"","The young man's shoulders visibly stiffened, his smile froze, but the shaking amplitude of the wine glass in his hand betrayed his inner nervousness.","\"Oh...ah...so you're Mrs. Qi. Heard a lot about you, pardon my rudeness.\"","Speaking, he lowered the glass to lightly tap against Sheng Mumu's.","Sheng Mumu took a light sip, responding calmly, \"It's fine.\"","The young man awkwardly left.","The married couple who were just talking with Qi Mo saw this scene and joked about it.","The lady laughed, \"Hahaha, Mrs. Qi is young and it's her first time attending a cocktail party, so she got mistaken for an unmarried young lady. It's because Qi has been hiding his new wife at home, afraid she'd get snatched away!\"","The middle-aged man beside her had a hearty laughing voice, \"Youth is great indeed. I wish I could be 10 years younger, then perhaps I could compete with Qi.\"","The lady exaggeratedly glared at him, \"You? In your dreams. You couldn't compare with Qi even when you were young.\"","Amidst the laughter, Sheng Mumu followed along with a fake smile.","She had smiled so much her mouth felt numb.","Suddenly, she felt her waist being lightly held by a pair of warm big hands.","Turning to look, Qi Mo had finished talking and naturally put his arm around her waist again.","Qi Mo's voice was light, \"What are you talking about?\"","The lady responded, \"We were saying many young men came to talk with Mrs. Qi just now.\"","Sheng Mumu's mouth was still smiling.","But in her heart she scolded \"f*ck\".","Clearly it was just one person, how did it become \"many young men\".","This was clearly trying to stir up problems between the couple!","Fortunately her relationship with Qi Mo was fake, so he wouldn't care.","Qi Mo didn't respond to the lady's words. He slightly lifted his arm to call over a waiter.","The waiter used a tray to receive Qi Mo's empty wine glass.","She didn't notice that when the man beside her lowered his head to put down the glass, his jaw tightened a bit.","Following that, the big hand around her waist tightened its grip a little.","Her curves were practically stuck to his body.","It was as if declaring a certain absolute dominance.","Sheng Mumu's red lips parted slightly. She thought for a bit but didn't say anything.","Looking up at the man much taller than herself, she tried to convey a message with her eyes: Do we have to keep acting like conjoined twins?","She hoped he would understand.","Qi Mo's dark eyes were deep and tranquil, his expression gave no clues to his thoughts.","Sheng Mumu: ......Alright, failed to convey the message.","She shifted her gaze towards the dessert table, planning to find an excuse to slip away. She lowered her voice and asked:","\"I'm going to get a slice of cake, want me to bring back a slice for you too?\"","Qi Mo glanced down at her, his brow faintly moved, voice low: \"No need.\"","\"Ok.\"","Sheng Mumu went alone.","As she maneuvered through the crowd, many male gazes followed her.","Qi Mo watched her back view, noticing the other men looking at her, his eyes dangerously darkened.","After some time, he lightly knitted his brow, lifted his wine glass, and drank a mouthful.","The silently aloof appearance of this man actually hid a wildness deep down.","Otherwise he wouldn't have been able to navigate the world of business at a young age and accumulate a huge fortune.","Men who compete for every inch of ground in the business world have territorial instincts that are almost reflexive.","By the time Sheng Mumu came back with two small cakes, the man's hand was naturally wrapped around her waist again.","Sheng Mumu didn't think too much of it, understanding his actions as just pretending to be a loving couple in front of others per their agreement.","She held a small cake in each hand.","The strawberry and chocolate flavors both looked delicious.","Just as she was about to dig in, Sheng Mumu noticed Qi Mo's gaze on her.","She looked back at him, eyes glancing down at the plates in her hands.","Her bright eyes blinked blankly for a few seconds, then slowly opened her mouth:","\"Um...both are mine. You said earlier you didn't want any, so I didn't grab your share.\"","Silence for half a second. Sheng Mumu felt like that didn't seem appropriate to say.","He provides her food and lodging, pays for her daily expenses on his card, and gives her a fixed 500,000 monthly allowance. It would be petty to fuss over a slice of cake.","Since he suddenly looked at her, he probably wanted cake now.","If he wanted it, she should just give it to him.","\"Here, you can have the chocolate one. I'll go grab another slice.\"","She symbolically nudged the plate towards him a few centimeters, eyes bright and clear.","Qi Mo's gaze paused faintly, looking at her for a few seconds with an inscrutable expression.","Then he said in a tone laced with laughter:","\"They're both yours, go ahead and eat.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked: \"???\"","If you're not eating, why stare at me.","..."]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Kezia, your stepmother is here","paragraphs":["The banquet was over. Sheng Mumu was holding Qi Mo's arm as they walked out of the venue.","As soon as they were out of everyone else's sight, Sheng Mumu retracted her hand and kept some distance from Qi Mo.","When not in front of others, there was no need to keep up the act.","\"Are we going back in the same car or separately?\"","Sheng Mumu asked in a casual, relaxed tone, with a hint of \"finally off work\" delight.","The lingering warmth on the inside of his arm felt unfamiliar, making Qi Mo a little distracted.","He loosened his tie with long, slender fingers and said softly:","\"Together.\"","The car slowly drove towards Xiyu Yueding.","Considerate driver Wang raised the privacy screen, giving some personal space to his boss and madam in the backseat.","The backseat of the luxury car was very spacious. Sitting there made the man's legs look even longer.","The streetlights outside shone in, illuminating his chiseled side profile even more handsomely.","Sheng Mumu looked away, stunned by Qi Mo's visual attack.","To avoid the awkwardness of being alone with her \"fake husband\", she conspicuously picked up her phone.","But she had just left the banquet, and there were already many reports about her online.","- \"Wow, Mrs. Qi is so beautiful, she could totally become a celebrity!\"","- \"What a perfect match, a talent among men and a beauty among women!\"","- \"The person above didn't say it right. He's talented, rich, good-looking AND kind-hearted!!!\"","- \"Hahaha, I admire them so much. Mr. Qi and Mrs. Qi look so in love.\"","- \"I can't even imagine how gorgeous their child would look if they have one. Hurry and have a baby!\"","Seeing the words \"have a baby\", Sheng Mumu choked.","A thought suddenly popped into her head.","Was Qi Mo going home tonight?","Just as she was thinking about it, her phone rang.","It was the housekeeper calling.","His first sentence after she picked up made her eyes widen in shock.","\"Madam, young master got into trouble at school.\"","Sheng Mumu was puzzled. \"???\"","Qi Shaobai caused trouble at school. Why didn't he call his father and called her instead?","Sheng Mumu reflexively looked at the man beside her, whose expression was calm and unperturbed. She was about to say \"Your son got into trouble at school\", but before she could speak, another ringtone sounded.","It came from Qi Mo's suit pocket.","Qi Mo took out his phone with his long, elegant hand.","He answered the call and spoke in fluent British English to the person on the other end.","Hearing it, Sheng Mumu was amazed.","She knew he had an attractive voice, but didn't expect his English to sound even more pleasing to the ear.","Listening felt like a massage to her ears.","It made her temporarily forget that she was also on a call.","\"Madam? Madam?\"","The housekeeper called her carefully when Sheng Mumu didn't respond for some time.","Actually, the housekeeper agonized for a long time before calling her.","The housekeeper felt bitter inside.","The man of the house was busy with work and often wasn't home. In the past when the young master got into trouble, he always called the executive assistant to handle it.","Now there was a madam in the house. Calling the executive assistant didn't seem right by emotion or reason.","Sheng Mumu returned to her senses and shifted her attention away from Qi Mo. She said to the phone:","\"Um, go ahead.\"","Housekeeper: \"The young master chased away his cram school teacher.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......So?\"","The housekeeper's voice gradually softened: \"The school said a parent still needs to go over. Sir is busy with work. Madam, do you think you could...\"","Before he finished speaking, Sheng Mumu heaved a long sigh.","What kind of thing was this?","They just pretended to be a loving couple, and now she had to \"work overtime\" to keep acting as a virtuous stepmother?","She felt exhausted.","The problem was, only she and Qi Mo knew about their agreement.","She couldn't refuse however she wanted. She could only reply: \"Alright, I know.\"","After hanging up, she had wanted to hand over the matter to Qi Mo since he happened to be there.","But unexpectedly, when the car stopped outside the mansion, Qi Mo showed no intention of getting out.","Qi Mo lowered the car window halfway. His tone naturally carried an aura that brooked no refusal.","\"I still have work to handle and will be away for a few days. You go home first.\"","After he spoke, the car drove away, heading straight for the airport.","Sheng Mumu watched the exquisite rear lights of the luxury car and mouthed: FML","How sweet.","Turns out he was sending her home!","What a \"good\" husband!","Although extremely reluctant, the next day, upholding the belief that \"not cooperating properly would get her kicked out\", Sheng Mumu still went to Qi Shaobai's school.","What else could she do if she didn't go? How else would she get to be a rich, leisurely madam and live in luxury?","Anyway, being called in by the school was just a formality.","She didn't need to spend too much effort.","She might as well just get it over with.","Even though she had imagined that the high school the young master of a wealthy family went to would be very big and prestigious, she didn't expect that after driving in through the front gate, it took a full fifteen minutes before they reached the classroom building.","They passed by the tennis court, equestrian field, lavender garden... After a bunch of places she wouldn't have imagined existing in a \"high school\", they finally saw the classroom building.","Sheng Mumu looked at Manager Zhang in the front passenger seat who had come along, and embarrassingly spoke up slowly.","\"Qi Shaobai is...\"","Before she could finish, the sensible housekeeper quickly followed up:","\"Madam, the young master is in Class 24 of Grade 10.\"","Avoiding the possible awkwardness for the madam.","Sheng Mumu silently gave the housekeeper's professionalism a thumbs up and got out of the car.","Last night, she had learned about the general situation -","To prepare Grade 10 students at Jing City No.1 Middle School for the pace of Grade 11 in advance, the school had hired famous teachers to run cram classes, charging by the minute, paid additionally by parents.","Qi Shaobai's class was assigned the most famous professor.","Yesterday, at the last class, the professor had kept them behind after class ended.","Qi Shaobai felt unhappy about it, and his face was ugly.","Having to add several classes every day had already greatly taken up personal time. Being kept longer disrupted his plans entirely.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's scowl, the professor felt his ulterior motive to earn more tutoring fees was exposed. He slapped the podium and yelled:","\"I kept you longer for your own good. If you don't want to listen, you can leave! No one's stopping you.\"","After yelling that line, feeling it wasn't cathartic enough, he singled out Qi Shaobai as a typical example to admonish the other students.","\"I really don't understand students nowadays. You all are bolder than the last. When I was a student, the teacher's word was law. No one would have dared to talk back. But your generation actually dares to show attitude to teachers. Do you even know what respecting teachers means!\"","\"It's my class. I can keep you longer if I want. If you don't want to listen, then get out!\"","After the professor said this, Qi Shaobai stood up with a dark look.","Everyone's eyes focused on him.","Sitting at the back, Wei Zhaonan whispered urgently:","\"Don't be impulsive! You can't get physical, you can't get physical.\"","Qi Shaobai ignored him completely, picked up his schoolbag, and walked straight to the front.","The professor froze. His original intent was to deflate Qi Shaobai's arrogance a bit. He thought scolding him a few lines would make him settle down, and it could also serve as a warning to others.","He didn't expect Qi Shaobai to not be the \"chicken\" to pluck as he pleased.","As Qi Shaobai walked past him, the professor looked at the student who was even taller than him and lost some confidence.","\"You...what are you doing?\"","Qi Shaobai didn't even glance at him. He pulled open the classroom door.","\"You said we could leave if we didn't want to listen.\"","Qi Shaobai was rebellious by nature. He was already unhappy about being kept longer. Now the professor said they could leave—wouldn't he be an idiot not to leave?","Bang. The door closed.","The classroom broke into an uproar.","Everyone didn't dare believe Qi Shaobai had just left so nonchalantly.","Now instead it was the professor who felt he lost face. Furious, he stormed out.","The professor complained to the Dean, saying he couldn't teach this student and with a class like this, whoever wanted to teach it could.","After listening to the housekeeper's vivid recounting,","Sheng Mumu was puzzled.","Excuse me?","So what exactly did Qi Shaobai do wrong?","Wasn't it that professor who told Qi Shaobai to leave?","If Qi Shaobai had talked back disrespectfully, it could be said he didn't respect teachers.","But from start to finish, he only seemed to have scowled because he was unhappy about being kept late.","Seriously, prof?","Is it illegal to have a sour face?","Sheng Mumu deeply sympathized with Qi Shaobai.","At the same time, she had a very off-topic thought—","Perhaps Qi Shaobai growing up to have a gloomy personality didn't entirely have to do with her as his vicious stepmother.","The environment around him also didn't seem too friendly.","For instance, in a situation like this, the head teacher and dean asked no questions and just wanted Qi Shaobai to admit wrongdoing in front of the whole class and write a self-reflection.","If the housekeeper hadn't curiously asked his good friend Wei Zhaonan and learned the truth, perhaps Qi Shaobai really would have been wrongly labeled as an unruly student who dared to anger teachers into leaving.","Sheng Mumu got out of the car and straightened her collar and hem.","She was wearing a small spread collar shirt today, light camel wide-leg pants, and carried a bag with an obscure brand logo from the wardrobe.","It was efficient and low-key, not flashy at all.","It looked like she had come to solve problems.","On the roof, Wei Zhaonan was lazily leaning over the railing spacing out.","He happened to see Sheng Mumu heading towards the teaching building.","Wei Zhaonan sighed inwardly that this was not good.","He turned and said to Qi Shaobai who had his eyes closed sunbathing next to him:","\"Qi Shaobai, your stepmother is here!\""]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: She's not really taking herself as a mother, is she","paragraphs":["Wei Zhaonan's voice was very loud. Several people playing poker next to him also glanced over, whispering:","\"Qi's mom is here?\"","\"Whose mom?\"","\"Qi's mom.\"","It sounded like they were cursing someone.","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows furrowed slightly as he slowly opened his eyes.","The noon sun shone in the clear, clean eyes of the young man, making him look especially good-looking.","A flash of disbelief crossed Qi Shaobai's icy pupils.","He gave a cold snort.","\"Che, you think I'd believe that?\"","He didn't believe it.","He was certain Wei Zhaonan was just bored and screaming nonsense to play a prank.","Then he closed his eyes again and continued basking in the sun.","\"Really, I'm not kidding you. Your mom is so beautiful, it's hard not to recognize her.\"","Qi Shaobai opened his eyes and glared at Wei Zhaonan, feeling his wording was very inappropriate. He impatiently said: \"Your mom.\"","Wei Zhaonan apologetically said: \"Stepmom, stepmom, I misspoke.\"","Seeing Wei Zhaonan's sincere expression, Qi Shaobai was half believing and half doubting.","Could that woman really have come?","He knew the Dean had called home yesterday.","He thought it would be like the many times before, with Mr. Dong coming as his dad's representative to say a few perfunctory words.","He had never imagined that woman would come to his school.","What was she here for?","Did she really think of him as her son?","Or did she want to catch him doing something wrong so she could tattle to his dad?","Soon, a classmate came up to the rooftop to notify Qi Shaobai:","\"The teacher asked you to go to the office.\"","Qi Shaobai lazily pushed open the office door.","The Dean, his class teacher, and professors were all there.","Sheng Mumu was there too...","His brows wrinkled in displeasure as he looked out the window with an indifferent attitude.","Yell and scold all you want, just get it over with quickly.","Outside the office, several classmates close to Qi Shaobai gathered, led by Wei Zhaonan.","Someone said: \"Qi's in for it this time. His stepmom came. He won't get away without a good scolding.\"","\"Our Qi is afraid of that?\"","\"Hard to say. Before, no matter how much trouble Qi caused, it was always Uncle Qi's assistant who came. But this time it's his stepmom, of course it's different.\"","Wei Zhaonan kicked the gossiping person and said, \"Less yapping.\"","In the office separated only by a wall, Sheng Mumu had originally been sitting in a chair, but at some point came to stand next to Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai glanced at her and uncomfortably shifted away, putting distance between them.","The Dean spoke first:","\"Mrs. Qi, I know you're usually busy too. Let's handle this quickly...\"","The Dean looked at the stern Professor Dai before continuing:","\"According to Professor Dai's opinion, we'll have Qi Shaobai read a self-criticism aloud to the class, then sincerely admit his mistake to Professor Dai and apologize, and the matter will be considered settled.\"","After speaking, the Dean silently shot an awkward, apologetic look at Sheng Mumu behind Professor Dai's back.","The Dean knew Sheng Mumu was Qi Shaobai's stepmother, and figured that since she was a stepmother, she probably wouldn't discipline her stepson too seriously. Just going through the motions would be enough to turn the page on this incident.","In fact, if not for Professor Dai being specially invited by the school, this minor issue wouldn't have warranted calling the parents at all.","In the past whenever Qi Shaobai caused more serious trouble, they didn't always notify the parents.","Most Beijing No. 1 High School students came from prominent families, so the Dean didn't dare discipline them too severely.","Professor Dai sat in a chair, legs crossed, holding a teacup. His expression clearly said: Let's see how stubborn you are, daring to make me lose face. I won't let you off if you don't get punished.","He took a sip of tea and looked at Sheng Mumu in a superior manner, waiting for her to nod and agree with the Dean's proposed solution.","The Dean figured that since Sheng Mumu was the stepmother, she probably wouldn't seriously discipline her stepson. Just going through the motions would be enough to resolve this matter.","Sheng Mumu tugged at the corner of her mouth and gave the Dean a faint smile, saying:","\"Principal, I'm not busy today. I came to school specifically to properly deal with this matter, no need to handle it quickly. Let's follow due process and first clarify whether Qi Shaobai was really at fault.\"","Hearing this, Professor Dai's hand holding the teacup twitched in shock as he looked up at Sheng Mumu in disbelief.","\"Mrs. Qi, what do you mean? Are you saying I wrongly accused him?\"","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips together and slowly said in an unhurried tone:","\"Professor, don't get agitated. On my way here I got a grasp of the situation. Qi Shaobai was indeed wrong this time, but it wasn't serious enough to warrant making him write a self-criticism and apologize to the whole class.\"","Teenagers have a lot of self-esteem.","Making them publicly apologize is very damaging to their self-esteem.","What's more, Sheng Mumu sincerely felt the school was making a mountain out of a molehill.","As her words fell, everyone present was shocked.","The most shocked was Qi Shaobai himself.","His ears must be malfunctioning.","Did this woman really just speak up for him?","Professor Dai slammed the teacup on the table. He looked at Sheng Mumu in disbelief.","\"Mrs. Qi, are you saying he did nothing wrong?\"","Sheng Mumu felt this professor was too narrow-minded.","She had just said in her first sentence that Qi Shaobai was in the wrong. How could he act as if he didn't hear that and deliberately pick a fight?","She smiled gently.","\"I didn't say he did nothing wrong, only that making him publicly apologize to the class is too severe.\"","Professor Dai's expression was ugly. In his many years of teaching, he had always had the final say.","This was the first time a parent didn't agree the child was in the wrong.","\"If he doesn't apologize or write a self-criticism, isn't that equivalent to you thinking he did nothing wrong?\"","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath, sensing this conversation would take some effort.","\"Professor Dai, from my understanding, Qi Shaobai didn't actually talk back to you, and before you yelled at him, he didn't make any move to leave the classroom either.\"","\"You're a teacher, and need to establish authority in front of students. I understand that very well. However, children also have self-esteem, and teenagers around seventeen or eighteen have especially strong self-esteem. Professor, don't you think your attitude toward Qi Shaobai was also damaging to his self-esteem?\"","...","As Sheng Mumu spoke, Qi Shaobai kept staring at her from the side.","A strange, indescribable feeling welled up in his chest.","Sour, warm.","A very unfamiliar sensation.","Ten minutes later, Qi Shaobai came out of the office.","Wei Zhaonan zoomed over like a wisp of smoke.","\"So, what happened? Got another scolding?\"","\"How many words do you have to write for your self-criticism? 3,000? 5,000?\"","\"We can pay someone to write it for you if needed.\"","Qi Shaobai's mind was still on what had just happened. He ignored Wei Zhaonan.","Sheng Mumu walked out of the office.","Qi Shaobai coldly cut Wei Zhaonan off: \"Talk less.\"","Wei Zhaonan shut his mouth and greeted Sheng Mumu with a smile, standing up perfectly straight.","\"Hello, Auntie!\"","Sheng Mumu suppressed the urge to clench her teeth and forced a smile in return.","She then turned to look at Qi Shaobai.","\"Well...I'm going home first then. You should go back to class.\"","Talking to Qi Shaobai felt somewhat awkward and unfamiliar to Sheng Mumu.","She knew how to play the parental role in front of the class teacher and professors.","But facing her stepson himself, she still struggled to find her position.","Having this grown son suddenly pop up was difficult to get used to.","Qi Shaobai gave an indifferent \"Mm\" and headed toward the classroom.","Wei Zhaonan followed behind Qi Shaobai, looking back and forth between him and Sheng Mumu with a baffled expression as he continued asking:","\"That's it? Auntie didn't scold you?\"","\"You don't need to write the self-criticism either?\"","Qi Shaobai tsked and kicked Wei Zhaonan. He felt Wei talked too much nonsense.","\"Shut up.\""]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: What a shame to be caught peeking","paragraphs":["During evening self-study time, Qi Shaobai thought about what had happened recently.","The more he thought about it, the more he felt it was strange.","He felt that he shouldn't look at people through tinted glasses.","Not every stepmother is sinister.","At least, Sheng Mumu didn't seem to be.","Qi Shaobai somehow thought of what had happened at home that day.","Sheng Mumu had the maid deliver snacks to him and reminded him that someone had slipped something in his drink.","The stubborn temperament of the teenager made him feel that he shouldn't always accept other people's kindness without giving anything in return.","One good turn deserves another.","Since Sheng Mumu had helped him, he didn't mind speaking up for Sheng Mumu in front of his dad a little bit.","He remembered that day she said his dad didn't like her drinking alcohol.","Qi Shaobai frowned and pondered for a long time before taking out his phone and tapping the screen.","He typed and deleted over and over again.","It took a very long time before he finally sent out a message.","At that time, Qi Mo was signing a letter of intent with a British partner.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's name light up on the screen,","Qi Mo said \"Excuse me\" to the other party in English.","Qi Shaobai rarely sent him messages.","He didn't know what had happened.","Qi Mo's expression was cold as he slowly capped his pen and knitted his brows before opening his phone.","His actions were unhurried and composed.","Reading the message on the screen, a hint of confusion flashed through Qi Mo's deep eyes.","The content of Qi Shaobai's message was:","\"There is no family rule in the Qi family that prohibits drinking alcohol. I personally think your request for her not to drink is a bit excessive.\"","Qi Mo's rugged eyebrows slowly furrowed as he sent a reply back.","The message was brief and concise, just like him - \"Who?\"","Upon receiving the message, Qi Shaobai gritted his teeth and quickly typed a reply on the screen: \"Your wife.\"","Qi Mo's eyes were dark and deep.","When did he ever say that he didn't like her drinking?","That night, Qi Mo called the butler Zhang.","Based on his understanding of Qi Shaobai, if nothing had happened, Qi Shaobai would never say such things to him suddenly.","\"Has anything happened at home recently?\"","Being asked so suddenly, Butler Zhang tensed up.","The master rarely asked about things at home, so by asking this, he must be asking about Madam, right?","\"Master, I didn't want to disturb you over there. Young master got into trouble at school today and Madam went to the young master's school.\"","\"Oh? What kind of trouble did he cause?\" The voice on the phone was low.","Butler Zhang reported everything he knew to Qi Mo in detail.","Including what he had heard from Sheng Mumu about Qi Shaobai only apologizing to the professor for his scowling.","In closing, Butler Zhang added, \"Thanks to Madam speaking up for the young master, otherwise given the young master's personality, even if he was wronged, he wouldn't say much.\"","Butler Zhang also told Qi Mo about Sheng Mumu previously having the servant buy snacks for Qi Shaobai.","After a few seconds of silence on the phone, a low \"hmm\" could be heard.","\"I see, thank you for letting me know.\"","*","Sheng Mumu suddenly realized in recent days that although she held the supplementary card given to her by Qi Mo, she didn't actually have much in savings that belonged to her.","The bank card had a balance of 0.5 yuan. She couldn't get her monthly 500,000 yuan allowance until next month.","She felt very insecure.","She didn't know how long she would remain in this world. Just thinking about the tragic ending of the original owner made her afraid. What if one day she was kicked out of the Qi family but didn't have enough money saved up to support herself for the rest of her life?","With this concern in mind, she started thinking.","Other than working as \"Mrs. Qi\", should she do some side work to earn money?","One day, after lunch, Sheng Mumu was wandering aimlessly onto the 3rd floor balcony.","Seeing the maid tending to the flowers in the vase, on a whim she asked:","\"Were these flowers grown at home?\"","She had previously seen the maid pruning branches and leaves in the greenhouse, so she naturally assumed these flowers were from there.","Maid: \"No, Madam. The bouquets in the vases are all freshly flown in daily.\"","Sheng Mumu was puzzled. \"What do you mean flown in daily? Don't we have a greenhouse?\"","The maid didn't know how to respond for a moment.","No matter what was used, wealthy families would only choose the most expensive. The maid also didn't know why fresh bouquets needed to be specially purchased daily when there was already a greenhouse.","Not every villa in Xiyu Yingting had a greenhouse, and there were quite a few families that went out daily to buy fresh flowers.","As Sheng Mumu thought about it, looking at the vase, she asked: \"How much does a bouquet like this cost?\"","Maid: \"The purchase amount fluctuates, but on average one bouquet is around 500 yuan.\"","Sheng Mumu clucked her tongue. \"Just this? One bouquet? Five hundred?\"","The maid nodded. Hearing Sheng Mumu ask again, \"Do the neighbors around also go out to buy flowers?\"","\"Yes Madam, almost every family purchases fresh bouquets from outside.\"","Her eyes widened even more.","A vase couldn't hold more than a few stems. Vases like these could be found every 10-odd meters in the house.","Sheng Mumu suddenly felt that breathing the fragrant air scented with fresh flowers every day previously was extremely invigorating.","That was the smell of burning money!","How could it not be invigorating!","As she was sighing emotionally, a brilliant money-making idea popped into her mind.","She, a highly educated genius with a master's degree, a cosmopolitan beauty who had experienced the rapid development of the internet age.","She suddenly felt that not taking advantage of the existing conditions to ruthlessly earn a big sum would be letting her transmigration go to waste!","No sooner said than done.","She researched this world carefully.","According to her observations, it was almost the same as the world she came from.","It only differed in some details.","For example, familiar songs and TV shows also existed in this world.","But some industries that were quite mature in her world had not yet developed here.","Thinking of this, Sheng Mumu suddenly felt as if she was playing a very realistic business simulation game.","The more she thought about it, the more excited she became. She was so excited she couldn't fall asleep at all.","On this night when her ambitious vision was gradually becoming clear, and she was counting money in her head until her hands cramped, thinking about how many people she would need to massage her in the future, Qi Mo suddenly returned home.","Lying with her back to the bedroom door, Sheng Mumu heard the sound of the doorknob turning.","In the darkness, soft footsteps drew closer and closer.","After a while, the mattress beside her sank, and along with a unique refreshing scent, Qi Mo got into bed.","Sheng Mumu's breathing became light.","Feeling the man's breathing gradually even out behind her, she slowly turned her body.","In the dim light, she examined her husband whom she had only seen twice before.","Qi Mo had one hand propped under his head and the other hand outside the covers, lying on his side.","His chest rose and fell slightly with each breath.","His breath gently brushed against her forehead.","It made her forehead feel itchy.","She adjusted her position a little in the darkness and propped herself up.","Plucking up her courage to observe him from another angle.","The sleeping Qi Mo lacked the unconscious majesty he usually exuded when awake.","His long eyelashes gently drooped down, and his tall nose made his face look three-dimensional and prominent.","Sheng Mumu didn't know how long she stared at this incomparably handsome face.","From his forehead to his eyes, to his nose, his jaws.","And finally stopping at his Adam's apple and collarbone.","Every part was too good-looking.","Time seemed to favor Qi Mo in particular.","His face didn't have a single wrinkle.","How could he look like a 38-year-old man?","Did wealthy people have special maintenance secrets?","Could it be botox?","Just as she was speculating.","Those beautiful peach blossom eyes silently and slowly opened, looking over at her in the dark.","The man's voice was gravelly, wrapped in an ascetic air, his tone low and hoarse:","\"Is there something on my face?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","She was so frightened her heart skipped a beat and she almost cried out.","This man wasn't asleep at all!","How long had he been awake???","Damn!","Getting caught peeping was too embarrassing!"]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Men's Worst Fear of being told no.","paragraphs":["The bedroom was unlit, and dim moonlight shone in through the window.","The two lay facing each other side by side.","In the weak light, a swirling, dark gleam appeared in Qi Mo's eyes, with fragmented points of light diffusing outwards, deep and captivating.","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched as she stared blankly for a good while before she could think of anything to say.","\"I think I have insomnia. I should...go sleep in another room, so I don't disturb your rest.\"","Getting caught staring was embarrassing.","Trying to explain why she was staring would only multiply the embarrassment factor.","She wanted to pretend nothing had happened and slip away from this socially dead scene.","Sheng Mumu sat up, covering the neckline of her nightgown.","There were many rooms in the villa, all tidy thanks to the servants, so she could go sleep in any of them.","In fact, she had wanted to suggest separate bedrooms to Qi Mo for a while now, but never had the chance to meet him.","Now seemed like a good opportunity.","\"You keep sleeping. I'll go next door.\"","Sheng Mumu threw off the covers and pushed herself up on her arms, ready to get up.","Suddenly, a large, broad palm grabbed her wrist, forcing her to stop moving.","As their skin made contact, they both felt a strange sensation.","Sheng Mumu's heart gave a sudden thump.","Although the man hadn't used much force, she froze, no longer moving.","At the banquet, he had put his arm around her waist, but there had been a layer of clothing between them.","This was the first time they touched with no barriers.","Senses amplified by the darkness, the smooth and delicate feel of the woman's wrist skin travelled from his palm.","Qi Mo's Adam's apple bobbed as his already hoarse voice grew even more gravelly.","\"It would raise suspicions.\"","Sheng Mumu blanked for a moment.","Suspicions?","Perhaps from staring at his handsome face for too long, her mind was muddled.","She suffered a brain fart, misunderstanding Qi Mo's meaning, and also forgetting about their prenuptial agreement.","Her mouth acted on subconscious instinct beyond her brain's control, blurting out:","\"Oh...sorry, I didn't consider that a husband and wife sleeping separately would raise suspicions about your, um, ability in that area. My apologies.\"","The most sensitive subject for a man was any suggestion he was inadequate down there.","A newlywed wife refusing to live with her husband implied something unspoken...","She had been careless.","The moment the words left her mouth, the air solidified.","She felt the large palm clasping her wrist tremble.","Qi Mo's temple pulsed as his brow furrowed deeply.","Did she have any idea what she was saying?","Sheng Mumu settled obediently back down, though her wrist was still held in Qi Mo's grasp.","She gently twisted her wrist, hinting he could let go now that she wasn't leaving.","For the sake of his image, she would play her role to the end.","After a long pause, a faint exhalation sounded in the darkness, and the hand gripping hers slowly relaxed.","Shortly after, the man's magnetic voice followed.","\"When did I ever say I don't like you drinking?\"","Instead of continuing the previous topic, Qi Mo thought of the message Qi Shaobai had sent him and asked about something that puzzled him.","He didn't recall ever saying such words.","Their conversations over the years could be counted on one hand.","He would never have required or prohibited her from doing anything.","But people make mistakes, so perhaps he had remembered wrong.","Facing uncertainty, he chose to ask directly.","Caught off guard by the sudden question, Sheng Mumu blanked. \"!!!\"","The little white lie she had told back then to resolve an emergency, she didn't expect it would actually reach Qi Mo's ears.","Only Qi Shaobai and her classmate had been present at the time, and her classmate would have had no opportunity to mention it to Qi Mo.","So the only possibility was that Qi Shaobai had said something.","Tsk.","The book said they rarely communicated as father and son, right?","How did Qi Mo even know about such a trivial matter?","Though the lights were off, Sheng Mumu still felt Qi Mo's gaze fixed on her.","His stare made her very uncomfortable.","The man waited silently for her response.","Seconds ticked by.","Suddenly, in the silence, the faintest sound of snoring arose.","\"Huh—\"","\"Huh- Huh—\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu closed her eyes.","Light, deliberately rhythmic snores sounded.","Pretending to sleep was the most convenient solution she could think of right now.","Wild horses couldn't make her speak another word this moment.","Qi Mo's gaze still lingered on Sheng Mumu's face.","In the dim moonlight, her red lips were slightly parted, her nose small and straight, long lashes faintly fluttering.","After a while, the corners of Qi Mo's lips quirked into a helpless arc. In the silence, his low magnetic voice carried a trace of regret:","\"You can do as you wish. I have no objections. Apologies for imposing on you to pretend to be my wife.\"","To him, their prenuptial agreement ending merely required some money.","But for the woman before him, it meant one more item under \"Married, Divorced\" in her history.","When it came down to it, he had imposed on her.","After speaking, Qi Mo lay back down.","He knew she had heard him.","In the darkness, Sheng Mumu held her breath, wide awake now.","Impose?","She didn't understand.","If not having to fulfill marital duties while living a life of luxury could be considered imposing, she didn't mind that kind of imposition.","She was tough. She could endure more of it.","...","In Sheng Mumu's imagination, Qi Mo would already have left for work after waking up.","But the next morning, when she yawned and stepped out of the room, she bumped right into the man coming out of his study after a video conference call.","He wore a black shirt. Since it wasn't a formal occasion, he hadn't tied a tie.","The top buttons were done up modestly, sleeves rolled to mid-forearm, revealing smooth, pale, strong wrists.","Seeing her emerge, the man halted and looked over.","Still groggy from just getting up, Sheng Mumu absently gazed back, eyes moist from her yawn. She blinked at him, clear and pure as a fawn.","Rubbing her eyes, she asked, \"You didn't go to work?\"","Qi Mo: \"Mm, not much to do today. I can handle things at home.\"","As he spoke, his gaze swept over her face.","There were red pressure marks on her face from sleeping, which paired with her slightly bewildered expression gave her an absentminded, natural cuteness.","Recalling what had occurred last night, Sheng Mumu's ears inexplicably reddened. Every second his intense, burning gaze lingered on her face felt scorching.","Just as she wanted to make an excuse to leave, the butler came upstairs and announced to them:","\"Sir, Madam, lunch is ready.\"","\"Mm,\" Qi Mo acknowledged.","He looked to Sheng Mumu. \"Perfect timing since you're up. Let's eat together.\"","Sheng Mumu numbly nodded.","Just as she was wondering if she should find some topic to chat about over their meal, a commotion sounded from downstairs.","The butler peeked down and beamed. \"Young Master is awake too.\"","Since it was Sunday without school, the meal naturally turned into one for \"the whole family.\""]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: Shimmering Sheng Mu Mu","paragraphs":["Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai ate dinner quietly like chickens.","It made Sheng Mumu feel embarrassed to even open her phone.","Usually when she was home alone, she would watch variety shows while eating.","Because it was so quiet, she was bored and thought back to what Qi Mo had said last night before going to bed.","He said she could do anything she wanted.","Did that mean if she didn't want to be a full-time housewife, he wouldn't mind if she went out to start a career?","Sheng Mumu had been a little worried before that since the Qi family was so wealthy, Qi Mo would reject it if she brought up wanting to do something.","But now, her concerns were gone.","Sheng Mumu even had a bold idea - why not ask Qi Mo for advice?","Starting a business was just the beginning. There would definitely be a lot to deal with when actually implementing it.","Managing such a large conglomerate, her little startup would be nothing for Qi Mo.","Adults should learn to make good use of all the resources around them.","She secretly decided to try and test the waters with Qi Mo when there was a natural chance.","Just as she was thinking about how to start the conversation with Qi Mo, Qi Shaobai's voice rang out, breaking the quiet at the dinner table.","\"Dad, I have something I want to show you.\"","Without even lifting his eyelids, Qi Mo asked, \"What is it?\"","Hearing the conversation between father and son, Sheng Mumu's curiosity was also piqued. She looked towards Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai carried a laptop out from his room and opened it on the table. He stood next to Qi Mo with his hands clenched, seeming a little nervous.","Sheng Mumu noticed his hands were clenched, as if he was a little nervous.","Qi Mo's gaze shifted to the computer.","Sheng Mumu also looked over.","On the screen was the backend for an e-commerce website.","The page was simple, and the website functionality was incomplete.","This was something Qi Shaobai had spent a month writing.","Sheng Mumu's eyes shifted between Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai's faces.","Combining what she knew about the plot of the novel, she roughly understood.","Qi Shaobai was showing his self-written program to Qi Mo, hoping to get his father's approval.","When Qi Mo first started his business, he was a typical tech guy.","Later as the conglomerate grew bigger and bigger, he gradually moved away from the technical front lines, shifting his focus to enterprise management and development.","Qi Shaobai seemed unruly, but he actually longed for his father's approval all along, taking his father as a goal, wanting to become the same kind of person as him.","Sheng Mumu remembered searching online for Qi Mo's resume before.","He had made his first bucket of gold through a program he wrote himself.","Qi Shaobai probably wanted to prove to Qi Mo that he had the same genes and talents that were inherited.","Qi Mo's expression didn't change much. He just casually glanced at it a few times before shifting his gaze away from the computer.","He said flatly:","\"You're still a student. Don't spend your time and energy on these kinds of things.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Qi Shaobai's shoulders sank and his jaw tightened.","This wasn't the result he had imagined.","In his imagination, his dad might have pointed out where he could improve, and given him some guidance.","Or maybe, with a very slim possibility, he might have praised him for doing a good job.","The cold, brief words extinguished all his expectations.","The program he had spent months working on seemed to be of no significance in his dad's eyes.","Sensing the subtle atmosphere, Sheng Mumu shrank her neck, minimizing her presence as much as possible, and silently shoveled the sautéed shrimp in her bowl.","The emotion in Qi Mo's eyes was hard to discern. He glanced at Qi Shaobai.","\"You're about to be a high school senior.\"","That was all he said, not continuing further.","Qi Shaobai already knew what his dad meant. A hint of gloom flashed through his eyes and he lowered his head.","\"I know what I should do.\"","Qi Mo: \"Mm.\"","This \"Mm\" represented both ending the conversation and hinting that Qi Shaobai could leave now.","Qi Shaobai left without even taking his computer back, going straight to his room.","Bang -","The door didn't close loudly, but it sounded especially depressing to Sheng Mumu.","This was the first time Sheng Mumu had personally witnessed how Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai interacted, and she couldn't help but feel a little surprised.","She knew their relationship was just average, but didn't expect the coldness to be to this degree.","She pursed her lips, but ultimately didn't say anything.","After all, she was a stepmother, and even a fake stepmother.","It wasn't her place to chime in.","After eating a few more bites, she pushed back her chair. \"I'm full, I'll go upstairs first.\"","She thought the taciturn Qi Mo would just give an \"Mm\" as a response like before.","Unexpectedly, when he heard her speak, he slowly lifted his head, looking over with a gentle gaze, and suddenly asked:","\"You've been going out a lot recently?\"","He had heard from Butler Zhang that she had been going out a lot lately.","Sometimes she would have the driver take her around the villa district.","She had even taken the initiative to visit two of the neighboring households and added the lady next door as a friend.","Sheng Mumu was a little surprised to hear this.","What?","Did he get addicted to controlling his son, and now wanted to control her as well?","\"Yeah, so what?\"","Although she felt a little unhappy inside, when facing the daddy with the money she still answered calmly.","Qi Mo: \"If you find it too boring staying at home, you can go to the vacation villa and walk around. The scenery there is nice. If you want to go, I'll have Butler Zhang arrange it for you.\"","Sheng Mumu clearly didn't expect him to say this.","She blinked. She felt ashamed for her earlier conjecturing.","Turns out he wasn't trying to control her, but was worried she found being a full-time housewife too boring.","Sheng Mumu's eyes curved into crescents. \"I'm not bored at all. I have more than enough to do every day.\"","Just investigating how many households lived in Xiyu Yue Court, and getting to know the neighboring ladies had already taken up quite a bit of effort.","Qi Mo murmured in acknowledgement. \"That's good if you're not bored.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly didn't want to leave anymore. She pulled out the chair and sat back down.","She might as well bring up her business ideas while she had the chance.","Now was a good opportunity to ask his opinion.","If she missed today, who knew how long it would be before she saw him again once he got busy.","\"Recently I've been thinking of starting a business. Can I get your advice?\"","After deliberating for a few seconds, Sheng Mumu spoke up. Then she looked at him steadily, waiting for his reply.","Qi Mo's expression was subtle. Clearly he had never imagined hearing the words \"start a business\" come from her mouth.","\"Start a business?\"","\"Mm-hmm, start a business,\" Sheng Mumu put her hands on the table and shifted a little towards Qi Mo. \"I want to open a flower shop, is that okay?\"","Qi Mo's sharp jawline gradually softened, and a hint of laughter flashed through his jet black pupils.","\"Of course that's okay. You don't need my permission to start a business. It's not really asking for advice, just chatting. If you want to talk to me about it, I'm willing to listen.\"","His response made her feel like a spring breeze was caressing her face.","Sheng Mumu instantly felt the man in front of her had become more handsome.","She cradled her chin in her hands, eyes curved into happy crescents, red lips parted, \"I really want to discuss it with you.\"","He was the most suitable person she could think of to discuss business ideas with.","Sheng Mumu started chattering away enthusiastically about what she had been mulling over the past few days.","\"To be more precise, I want to open a flower shop focused on flower delivery services, without a physical storefront. Every day we could deliver fresh bouquets to customers' doorsteps.\"","\"I did some market research. A lot of families here in our villa district have a habit of buying fresh flowers every day.\"","\"There are over 50 households living here. If I could get all their fresh flower business, the profits would be quite considerable.\"","As she talked, she would occasionally make exaggerated hand gestures, a habit formed from giving PPT presentations to superiors in her previous job.","Gazing at her bright, energetic eyes, Qi Mo felt an indescribable sensation arise in his heart.","It was as if he was looking at his young entrepreneurial self again.","Yet it also seemed he had unintentionally stumbled upon a shining, independent soul."]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: In case there's a bad Divorce.","paragraphs":["Qi Mo's eyes glimmered faintly as he listened attentively.","Sheng Mumu became more and more animated as she analyzed the information she had gathered over the past few days wandering around the villa district and from getting to know her new neighbor Mrs. Song.","She gestured dramatically, holding up fingers to illustrate her points:","\"Do you know, a bouquet from our vases costs five hundred, five hundred!\"","\"I've counted, there are eight vases around the house!\"","Then she tapped her chin thoughtfully as she calculated:","\"I've figured it out - conservatively each household in Xiyu Yue Ting spends five hundred per day, so seventy-five thousand per month.\"","\"Also, I'm thinking of opening the flower shop in the area between several upscale residential areas near Xiyu Yue Ting, to expand the reach.\"","\"Calculating it out, even ignoring other communities for now and just Xiyu Yue Ting, after deducting costs, at least half of that is pure profit - over three hundred thousand.\"","Hearing her use the term \"our family,\" the usually inscrutable man's eyes flickered faintly.","Unaware, Sheng Mumu continued enthusiastically: \"But it will definitely be harder than I imagined to actually do it. I'll have to think of some ways - what if I lower the price, three hundred per bouquet, would that be competitive?\"","\"It would be competitive, but there's no need.\" Qi Mo focused intently and responded when Sheng Mumu asked his opinion.","Sheng Mumu pouted unconsciously, a little disappointed to have cold water poured on her idea.","Her playful little expression, seen by the nearby butler and servants, actually resembled a wife coquettishly complaining to her husband.","Qi Mo said: \"Your idea is very good, and your approach is also very apt. Lowering prices to attract traffic would be a good marketing tactic for an ordinary community, but here it would actually become a drawback.\"","With just that one sentence, Sheng Mumu immediately understood.","\"You mean the people living around here would be willing to buy expensive flowers anyway, so there's no need to lower prices at all?\"","She tilted her head, murmuring his words to herself again.","\"No need to lower prices... On the contrary, prices could even be raised, right?\"","Qi Mo's eyes crinkled faintly. \"Yes, that's possible.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled approvingly and emphatically patted Qi Mo's shoulder three times.","\"Impressive, impressive. As expected from a businessman.\"","As if he was a natural when it came to making money.","Not far away, the previously benevolent-looking Zhang Housekeeper stiffened when he saw Sheng Mumu patting Qi Mo's shoulder.","He had worked for the Qi family for many years and had never seen anyone dare to pat the young master like that.","What the devil.","And Young Master is actually smiling???","Seeing Sheng Mumu compliment Qi Mo, Zhang Housekeeper discreetly raised his hand towards Qi Mo.","The housekeeper immediately understood.","Soon, servants brought over a pot of floral tea and some tea snacks.","Sheng Mumu casually took a sip of tea and modestly asked for Qi Mo's opinion:","\"What do you think, does this plan have potential?\"","Qi Mo affirmed, \"This is a very good project.\"","Having gotten approval from a business tycoon, Sheng Mumu felt like a cat being petted - exceptionally content.","Qi Mo's eyes were deep as he silently pondered for a moment before slowly continuing:","\"For you, you could also consider incorporating a physical store.\"","Sheng Mumu tilted her head, murmuring his words to herself again.","\"Incorporate a physical store...\"","Qi Mo elegantly picked up his teacup, taking a shallow sip, his posture at ease.","\"The purpose of a physical store is not just to sell flowers, but more often to serve as a brand promotion.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Not to sell flowers?\"","She lowered her eyes, contemplating his words.","Her gaze inadvertently fell on the steaming floral tea. Suddenly she understood something and said:","\"The physical store could focus on floral tea, afternoon tea. If customer traffic increases, could also open up flower arranging classes or art salons.\"","She recalled the wealthy madams she had seen on TV before.","After satisfying material needs, they would often want to cultivate some elegant hobbies.","Not expecting Sheng Mumu to grasp it immediately and even take it a step further, Qi Mo's lips hooked approvingly.","\"Excellent idea, worth trying out.\"","Before talking to Qi Mo, the flower shop plan was just an outline in Sheng Mumu's mind.","After their discussion, she felt it could now directly proceed - building it into a franchise brand promoted across upscale communities seemed imminent.","Sheng Mumu was excited, then sank back down. Opening a physical store was good, but costs would be higher.","Qi Mo had struggled in the business world for many years. With one look he discerned the subtle change in her expression. Putting down his teacup, he slowly began:","\"What's the estimated initial investment? I'll provide it for you.\"","\"No need.\" Sheng Mumu rejected outright without thinking, then said in a volume only the two could hear: \"To avoid complications with dividing assets after divorcing, better to not be entangled too much.\"","Qi Mo was taken aback to hear this.","He hadn't considered this aspect before.","Nor had he thought Sheng Mumu would want a share of ownership for taking his money.","Qi Mo looked at Sheng Mumu, his gaze now tinged with incomprehension.","Not long ago, she had still wanted to pretend their marriage was real.","Why could she now so nonchalantly talk about divorce?","Speaking with utter sincerity, without the slightest intention of advance and retreat tactics.","For the first time, this man - usually skilled in logic and understanding human nature - felt unable to see through someone.","After pondering for a moment, Sheng Mumu finally thought of a solution.","One that would allow her to quickly start on the flower shop project without lacking funds.","She looked straight at Qi Mo, eyes bright, smiling as she blinked at him.","\"Um... I'll probably need about two million initial capital. Could I borrow that from you, at the same interest rate as banks? Would that work?\"","Worried he might disagree, she quickly added:","\"You can think of it as an employee asking the boss for an advance on salary, you can even earn interest on it. How about it?\"","When she finished speaking, the man's hand gripping his teacup silently tightened.","Salary?","Was she referring to the five hundred thousand monthly living expenses mentioned in their prenuptial agreement?","The word \"salary\" was far too cold. The previously warm atmosphere was instantly doused.","Qi Mo lowered his eyes, restraining the curiosity and probing that had flashed through his eyes.","Sheng Mumu waited anxiously for his reply, brows slightly knitted.","After a long pause, he slowly raised his eyes, looking at her meaningfully and remarking with interest:","\"Okay.\"","At his words, Sheng Mumu seemed to hear a \"Funds transferred\" notification chime in her ears.","She clenched her fists and cheered silently.","Yes! Success!","With the strong backing of her rich dad, Sheng Mumu was full of motivation.","After saying goodbye to Qi Mo, she bounced upstairs, planning to make a list of everything needed to prepare for the flower shop.","Reaching the second floor landing, from the corner of her eye she noticed Qi Mo walking over to the sofa holding the laptop QI Shaobai had left behind.","Sheng Mumu slowed her pace, looking over inquisitively.","She saw Qi Mo open the laptop - the screen showed the backend code for the shopping program Qi Shaobai had written.","He slowly scrolled through the pages, reading through the code carefully from start to finish.","His sharp, rugged profile sometimes taut, sometimes softened.","Sheng Mumu tiptoed slightly. Walking from the second floor stairs to the master bedroom, she tread extremely lightly. But suspicion rose to a peak after silently closing the door.","So Qi Mo wasn't indifferent towards Qi Shaobai after all.","Why wouldn't he express it openly?"]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Your stepmother went into a hotel with a man.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu let loose and fully embraced the opportunity at hand.","With great care, she drafted a loan agreement.","One day, when Qi Mo returned home, his foot had just crossed the threshold of the bedroom.","Sheng Mumu, who was waiting by the door, promptly handed him the agreement.","\"Mr. Qi, please sign here,\" she said.","The man's hand, which was loosening his tie, paused for a moment.","After a brief moment of hesitation, he couldn't help but smile and took the agreement, writing his name next to hers.","Sheng Mumu carefully received the signed agreement and reassured him, \"I will definitely repay the principal and interest within the agreed time frame, and I won't run away.\"","Qi Mo chuckled. \"Hmm.\"","Since the company went public, the contracts he handled never amounted to less than nine figures.","It had been many years since he had treated a mere two million agreement with such solemnity.","\"Now that it's signed, is there anything else I need to do?\" Qi Mo asked, a hint of amusement in his voice.","\"No, just wait for good news from me,\" Sheng Mumu replied, her lips curved confidently.","Qi Mo's gaze fell on her self-assured smile, his Adam's apple bobbing slightly as he tugged his tie a little harder. He spoke with a hint of laughter, \"Alright.\"","Watching Sheng Mumu leave with excitement, he lowered his gaze to the contract in his hand.","[Additional note: If the debtor Sheng Mumu fails to fulfill the repayment obligation within the specified period, the creditor Qi Mo has the right to pursue the outstanding debt by any means necessary.]","—Qi Mo; Sheng Mumu.","This was perhaps the most extraordinary contract he had ever signed in his life.","He walked into his study and placed this contract together with a stack of project contracts, each with at least nine zeros behind the numbers.","*","The progress of the flower shop exceeded Sheng Mumu's expectations.","She spent half a month surveying the area and finally settled on a storefront less than a kilometer away from Xiyu Yue Ting, surrounded by three upscale residential areas.","The storefront had two floors, with nearly fifty square meters of space on the ground floor, which could be transformed into an outdoor glass greenhouse.","Standing outside the still empty shop, Sheng Mumu could already envision the beautiful scene of sunlight streaming through the colored glass a few months later.","Once the store address was finalized, Sheng Mumu began contacting imported flower suppliers.","She fully utilized her well-honed ability to compare prices, which she had developed during past Double Eleven shopping festivals.","Among the numerous cooperative discount offers from suppliers, she selected the one that suited her best.","Following the idea that \"cost-saving equals early profitability,\" Sheng Mumu employed bargaining techniques she had learned from her grandmother when they used to go shopping together.","However, her grandmother's bargaining involved getting a few extra scallions from the vegetable vendor.","In contrast, Sheng Mumu smiled and effortlessly convinced the supplier to include exquisite complimentary greeting cards with each bouquet.","But these greeting cards shouldn't be underestimated.","They would play a crucial role in the promotional ideas she had in mind for the flower shop.","Just as she was contemplating the name of the shop, her phone buzzed in her pocket.","Before she could unlock the screen, it vibrated several more times.","Mrs. Song, the neighbor from the next villa, had added Sheng Mumu to the community's housewives group chat.","She sent three consecutive welcome messages, subtly conveying the underlying message of \"I've become good friends with Mrs. Qi\" that was worth flaunting.","Mrs. Song: We have a new friend in our group, Mrs. Qi, who lives next door to me. Mrs. Qi is beautiful and easy to get along with. Welcome, welcome! [Applause]","Mrs. Zhao: Is she Mrs. Qi Mo, Qi Mo's wife?","Mrs. Qian: Of course, Mrs. Song lives next to the Qi residence. Welcome, Mrs. Qi.","Mrs. Sun: I've been wanting to meet Mrs. Qi for a long time. I bumped into her at the entrance of the residential area last time. She has a great figure. Maybe she can share some tips on body management with us. [Smile] [Rose]","Mrs. Li: Let's have an afternoon tea together.","...","Before joining the group, Mrs. Song briefly introduced Mrs. Qi to Sheng Mumu. The people in this group were of similar age, mostly in their thirties, and lived in the same residential area. Occasionally, they would get together for beauty treatments, gossip, and play mahjong to pass the time.","To be honest, Sheng Mumu was not used to the shallow and unproductive conversations in this commercial group chat.","But in order to attract the first batch of customers to her flower shop, she occasionally participated in the group chat and tried to engage in the topics discussed by everyone.","Sheng Mumu noticed that everyone else's nickname followed the format of \"Mrs. X.\"","After hesitating for a while, she decided not to follow the trend and continued to use her own name as the nickname in the group.","Not for any particular reason.","Just the thought that if she divorced Qi Mo one day and was still in the group, she would have to change her nickname back, which would be awkward.","However, even though she chatted with everyone using her real name \"Sheng Mumu\" every day, the ladies still referred to her as Mrs. Qi.","At that moment, Sheng Mumu finally understood the meaning behind Qi Mo's words that day.","He said, \"If it were you, you could consider managing a physical store.\"","If it were you...","Implicitly, it included her current identity as Mrs. Qi.","Qi Mo truly deserved to be a successful businessman who led the Qi Group to go public at a young age.","In just a short conversation, he had already stood in her shoes and considered her advantages.","He was truly a cunning old fox!","Sheng Mumu silently sighed in her heart.","There was no negative connotation.","It could be considered praise.","In her previous world, during her school days when she was experiencing her first taste of love, Sheng Mumu had secretly admired several people.","After growing up and becoming more mature, she seriously analyzed the common characteristics of the boys she liked—","Without exception, they had to be intelligent.","She was contradictory.","She could occasionally have a brain freeze and do something stupid, but her significant other must be intelligent.","Exceptionally intelligent.","Intelligent in a worldly and sophisticated way.","It was precisely because she understood this point that she found the reason for her being single since birth.","Since starting to work after graduation and losing the naive and beautiful filter of campus life, she had encountered one smooth-talking man after another.","Among ten people, there were probably five smooth talkers, three oily men, and one wise guy.","The remaining one might even be a sister.","Sigh.","Compared to the people she had met before, this world was really too friendly.","In other words, her \"fake husband\" Qi Mo was just too good, not fitting into the aforementioned categories.","Wait a minute! Stop!","Why should she compare Qi Mo with her criteria for choosing a partner?","That's strange.","Sheng Mumu hit the brakes on her thoughts and got back on track.","With her personality, she couldn't accept the convenience brought by her identity as Mrs. Qi during her entrepreneurial process without a clear conscience.","She secretly thought in her heart that she would share the profits with Qi Mo once the flower shop started making money.","Even if he didn't want it, she would definitely find another way to give it to him.","She didn't want to owe anyone any favors.","On the other hand, Qi Shaobai also noticed that Sheng Mumu had been extremely busy, leaving early and returning late every day.","He didn't inquire further.","Sheng Mumu was not the malicious stepmother he had imagined, but there was no need to deliberately get closer to her.","Being strangers living under the same roof was fine, without interfering with each other—it was good enough.","On this day, Qi Shaobai skipped his evening self-study and made plans to play basketball with Wei Chaonan.","While on their way to the basketball court, someone suddenly appeared and blocked their path.","Liu Zhenzhen gathered her courage and stood opposite Qi Shaobai, timidly raising her gaze.","\"Brother Qi...\"","Last time, Liu Zhenzhen had tried to drug Qi Shaobai's drink but failed. She had thought that as long as Qi Shaobai didn't notice, there would be another opportunity in the future.","But she didn't expect that after that day, Qi Shaobai would always be indifferent to her, not even willing to talk to her.","She had no idea where she had gone wrong.","Qi Shaobai glanced at her and impatiently said,","\"Don't block the way.\"","After uttering those words, he continued walking forward.","After Sheng Mumu told him about the incident with the drugged drink, he completely cut off contact with Liu Zhenzhen. They weren't that close to begin with, so severing ties didn't burden his mind.","He didn't make it clear because he didn't want any trouble.","He didn't expect Liu Zhenzhen to suddenly appear here today.","Seeing that Qi Shaobai didn't want to acknowledge her, Liu Zhenzhen grew anxious and took a couple of steps forward to catch up.","Gritting her teeth, she called out,","\"Brother Qi, I saw your stepmother and a man entering a hotel.\""]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Tea Radar Goes Off Again","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai halted his footsteps and slowly turned around.","Liu Zhenzhen was secretly delighted in her heart. She steadied her breathing and ran up to stand in front of him.","\"This afternoon, I saw your stepmother going into a hotel with another man. That wasn't Qi uncle.\"","In order to prove what she was saying, Liu Zhenzhen took out her phone and opened up the photo album. She held it out in front of Qi Shaobai.","Whether it was heaven helping her or not, Liu Zhenzhen had been worrying recently about how to find opportunities to chat with Qi Shaobai. By chance this afternoon, she had stumbled upon that scene.","In front of a five-star hotel entrance.","She saw Sheng Mumu get out of a car with a strange man, chatting and laughing as they walked into the hotel together.","She was extremely shocked.","Amidst her astonishment, she did not forget to use her phone to take some photos.","This was a good chance to find an excuse to talk to Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai lowered his eyes and swept a glance across the phone screen.","His brow furrowed slightly.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's change in expression, Liu Zhenzhen thought to herself: Success!","She had imagined that if Qi Shaobai's stepmother really was having an affair like she guessed, that would be perfect.","Then, she could take the initiative to offer to keep the secret for Qi Shaobai.","Having a shared secret often brings two people closer together.","Then, if she tried a little harder, perhaps she could become Qi Shaobai's girlfriend.","This had been her dream and wish ever since she first saw Qi Shaobai in 10th grade.","Qi Shaobai gazed coldly at the screen, lips pressed tightly together.","The man in the photo looked around the same age as Sheng Mumu.","That meant he was younger than his dad.","No matter how shocked he was inside, he did not want to show even a hint of it on his face in front of others.","Qi Shaobai's gaze moved away from the phone. He continued walking forward.","After taking a few steps, as if remembering something, he finally turned back and said to Liu Zhenzhen:","\"Send those photos to me.\"","...","Qi Shaobai was no longer in the mood to play basketball. He sent Wei Zhaonan a message saying he wouldn't go anymore.","Then he directly got in the car.","He told the driver: \"Go home.\"","Qi Shaobai gazed out the car window.","The flickering light of the streetlamps shone on his face, alternating between light and shadow.","In the stubborn, deep gaze of the youth, it was hard to tell whether it was disappointment or anger.","When Qi Shaobai returned home, Sheng Mumu was sitting on the living room sofa talking to someone on the phone.","Just as Qi Shaobai was bending down to change his shoes, Sheng Mumu happened to end her call and put her phone back in her pocket.","This coincidence made Qi Shaobai feel heavy inside.","He couldn't help but sensitively suspect that Sheng Mumu deliberately hung up so quickly so he wouldn't hear the content of the phone call.","Seeing Qi Shaobai return, Sheng Mumu casually asked:","\"You're back. Have you eaten?\"","After interacting these past days, Sheng Mumu's attitude toward Qi Shaobai had gradually become less awkward.","She was increasingly able to naturally accept the role of stepmother.","During their infrequent encounters, she would occasionally chat some superficial, meaningless words.","Qi Shaobai's face was expressionless as he put on his slippers and walked in.","\"I ate a little for dinner.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Oh.\"","Just as she was about to turn around and go upstairs, Qi Shaobai called out to stop her.","\"Wait a moment—\"","Sheng Mumu looked back.","Qi Shaobai appeared hesitant. He seemed to take a deep breath, then took out his phone from his pocket.","Sheng Mumu couldn't discern any clues from his expression. She looked puzzled: \"?\"","Qi Shaobai handed his phone over.","\"Someone showed me some photos. Take a look.\"","Qi Shaobai spoke very calmly. He was simply objectively recounting what he had heard, without adding any emotion.","Before figuring out the truth of the matter, he would not rashly make judgments.","However, a tiny spark had been lit in his suspicions.","In fact, when his dad had told him he was bringing a woman home to marry, Qi Shaobai had wickedly wondered:","Sheng Mumu was 28 and his dad was 38. There was a 10 year age gap between them. Wouldn't that become a problem in the future?","Why would a 28 year old Sheng Mumu choose someone so much older than her as a marriage partner?","Now, Qi Shaobai and Sheng Mumu stood facing each other.","He wanted to get to the bottom of the photos, and also resolve the questions that had been buried in his heart all this time.","Sheng Mumu took the phone with a completely bewildered look. She swiped through each photo one by one.","Her mental process gradually shifted from \"That's not me!\" shock, to \"I should have put on a more flattering lip color since I knew I might get photographed\" regret.","In the last photo, the wind had just blown, messing up her hair in a very unflattering way.","Who took these? Would they get in trouble for sneaky shots?","Feeling a bit angry, she swiped the screen with too much force, directly exiting the photo album and going back to the messaging screen.","Unintentionally, she caught sight of the profile pic of the person who had sent these photos to Qi Shaobai.","Long straight black hair, posing with faux innocence.","She immediately recognized who it was.","Oh, wasn't this that little green tea girl who had come to their house as a guest the other day?","Sheng Mumu's eyes were sharp. In just a few seconds, she noticed the last message Liu Zhenzhen had sent to Qi Shaobai:","[Qi gege, let's meet up and chat this weekend if you're free. I want to help you resolve this matter together. Don't worry, I will definitely keep it secret for you. [Cute Cat Emoji.JPG]]","Ding ding—","Sheng Mumu's green tea radar went off again.","So Liu Zhenzhen wanted to use the secretly photographed pictures of her to get close to Qi Shaobai?","Sheng Mumu thought it was funny. When she gave the phone back to Qi Shaobai, she candidly said:","\"Sorry, I accidentally scrolled out just now.\"","It was impolite to exit out of someone's photo album into their private messages, but she really hadn't done it on purpose and felt the need to clarify that to Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai didn't care about such things. On the contrary, he was surprised that Sheng Mumu's reaction seemed so calm after seeing the photos.","He gazed straight at Sheng Mumu, eyes opened a bit wider, as if waiting for her to say something.","Sheng Mumu frowned. Her expression suddenly turned gloomy:","\"She took such unflattering pictures of me. To be fair, I should look better in person, right?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","???","Is that the point?","Sheng Mumu was still annoyed.","\"I shouldn't have believed the sales lady. The nude lip color looks like it's almost gone. What do you think?\"","Qi Shaobai was suddenly at a loss for how to respond.","After a long pause of several seconds, he replied somewhat helplessly: \"It's fine, not ugly.\"","Sheng Mumu had just casually asked on a whim. She never expected the aloof, prickly Qi Shaobai to actually give a serious answer.","She suddenly felt comforted.","Fine. I'll believe your aesthetic discernment since you're the future male lead.","Sheng Mumu brought the conversation back on track. She slowly said:","\"Liu Zhenzhen wants to meet up with you. Bring me along too?\""]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: I didn't cheat on your Dad.","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai subconsciously frowned: \"I didn't plan on meeting with her.\"","If Liu Zhenzhen hadn't insisted on adding him on WeChat to send photos, he wouldn't have wanted to add her at all.","Qi Shaobai's quick response gave Sheng Mumu a vague sense that he meant to draw a clear line with Liu Zhenzhen.","Sheng Mumu's gaze became approving.","Not bad, Qi Shaobai was still quite virtuous before meeting the future female lead.","He was educable.","Qi Shaobai had imagined Sheng Mumu's reaction after seeing the photos.","If she had strongly denied it or wanted to silence him, he would definitely have told his dad.","But now, she was so nonchalant about it.","It made him confused instead.","Qi Shaobai hadn't noticed, but the dark cloud gathering over his brow had dispersed somewhat.","It seemed he felt relieved in his heart.","Subconsciously felt there was a misunderstanding about this.","He didn't actually dislike Sheng Mumu as a stepmother, on the contrary, after the parent-teacher conference incident, the impression Sheng Mumu left him with wasn't bad.","She was an adult who was reasonable and didn't judge people with prejudice.","After thinking for a while, Sheng Mumu said, \"Then I'll go meet with her alone, can you help arrange it?\"","Qi Shaobai frowned in puzzlement: \"?\"","What was she trying to do?","Pay hush money? Or spend a high price to buy the photos from Liu Zhenzhen?","He had already seen the photos himself, what was the point of her doing this?","Qi Shaobai: \"I'll go with you.\"","Sheng Mumu understood what Qi Shaobai was thinking. She smiled and said:","\"Don't worry, I didn't cheat on your dad.\"","\"Recently I wanted to open a flower shop. The man in the photos was introduced by Vice President Dong to help with flower sales channels. We simply went to the hotel because the afternoon tea there is delicious.\"","She didn't have the time or reason to cheat.","Right now she just wanted to focus on business. Money was more lovable than men.","What feelings?","It would interfere with her making money.","Having his assumptions laid bare, Qi Shaobai curled the fingers hanging by his side. He didn't look Sheng Mumu in the eye, and his jaw tightened somewhat.","\"I don't listen to one side of the story, which is why I came to ask you. I didn't intend to catch you having an affair.\"","Hearing this, Sheng Mumu nodded approvingly with a faint smile.","Good, knowing to ask directly when there's an issue was a good habit.","So many misunderstandings in novels were because the male and female leads didn't communicate.","Luckily this future male lead Qi Shaobai had a voice.","Not bad, not bad.","As expected, her own taste in choosing novels wasn't bad. She mentally gave herself a thumbs up.","Qi Shaobai was silent, not knowing what to say.","Indeed.","Thinking carefully, except for being young, that man couldn't compare to his dad anywhere.","Unless you were blind, you wouldn't choose the latter over his dad.","Qi Shaobai suddenly felt somewhat remorseful.","He shouldn't have assumed malicious things about Sheng Mumu's relationship with that man.","His face flushed slightly.","Not wanting Sheng Mumu to see his embarrassed appearance, he unnaturally rubbed the back of his neck.","Seeing through Qi Shaobai's mind, Sheng Mumu spoke reassuringly:","\"You speaking up directly like this is a very good habit. You didn't bring me any distress. So don't feel bad or like you were meddling.\"","\"Communicating directly with adults is great. Keep it up, young man.\"","Qi Shaobai slowly looked towards Sheng Mumu, momentarily speechless.","He was surprised Sheng Mumu would actually bring him snacks.","Even more surprised that Sheng Mumu had noticed his usual flavor preferences.","From young till now, even his dad hadn't paid attention to these little details.","In an instant, his remorse grew stronger.","When Liu Zhenzhen received Qi Shaobai's message, she was at evening self-study.","\"Ah!\"","Seeing the four words \"time\" and \"location\" on the screen, she couldn't help crying out in excitement.","She didn't care about her classmates' gazes, openly replying to the message.","The smile on her face was so wide it seemed about to spill out.","She and Qi Shaobai agreed to meet at a cafe on the commercial street outside school on Sunday night.","A senior sister had said the cafe had a very nice decorated atmosphere, and many couples liked going there on dates.","Evening self-study wasn't over yet, but she faked illness and went home early.","Hoping to have ample time to coordinate her outfit and accessories, so she could appear before Qi Shaobai in optimal condition this weekend.","The photos were a stepping stone.","She could finally use this stepping stone to get closer to the boy of her dreams.","*","The day Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai went out happened to be Sunday. Neither expected Qi Mo to actually be home.","Sheng Mumu stood in the doorway of Qi Shaobai's room, yelling in without knocking:","\"Are you ready? I've already changed, why are you so slow.\"","Qi Shaobai's voice rang clear from the room: \"Coming.\"","Sheng Mumu urged: \"Hurry up, hurry up.\"","Teenagers were so troublesome. Slowly getting ready, too obsessed with their idol image.","Not long after, the room door opened.","Qi Shaobai didn't look directly at Sheng Mumu, speaking casually: \"Let's go.\"","In the living room, hearing their entire conversation, Qi Mo's hand tightened on his coffee cup.","His gaze towards them became profound.","He had never seen Qi Shaobai listen to someone other than him before.","Nor had he imagined that after just one month, Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai's relationship would be so harmonious.","Even...","Talking with Sheng Mumu, Qi Shaobai seemed more relaxed and casual than with him.","Passing through the living room, Sheng Mumu only then noticed Qi Mo sitting there, somewhat surprised.","\"Oh, you're not going to work today?\"","Qi Mo nodded: \"Mm, but I'm about to head out for a meeting.\"","Sheng Mumu immediately had a \"I knew it\" expression.","In her impression, if he wasn't working, then he was on the way to work.","\"You're going out?\"","Qi Mo looked at Qi Shaobai, then back to Sheng Mumu, and asked.","Before Sheng Mumu could reply, Qi Shaobai quickly said:","\"Mm...I made plans with Wei Chaonan to play ball. She happened to be going out and is giving me a ride.\"","Sheng Mumu slowly turned her neck and silently looked at Qi Shaobai.","Kid, do you know how obvious your lying looks?","Oblivious, Qi Shaobai added:","\"I'm going to be late, let's go. Bye, Dad.\"","Of course Sheng Mumu could tell he was lying. Qi Mo naturally could too.","But he didn't expose it, giving a faint laugh instead.","\"Mm, go on.\"","...","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai got in the car.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's relief, she couldn't help laughing and said while starting the car:","\"Kid, not bad at lying, don't do it again next time.\"","Qi Shaobai turned to look at her, a questioning expression in his eyes.","Sheng Mumu's lips pressed in a line as she shook her head: \"Obvious at a glance.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"That obvious?\"","He only told a little lie because he didn't want to escalate things to his dad before getting to the bottom of the photo matter.","\"Hmm...how to put it,\" Sheng Mumu organized her words, \"Even elementary schoolers lying to teachers about forgetting homework have better acting skills than you.\"","This analogy was insulting yet funny.","Qi Shaobai couldn't help a small eye roll and laugh. \"You can exaggerate more.\"","Sheng Mumu gave him a \"believe it or not\" look. She stepped on the gas.","The white Lamborghini drove off.","The ride was more relaxed than Qi Shaobai imagined.","He had thought it would be awkward going out with Sheng Mumu his stepmother for the first time.","But it wasn't awkward at all.","The two didn't talk much. Occasionally Sheng Mumu would ask him about good restaurants in the city, and he recommended one or two based on his preferences.","The atmosphere was harmonious, as if they weren't going to meet Liu Zhenzhen at all but were simply giving him a ride.","It was just, strange."]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Ryu Jinjin","paragraphs":["Inside the coffee shop.","Liu Zhenzhen had arrived early.","She chose the table by the window on the right side when entering.","She hoped Qi Shaobai would see her at first glance when he came in.","While there was still time before the appointed time, she took out a mirror from her bag to check her makeup.","Hmm, very nice.","A natural, no-makeup look, and her complexion also looked great.","Today she wore a light blue floral print dress.","This was the most expensive dress in her closet that she had reluctantly spent 2000 yuan on for her birthday last year, only worn on important occasions as her \"battle dress\".","The neckline was designed very crafty, with a little \"v\" opening that allowed a tantalizing glimpse of her figure.","She had also specially matched it with a necklace, bracelet and earrings.","Usually she was not allowed to wear jewelry at school, but wearing them today would definitely make Qi Shaobai's eyes light up, showing her most beautiful side.","Through the floor-to-ceiling windows, Liu Zhenzhen saw a white Lamborghini stop at the entrance of the coffee shop.","She was delighted.","With such a cool license plate, this luxurious car must be from the Qi family.","She had not expected Qi Shaobai to attach such importance to this date that he would drive over personally.","She could not help imagining that after finishing their coffee, she might be able to sit in the passenger seat and take a drive with him.","Just thinking about it made her blush slightly.","The passenger door opened.","Qi Shaobai got out.","He was wearing a black T-shirt and grey sweatpants. Even such a simple outfit still had an irresistible charm, looking youthful and carefree, with a hint of rebellion in his brows and eyes.","Right after, Sheng Mumu pushed open the car door.","The driver's side was squeezed against the wall making it narrow, so she first handed her bag out and very naturally instructed:","\"Qi Shaobai, come help me get my bag, it's hard to open the door.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned for half a second, but his body reacted faster than his brain, and he had already taken Sheng Mumu's bag.","Sheng Mumu got out of the car smoothly, closed the door, took back her bag, and said \"Thanks.\"","This scene made Liu Zhenzhen's eyes pop out.","She was still in shock about what was going on when Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai sat down across from her.","Sheng Mumu was the only adult at the table. Compared to the two high schoolers, she seemed much more composed and steady.","As soon as she sat down, she beckoned to the waiter.","\"One iced latte.\" She looked up at Qi Shaobai and Liu Zhenzhen and asked casually, \"What would you like to drink?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Iced water.\"","Liu Zhenzhen was intimidated by Sheng Mumu's aura. Afraid that she had come to confront her about the secret photos, she responded half a beat slower:","\"...Orange juice, thanks Auntie.\"","Sheng Mumu told the waiter: \"Also one iced water, one orange juice, and a waffle and some fries.\"","Soon the waiter brought over their orders.","Sheng Mumu was in no hurry to get to the point.","She ate a few fries while they were still hot and crispy, as a foodie's self-cultivation did not allow her to watch the fries go soft without taking action.","Seeing how calm she was, Liu Zhenzhen couldn't sit still anymore and broke the silence first:","\"Auntie, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to secretly take photos of you.\"","\"Oh? Is that so?\" Sheng Mumu glanced back as if casually, a rare sharpness flashing through her eyes. Then she smiled and said, \"I'm not as easily fooled as Qi Shaobai, little one.\"","I've got 11 years on you, don't think I didn't earn it. I've seen countless scheming girls like you.","Hearing this, Qi Shaobai sitting to the side stiffened for a moment: \"...\"","It felt like he was being implied about something.","What did she mean he was easily fooled?","He was very smart okay?","Liu Zhenzhen looked aggrievedly at Qi Shaobai for a moment. Seeing that he didn't even glance at her or try to speak up, she slightly knitted her brows, seeming lost in thought about something else.","Liu Zhenzhen thought: Qi Shaobai must be afraid of his stepmother, that's why he's not saying anything.","Recalling the scene of Qi Shaobai helping Sheng Mumu with her bag when getting out of the car, she became even more convinced of what she was thinking.","Since he was unwilling to openly offend the malicious stepmother, then she would do it for him.","Liu Zhenzhen decided to show Qi Shaobai her determination to always stand by his side through action.","\"Auntie, my intention in taking those photos was out of concern for Shaobai. Now that you know, I hope you won't make things difficult for Shaobai anymore in the future. Treat Shaobai better. I promise I won't tell anyone about the photos.\"","Qi Shaobai felt goosebumps rising.","???","Who allowed her to call him that?","At this time Sheng Mumu was also somewhat confused. What did she mean by \"make things difficult again\"?","When had she ever made things difficult for him?","Please, don't think of a stepmother as being so terrifying!","This girl must have watched too many melodramatic family dramas.","After saying all this, Liu Zhenzhen stared at Sheng Mumu, not wanting to back down in aura.","She had the photos in hand. Ultimately, wasn't the other party the one who should be afraid?","While holding eye contact, Liu Zhenzhen noticed Sheng Mumu's outfit today.","The qipao jacket Sheng Mumu was wearing was something she had seen in a magazine last week. It was a limited edition piece from a designer's current collection, supposedly costing 80,000 yuan.","Liu Zhenzhen also recognized Sheng Mumu's chain bag at her side. That alone had to be worth six digits.","Liu Zhenzhen knew not to compete with a grown woman on clothing and accessories, but still unconsciously felt a twinge of sourness in her heart as she clenched her hands tightly.","Suddenly feeling that her own blue dress looked particularly shabby in comparison.","Then this sourness turned into disdain.","Humph, putting on airs as a stepmother when she could only dress so extravagantly by becoming Mrs. Qi.","Once she won Qi Shaobai's heart and married into the Qi family, she would also be able to have all those brand name clothes, bags, and jewelry.","Sheng Mumu smiled calmly.","Facing a girl quite a bit younger than herself, she really had no desire to engage in a battle.","She unlocked her bag, took out her phone and some printed papers.","Then she tapped her phone a few times, turned it around, and slid it across to Liu Zhenzhen.","\"Little one, the person in this video is you, right?\"","Hearing this, Liu Zhenzhen's heart raced as she lowered her eyes in panic.","The video made her face turn white with fright.","It had captured the scene of her secretly pouring something into Qi Shaobai's cup that day at the Qi house...","She would never have imagined that moment was witnessed and recorded.","Moreover, by Qi Shaobai's stepmother!","Seeing Liu Zhenzhen scared pale, Sheng Mumu had no intention of letting up.","Because the feeling of slapping someone in the face like this was just too satisfying.","She now fully understood why female leads in TV dramas always seemed to have so many misunderstandings pile up before resolving them all at once.","It felt so good!","Sheng Mumu lightly brushed her fair hand over the papers and spread them out in front of Liu Zhenzhen.","Fortunately Sheng Mumu had had the foresight to immediately record Liu Zhenzhen's misdeeds on video when she discovered it, in case the facts became unclear afterward.","She had even specially gotten the contents of that drink analyzed, just in case someone tried to deny accountability later on.","Sheng Mumu said: \"You should know better than me what you added to the drink. If this matter got escalated to the school...\"","Upon hearing the word \"school\", Liu Zhenzhen's mind buzzed.","She didn't hear the rest of the words. Her whole body was filled with fear.","Luckily she was sitting down. If standing, her legs probably would have gone soft and she would have collapsed."]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: The red scarf on the chest is brighter.","paragraphs":["Liu Zhenzhen had worked so hard to get into Beijing No. 1 Middle School, an elite school for the children of wealthy families, just so that she could meet more children of rich families and rise up in the world. If she got expelled from school because of this, her life would be over!","Thinking about this, tears started streaming down her face.","\"Auntie, I was wrong, I shouldn't have tried to threaten you with those photos. I really know I did something wrong...\"","Sheng Mumu hated it the most when someone tried to use tears to sway her, even if it was a little girl ten years younger than herself, and she immediately became irritated.","Raising her voice, she sternly said:","\"Don't cry!\"","If the girl kept crying like this, it would seem as if Sheng Mumu was bullying her.","When Liu Zhenzhen finally managed to hold back her tears, Sheng Mumu spoke again:","\"Those photos you took of me weren't a threat. I don't have any weaknesses that could be threatened, and the relationship between me and that man isn't what you think.\"","Liu Zhenzhen sniffled, not daring to sob out loud.","Sheng Mumu said, \"I'm telling you this so that you don't think I'm bullying a little kid.","Liu Zhenzhen said, \"No, auntie, it was all my fault...\"","\"Of course it was your fault,\" Sheng Mumu nodded decisively. \"You shouldn't be thinking such crooked thoughts at such a young age, and you mustn't lead our Qi Shaobai astray.\"","Hearing this, Qi Shaobai, who had been staring out the window the whole time not wanting to join the conversation, slowly turned his head and looked at Sheng Mumu.","His ears shouldn't have a problem.","Did she just say \"our Qi Shaobai\"?","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Sheng Mumu had already gotten into character and didn't notice Qi Shaobai's strange expression as she continued speaking to Liu Zhenzhen:","\"Sister understands what you're thinking at your age. I was young once too. I just hope that you stop thinking like that from now on. Studying is the main duty of high school students. Our family is quite traditional, and his father and I don't allow him to date early.\"","After saying all this in one breath, Sheng Mumu had a sense of déjà vu, as if she was a mother-in-law slapping a bank card down in the face of the mistress and saying, \"Here's 5 million, now leave my son alone.\"","Of course, she only felt this way a tiny bit.","After all, Qi Shaobai wasn't her son.","She would also never do something as silly as trying to buy someone off with money like in those clichéd plots.","That would just be stupid.","Beside her, Qi Shaobai had just taken a sip of iced water. Upon hearing Sheng Mumu refer to herself as \"sister\", he choked on the water. Through sheer willpower, he managed to force back the cough.","Sister? What the heck?","When others called you auntie, you voluntarily lowered your status?","Your thought process is quite interesting.","To think Dad married such a stepmother...","Dad's taste in women...","Is quite unique...","This ridiculous farce ended after Liu Zhenzhen swore again and again that she would never bother Qi Shaobai again.","Sheng Mumu suddenly remembered that the female lead of the book wouldn't appear for a while yet.","By then, she might have already divorced Qi Mo.","Helping the female lead resolve a little green tea bitch* early could be considered her contribution as a nominal mother-in-law.","Do good deeds without seeking credit.","Instantly, Sheng Mumu felt like the red scarf on her chest shone even more brightly.","Her expression became proud along with it.","Only Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai were left sitting at the table.","Qi Shaobai looked at Sheng Mumu with a trace more admiration in his eyes.","With his hands folded in front of him, he clearly felt his stepmother was quite capable, yet he still maintained an indifferent expression, casually saying:","\"I was sick of her pestering me too. Thank you for helping me resolve this annoyance. I didn't expect you to be so eloquent.\"","She had resolved the matter in just a few sentences without saying anything harsh.","Not only did she clarify the photo incident, but she also got Liu Zhenzhen to stop buzzing around him like a fly in the future.","Awesome.","Sheng Mumu was also quite satisfied with how she had handled things today. Raising an eyebrow, she jokingly teased:","\"Little boy, do you suddenly feel like kneeling down and calling me Daddy?\"","Qi Shaobai's expression froze, and the corner of his mouth twitched. \"...\"","His face instantly transformed into one looking at an idiot.","There's something seriously wrong with you.","No need to go that far.","Really no need.","Sheng Mumu read the contempt on his face. She raised her hand and pretended to smack him.","\"You little punk, what's with that look on your face?\"","For some reason, Qi Shaobai found it funny but didn't retort. Instead, his expression became serious as he slowly said:","\"Right, can you not tell my dad about this matter?\"","Sheng Mumu narrowed her eyes, wondering what Qi Shaobai was scheming.","What was up with this father and son? Why were both so unwilling to let the other know about their matters?","Qi Shaobai's gaze was evasive, his voice carrying a youthful stubbornness.","\"I don't want my dad to know.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly understood.","A prideful man indeed.","She could understand.","While she understood in her heart, she wasn't willing to directly promise with her mouth.","She hadn't forgotten the contemptuous look Qi Shaobai had given her earlier, as if looking at an idiot.","Sheng Mumu took a sip of coffee arrogantly and slowly said:","\"I can promise, but there's a condition.\"","Qi Shaobai's brows furrowed. \"What condition?\"","Sheng Mumu looked outside the floor-to-ceiling windows.","They were on a street behind the school. Even on weekends, many students came here to hang out, and many of the restaurants and shops were filled with people.","\"Treat me to a meal as a landlord should. You're familiar with this area.\"","To be brutally honest, Sheng Mumu was tired of eating the exotic mountain and seafood dishes made by the Qi family's chef ever since transmigrating to this world.","Just now when she got out of the car, she had smelled the scent of fried chicken strips.","The tender chicken coated with breadcrumbs then fried to a crisp in oil, sprinkled with cumin and chili powder.","The Sheng Mumu next door was practically drooling.","Because they had serious business to deal with earlier, Sheng Mumu didn't have the nerve to suggest randomly going to buy chicken strips.","Now that the matter was resolved, her previously suppressed appetite rose up again.","Upon hearing this, Qi Shaobai couldn't help but let out a laugh through his nose.","He had thought it would be some kind of outrageous demand.","That's it?","He rubbed the back of his neck and got up, walking to the door and arrogantly throwing over his shoulder:","\"Let's go, order whatever you want.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Sheng Mumu walked slowly behind him.","Inwardly mocking him.","Must you act so much like a rich boss just to leave? You little punk.","Qi Shaobai had originally resolved himself to being ruthlessly exploited by Sheng Mumu, but unexpectedly, she showed no interest in the high-end restaurants around the school. Instead, her gaze kept landing on the small carts of street vendors.","Red bean wheel cakes, baked sweet potatoes, assorted grain pancakes, charcoal-grilled chicken legs, green bean soup...","It wasn't until Sheng Mumu contentedly said, \"Thank you Qi classmate for the treat, I'm full now,\" that he had spent less than 100 RMB.","100 RMB to buy Sheng Mumu's silence over keeping the secret.","A bit of a profit.","Sheng Mumu also felt she had gotten the better deal.","She thoroughly understood the meaning behind the idiom \"a wild boar that can't eat fine grains.\"**","After eating so many exotic delicacies, she really missed the affordable snacks behind the school.","Just as the two were about to head back, Sheng Mumu noticed that Qi Shaobai had stopped in front of a stand and wasn't moving."]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Sheng Mu Mu is very Loyal","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu was curious and stepped back two steps to look over. She asked:","“You’re not full yet?”","Teenage boys with growing bodies really do have huge appetites.","Qi Shaobai didn’t hear Sheng Mumu’s words.","Standing in front of the malt sugar stall, scenes of the few times he had spent time alone with his dad floated through his mind.","At the beginning of 10th grade when the school held a parents meeting, his dad happened to not be busy that day and came.","On the way home after the meeting, Qi Shaobai saw his dad ask the driver to stop and buy a bag of malt sugar.","He seemed to like eating this.","Seeing Qi Shaobai lost in thought, Sheng Mumu took out her wallet.","“Do you want to eat some malt sugar? I'll treat you.”","Qi Shaobai looked away, appearing indifferent as he glanced at the street lamp. “I don't eat that stuff, my dad likes it.”","“Oh.” Sheng Mumu paused. “If he likes it, why not just buy it? The vendor won't give it to you for free just because you're looking longingly at it.”","Qi Shaobai: “......”","He wasn't looking longingly at all.","As Sheng Mumu spoke, she laughed and took out some money to buy a bag. She held it out to Qi Shaobai.","“Here, take it.”","Qi Shaobai didn't reach out. Instead he put his hands in his pockets, looking aloof.","“I didn't say I wanted to buy it.”","Sheng Mumu: “......”","What a stubborn kid!","He clearly wanted to buy a treat for his dad but didn't want his dad to know it was his idea.","Sheng Mumu was too lazy to explain further. “Fine, I’ll give it to your dad for you.”","Qi Shaobai's expression softened, but his mouth remained stubborn. He shrank his neck back.","“It’s not for me, you wanted to buy it yourself, so you give it to him.”","Sheng Mumu laughed. “Alright, alright, I bought it.”","Would rather die than admit it, huh?","Oh well, no need to expose this rebellious kid.","The car had just driven into a nice neighborhood when Sheng Mumu rolled down her window halfway.","The weather today was great, and the evening breeze felt especially refreshing on her face.","On a whim, she wanted to get out of the car for a walk to help digest her meal.","She really ate too much.","She turned off the engine, parked, and got out in one smooth motion.","Qi Shaobai didn't understand. “What are you doing? We're not there yet.”","Sheng Mumu realized that after spending a day together, Qi Shaobai was no longer as guarded and cold towards her as before.","This wasn’t a good thing. She was supposed to act like a stepmother.","She retorted, “You’re the old one, your whole family is old.”","Qi Shaobai: “......”","That was hard to respond to.","Compared to Sheng Mumu, his dad was pretty old.","Seeing Qi Shaobai at a loss for words, Sheng Mumu felt satisfied. She pushed open the door and got out.","Bending down to look in the car, she asked,","“I ate too much and want to walk it off for a bit. I’ll leave the car here and have Butler Zhang come get it later, or do you want the keys to drive back yourself? Oh right, do you have a license?”","Qi Shaobai wasn’t yet 18 and didn’t have a license, but he knew how to drive.","He sighed resignedly without mentioning he could drive. He got out of the car, as if reluctantly.","“I’ll walk too.”","And so the two strolled slowly down the scenic path.","Sheng Mumu held the bag of malt sugar in one hand, swinging both hands casually behind her back. She looked up at the sky, breathing in the fresh air, and felt her overstuffed stomach settle down quite a bit.","Just then, a black Rolls-Royce drove into the nice neighborhood.","Qi Mo was returning from a tedious board meeting, sitting in the backseat massaging his temples.","Usually at times like this, Driver Wang would keep silent, providing him an environment of absolute quiet to rest in.","But today he broke the norm and spoke up, disturbing the peace in the car.","“Boss Qi, I think that’s Young Master and... Madame up ahead.”","Qi Mo looked up to see.","He was very familiar with Qi Shaobai’s lanky figure and recognized him instantly.","Qi Shaobai was holding a woman’s handbag.","He recognized it as the one Sheng Mumu took when she went out.","Beside Qi Shaobai, Sheng Mumu walked leisurely and carefreely, occasionally turning to chat with him. They seemed to be getting along well.","Driver Wang glanced in the rearview mirror.","“Boss Qi, should we stop to give Madame and Young Master a ride?”","Qi Mo was silent for a few seconds before nodding slightly.","“Mm, stop up ahead.”","“Yes Boss Qi.”","When the Rolls-Royce pulled up next to Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai, Sheng Mumu had just finished telling Qi Shaobai about a lame joke she'd seen.","After Sheng Mumu finished the joke, she laughed so hard she couldn't stand up straight.","Qi Shaobai just looked at her coldly, thinking she looked more like a joke than the lame joke itself. He forced out a couple laughs to humor her.","“Heh heh.”","Sheng Mumu stood up straight, face falling.","“You're better off not laughing. You know going 'heh heh' is likely to get you beat up out there.”","Qi Shaobai thought to himself: Who would dare hit me?","Suddenly, a familiar voice came from beside them.","“Why didn’t you drive back?”","They both turned to see the handsome, charismatic man with a commanding aura through the partially rolled down window. They were both surprised.","Seeing Qi Mo, Qi Shaobai instantly switched to good boy mode. “Dad.”","Perhaps it was the intimacy built up from sharing a bed, but Sheng Mumu had forgotten about Qi Mo's aloof demeanor.","She spoke casually, “I ate too much and wanted to walk back.”","Driver Wang got out of the driver's seat to open the door for his boss.","Qi Mo stepped out with his long legs and stood before them, tidying his coat collar. His tone was casual:","“I’ll walk too.”","Qi Shaobai was stunned. “......”","Sheng Mumu blinked. For a moment she didn't say anything either.","Not because she was shocked that Qi Mo wanted to take a stroll with them, but because his getting out of the car and straightening his clothes was so suave it left her in awe.","Once again she marveled that this man really knew how to charm people, exuding mature masculine appeal at all times.","The sidewalks in this elite neighborhood were usually empty since most residents came and went by car.","With no one else around, the three of them standing by the side of the road made Qi Shaobai feel like a high wattage light bulb.","He was certain his dad only decided to walk instead of riding in the car because of Sheng Mumu.","In Qi Shaobai's eyes, his 38 year-old dad suddenly marrying a woman 10 years younger could only mean he was head over heels in love.","Qi Shaobai hesitated, thinking he might as well just take the car home.","Before he could suggest it, Driver Wang had already driven the Rolls-Royce away.","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","Fine, he was stuck being the light bulb whether he wanted to or not.","Qi Mo very naturally walked to Sheng Mumu's right side.","Seeing the two men on either side of her, both a bit taller, Sheng Mumu wondered if she should change their formation from a \"V\" to a diagonal \"I\".","That way she wouldn't look so short in comparison.","She was pondering this silliness when she felt a gentle grip on her elbow.","Qi Mo's broad palm touched her arm lightly as he looked at the bag in her hand.","\"Let me carry that.\"","He was well-bred, so it was only right for him to help carry things whether she was really his wife or not.","Sheng Mumu didn't stand on ceremony and handed the bag over.","\"Here, this was bought for you anyway so you should take it.\"","Hearing this, Qi Shaobai tensed up.","He was very worried Sheng Mumu would blurt out about the scene at the malt sugar stand.","As Qi Mumu's eyes narrowed following Sheng Mumu's lighthearted words, the warmth in them hardened.","The lamplight shone in his dark yet bright pupils, a flash of subtle surprise passing through.","\"Bought for me? What is it?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Malt sugar.\"","To prevent her from letting anything slip, Qi Shaobai quickly added:","\"She happened to pick me up from school today after I finished playing basketball, and we came across it on the way back.\"","Qi Mo glanced at Qi Shaobai then back at Sheng Mumu. \"Thank you.\"","Walking in the shadow of the streetlamp, Qi Shaobai's shoulders sagged in relief.","He quietly breathed a sigh of relief.","Phew -","Luckily this stepmother was decently trustworthy.","She didn't mention to his dad that it was his idea to buy it.","However, Qi Shaobai didn't know that Sheng Mumu ratted him out later that night..."]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Tell you under the Table","paragraphs":["Bedroom.","When Qi Mo came out of the bathroom after taking a shower, Sheng Mumu was applying a face mask.","Seeing him come out, Sheng Mumu said naturally:","\"Oh, by the way, I'll let you in on a little secret - the maltose candy was specially brought by Qi Shaobai for you. He was staring longingly at the stand, I couldn't stand to watch it anymore.\"","With that said, thinking of Qi Shaobai's blank look, she laughed a few times.","Because of the face mask, her pronunciation was strange, and her \"haha\" laugh turned into \"roar roar\".","She laughed with eyes curved looking at the mirror, not noticing that the man reflected in the mirror was looking at her.","The man had a tall figure, and his motion of drying his hair paused for a moment.","His gaze fell on her back and stopped.","For a fleeting second, he suddenly had a feeling.","It was as if she really treated him and Qi Shaobai as a family.","A strange yet unfamiliar feeling rippled through his heart.","He couldn't say where it came from, but it made the corners of his eyes curl up inexplicably.","Sheng Mumu didn't think she had done anything wrong by secretly leaking information to Qi Mo.","After all, Qi Shaobai had treated her to food today, they had just agreed to keep Liu Zhenzhen's secret between them.","She thought carefully, although she and Qi Shaobai had established a brief stepmother-stepson revolutionary friendship, compared to this brat Qi Shaobai, her real sugardaddy was Qi Mo.","Qi Mo was the one who paid her salary.","Being honest with him could do no harm.","Because maltose candy was mentioned, her quick wit made her suddenly think of a saying she had heard before.","It is said that men who like sweets dote on their wives.","She pondered for a while...","Qi Mo likes maltose candy, Qi Shaobai likes grape flavored sweet soda.","It seems that the Qi men have a liking for sweets.","As the male protagonist of the novel, Qi Shaobai would naturally dote on the female protagonist in the future, so this saying makes some sense.","But Qi Mo...","It doesn't seem to apply.","Sheng Mumu thought of the plot in the book, after the original owner was kicked out, Qi Mo didn't seem to have married again, and died alone.","He didn't even marry a wife, let alone dote on her.","With her thoughts wandering this far, Sheng Mumu suddenly felt a chill down her spine.","Once again determined that she must get along well with the Qi father and son, fulfill the marriage agreement, take the money when it expires, and slip away.","Before going to bed, Sheng Mumu solemnly said to Qi Mo:","\"In the future if I come across a maltose candy stand, I'll get some for you.\"","It would be a favor.","Understanding the preferences of her sugardaddy and taking care of his emotions would be beneficial to her status as a wealthy madam lasting a long time.","Being good to him is also being good to herself.","She really is a clever girl.","Qi Mo took off his ring and placed it gently on the bedside table. Hearing her words, his actions slowed.","\"Thank you then.\"","Actually with his personality, his reply would be \"No need\".","But this time he didn't say that.","Sheng Mumu waved her hand grandly.","\"Hey, with our relationship, no need for thanks!\"","He already gave her 500,000 pocket money every month, how could she be petty over a few bags of maltose?","But Qi Mo misunderstood Sheng Mumu's meaning and fell silent for a few seconds without replying.","When it came to guessing a woman's thoughts, he lacked experience.","Although in the business world, he would also encounter many successful female entrepreneurs, communicating with those women, gender differences could actually be ignored. There was no obvious feeling that men and women were essentially the same, and he would not look down on or treat the other person differently because she was a woman, so her thoughts were not difficult to guess either.","At this moment, Qi Mo realized that a woman's heart really was hard to understand.","What Sheng Mumu meant by \"our relationship\".","He thought about it for a while, and finally came to a conclusion - a marital relationship.","Because they were husband and wife, there was no need to say thank you.","Hmm, it seemed to make sense.","He took note of it.","Before going to sleep, Sheng Mumu mentally reviewed what happened today with her back to Qi Mo.","Getting along with Qi Shaobai was still harmonious. At the current rate, he probably wouldn't become gloomy.","As for Qi Mo, there was not much contact or conversation.","But every time they talked, Qi Mo always gave her a feeling of respect and comfort.","It seemed she didn't need to be too nervous.","As long as she was honest and didn't do anything to damage the relationship between the Qi father and son, there was no need to worry about being kicked out.","Having figured this out, Sheng Mumu decided to interact with them in a more relaxed and casual manner from now on.","*","In the following period of time, Qi Mo was still very busy and rarely came home.","Sheng Mumu was busy with the flower shop matters, and was not home most of the time either.","One day, Sheng Mumu had just returned home and ran into Qi Mo in the yard who was about to go out.","Finally getting a chance to see him, Sheng Mumu seized the opportunity to ask him several questions about what to pay attention to when signing supplier contracts.","Driver Xiao Wang stood in front of the car and glanced at his watch after seeing the two talking.","The afternoon meeting time was coming up, Chairman Qi was usually punctual, could he be late this time?","He looked over worriedly, hesitating whether he should remind them.","Qi Mo was chatting lightly with Sheng Mumu, his expression calm, showing no impatience at all.","After sweeping Xiao Wang a glance, he said to him: \"You go back to the car first.\"","The subtext was: No hurry to leave yet.","Xiao Wang silently sat in the car, and said to himself: I've learned my lesson.","Compared to work, Madam's position in Chairman Qi's heart is more important!"]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: To ensure the smooth birth of the wife","paragraphs":["Regarding the flower shop, Sheng Mumu had basically thought through everything that needed considering.","The only thing that had yet to be determined was the name of the shop.","She had thought of several names, but found them all ordinary and unremarkable, not to her liking.","Fortunately, she had a life motto that often guided her when she was lost.","The saying went: Think thrice before you act.","Think about whether you can not solve this issue?","Think about whether you can solve this tomorrow?","Think about whether you can let someone else solve this?","Abiding by the third tenet of her life motto \"Think thrice before you act,\" she asked Qi Mo if he had any good ideas.","Qi Mo came up with two names.","Sheng Mumu felt they were both too grand, bold and vigorous, not matching the vibe of a flower shop.","Seeing Sheng Mumu dissatisfied with the names he suggested, Qi Mo said:","\"Naming is indeed an important matter. Do you need me to find a professional team to help you come up with ideas?\"","Nowadays there were many companies that specialized in corporate naming services.","Sheng Mumu smiled and declined his good intentions:","\"No need, no need, I'll think of something myself.\"","Professional teams charge fees after all.","She didn't want to spend money so wrongly.","So she had no choice but to resort to the second tenet of \"Think thrice before you act\" - think about whether you can solve this tomorrow.","Uh, so.","The naming was dragged on for several more days.","She was not in a hurry either, silently hoping a flash of inspiration would come to her.","And she did get what she wished for.","Inspiration struck on a certain night.","She sat on the sofa with her feet curled up, watching TV shows while sipping bird's nest soup.","On TV, an imperial concubine was primping in front of a mirror, her rosy lips parted lightly: \"A woman's beauty is for her own delight. His Majesty likes it most when I put on peach blossom makeup. Fruit Green, bring my rouge over...\"","Before the line was finished, Sheng Mumu scoffed:","\"A woman should not dress up for her own delight, but should dress up to delight herself. Modern TV shows always spread undesirable values.\"","Oh wait.","Delight oneself?","To please oneself, to enjoy life.","What a nice implication.","Delivering fresh flowers was already a very romantic thing. Using a daily bouquet to delight oneself, to make life pleasant.","Sheng Mumu slapped her forehead.","\"That's it, just call it Yue Zi Flower House!\"","Sheng Mumu had been vexed by the naming for a long time. Now that it was finally decided, she couldn't wait to share the joy with a loudspeaker.","She looked around, and surprisingly not a soul was in the huge villa!","When one was happy but had no one to cheer with, the excitement would be much dampened.","What a coincidence.","The door of the study on the second floor opened slowly, and Qi Mo walked out.","Qi Mo was going to the kitchen for a glass of iced water.","He had just come downstairs when Sheng Mumu sprang up from the sofa and ran to him.","She hopped and skipped, stopping in front of him and grabbing his sleeve. Her face was beaming with smiles, her voice like a twittering bird, chirping excitedly.","\"I've got it, I've got it! I finally got it!\"","Not knowing what she was talking about, Qi Mo raised his eyebrows questioningly, \"?\"","At this moment, Zhang the housekeeper, who had just finished taking stock of the wine cellar, walked out. Seeing Sheng Mumu enthusiastically holding Qi Mo's sleeve and shouting excitedly, his quick-reacting mind immediately jumped to conclusions.","Having worked for the Qi family for many years, Zhang the housekeeper's forte was his ability to swiftly extract key information from the brief words of his employers.","Suddenly his face lit up and he congratulated them loudly:","\"Congratulations Sir, congratulations Madam. For the next ten months I will pay extra attention to Madam's diet and ensure her safe delivery.\"","Sheng Mumu slowly turned her head. Her face still had the remnants of a smile mixed with puzzlement.","Huh?","Zhang housekeeper, what are you talking about? I don't understand.","Qi Mo also turned to look at Zhang housekeeper, helplessly pinching his nose bridge, not responding.","Misunderstandings and mistakes tend to occur in succession, triggering a butterfly effect.","Sure enough, before Zhang housekeeper had finished speaking, Qi Shaobai, who had just returned home from his evening study session, came in from the front entrance after changing into slippers.","He clearly heard every thunderous word from Zhang housekeeper.","Understandably, hearing such news left him shocked. He stopped in his tracks.","What Qi Shaobai saw —","Stepmother grinning foolishly, Zhang housekeeper congratulating with delight.","And his dad standing there casually, seemingly in good spirits too.","It was clear to him.","What else did he not understand?","Before Sheng Mumu could react, \"Huh... Zhang housekeeper, what are you talking about?\" as if she had misunderstood her meaning, Qi Shaobai took her words to mean something else.","The sensitive teenager, going through puberty, guessed that she was pretending to be confused, not wanting him to know about the news, worried that he would feel uncomfortable knowing a new family member was coming.","Please, he was almost an adult at seventeen.","Don't treat him like a little kid!","Ever since he found out his dad was bringing home a new wife, he had prepared himself for possibly having younger siblings anytime.","Qi Shaobai leisurely walked past Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu.","He had taken a few steps out before turning back.","Seemingly casually, he tilted his body towards the two, who in his eyes were celebrating, and said:","\"No need to avoid celebrating in front of me, I don't mind.\"","He had to make his stance clear,","So that none of them would feel uncomfortable.","After speaking, Qi Shaobai continued towards his room. Then as if recalling something, he looked back at Sheng Mumu and said:","\"Congratulations.\"","Having said that, he went into his room and closed the door.","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","By now, even someone slow on the uptake should have understood.","She looked at Qi Mo, twitching her mouth awkwardly.","\"Uh...actually what I wanted to say was, I've come up with a name for the flower shop, planning to call it Yue Zi.\"","As she spoke, she was still holding onto Qi Mo's shirt cuff, her mind bombarded with so much information in an instant that she forgot to let go.","The posture seemed somewhat intimate.","Zhang the housekeeper already felt embarrassed and quietly walked away.","Sheng Mumu blinked at Qi Mo and said,","\"Qi Shaobai seems to have misunderstood something. Should I go explain to him that he seems to think I'm pregnant...\"","Qi Mo's gaze lowered slowly until it stopped at the wrinkled spot on the cuff where she had grabbed.","His voice slowed, \"No need to explain.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"You sure?\"","Qi Mo looked up at her: \"Yes, he's grown up now, no need to specifically explain everything to him.\"","Sheng Mumu nodded, \"Okay.\"","If he said don't explain then don't explain.","After all she wasn't pregnant, never would be in her life. Qi Shaobai would figure it out eventually.","She happily went upstairs to call the designer.","After Sheng Mumu left, Qi Mo leisurely smoothed out his wrinkled shirt cuffs and strode towards the kitchen.","He had an upright and tall figure. One hand leaned on the counter, the other held up a glass to his lips.","His forearms were exposed, exuding a sense of strength.","When he tilted his head back, his jawline was sharp and rugged.","His whole body emanated a low-key yet solid mature masculinity.","His adam's apple bobbed up and down a few times as the icy water slid down his throat.","Upstairs, Sheng Mumu's delightful voice discussing ideas for the shop sign floated down, falling into his ears.","It sounded like she was going over concepts for the storefront banner.","Qi Mo's gaze wandered aimlessly around the living room.","Previously when it was just Qi Shaobai and him living here, he had felt the place was a little too spacious, and had considered moving to another house.","His vision grew hazy, not focusing on anything.","Sheng Mumu's pleasant voice continued to drift down.","He took another sip of water, tilting his head back.","It seemed there was no need for that anymore."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Thank you, Old Man.","paragraphs":["Sierdun Restaurant VIP Luxury Package.","\"Mr. Qi, thank you for taking the time out of your busy schedule to come today,\" said Mr. Li carefully, keeping a close watch on Qi Mo's expression and weighing every word before speaking. Whether the company's performance in the second half of the year could stabilize and improve depended on whether Qi Mo would agree to hand over operations of the newly built resort restaurant to him.","So he had to be extra attentive.","Qi Mo gave a barely perceptible nod in response.","Knowing Qi Mo was a man of few words, Mr. Li turned the lazy susan and took the initiative to find a conversation topic.","\"Mr. Qi, please try this. It was made by the new Thai chef. It's very authentic and delicious.\"","Qi Mo looked over.","On the plate was a serving of green curry beef shank in Thai style.","Thai cuisine.","Qi Mo's eyes flickered slightly as a scene suddenly came to his mind—","Last night before falling asleep, Sheng Mumu seemed to be murmuring to herself, or chatting idly with him:","\"It looks like Zhang Housekeeper really thinks I'm pregnant. Hilarious. These past two days the dishes he's been making for the kitchen have either been super sour or super spicy.\"","As she spoke, he saw Sheng Mumu lift her head slightly in regret: \"Ah, I suddenly feel like eating winter melon barley soup. Weird.\"","Sheng Mumu flipped over and opened a food delivery app.","After a while, she sighed again in disappointment, \"The photos of these delivery restaurants don't look authentic at all. Never mind, forget it.\"","...","Qi Mo didn't know what had come over him. With Mr. Li still talking about his ideas for managing the resort restaurant across from him, he suddenly asked:","\"You said the chef here is from Thailand?\"","Mr. Li's eyes lit up. Seeing the usually silent Qi Mo take the initiative to ask a question, he felt like he had grasped his preferences and immediately gave an enthusiastic thumbs up, dramatically replying:","\"Yes, Mr. Qi! This chef is top-notch even in Thailand.\"","Qi Mo nodded thoughtfully.","...","Fifteen minutes later.","Gauging that the business dinner was likely ending soon, driver Wang parked the car outside ahead of time and got out to stand beside it, waiting for Qi Mo.","Soon, several people walked out of the restaurant's revolving doors.","As usual, Wang maintained his professional smile as he waited for Qi Mo to get in the car.","Suddenly, a look of puzzlement appeared on his face.","He had been Qi Mo's personal driver for many years, accompanying him to countless business dinners.","Yet he had never seen Qi Mo like today, walking out carrying a takeout bag.","After Qi Mo bid the others farewell, Wang hurried up to him.","\"Mr. Qi, let me take that for you.\"","Without stopping, Qi Mo replied, \"No need, I'll carry it.\"","\"As you wish, Mr. Qi.\"","Though curious, Wang didn't say more. He quickened his pace to open the rear door for Qi Mo. After Qi Mo got in, he routinely asked:","\"Mr. Qi, would you like to go back to Xiyu Yue Ting or the office?\"","Qi Mo had a private bedroom in his office rest area that he often used for overnight stays when he had an early flight the next day or worked too late.","Qi Mo's face was obscured in shadow as he quietly answered, \"Xiyu Yue Ting.\"","\"Very well, Mr. Qi.\"","Hearing his reply, Wang regretted asking the extra question.","It seemed his ability to read the situation still wasn't as good as Zhang Housekeeper's or Executive Assistant Dong's.","Seeing Mr. Qi uncharacteristically taking home a to-go package, he really shouldn't have had to ask where to go.","Of course it was home.","Wang drove a little faster than usual on the road back.","By the time the car pulled up to the villa entrance, the soup Qi Mo held was still hot.","Inside the villa.","Sheng Mumu had just got off a phone call with the manager in charge of decorating her new store.","Ending the call, she realized they had talked for over an hour.","Sheng Mumu rubbed her stomach, famished.","Just as she was wondering what to eat, she saw Qi Mo come in from the foyer, having changed into casual clothes.","With his suit jacket draped over one arm, he extended the other forward and naturally said:","\"I brought you something to eat.\"","Sheng Mumu was caught off guard. She reflexively reached out to take the bag. \"You brought me food?\"","The bag emitted a tantalizing sour and spicy aroma that wafted into her nose and straight to her taste buds.","It smelled amazing.","Loosening his tie, Qi Mo headed inside and casually remarked:","\"Mm, it should still be hot.\"","The corners of Sheng Mumu's eyes curled up. \"What is it?\"","Qi Mo: \"The Thai chef at this restaurant makes excellent winter melon barley soup. I got you a serving, and two boxes of coconut jelly dessert.\"","When Sheng Mumu heard this, her face lit up in delight.","\"Yay! I've been craving that lately!\"","She had always been good at playing along and reacting positively when shown kindness. Back when she was working, whenever her work WeChat group got a red envelope, she was always the first to send the \"Thank you, Boss!\" emoji.","She reflexively started to blurt out: \"Thank you, darl—\"","Catching Zhang Housekeeper entering the room in her peripheral vision, she abruptly stopped herself.","Saying \"Thank you, Boss\" to Qi Mo in front of Zhang Housekeeper would make their husband and wife relationship seem distant.","She swiftly switched gears and lilted: \"—ling.\"","Thank you, darling...","Qi Mo's brow flickered slightly. His movements stilled briefly as he untied his tie, and his deep eyes narrowed while slowly turning to look at her.","After silently gazing at her for a few seconds, the corners of his lips faintly quirked up.","He tugged off his tie with extra force and headed to the walk-in closet while undoing the first button of his shirt.","Sheng Mumu didn't dwell too much on the slightly stilted exchange just now. After all, at the wine reception that day, she had sweetly called Qi Mo \"darling\" in front of many people already.","Calling him that now didn't feel awkward, at least.","What she cared about more at the moment was the tantalizing winter melon barley soup in her hands.","She was just too hungry.","Qi Mo came out of the walk-in closet in workout clothes and entered the first floor gym.","Lately, Sheng Mumu had observed and summarized some of Qi Mo's lifestyle habits.","For example, no matter how busy he was with work, he always set aside two days a week to work out.","Sitting in the living room, Sheng Mumu took out the winter melon barley soup from the bag.","Unintentionally glancing up, through the frosted glass windows of the gym, she saw Qi Mo stepping onto the treadmill.","A sudden sense of guilt welled up inside her.","He already had such a good physique—broad shoulders, narrow waist, chiseled abs, handsomely sculpted. Yet he still worked out so diligently.","Was he trying to discourage ordinary people?","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips together and shot a glare at Qi Mo. She silently went to the kitchen to take out two bowls and divided the winter melon barley soup into two portions.","Glancing at the time, she thought to herself: It should be soon, the rebellious brat will be home any minute.","Well, if old Qi is so against work-life balance, she would have to pull his son little Qi into her schemes against his unreasonable standards.","She wouldn't be the only one gaining weight.","...","It was early July, and school was out for summer vacation.","With no school to go to every day, Qi Shaobai's life now consisted of two things:","Either going out to play basketball with Wei Zhaonan and the guys, not coming home until after dinner.","Or staying home all day building large Lego sets, going at it for the entire day.","He alternated between these two activities.","Yesterday, Sheng Mumu saw Zhang Housekeeper taking a completed giant race car Lego set into the collection room.","She guessed today Qi Shaobai was probably out playing basketball.","Sure enough, not long after, she heard the faintly dragging footsteps of a teenager coming from the foyer.","Qi Shaobai lazily shuffled in.","Right after turning the corner into the living room, a clear, cheerful voice called out to him.","\"Little Qi, come, come over!\"","Qi Shaobai's scalp tingled. Seeing Sheng Mumu smiling brightly and beckoning to him, his eyebrows knitted together in puzzlement.","Uncomfortably craning his neck back, he felt Sheng Mumu was being overly enthusiastic today.","\"I already ate, I don't need anything else.\"","But Sheng Mumu was not to be so easily deterred. She continued to entice him: \"Your dad specially brought back takeout of hot and sour winter melon barley soup for us.\"","Qi Shaobai halted in his tracks.","\"Huh?\"","Did he hear that right?","His dad.","Brought takeout.","For them?","The three key points didn't make sense individually or combined.","His reticent dad would bring him takeout food?"]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: In Her Tracks","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai's emotions were not apparent on his face. He still had an indifferent and annoyed look. He lazily glanced over and said, \"Oh, you eat first. I just finished playing basketball so I'll go take a shower before eating.\"","Sheng Mumu said, \"Don't shower, I don't mind your sweaty smell. Come quickly, it won't taste good when it's cold.\"","Qi Shaobai's footsteps that had just stepped out paused, and he slowly turned back around and went to sit down.","Sheng Mumu had a satisfied expression on her face at getting her way. She pushed the bowl of soup towards Qi Shaobai and said, \"Thank you...\"","Qi Shaobai took the bowl and chopsticks, preparing to start eating, when he suddenly thought of something and sharply turned his head.","\"You can't eat this!\"","Sheng Mumu looked up in surprise, having just taken a sip of the soup, and didn't know whether to swallow it or not.","Her eyes seemed to say: ???","Qi Shaobai had a serious expression. \"There's lemongrass in the Dong Yin soup...\"","\"Pregnant women...can't eat that.\"","His brows were deeply furrowed, as if resentful.","\"You're already pregnant, how can you not pay attention to these things? My dad too, how could he bring this for you?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","She was amused by Qi Shaobai's domineering aura at the mere age of seventeen. After swallowing that mouthful of soup, she said, \"How do you know about this stuff at such a young age?\"","Qi Shaobai clicked his tongue. \"Didn't I say you can't eat it?\"","Sheng Mumu laughed. \"I'm not pregnant, you misunderstood, young man.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"That day, Manager Zhang misheard. You were also mistaken.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......He misheard?\"","But he clearly remembered his dad had a delighted expression that day.","Sheng Mumu fearlessly drank another big gulp of the soup and said,","\"Your dad and I don't plan on having a child yet. If we do, we'll let you know in advance.\"","She didn't mean to impress her stepson.","Since they were on the topic, might as well mention it.","Qi Shaobai was silent for a few seconds before slowly saying,","\"Actually, you don't need to tell me. You two are you two, and I am me.\"","The words sounded cold, but his tone was not forceful.","Sheng Mumu could even hear a hint of stubborn compromise unique to teenagers.","She smiled and said, \"Hurry up and eat, it'll really get cold.\"","\"Okay.\" Qi Shaobai nodded and picked up his spoon.","After eating most of it, Sheng Mumu leaned back against the sofa, looking at Qi Shaobai. The more she looked the more displeased she became.","After thinking for a while, she decided she still had to say it.","\"Qi Shaobai, can you change your hairstyle? It's so ugly.\"","Qi Shaobai's hand holding the spoon froze. When he turned his head back, his face clearly showed surprise.","Ugly?","From young till now, people who saw him would praise his good looks. This was the first time he had heard the word \"ugly\" used to describe him.","Sheng Mumu leaned back a little more, frowning as she sized him up. She started to seriously critique.","\"Your bone structure is pretty good, why don't you cut your hair shorter for a more energetic and refreshing look?\"","Sheng Mumu had wanted to say this for a long time but held back. Today she finally couldn't stand it anymore.","Qi Shaobai liked to tie his bangs up with a hair band.","The style was very Japanese, but not suitable for all occasions.","As soon as he took off the headband and wore his school uniform, his bangs would flutter in the wind, making him look especially melancholy.","The novel mentioned he had a gloomy temperament. She wondered if it was related to his hairstyle.","Sheng Mumu: \"The melancholy look is not in fashion nowadays. Having long bangs is very uncool.\"","Qi Shaobai raised his eyes to look at his bangs, which did obstruct his vision somewhat.","\"The stylist did it randomly.\"","A family hairstylist came once every two weeks. Every time, his attitude was \"do whatever you want.\"","Sheng Mumu shook her head and sighed, \"Looks like this Tony has very old-fashioned taste and lacks skill.\"","Qi Shaobai's eyes widened slightly. \"How did you know his name is Tony?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Ha? It really is Tony?","Sheng Mumu half complaining, half explaining, said: \"Young master who doesn't pay attention to worldly affairs, just search for hair stylist appointments on any group buying app, and Tony's can take up half.\"","\"Hahaha......\" Qi Shaobai laughed.","Sheng Mumu also laughed because of this unexpected coincidence.","......","In the gym, on the treadmill.","Qi Mo was attracted by the noise outside to look over.","Through the glass door, he saw Sheng Mumu laughing brightly.","She had bright and charming eyes. When she smiled, she had two little dimples. Her voice was melodious and pleasant to hear.","His gaze unconsciously lingered a while longer. Leaning his elbows on the treadmill, he stared outside in a daze, his eyes gradually narrowing.","A corner of his soft heart seemed to be pulled by some unknown emotion.","After working out, Qi Mo went upstairs to shower.","As he turned on the shower head and water sprayed down, he reached out to press the shower gel as usual.","But his hand swiped at empty space. He pressed twice but nothing came out.","He wiped the water from his face with one hand and turned to look.","A bottle of tea brown shower gel sat there untouched.","His long, slender fingers still had water droplets. He turned the shower gel bottle over to the other side.","The label said: Not for sale.","His eyes shifted slightly, and he suddenly smiled.","He subconsciously glanced at the bathtub area outside the shower stall.","A matching set of tea brown bath products sat on a ceramic plate next to the bathtub.","Qi Mo understood in his heart.","Indeed, his bottle was a free gift from the shower gel she used.","With their contractual marriage, if she specifically wanted to buy something for him, it would be very strange.","But just imagining her naturally placing the free gift in the shower stall made his heart stir inexplicably.","Ever since she appeared, the details of his life were imprinted with traces of her.","Around the square bathtub, the row of ceramic tiles were filled with aromatic candles in various shapes, neatly stored in trays to create a sense of ritual.","Before every bath, she would choose which scented candle to light today based on the weather, her mood, or even her lucky color that day.","The same sense of ritual was applied to choosing bath oils.","She seemed to greatly enjoy bath time.","Qi Mo discovered he could always smell different fragrances on her.","He had to admit, her taste was exquisite. Every fragrance was very pleasant.","Originally, he disliked personal items that had a strong scent. But now, always falling asleep next to the faint aroma, he didn't dislike it as much.","As the variety of bath products and fragrances on the bathtub side increased, the shower stall would occasionally also have one or two bottles he hadn't seen before.","Without exception, they were all free gifts.","His long lashes lowered, and droplets of water rolled down them, obscuring the light in his eyes.","But the smile at the corner of his lips exposed his emotions.","He didn't mind that he was the one using the \"free gifts.\"","With their relationship as a contract marriage, if she specifically wanted to buy something for him, it would be very strange.","But just imagining her naturally placing the free gift in the shower stall made his heart inexplicably stirred.","Ever since she appeared, the details of his life were imprinted with traces of her."]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: Does Keyes always know you're out there praising him like that","paragraphs":["After the name of the flower shop was determined, many things became more convenient.","For example, the design of the flower bouquet wrapping paper and the addition of the shop logo to the small decorations in the store.","In less than a month, the project had progressed to seventy percent.","The renovation team that Dong Assistant helped contact was very reliable. According to Sheng Mumu's requirements, they designed the outer glass greenhouse of the store into a rare streamlined design with many curved elements.","From the outside, it had a strong artistic atmosphere. When the sunlight shone on it, it reflected a small pool of vibrant light and shadows on the ground, which looked particularly beautiful.","After seeing that the store renovation and suppliers were settled, Sheng Mumu started recruiting the first batch of customers.","Auntie Song who lived next door was her undisputed choice.","Auntie Song had just finished breakfast when she received a message from Sheng Mumu.","[Listen, Ran, I'm coming over to see you this afternoon.]","Seeing her name on the screen, Auntie Song was slightly moved.","Since marrying her current husband, very few people still called her by her original name.","The last time she told Sheng Mumu her name, the other party exclaimed:","\"Su Tingran, Su Tingran, doesn't it sound so nice! Such a beautiful name, if it were me, I would hate for people not to call me by name every day. I've decided from now on I'll call you Tingran, not Auntie Song.\"","Of course she agreed.","Su Tingran was three years older than Sheng Mumu. After graduating, she married her current husband.","Her husband did foreign trade business and was rarely in the country.","Since moving to Xiyu Yue Court, she had been managing everything big and small in the home alone.","Perhaps it was her lively and outgoing personality, or perhaps it was because she pitied her for always being home alone, the villa area’s madams always invited her along when going shopping or playing mahjong.","But she knew that even the few madams who chatted in the WeChat group every day probably didn’t remember what her original name was.","Calling her by her husband's surname had become almost habitual.","Until Sheng Mumu appeared.","She was the first to remember her name and offered to call her by her given name.","Su Tingran vaguely felt that Sheng Mumu was very different from the other madams in the villa area.","She was never keen on gossiping about other people's families, nor was she thinking about how to be a little thinner and more beautiful every day to attract her husband's full attention.","She lived like a little sun, shining bright by herself continuously.","In the afternoon, when Sheng Mumu told her about opening a flower shop, Su Tingran's thoughts were further confirmed.","\"You mean that colorful glass greenhouse is yours?\"","Sheng Mumu nodded proudly, \"It's called Yue Ji Flower Shop, it mainly provides flower delivery services.\"","Su Tingran didn't stint on praise: \"I've passed by there many times, and have always been particularly curious about it, attracted by the exterior and couldn't help but take several more glances.\"","\"Flower delivery is great, I want to support your shop’s business. How can I buy it, by season or by year?\"","\"Auntie Qi, I really didn't expect you to have a flair for business...\"","Sheng Mumu was a little embarrassed by the praise, and giggled.","\"No, no.\"","Speaking, she took out the prepared mobile phone promotional page and handed it to Su Tingran to see.","According to the different types and color schemes of the flowers, Sheng Mumu set up the flower delivery service into four themes:","Luxury, National Style, Hidden Charm, Vibrant.","The prices were 388, 588, 788 and 988 per bouquet respectively.","It was a bit expensive, but one look at the packaging and you could tell a lot of thought had been put into it.","The color scheme was elegant and artistic, the materials were superior, and just the ribbon selection alone, she had visited several handmade silk shops before achieving results she was very satisfied with.","Ding-","A payment notification popped up above the phone.","[360,620.00 yuan has been received in your bank account ending in ****]","Without a second thought, Su Tingran directly chose the most expensive \"Vibrant\" theme package and very generously bought an annual package.","Sheng Mumu was extremely excited inside but forced herself to remain calm on the surface, unable to stop the corners of her mouth from rising.","\"Tingran...you...you are too kind.\"","Su Tingran: \"No kindness at all. My family originally orders flowers every day anyway, your shop’s flowers are so beautiful, who else would I order from if not you? I was afraid if I didn't preorder early, after the other madams found out there was such a flower shop at their doorstep, they'd buy everything out if they wanted to.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled even more brilliantly, \"Don't worry, I'll definitely keep some for you.\"","Hearing Su Tingran's words, Sheng Mumu had already imagined the scene of incoming payment notifications sounding continuously.","Before Sheng Mumu could continue daydreaming, Su Tingran's tone suddenly changed:","\"By the way, what does Qi think about you opening a flower shop? Does he have any objections?\"","Almost all the madams in the villa area were unemployed.","The few who did work were in idle positions at their husbands' companies, mostly to keep an eye on their husbands and prevent them from finding other women outside.","It seemed like an unwritten rule - if it was known that a madam was starting a business or working outside, it would inevitably raise speculation whether she was preparing for a divorce settlement.","Sheng Mumu returned to her senses, stunned for a moment, \"Him? No objections.\"","Su Tingran's expression was a little tense, wondering if she had touched on a topic she shouldn't have, and was just about to comfort her a few words and not mention it again, when she heard Sheng Mumu say:","\"He gave me a lot of very practical suggestions. If not for him, the store wouldn't have opened so smoothly.\"","Su Tingran: \"...\"","Her mouth was slightly open. It was a long time before she murmured incredulously:","\"Chief Qi is really great.\"","He actually had no objections to his wife going out to start a business and even provided help.","It really surprised her.","When she first moved into the villa area, she had also suggested to her husband that she wanted to find a leisurely place to work part time to pass the time.","But her husband sternly rejected it: \"No! You married me but still want to go out and work, what will people say? The prestigious Madam Song working a job? No, you stay home obediently, keep the house in order, spend my money however you want.\"","At the time, Su Tingran thought her husband's words were quite sweet, as if he was trying to protect her image.","But now when she thought back, there was an indescribable discomfort, all kinds of unpleasant feelings.","Just as she was thinking, she saw Sheng Mumu nod seriously and answer her words.","\"Yeah, he's still not bad, apart from being busy with work, no complaints.\"","Su Tingran: \"...\"","\"Pffft-\" The word \"complaints\" was so amusing, Su Tingran couldn't help laughing out loud: \"Does Chief Qi know you're praising him like this outside?\"","Sheng Mumu lazily shrugged her shoulders and shamelessly said: \"How could he know, he'd be too arrogant.\"","After she finished speaking, Su Tingran laughed even more, almost laughing until tears came out.","In fact, Sheng Mumu's words were somewhat exaggerated.","After all, they were in a contractual marriage, they had to put on an intimate and affectionate appearance in front of others.","But she didn't know that such expressions of affection, to a traditional elite madam like Su Tingran, seemed very novel and surprising.","During the day, one shouldn't speak ill of others behind their backs.","At that time.","In a commercial building in Beijing.","Two clear sneezes could be heard from the top floor.","\"Achoo! Achoo!\"","Hearing the sounds coming from the CEO's office, Dong Assistant knocked twice on the door before pushing it open.","\"Chief Qi, do you need me to contact your family doctor?\"","The man with a cold and imposing demeanor sitting at the desk glanced up and calmly said, \"No need.\"","After he finished speaking, his phone on the desk lit up.","He received a message from Sheng Mumu.","Sheng Mumu: \"First order secured, 10% of the repayment progress done, cool right?\"","The light in the eyes of the man with chiseled features softened as he looked at the screen, inadvertently curving his lips.","His well-proportioned fingers lightly tapped the screen to reply: \"Mm.\"","After thinking for a moment, he deleted the message.","He retyped and sent:","\"Cool.\""]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: In what age do people still take husbands' names","paragraphs":["Su Tingran quickly told the other wives in the WeChat group that Sheng Mumu's flower shop Yueji was about to open.","The group reacted enthusiastically.","[Mrs. Zhao: I will definitely support Mr. Qi's wife's flower shop. I'm subscribing to the one-year \"Chinese Style\" package.]","[Mrs. Qian: My husband Old Qian likes having flowers that smell good at home. I'll get the six-month \"Hidden Beauty\" package.]","[Mrs. Sun: I read Yueji's promotional web page carefully. Are there derivative products for sale too?]","[Mrs. Li: To show my support, I want to buy some vases first.]","Sheng Mumu tapped the screen rapidly with her fingers and excitedly responded:","[Thank you all for your support! In addition to delivering flowers to your door, Yueji will also gradually expand into fragrances, home textiles, home decor, tableware and more. There are also plans to open floristry salons and baking interest classes offline. Stay tuned!]","Where there was overt praise, there would naturally also be subtle critiques.","[Mrs. Zhou: Mrs. Qi is so lucky. I thought she had married a husband, but turns out she gained a capable subordinate who even helps earn money [laughing][eating melon]. I don't mean anything by this, just want to compliment Mrs. Qi on being so capable~]","[Mr. Wu's Baby: Mrs. Qi is the first villa area resident to open a shop. That takes courage.]","[Mr. Zheng's Precious Wife: Mrs. Qi, aren't you afraid of getting dirty from all that soil?]","[Wang Qinwei: I also really want to open a flower shop, but my husband won't let me. He says women should stay home looking pretty, not show their faces in public so much. ]","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Seeing the increasingly unpleasant conversation, her expression froze.","Gramps Looking at Phone on Subway.jpg","She really wanted to give Mmes. Zhou, Wu, Zheng and Wang a \"Model of Modern Womanhood\" banner each.","And gift each of them a loquat plum.","What do you mean?","What do you mean???","Just as Sheng Mumu was wondering what would be appropriate to say, her phone rang.","Su Tingran called out of concern that Sheng Mumu would be upset by Mmes. Zhou, Wu, Zheng and Wang's words.","She also gave Sheng Mumu some background on these four women.","\"You're new to the group and don't know this yet, but their favorite thing is to show off their husbands. Just ignore them.\"","\"Especially Mrs. Wang, Wang Qinwei. Her birth name is Qinwei. After marrying her husband, she was afraid others wouldn't know who her husband was, so she changed her surname to match his.\"","Sheng Mumu clicked her tongue. \"What era is this that people are still changing their surnames after marriage?\"","Su Tingran said, \"That's not even the worst of it. No matter what the group chat is about, she finds a way to steer the conversation back to her husband. You'll see what I mean later.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't even have to wait until later. Right after she hung up, she saw Wang Qinwei had already sent a slew of solo messages in the wife group.","[Wang Qinwei: I really should support Mrs. Qi's flower shop business. After all, she's working hard starting this business herself, it's not easy. But unfortunately I'm allergic to pollen, so when my husband and I go out to eat, he has the restaurant remove all the fresh flowers beforehand.]","[Wang Qinwei: Oh right, speaking of flowers, it reminds me of the diamond necklace my husband gave me last week. Let me show you.]","[Wang Qinwei: [picture]]","[Wang Qinwei: [picture]]","[Wang Qinwei: My husband knows I like flowers but can't tolerate the scent, so he had this flower shaped necklace custom made for me. It cost 20 million yuan!]","[Wang Qinwei: I'm so skinny, usually find it too heavy when worn. You guys know how clumsy I am, even walking on flat ground I manage to trip. I have to hold my husband's hand going down stairs, and when going out, or I'd be worried that if I tripped while wearing this huge diamond it would stab my neck.]","[Wang Qinwei: I'm letting you all see how silly I am. My husband is always saying I'm his little silly girl.]","...","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","She could sum up her current mood in four words — speechless with amazement.","She had seen exaggerated and pretentious people on TV dramas before.","But she had never seen someone as ridiculous as Wang Qinwei.","She scrolled through the screen. The floral necklace Wang Qinwei had sent seemed vaguely familiar, though she couldn't remember where she'd seen it before.","She had not originally planned on saying anything more in the group chat, but after seeing several more messages from Wang Qinwei boasting about how accident-prone yet doted on by her husband she was, Sheng Mumu couldn't resist.","She shared a post from a medical institution's public WeChat account to the group, very considerately.","The title was: [Frequently Tripping When Walking May Indicate Cerebellar Atrophy, Doctor's Professional Tips On 5 Things To Watch For]","And she helpfully advised: [Mrs. Wang, you really should be careful. Although we're all young, it's best to prevent this disease before it happens, don't conceal illness or avoid seeing a doctor.]","\"What does she mean by this!\" Wang Qinwei's face instantly collapsed when she saw the message.","The next second, she angrily threw her phone out. It landed on the carpet with a muffled thud.","She yelled loudly:","\"What is this Mrs. Qi trying to imply? Hinting that I'm sick?\"","...","Sheng Mumu exited WeChat.","She decided to think happy thoughts instead, so as not to be infected by princess syndrome.","She opened her bank account balance page. Seeing the number there instantly improved her mood tremendously.","She was one big step closer to paying off her debt.","Thinking of this, she screenshot the balance and sent it to Sugar Daddy Qi to proudly report her progress.","It also signaled that her repayment pace was picking up.","Qi Mo received the WeChat message while on the way to the airport.","The vacation resort was complete. He was going to Shen City for an inspection trip over the next few days.","Seeing the screenshot Sheng Mumu sent, Qi Mo's finger hovered over the screen. He pondered briefly before deciding to express his congratulations in the most straightforward way possible.","By sending a red envelope.","He put his phone back into his pocket and inadvertently glanced out the window.","In the distance, a woman with short hair was looking down at her watch, then anxiously looked up, seeming to be waiting for a car.","The moment the short-haired woman turned her head, Qi Mo recognized her. He instructed his driver:","\"Little Wang, stop ahead.\"","The black Bentley pulled up in front of the short-haired woman. The window slowly rolled down.","She saw the refined, handsome features and poised bearing of the man inside, looking slightly surprised.","\"Mr. Qi, what a coincidence.\"","Dr. Jiang worked in Canton City for a long period as private caregiver for Qi Mo's grandmother.","She was diligent and attentive in her work, maintaining good relations with both Elder Madame Qi and Mr. Qi.","Earlier this year, she finally obtained a private practice license. She resigned from being Elder Madame Qi's caregiver to come to the capital city and start her own venture.","Dr. Jiang gave a wry smile. \"Yes, I didn't expect it would be so hard to hail a cab at this time.\"","Qi Mo asked her destination, and found it was along the way. He offered her a ride.","Dr. Jiang glanced at the time and smiled apologetically before pulling the car door open.","\"Thank you for the trouble, Mr. Qi.\"","Qi Mo said, \"It's no trouble.\"","The car had been going for a while.","Qi Mo's phone in his pocket started vibrating.","Sheng Mumu had been working on the shop's membership forms. After finishing up, she finally saw the red envelope Qi Mo sent.","The amount made her so excited she sent him three emoji packs in one breath.","[Thank you Boss.GIF]","[Boss is so generous! [Bowing to serve tea]]","[The one who sent this red envelope is so handsome.JPG]","Seeing the messages on his phone, Qi Mo's eyes involuntarily lit up with a smile."]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Mrs. Keyes, do you want me to help you beat up your mistress","paragraphs":["\"Mrs. Qi?\" Dr. Jiang looked at Qi Mo curiously and couldn't help asking gossipily.","In her impression, Mr. Qi's expression was always indifferent. Thinking of the news she saw online recently, she reasonably guessed that the information that could make Mr. Qi's eyes gleam with smiles must have come from that Mrs. Qi whom she had only heard of but not met.","Qi Mo's mouth curled up slightly and he nodded.","Dr. Jiang said, \"Granny must be very happy to see you and your wife get along so well.\"","Qi Mo smiled gently without answering.","Granny Qi was kind and easy-going. She treated Dr. Jiang as a junior and would occasionally call her to chat even after she resigned from work.","The elderly always centered their lives around their descendants. She had mentioned her grandson Qi Mo's marriage to Dr. Jiang more than once, worried that Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu's relationship might not be as sweet as other newlyweds' because it was arranged by their elders.","Now that she saw Mr. Qi's expression with her own eyes, Dr. Jiang was genuinely happy for the old lady.","When they arrived, Dr. Jiang got off the car, bent down and said to the people in the car, \"Mr. Qi, I'll keep what you told me in mind. When Granny comes to the city, I'll arrange a full physical examination for her.\"","Qi Mo nodded, \"Thanks for the trouble.\"","Dr. Jiang smiled, \"It's me who should thank you for giving me a ride.\"","\"You're welcome. It's on my way anyway.\"","After thanking Qi Mo, Dr. Jiang walked into the residential area.","Standing at the entrance of the residential area, she didn't go in directly. Instead, she stood still and looked up for a while.","She had been working hard in Guangzhou for over ten years since her graduation. Now she had finally realized her dream of buying a nice house in the city and owning her own clinic. A bright future was waving to her.","Dr. Jiang took a deep breath and walked in full of confidence.","She didn't know that not far away, at the door of a boutique store, two women had been gazing at her and gossiping about her.","\"I'm not seeing it wrong, am I? That man in the car just now looks like Qi Mo Qi, doesn't he?\"","\"You're not mistaken. I've bumped into his car coming in and out of the community several times. It's definitely his car.\"","\"My god! That woman getting off his car didn't look like Mrs. Qi. Could she be...?\" The woman looked meaningfully at the other.","The other immediately understood. \"Tsk, tsk, she must be a mistress. The houses here aren't cheap. No mistress could afford such a nice house.\"","\"Yeah, that makes sense!\"","\"Men with money are all like this. Their families are intact, but they have colorful flags fluttering outside.\"","\"Poor Mrs. Qi. They just got married. I thought they would have a wonderful relationship.\" The woman sneered a few times.","\"I can't wait to share this with Mrs. Wang. She loves gossip.\"","\"Haha, if you tell Mrs. Wang, won't everyone know?\"","After speaking, the two women giggled covering their mouths, exchanging a look as if waiting to watch the show.","Wang Qinwei was still irritated by Sheng Mumu.","Suddenly hearing this explosive news, she was so shocked that her mouth gaped open.","She kept asking, \"For real? What? Mr. Qi, our Mr. Qi in the villa area?\"","\"Are you sure it's our Mr. Qi in the community?\"","The person on the phone affirmed, \"I saw it with my own eyes. You say, is it true or not?\"","Upon hearing this, Wang Qinwei suddenly laughed, as if relieved.","\"So that's why Mrs. Qi was subtly taunting me in the group chat just now. Turns out her husband is keeping a mistress outside, and she feels imbalanced seeing my husband and I get along so well!\"","The person on the phone, eager to watch the show, continued fueling the fire, \"That's right!\"","After hanging up the phone, Wang Qinwei privately chatted with several wives she was close with and shared the \"explosive gossip\" she had just gotten.","Rumors often spread faster than one could imagine. In less than half a day, nearly half of the wives in the group knew about it.","And the other half all got to know when Wang Qinwei posted a wrong message in the group, whether intentionally or not.","【Wang Qinwei: I'm sure I didn't see it wrong. A pretty short-haired woman got off Mr. Qi's car and went back to their love nest.】","At this moment, Sheng Mumu was checking the group chat records and the list of people who had purchased flower shop memberships, carefully avoiding mistakes.","Seeing the sudden message, she first had an expression of eating melon.","When she looked closely and realized \"Mr. Qi\" referred to Qi Mo, her face darkened and her brows deeply furrowed.","Oh my, the melon hit her own family?","Ever since she transmigrated here, she had been very clear that she and Qi Mo were contractual spouses. If Qi Mo had other women outside, whether it was a fleeting affair or for that kind of need, it would be very normal.","Men, what's more, rich mature men.","It was none of her business and she had no right to intervene.","But when the rumor was thrown at her face, she was at a loss for a moment.","She urgently asked: When a wife finds her husband keeping a mistress outside, how should she react most normally?","Please advise ASAP.","To act well as a contractual spouse and earn the monthly 500,000 yuan salary, she had to face problems she shouldn't have at such a young age.","Soon in the wives' group chat, Wang Qinwei's message received several replies.","【Mrs. Zhou: What? Mr. Qi, can't be our Mr. Qi in the villa area, right? [Shocked][Shocked][Shocked]】","【My Baby of Mr. Wu's Family: I don't know if I should say this, but there's only one family with the surname Qi in our community...】","【Mr. Zheng's Precious Wife: @Wang Qinwei, did you post to the wrong chat? You can't say things carelessly like that.】","Wang Qinwei counted the time after sending the message. At 1 minute 50 seconds, she quickly recalled it.","Then she pretended to slip her hand and said, \"Oops, my hand slipped. I accidentally posted it to the group. Just ignore it, everyone.\"","Those who didn't get to eat the hot melon asked, \"What is it? What happened?\"","Wang Qinwei acted very awkward and said, \"Not convenient to talk about it in the group.\"","Having watched the whole show, Sheng Mumu exclaimed inwardly: Goodness.","Now the whole world knew Qi Mo had a woman outside.","She couldn't help covering up for him even if she wanted to.","Soon, several wives privately messaged Sheng Mumu.","【Um... Mrs. Qi, are you okay?】","【Mrs. Qi, don't be sad. This is too common. To be honest, I suspect mine also keeps a mistress outside.】","【Mrs. Qi, do you need me to go beat up the mistress?】","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath, feeling blue and laughing. \"...\"","On the other hand, Wang Qinwei felt happy for letting off steam and felt like she had done something big, fully fulfilled.","That night when her husband came home, she walked over swaying her waist,","\"Baby, our wives' group chat was so lively today.\"","Mr. Wang responded casually while changing shoes,","\"Oh? What happened, sweetie?\"","Wang Qinwei giggled covering her mouth and said,","\"Mr. Qi, our Mr. Qi in the community, his affair got exposed and it spread all over the group chat.\"","Mr. Wang paused and spoke solemnly,","\"Don't go along with those people making a fuss in the group.\"","His company had business dealings with Qi Mo's company. Offending Qi Mo over women's gossips could cause trouble.","Seeing her husband's stern tone, Wang Qinwei pouted charmingly.","\"What do you mean making a fuss? It was me who told them.\"","Hearing this, Mr. Wang rushed over before even changing his shoes properly and grabbed her wrist.","\"What? You talked about the Qi family's private affairs in the group? You're so bored!\"","\"Ouch, you're hurting me!\" Wang Qinwei looked at her husband aggrievedly and complained, \"What's wrong? Mrs. Qi said in the group this afternoon that I walk stumbling because I have cerebral atrophy. Why can't I fight back a little? You're not standing up for me but scolding me instead!\"","After speaking, Wang Qinwei punched her husband's chest with small fists.","Unexpectedly, her husband was not as caring and gentle as usual. He scolded seriously,","\"Foolishness! Qinwei, it seems I've spoiled you too much!\"","Wang Qinwei's nose soured. She felt her husband didn't understand her at all, but didn't dare to really get angry either. She could only start sobbing.","Usually as long as she cried, her husband would definitely come to coax her.","But this time, her husband completely ignored her. He walked quickly into the study and slammed the door.","At this moment, Mr. Wang had something more important than coaxing his wife — calling Qi Mo to apologize.","It took him a long time before he got through to Qi Mo's phone.","\"Mr. Qi, I'm so sorry to bother you this late. My wife doing something like that, I sincerely apologize!\"","On the phone, Qi Mo didn't understand what he meant, \"Hmm?\"","Mr. Wang spoke respectfully, \"My wife is as stupid as a pig, talking nonsense in the group chat, causing trouble for you and your wife.\"","Hearing this, a cold gleam flashed across Qi Mo's deep eyes, and his jaw slowly tensed.","His voice was low: \"What trouble?\"","..."]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: How can a wife who just learned that her husband cheated on her smile so brightly","paragraphs":["In the past few days, Sheng Mumu felt that she was about to lose control of her facial expressions.","She would be overjoyed one second because the flower shop business was booming.","The next second, when someone passed by and saw her, she had to have a touch of sadness between her brows again, not daring to be too unbridled in her happiness.","Alas!","How could a wife who just found out her husband was cheating smile so radiantly?","As long as she stayed in the position of Qi Mo's wife for one more day, she had to react the way a wife should.","Exhausting.","So exhausting.","Fortunately, she knew well that the life cycle of each piece of gossip was not long. When new gossip appeared, no one would remember Qi Mo's affair anymore.","As long as she didn't overreact, peacefully riding out this period, everything could get better.","However, things did not develop in the direction she had envisioned. The more indifferent she appeared, the more others cared, eager to pry more insider news from her mouth.","People kept asking her out for afternoon tea and mahjong a few times a week.","She declined several times with the excuse that \"the shop just opened and is too busy.\"","Until she felt bad about declining again, she reluctantly accepted Mrs. Sun's mahjong invitation.","After all, quite a few ladies in the wives' group had helped the Yueji Flower Shop, so if she took their money and then didn't show up, it would look like she had taken the money and run.","That day, she reluctantly went out to fulfill the mahjong appointment.","At the same time, Wang Qinwei also walked out of her home.","Ever since being lectured by her husband last time, Wang Qinwei became more and more angry the more she thought about it.","Her husband, who usually indulged her every wish with gentle words, had never been so fierce to her.","She blamed it on Sheng Mumu.","She rolled her eyes towards the sky, and they almost popped out.","Humph, the fact that Qi Mo kept a mistress was already true. Why couldn't she say it?","Just because Qi Mo's business was big?","Wang Qinwei was unwilling.","Today, she specially got Mrs. Qian to give up her mahjong spot for herself.","She looked forward to ridiculing Sheng Mumu well at the mahjong table.","...","This was Sheng Mumu's first time playing mahjong with the villa area ladies.","When she arrived at Mrs. Sun's house, Mrs. Zhou and Mrs. Sun were already sitting at the table.","She looked left and right with a light smile and asked,","\"I thought I was the last one to arrive, but Mrs. Qian is not here yet?\"","Mrs. Zhou replied, \"Mrs. Qian has something at home and can't make it, Mrs. Wang is taking her place.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","What a small world indeed.","Thinking of Wang Qinwei's endless talk about her husband, she had a premonition that today's mahjong game would be very noisy.","Since she was already here, she naturally could not sneak away temporarily.","She sat down at the mahjong table with a natural expression.","Mrs. Sun asked, \"Mrs. Qi, have you played mahjong before?\"","Sheng Mumu answered truthfully, \"Very little, my skills are poor.\"","In her previous life, working 996 overtime every day, she rarely had leisure time.","Occasionally she would play mahjong with the wives of cooperating company leaders, but those were all \"business mahjong\", aimed at losing money.","Over time, the words \"playing mahjong\" were equated with \"giving away money\" in her dictionary.","Today she came prepared to lose money.","She thought it through very clearly.","Everyone cared so much about the flower shop business, appropriately giving back some as marketing expenses made sense.","Mrs. Sun waved her hand kindly and reminded her,","\"Then you have to be careful, Mrs. Zhou and Mrs. Wang are fierce players. Last time playing with them, I lost 50,000 in three rounds.\"","Sheng Mumu paused, \"!!!!\"","Losing 50,000 in three rounds?","Playing stakes that high?","When she left home, she brought 10,000 cash, which she thought was more than enough at the time.","Now after hearing this, she began to doubt whether she could last an hour.","She slowly took out her phone, intending to secretly send Zhang the butler a message to surreptitiously bring her some money.","Before she could send the message, a shrill voice came from behind.","\"Oh my, I'm late, ladies. My husband desperately didn't want me to go, insisting that I stay home and accompany him. I barely managed to get out after much difficulty. I'm so sorry for being late, it's all because of my husband.\"","Without turning back, everyone could tell from the words \"my husband\" that it was Mrs. Wang who had arrived.","Wang Qinwei appeared in front of everyone with a smiling face, pulled out a chair, and sat down beaming.","Without waiting for Sheng Mumu to finish sending her message, Wang Qinwei had already started shuffling the tiles, urging:","\"Let's start quickly.\"","Sheng Mumu lowered her head and quickly edited the message while the automatic mahjong table was still shuffling.","Just as she was about to hit send, her phone screen darkened.","The battery was low and it automatically shut down...","Sheng Mumu: ...","Beijing Airport.","A tall, upright man walked out of the VIP passage.","With exquisite proportions, chiseled, aloof features, his coat swaying slightly as he walked, every frame was like a picture from a fashion magazine.","The temperature in Beijing was much higher than in Shen City.","As Qi Mo walked, he took off his coat and handed it to the driver Xiao Wang who had come to pick him up, casually asking:","\"Where's my wife?\"","Xiao Wang was baffled.","How would he know?","But as a capable subordinate, he could not say \"I don't know\"","He had to either provide an answer or suggest a solution.","\"I'll call the butler Zhang right away.\"","Qi Mo's magnetic, husky voice responded. \"Never mind, I'll call him.\"","The reason Qi Mo suddenly asked Xiao Wang was because when he called Sheng Mumu earlier, her phone was off.","After receiving Mr. Wang's call a few days ago, he decided that when he returned to Beijing, he would go home first instead of rushing back to work, to talk with Sheng Mumu about that matter.","Perhaps it was the habit developed from years of doing business.","When faced with any problem, he preferred to communicate face-to-face.","That way he could directly see the other's reaction and expression.","On the phone, the butler Zhang told Qi Mo:","\"Madam has been invited by Mrs. Sun to play mahjong. They have asked Madam many times, and Madam was reluctant to go at first. But today she must have been in a good mood and went to Mrs. Sun's house to play mahjong. What a coincidence, she probably won't be back for a while. Sir, do you need me to pass on to Madam that you've returned?\"","Qi Mo was silent for a few seconds, and said lightly, \"No need.\"","Seeing Qi Mo hang up, Xiao Wang turned his head and asked,","\"Boss Qi, shall we go now?\"","Qi Mo's slender, well-proportioned fingers gently tapped on the car window frame as he gazed out the window. Suddenly he asked:","\"Xiao Wang, do you know which villa Mrs. Sun lives in?\"","..."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Four Words, None of your Business.","paragraphs":["At the Sun Residence.","\"Eight bamboo.\"","\"Pung.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and made the pung with eight bamboo, then glanced at the tiles in front of her again.","It was close to winning by drawing and discarding all tiles.","Across the mahjong table, Wang Qinwei said with a hint of amusement in her voice:","\"Oh! Mrs. Qi has such sharp eyes, you stole my tile before I could even get a good look.\"","Sheng Mumu glanced up briefly without bothering to respond.","Wang Qinwei had already thought of mocking words to say, regardless of whether Sheng Mumu would engage her or not, she would keep talking.","Suddenly, she heaved a long sigh, \"Ah--\"","Her tone was extremely exaggerated, dragging the last syllable. The three women at the table looked over.","Wang Qinwei: \"Mrs. Qi, I really feel sorry for you. You have such sharp eyes, yet you didn't notice the vixen right under your nose!\"","Sheng Mumu's expression was unchanged. She calmly glanced at Wang Qinwei before shifting her attention back to her tiles.","She couldn't get distracted now. This win was critical.","Wang Qinwei smiled as she gently pressed the corners of her eyes, twisting her upper body in an affected manner. She continued:","\"Mrs. Qi, I'm really not boasting, but as a woman, after getting married you have to learn some wifely arts, otherwise your husband will sooner or later be seduced away by those vulgar girls outside.\"","Sheng Mumu drew a tile and suddenly looked troubled. She glanced up at Wang Qinwei.","Seeing this, Wang Qinwei couldn't help the corners of her mouth curving up smugly.","She was thinking to herself: Haha, I hit a sore spot didn't I?","Wang Qinwei quickly suppressed her smugness and pretended to console:","\"Mrs. Qi, do you need me to impart some of my experience to you? I've been married for five years, and my husband still clings on to me tightly.\"","Sheng Mumu shook her head. She smiled lightly. \"I'm so sorry, I drew the wrong tile.\"","Wang Qinwei: \"............?\"","What?","Sheng Mumu: \"Self drawn, cleared hand with one suit, 8,000 points.\"","Including this round, she had won three rounds consecutively.","She was starting to feel a little bad for raking in so much money.","Wang Qinwei frowned in displeasure as she reluctantly took money out to pay Sheng Mumu.","She thought to herself: Hmph, keeping calm even when provoked. Let's see how long you can endure this.","Halfway through the next round...","Wang Qinwei cleared her throat and looked around the table at the four women. She spoke mysteriously:","\"Now I'm starting to believe in what elders always say.\"","Mrs. Zhou asked curiously: \"What do they say?\"","Wang Qinwei's gaze slowly rested on Sheng Mumu. \"Unlucky in relationships, lucky in gambling.\"","After she finished speaking, Mrs. Zhou and Mrs. Sun exchanged glances, sensing the turbulent undercurrents around the mahjong table.","Wang Qinwei hid her smile and continued: \"Mrs. Qi was so lucky to be able to self-draw that winning tile earlier. It must've been heaven's blessing.\"","Mrs. Sun was not gossipy. She just listened placidly while playing a tile: \"Three bamboo.\"","Sheng Mumu looked at the table: \"Pung.\"","Following Wang Qinwei's train of thought, Mrs. Zhou said: \"Mrs. Qi is really having great luck today.\"","Sheng Mumu gave a charming smile:","\"Yes, so you all should stop chatting and focus, be careful that I'll wipe the floor with you all.\"","Irritated that her veiled mocking proved useless, Wang Qinwei angrily slapped down a tile: \"Seven bamboo!\"","\"Hu!\" Sheng Mumu grinned. \"All simples, I win with your seven bamboo.\"","\"8,000 points each again.\"","Mrs. Sun looked at Sheng Mumu and joked: \"Mrs. Qi, you said you weren't good at mahjong earlier. Turns out you were just tricking us!\"","Sheng Mumu chuckled. \"No no, I really have to thank Mrs. Wang for the blessings.\"","Unlucky in relationships, lucky in gambling.","If the saying was true, as long as Qi Mo fooled around outside, her luck would be overflowing.","She was willing to have a meat and veggie combo life forever, in exchange for such great fortune.","Wang Qinwei was rendered speechless. After paying up resentfully, she heavily shoved the tiles away.","\"Again!\"","She refused to believe this. Her scornful tactics were useless, and even her proud mahjong skills had lost to Sheng Mumu.","Hmph.","...","An hour later.","Only when Wang Qinwei had lost all but one small bill from the 80,000 yuan she brought out did she realize what was happening.","What was wrong with her!","She had come out today fully intending to vent her resentment.","Yet somehow she ended up competing fiercely against Sheng Mumu at the mahjong table.","On the other hand, Sheng Mumu had become the big winner of this round.","A clean sweep.","In just a few hours, she had won close to 100,000 yuan.","More than the bonus she earned from a few months of hard project work.","Sheng Mumu tried her best not to behave like she had never seen so much money before.","She maintained an air of casual aloofness as she slowly put the money into her bag.","The more indifferent she acted, the more irritable Wang Qinwei became.","Not only did her taunting fail, she even lost money.","Infuriating!","Wang Qinwei calmed herself and adjusted her mindset.","Since Sheng Mumu wouldn't fall for aggression, she would try a softer approach.","When Mrs. Sun went to the restroom halfway through a round, Wang Qinwei suddenly grabbed Sheng Mumu's hand.","She patted it comfortingly and said:","\"Mrs. Qi, we're all women, I understand the bitterness in your heart. Even though you're forcing yourself to smile, I know you're crying inside.\"","Goosebumps instantly rose on Sheng Mumu's skin. She slowly looked up, staring at Wang Qinwei as if she was an idiot.","Seeing Sheng Mumu's eyelashes fluttering, her expression dazed, Wang Qinwei thought she had struck a chord about her troubles, and continued fervently:","\"Ah, when it comes down to it, it was my carelessness that caused this matter to spread and become common knowledge in our neighborhood. How about this, if you and Mr. Qi get a divorce, I'll recommend the best divorce lawyer in the city to you, as an apology.\"","\"Pfft--\"","Sheng Mumu finally couldn't hold back her laughter.","With that one laugh, ten years of cultivated image were ruined.","The painstakingly maintained facade of a peaceful marriage vanished.","She couldn't help it. Mrs. Wang was calculating too loudly, hitting her funny bone.","How could someone be so stupidly obvious?","Afraid that others wouldn't know about her eagerness to escalate the matter.","Sheng Mumu suppressed her laughter.","Since her act was already broken, she might as well speak plainly.","She pulled her hand out of Wang Qinwei's grip and said unhurriedly:","\"Mrs. Wang, you've been going on about my family affairs this whole mahjong game. I didn't want to disturb Mrs. Zhou and Mrs. Sun's enjoyment, which is why I didn't respond. But now that we're done playing, since you're so curious about my matters, let me give you a response.\"","Wang Qinwei stared blankly at Sheng Mumu, feeling like she had changed into a different person. She was momentarily struck speechless.","Sheng Mumu: \"My response is very simple.\"","Wang Qinwei looked at her puzzled: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Four words: None of your business.\"","Wang Qinwei: \"You...\"","Sheng Mumu: \"What about me? Are you so bored staying home every day that your mouth starts to stink, so the rare chance you come out to play mahjong, you want to chat endlessly to give your mouth some exercise?\"","Wang Qinwei's expression froze. \"You dare say I have a stinky mouth?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Just a metaphor, don't take it so seriously.\"","Wang Qinwei had never suffered this kind of anger before. Her hands shook uncontrollably, her body went cold, and her eyes glared fiercely at Sheng Mumu.","Beside them, Mrs. Zhou watched the two anxiously, at a loss.","She should be helping Wang Qinwei, who was closer to her, but seeing Sheng Mumu unleash her anger, Mrs. Zhou panicked and instinctively felt it was better not to get involved.","Wang Qinwei slammed the mahjong table forcefully, the impact numbing her palm. She yelled loudly:","\"Who do you think you are? Not even my husband dares to speak to me like that!\"","\"You can't even keep your own man's heart, yet you still dare to act arrogant in front of me?\"","\"Do you have the ability to make your husband change his mind? Do you have the ability to catch the mistress?\"","Sheng Mumu looked at Wang Qinwei expressionlessly.","She felt Wang Qinwei was truly pitiful.","Her self-worth was completely dependent on men. Every sentence exposed her deeply ingrained insecurities.","Just as Sheng Mumu was about to say more, steady footsteps gradually approached.","At the entrance, a female servant from the Sun family walked ahead to lead the way. She gestured towards the mahjong table and said:","\"Mr. Qi, Mrs. Qi is over there.\""]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Qi Mo: \"I give the confidence, is it enough\"","paragraphs":["The three people at the mahjong table turned their heads in unison at the sound.","Qi Mo's tall and straight figure appeared before everyone.","The mahjong room in Mrs. Sun's home had warm ceiling lights that shone down, illuminating Qi Mo's prominent brow bones.","His long eyelashes were thick, casting a small shadow beneath his eyes. The beam of light continued downward, grazing the bridge of his nose before finally being cut off by the hard lines of his jaw.","He was handsome as if he had stepped out of a comic book.","His cool eyes swept over the flustered Wang Qinwei, his voice carrying a bone-chilling authority as he calmly said,","\"Is the assurance I gave enough?\"","Wang Qinwei's body stiffened, not daring to meet Qi Mo's piercing cold gaze directly.","\"Mr...Mr. Qi?\"","Mrs. Zhou, who was standing to the side, held her breath. For a moment, she forgot the earlier chaotic scene, staring fixedly at Qi Mo.","She had caught glimpses of Qi Mo before in the neighborhood but had never spoken to him.","Only today did she realize how nice his voice was and how good-looking he was.","Mrs. Zhou finally understood why Mrs. Qi stayed silent even though she knew he was having an affair.","If it had been her in Mrs. Qi's position, she would have definitely clung onto her position as the main wife no matter what.","Even if he kept ten or eight mistresses on the side, she would absolutely defend her status as the official wife.","Sheng Mumu had already been visually attacked by Qi Mo's handsome face and beauty many times, so she was basically immune. She would not be distracted by ogling his face and forget the main issue. She blurted out, \"How did you get here?\"","Qi Mo's gaze slowly moved away from Wang Qinwei and landed on Sheng Mumu. The chilling aura that made people shudder completely disappeared from his eyes when looking at her. He said in a low voice, \"I came to take you home.\"","He knew she didn't want to participate in the wives' mahjong games.","By coming directly to the Suns' to find her, he wanted to naturally lead her away.","He didn't expect to hear Wang Qinwei's words when he reached the porch.","Sheng Mumu secretly raised her eyebrows at him twice.","She transmitted a telepathic message with her eyes: Was it because you knew your affair was exposed so you came to save the situation by pretending to be a loving couple?","Qi Mo was amused by her two raised eyebrows, faintly hooking up the corners of his lips.","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath: \"...\"","Okay.","She understood what she had to do now.","It seemed her guess was right - it was time again to abide by their prenuptial agreement and pretend to be a loving couple in front of others.","She got up and walked over to Qi Mo, her fair arm circling around his neck as she squeezed out a sickeningly sweet smile and said,","\"Hubby, you came to pick me up. We just finished our game.\"","Qi Mo's body stiffened as he reflexively put his hand around her waist.","Sheng Mumu took the opportunity to move closer and lowered her voice to whisper in his ear,","\"Luckily you came, I was almost annoyed to death by this gossiping woman. Your affair is getting harder to cover up. Let's go home and discuss how to deal with it next.\"","Qi Mo's gaze darkened as he stared at her for a few seconds before replying in a normal voice, \"No need to deal with it, there is no affair, it's a misunderstanding.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked: \"???\"","Hey, isn't that blatantly lying?","Weren't you seen entering a love nest with someone?","Wang Qinwei had already been stunned speechless to the side.","She had assumed a cheating man would treat his official wife coldly.","She didn't expect Qi Mo to show no coldness at all.","On the contrary, there was an indescribable gentleness in his eyes.","This kind of gentleness was something she had never seen in her husband, whom she was so proud of.","Witnessing the loving interaction between Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu made her feel like she had just eaten shit - extremely uncomfortable. She completely lost her rationality and critical thinking abilities, scornfully mocking:","\"What's with the act? Everyone knows you two are estranged.\"","Mrs. Zhou abruptly turned her head, signalling urgently with her eyes for Wang Qinwei to stop talking.","Everyone knew that although the residents of Xiyu Yue Ting were all wealthy, there were still differences in status among the rich.","For example, her husband Zhou only had enough assets to barely purchase a house here, in order to get acquainted with more social elites.","Whereas Wang Qinwei's husband Wang's business was large in scale, but the company had been declining the past two years. It was possible that a wrong decision could lead to bankruptcy at any time.","The minor skirmishes that arose among wives due to gossip, if it really spread to the men's social circles, would take on a completely different meaning.","Right now, President Qi had already stood up to defend Mrs. Qi. Wang Qinwei really needn't continue arguing just to save face.","Mrs. Zhou pulled Wang Qinwei's clothes and advised, \"Stop arguing. You misunderstood them. Mr. and Mrs. Qi have a great relationship.\"","Then she turned to look at Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu, \"She lost money today and is in a bad mood, that's why she lashed out. Don't take it to heart Mr. Qi.\"","Wang Qinwei was halfway through speaking, how could she stop there? She shook off Mrs. Zhou's hand and said,","\"What misunderstanding? Everyone here is married. Who doesn't understand that it's normal for a man to keep an official wife at home while secretly raising a lover outside? It's nothing surprising.\"","Wang Qinwei's fingers clenched tightly. \"I'm just stating the facts. How is that wrong?\"","Just as the confrontation had reached an impasse, Mrs. Sun, who had gone to the washroom, came back.","Her voice floated over before her figure appeared, \"Aiya, Mrs. Wang, Mrs. Wang, check out the news quick, something big happened!\"","Everyone looked over at the sound. A look of bewilderment on their faces.","Only Qi Mo remained unmoving, as if he already knew what was going to happen.","Mrs. Sun appeared before everyone holding her phone, \"The news said that Mr. and Mrs. Wang attended a banquet together.\"","She looked at Wang Qinwei awkwardly, \"But the Mrs. Wang in the photo isn't you!\"","There was a full three seconds of frozen silence after she finished speaking.","Everyone was processing the amount of information in Mrs. Sun's words.","Sheng Mumu: ???","Today's mahjong game was truly worth it!","Not only did she earn money, she also got to eat up fresh hot gossip.","Mrs. Zhou looked back and forth between Mrs. Sun and Wang Qinwei.","Wang Qinwei was completely frozen. Before Mrs. Sun could even walk over, she rushed forward to snatch the phone, yelling,","\"What nonsense are you spouting?\"","Mrs. Sun, who had her phone snatched away, stumbled. After being stabilized by a servant, she saw Qi Mo was here and was surprised.","\"Oh? Mr. Qi?\"","Although she was concerned about the news she just saw, her instincts as Mrs. Sun still made her give the appropriate reaction first.","\"We've been neighbors for so many years, yet this is the first time you've come to our home. Old Sun will be overjoyed when he finds out. He's been wanting to chat with you for a while. Old Sun will be back soon. Mr. Qi, stay for a casual meal.\"","Mr. Sun had tried many times to get acquainted with Qi Mo, taking the initiative to visit and invite Qi Mo out for tea or fishing, but had been rejected every time.","Mrs. Sun wanted to take this opportunity to build ties for her husband.","Qi Mo's lips curved into a faint smile, his tone calm, \"Next time when I'm free, I'll make plans with Mr. Sun for tea. Today is not very convenient.\"","Mrs. Sun glanced at Sheng Mumu, whose waist was being held by Qi Mo, and suddenly understood. Laughing, she patted her own forehead.","\"Look at me, I forgot Mr. Qi came to pick up Mrs. Qi. Next time, I'll have Old Sun set up a gathering.\"","Qi Mo softly responded, \"Mm.\"","Sheng Mumu's attention was not on the conversation between Qi Mo and Mrs. Sun. Led by curiosity, her focus drifted to Wang Qinwei's side.","Wang Qinwei's eyes were wide open in shock. Her expression gradually changed from bewilderment to disappointment, then to hysterical anger.","Her nails dug into her palms, her lips pressed tightly together.","Seeing the photos in the news, her legs turned soft and she could barely stand. She managed to steady herself by gripping the corner of the mahjong table.","It was truly laughable.","She had always loved showing off her affection in the wives' chat group, whether it was a new bag or new jewelry her husband bought her, she would take a photo and post it on Moments immediately.","It was as if doing so would let everyone know how much her husband doted on her.","But only she herself knew that after five years of marriage, her husband had never been willing to take a photo with her.","He indulged her every whim when they were alone but never brought her out to meet others or introduce her to friends and relatives.","Seeing the photos in the news now, she finally found the answer."]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Is Dad Cheating on You","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu's phone was out of battery, so she nudged Qi Mo's arm with her shoulder.","\"Can I borrow your phone to check out some gossip? My phone is dead.\"","Qi Mo naturally reached into his pocket and handed her his personal phone.","Sheng Mumu quickly browsed the news headlines to finally understand what had happened.","In the news photo - Mr. Wang had his arm around the waist of a wealthy lady, with a look of sincere concern on his face.","The headline read: The tycoon of the steel industry has a secret 10 year marriage, turns out his son-in-law is...","It turned out that Wang Qinwei's husband had already been married once before, his wife was the daughter of the steel tycoon, two years older than him.","The news article was written vividly.","It said that this was the first time the couple had publicly revealed their relationship, because Mr. Wang's company was facing a crisis, and he had no choice but to seek help from his father-in-law. So they took this opportunity of the news announcement to boost the company's stock price.","Sheng Mumu scrolled through the screen, both surprised and disgusted.","How could Mr. Wang's company suddenly face a crisis at this time? Just two days ago, Wang Qinwei was still bragging in the wives' chat group about the 2 million diamond necklace Mr. Wang had bought for her. It didn't seem like they were in financial difficulty!","If Sheng Mumu remembered correctly, Wang Qinwei had just mentioned during their card game that she had been married for 5 years.","So that meant, all these years, Wang Qinwei's husband had two families?","He married the daughter of the steel tycoon 10 years ago, and married Wang Qinwei 5 years ago.","Bigamy!","Sheng Mumu's gaze moved away from the phone and she slowly looked towards Wang Qinwei.","Wang Qinwei had already collapsed to the floor from the tremendous blow, with tears streaming down her face.","Sensing Sheng Mumu looking at her, Wang Qinwei clenched her fists tightly and glared up at her, eyes full of anger.","\"Are you satisfied now?\"","\"Seeing me in such dire straits, you're happy right?\"","Wang Qinwei was like a madwoman who had nowhere to vent her grief, anguish and resentment, and took it all out on Sheng Mumu.","After her words, she didn't wait for Sheng Mumu's reply, but picked up her phone again and again, and suddenly started laughing in self-deprecation.","\"Ha...hahaha...\"","The man in the news photo had a humble smile while helping carry the steel tycoon's daughter's handbag. He was completely different from the husband in her impression.","Just a moment ago, she was still aggressive and mocking others, but it turns out that she herself failed to hold onto her husband's heart, and the one her husband had on the side was her.","Oh no.","To be precise.","She was the one he kept on the side.","It really was too ironic.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, her fine brows slightly knitted, and it took her a long while before she finally spoke up in a calm tone, with normal volume:","\"I won't laugh at you, there's nothing funny about this.\"","Wang Qinwei stared blankly at Sheng Mumu, her lips moved but no words came out.","Sheng Mumu turned her head and said to Qi Mo, \"Let's go back.\"","Qi Mo's gaze flickered slightly as he nodded lightly.","After leaving the Sun residence, Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo walked side by side on the road.","She was still thinking about what had just happened.","The world was really unpredictable.","Who could have thought that the one who liked to show off the most in the wives' chat group, the one who liked to spread other people's gossip the most, would end up becoming the biggest gossip herself.","Her phone had died, but she could guess that the wives' chat group must have exploded by now.","Just this morning, she was still hoping that some new gossip would appear as soon as possible to divert the attention of the ladies in the chat group.","But when the new gossip really came out, she somehow felt uncomfortable inside.","After all, the source of all this gossip always revolved around which woman got hurt again.","Thinking of this, she felt a sense of sighing regret.","Just as she was lamenting, Qi Mo called the butler Zhang to bring the car around.","Butler Zhang got out of the car, handed the car keys to Qi Mo, and respectfully nodded in greeting: \"Sir, Madam.\"","Qi Mo took the keys and said to Butler Zhang: \"Alright, you can go back first.\"","Sheng Mumu returned to her senses, \"Aren't we going back?\"","Qi Mo walked to the driver's side, pulled open the door, and leaned on it. He looked at her playfully:","\"Your stomach was growling just now. If I don't take you to get something to eat, you'll keep me up tonight.\"","Sheng Mumu's earlobes secretly turned a little red.","She had been so absorbed in her thoughts just now that she didn't even notice her stomach rumbling.","She smiled awkwardly, and pulled open the passenger door.","Just as she sat down, Qi Mo leaned over and a crisp, pleasant scent invaded Sheng Mumu's nostrils.","She couldn't help but shrink her neck, her back pressed tightly against the seat.","When Butler Zhang took the car from the garage just now, he had randomly grabbed one of the luxury cars, which happened to be one with not too spacious interior.","Sheng Mumu watched as Qi Mo stretched out his long arm, reaching over her to pull out the seat belt and buckle her in.","It was clearly a very common, gentlemanly gesture, yet she suddenly felt nervous when he leaned over.","His handsome, striking features were magnified up close, his deep brows and eyes seemed to have an attractive force, like a whirlpool that made it hard to look away.","She didn't feel overwhelmed by Qi Mo's good looks under the dim atmosphere lighting at Mrs. Sun's place, but was struck by his up close visual impact in the dark car interior.","Sheng Mumu: \"Thank you.\"","Qi Mo sat back leisurely, methodically rolled up his sleeves, his movements calm and composed.","A section of his fair yet powerful forearm was revealed, lightly resting on the steering wheel as he turned to look at her and suddenly said:","\"In the future, if you don't want to participate in this kind of gambling gathering, you can directly refuse, no need to force yourself.\"","When the gambling gathering was mentioned, Sheng Mumu beamed.","\"I didn't force myself, it was fine since I went today, otherwise I wouldn't have known that I'm so good at gambling.\"","Qi Mo's gaze was fixed intently on her: \"Oh? How much did you win?\"","Sheng Mumu patted her bulging pocket, \"I won close to 100,000! You have to say I'm awesome right?\"","The corner of Qi Mo's mouth curled up slightly, his tone carrying a hint of laughter.","\"Cool.\"","Having received affirmation, Sheng Mumu was extremely pleased with herself, tilting her chin up.","\"Let's go, today's meal is my treat. Money won through gambling must be spent quickly, so that good luck will continue to flow.\"","This was Qi Mo's first time hearing such a notion, and he found it amusing. He nodded.","\"Alright, what do you want to eat?\"","Sheng Mumu cocked a proud brow, smiling brightly, \"Anything you choose is fine.\"","......","Butler Zhang stood by the roadside with his hands behind his back, watching as the car's tail lights gradually faded into the distance. A pleased, gratified smile spread across his old face.","Butler Zhang: Ah, this family can't do without me!","When he went out earlier, he didn't know what inspired him to choose this car from the garage full of luxury cars.","Seeing the shy expression on Madam's face when Sir helped buckle her seatbelt just now, Butler Zhang felt that he had performed his duty as a butler perfectly!","At that time.","A lanky teenager wearing a T-shirt and shorts walked in from outside the villa area.","The boy was holding a basketball, idly playing with it in his hands.","Two maid-looking people walked ahead of him, chatting as they strolled.","He vaguely heard snippets of the conversation ahead.","\"Have you heard, there's another family in the compound whose husband had an affair and got caught by his wife!\"","\"Are you talking about the biggest villa?\"","\"I don't know about that, I heard my wife talking to someone else and seems to be surnamed Qi? Is it pronounced Qi Liuhao? Do you know which family it is?\"","\"Oh no, it's not Qi, it's Qi, the biggest villa.\"","\"I also heard they will most likely get a divorce.\"","Boom - boom boom -","Hearing the noise, the two lowered their volume and turned around.","They discovered it was a teenage boy who had accidentally dropped his basketball. They turned their heads back and continued chatting.","Qi Shaobai bent over to pick up the ball, his eyes gradually becoming overcast.","When he stood up, he looked up and heaved a long sigh.","At his current age, he didn't yet have the ability to hide his worries deep in his heart. The previously calm expression on his face turned gloomy and overcast.","Even though he tried his best not to think about it, his mind kept replaying what he just overheard.","The street lamp shone obliquely on Qi Shaobai's cold countenance.","He gritted his teeth, brows furrowed tightly.","Dad had an affair?","The abstract concept of \"family\" that had just barely taken shape in his heart seemed to crumble in an instant.","The evening air temperature was stuffy on a July night.","Qi Shaobai's chest was blocked by a lump of gloom, his throat even more stifling than the summer night weather."]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Mr. Qi, how many bully do you eat at a meal","paragraphs":["Tonight's wives chat group was livelier than usual.","Sheng Mumu and Wang Qinwei became the center of attention.","[Mrs. Sun: Don't spread those rumors, everyone. Mrs. Qi was at my house playing mahjong today, and Qi Chief came to pick her up in person. They looked very much in love.]","[Mrs. Zhao: I knew it! I didn't believe those nonsense stories either. Mrs. Qi looks so spirited and happy, clearly a woman nourished by love.]","[Mrs. Song: Don't believe rumors, don't spread rumors. [making a face]]","[Mrs. Qian: Sorry about skipping mahjong today.]","[Mrs. Sun: @Mrs. Qian, you dodged a bullet. Mrs. Qi won against three families today, super lucky.]","[Mrs. Li: Who lost big? [curious]]","[Mrs. Sun: Mrs. Wang, her luck was bad today. Ah, let's not mention it.]","[Mrs. Li: Huh? How come I don't see Mrs. Wang chatting in the group? She usually loves talking with everyone.]","[Mr. Wu's Precious: Oh Mrs. Li, you didn't see the news? ]","[Mrs. Li: What news? I just got back from vacation in Switzerland, still at the airport, just opened my phone.]","Those who used to be close with Wang Qinwei suddenly distanced themselves from her, and started mocking -","[Mr. Zheng's Little Wife: My god, so juicy. Looks like Mrs. Wang didn't just have bad mahjong luck, her marriage ran into trouble too [covering mouth giggling]]","[Mr. Wu's Precious: I felt something was off for a while. Mrs. Wang always loved showing off her lovey-dovey relationship in the group, but we've never run into the couple together in the compound. So this is what's going on, who would've thought!]","[Mr. Zheng's Little Wife: That's right, that 2 million dollar necklace she showed off, it's got to be a fake right?]","[Mrs. Li: You guessed right! I just went on vacation in Switzerland, met a friend who said the flower shaped necklace auctioned here last month was won by Qi Chief from Beijing. And it was the only one!]","[Mrs. Qian: Last month? That must have been when Mrs. Qi got married, Qi Chief probably bought it as a gift for his new wife.]","[Mr. Wu's Precious: Hahahaha, I'm dying, Mrs. Wang is too embarrassing!]","[Mrs. Zhou: That's right, I was there playing mahjong today, Mrs. Wang was furious.]","[Mrs. Zhou: To think I used to be close with her, listening to her gossip about Mrs. Qi. Now looking back, she was probably just jealous that Mrs. Qi is happily married.]","[...]","In the car.","The center of attention Sheng Mumu was using Qi Mo's phone to look for restaurants nearby.","After a long time she picked a barbecue restaurant not far from Xiyu Garden.","Sheng Mumu pulled up driving directions, planning to prop the phone on a car mount.","After looking around, she realized there was no phone mount in the car.","Oh...","He always had a driver take him around, so a phone mount was unnecessary.","Qi Mo glanced at Sheng Mumu's hovering hand.","\"Picked a place?\"","Sheng Mumu responded: \"Mm, a barbecue restaurant, not too far, but on a small road, might be hard to navigate.\"","Qi Mo watched the road ahead, \"I can't look at navigation while driving, you follow the directions and guide me.\"","\"Ok.\"","Qi Mo had planned to talk to Sheng Mumu about Dr. Jiang on the drive over.","Seeing her fully concentrated on the navigation, afraid to make a wrong turn, he decided to wait until they got to the restaurant.","As the car approached the villa compound entrance, Sheng Mumu's attention was caught by a familiar figure.","\"Isn't that Qi Shaobai up ahead?\"","Hearing this, Qi Mo slowed down and looked in the direction she was gazing.","Qi Shaobai was sitting on a roadside bench, elbows on knees, staring blankly at the ground lost in thought.","The car stopped in front of Qi Shaobai.","Sheng Mumu rolled down her window.","\"Little Qi, what are you doing sitting here?\"","Caught off guard mid-daze, Qi Shaobai lifted his head with a startled look.","Before he could respond, Sheng Mumu cheerfully invited:","\"Your dad and I are going for barbecue, want to join?\"","Qi Shaobai's gaze went past Sheng Mumu to the man in the driver's seat. He pondered for a good few seconds before heaving a sigh of relief. Silently he got up and opened the back door to get in.","He actually had no appetite at all.","But on second thought, this might be a farewell dinner, so he went along.","He didn't know this stepmother Sheng Mumu for long, but his impression of her was decent.","If the rumors were true, that his father had an affair leading to divorce...","As the son, he felt somewhat guilty.","Qi Shaobai got in the car carrying this gloom.","He had assumed the atmosphere would be even heavier for the two in front, but reality was far from what he imagined.","Recalling the scene at Mrs. Sun's house, when Qi Mo suddenly appeared, Sheng Mumu couldn't help joking about it.","\"What you said back there was so TV drama-like.\"","Qi Mo casually glanced over, tone flat, \"What did I say?\"","Sheng Mumu cleared her throat, and lowered her voice to mimic Qi Mo's tone from earlier.","\"Ahem...Is the assurance I give enough?\"","Still feeling unsatisfied after the mimicry, she shaped her hand into a mic shape and held it to Qi Mo.","\"Let me interview you, Mr. Qi. How many big bosses can you take down in one meal? Such an awesome vibe.\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","He looked down at the fair fist held up to his face, and let out a low chuckle, the overbearing aura around him turning gentle.","Seeing him laugh, Sheng Mumu was even more delighted. \"Oh, Mr. Qi, successful men like you, have you ever said, 'It's getting cold, time to bankrupt the Wangs'?\"","Qi Mo kept one hand on the steering wheel, propped his elbow on the other, glancing over with mirth in his eyes.","The hard edges of his jawline softened, his tone also taking on a hint of laughter, voice gentling:","\"No one speaks like that.\"","If he wanted to take action, he would just directly do it, no need to announce it ahead of time.","\"With your wealth, you could be more arrogant,\" Sheng Mumu seriously shook her head in argument.","Qi Mo helplessly rubbed his temple, letting out a few muffled chuckles from his chest.","Sheng Mumu also realized she wasn't making much sense, and started laughing too.","The man's summer breeze-like charming low laughter mingled with the woman's vaguely silly crisp laughter, falling upon the \"foolish son's\" ears in the backseat.","Qi Shaobai was thoroughly confused: \"???\"","The usually cold eyes of the seventeen year old rebellious teen now harbored great bewilderment never seen before.","Was the adult world so strong that they could laugh off anything that happened, or did he get something wrong?","These two really didn't seem like they were about to divorce at all."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: A heart-warming family Meal.","paragraphs":["Upon arriving at the barbecue restaurant, the server led the three to a private room and they sat down.","Seeing Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai sitting steadily without any intention of ordering, Sheng Mumu took the initiative to take on the task of ordering dishes.","After looking through the menu for a while, she closed it and said to the server:","\"We'll have one Warm Family Set Meal.\"","It was just the right amount for three people, and much more cost-effective than ordering individually.","Sheng Mumu felt proud of herself for being wealthy yet not wasteful. However, she didn't expect that as soon as she finished speaking, Qi father and son looked over at the same time.","It was just a glance, and they both retracted their gazes again, resuming their silent, aloof appearances.","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","What do they mean?","Do they think she ordered the set meal because it's too cheap, and fails to reflect the wealthy family's style?","Before she could think too much about it, the server had already brought over the ingredients and charcoal.","She first eyed a plate of pork belly that looked very fresh, and neatly arranged the slices on the grill.","Qi Shaobai was still thinking back to the rumors he had heard in the residential district.","After a while, he finally couldn't hold back.","Leaning back with his hands in his pockets, he suddenly spoke:","\"I already know about you two.\"","With these words, Sheng Mumu's hand that was holding the barbecue tongs and flipping the meat paused. She looked up blankly.","Alarm bells immediately went off in her heart.","Know what?","Qi Shaobai had a grave expression, making her heart tighten involuntarily and her hand tremble slightly.","Could it be that he found out about her and Qi Mo's fake marriage?!","Qi Shaobai's gaze lazily fell on the burning coals.","\"I heard people in the district saying that you two...are getting a divorce because of an affair.\"","The air seemed to freeze for a second.","In the midst of the silence, Sheng Mumu secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","Just as she felt relieved that Qi Shaobai had not discovered their contractual marriage and she would not have to terminate the contract early, the ink-colored eyes beside her suddenly froze over, and a hint of coldness surfaced.","The three of them stopped talking.","Only the sizzling sound of grilling meat could be heard from time to time, unusually jarring.","...","Finally, Qi Mo was the first to break the deathly silence.","He glanced coldly at Qi Shaobai, then his gaze lingered on Sheng Mumu as he slowly said:","\"That's good. I came back early from Shen City because I wanted to clear this up with you—\"","His tone was calm and unruffled, but the two listening to him were not composed at all.","When Qi Mo started to talk about the \"affair\", for some reason, Sheng Mumu suddenly became nervous. Her hand under the table involuntarily clenched.","All kinds of TV drama scenes suddenly popped into her mind, and she couldn't help but speculate.","Would he say that his white moonlight has returned to the country, and that she, his fake wife, needs to be let go early?","Or is the woman a new intern at their company, and feelings developed after working closely together every day?","No matter which one, she didn't want to be let go early...","Just as she was thinking more and more absurdly and her expression was becoming more and more hopeless, the man's low, magnetic voice pulled her back to reality.","\"That woman is Dr. Jiang, my granny's former private doctor. I happened to run into her that day and gave her a ride.\"","\"When my granny comes to Jing City in a while, I asked Dr. Jiang to do a full physical exam for her.\"","Qi Mo glanced at Qi Shaobai again. When speaking to his son, his tone was clearly several degrees colder:","\"The rumors you heard are not true.\"","When he finished speaking, completely different expressions emerged on Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai's faces.","Qi Shaobai's shoulders sagged in relief as he exclaimed in sudden realization:","\"Dr. Jiang, ah, I met her when I was little.\"","He had just finished speaking when Qi Shaobai frowned slightly, a strange feeling of discomfort welling up in his heart.","Would saying this make it seem like he was trying to explain for his dad?","As he was thinking this, his gaze turned to Sheng Mumu.","He saw that Sheng Mumu's face showed no signs of relaxation; on the contrary, she gradually stiffened, her breathing slowed, and she murmured:","\"I see...\"","She didn't quite catch what Qi Shaobai had said.","Upon hearing the four words \"full physical exam\" from Qi Mo, she suddenly thought of something extremely important.","In the book, Qi Granny, Qi Mo's grandmother, had been described from Qi Shaobai's perspective.","Qi Granny was diagnosed with a tumor before Qi Shaobai went to college. By the time it was discovered, it was already in the late stages. At that time, Qi Shaobai was overseas participating in a study abroad program, while Qi Mo was working abroad.","Not wanting them to worry, Qi Granny concealed the illness. Her condition deteriorated rapidly and she passed away within a week.","Not being able to see Qi Granny one last time later became the biggest regret for the father and son.","Sheng Mumu felt as if she had been doused with a bucket of cold water. She stared blankly at the two people in front of her who were still oblivious to what was about to happen, and a complicated emotion crept into her heart.","After a while, she smiled and said,","\"When Granny comes to Jing City, I'll go with her for the physical.\"","As she spoke, she picked up the barbecue tongs to change the subject.","\"Let's eat quickly. The meat is about to get burnt. If we don't start eating soon, it won't be grilled pork belly anymore, it'll be cremated pork belly.\"","\"Pfft—\"","The seventeen-year-old's emotions came and went quickly. Just a moment ago he was still frowning worriedly, but now he was instantly tickled by Sheng Mumu's words and burst out laughing.","\"Cremated, what the heck!\"","The atmosphere seemed to ease up a bit. Qi Mo's eyes narrowed slightly.","His keen observational skills allowed him to detect Sheng Mumu's absent-mindedness when she spoke.","He didn't break the atmosphere and silently rolled up his shirt sleeves, naturally reaching out to take the barbecue tongs from Sheng Mumu's hands.","\"I'll grill, you must be hungry so eat first.\"","Sheng Mumu was startled and didn't react in time before Qi Mo had taken the tongs from her hands.","The man's grilling was not very skilled; it was evident he didn't usually go into the kitchen.","But he moved neither hastily nor slowly, and his every action exuded a calm and composed aura, which actually concealed his clumsiness and made him appear collected.","In no time, her plate was already piled with several slices of meat.","On the other side of the table, in front of the teenager Qi Shaobai who was going through a growth spurt, there was a lonely single slice of meat.","Qi Shaobai: ......","*","All the way until the three of them finished eating barbecue and returned home, Sheng Mumu kept thinking about Qi Granny's matter.","The marriage contract stated that it would automatically be cancelled 100 years after Qi Granny's passing.","According to the timeline in the book, there should still be less than a year before Qi Granny was diagnosed with the tumor.","If they could detect the illness early and treat it in time,","was there a possibility that Granny could live a few more years?","She could have just pretended not to know anything, and waited until the day the prenuptial agreement took effect to take a large sum of money and leave the Qi family.","But the human heart is made of flesh, after all. Knowing how things would unfold, she could not just sit by and watch regret occur right before her eyes.","Sheng Mumu bit her lip.","She thought to herself, never mind, contract or no contract, and regardless of whether this would change the plotline of the book.","When Granny comes to Jing City, she must accompany her to carefully examine her health.","Even if she couldn't prevent the illness, she would at least let this father and son see Granny one last time, so they have no regrets.","When Qi Mo came out of the shower, Sheng Mumu had already sorted out her emotions.","Seeing him come out, Sheng Mumu got up and headed towards the bathroom, planning to take a bath too.","In passing, she casually tied up her long hair with a hair tie into a messy bun.","Revealing the smooth, slender lines of her neck and shoulders.","With her hair down she looked glamorous and dazzling, but tied up she had a touch of childlike innocence she couldn't hide.","As they passed each other, Qi Mo's gaze fell on the fuzzy wisps of hair around her ear. He suddenly stopped in his tracks and called out to stop her.","\"Wait, I have something to tell you.\""]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: He seemed angry, and he seemed to laugh.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu turned her head when she heard the sound.","The two of them were very close, close enough that she could smell the nice scent of Qi Mo's bath gel.","She took a light breath, and found that the fragrance was from the same brand of bath gel as hers.","The robe on the man in front of her was loose and casual, contrasting with his usual suited image.","Water droplets from his hair tips fell onto his collarbone and disappeared into his robe, arousing her imagination for no reason.","She had inadvertently seen his bare upper body a few times before, and knew that his robe hid a firm waistline underneath.","She didn't know why, but her earlobes suddenly felt a little hot, and her eyes quickly looked up.","She was also shy about looking straight into his eyes, so she responded while facing his chest:","\"What's the matter?\"","Qi Mo's voice was low and casual:","\"The affair was just a rumor, not a lie made up to fool Qi Shao. Don't get the wrong idea.\"","Her absent-mindedness at dinner was probably because she had misunderstood this?","As a contractual couple, there was no need to explain too much.","But when he walked out of the bathroom and saw her sitting on the bed with her cheeks in her hands, deep in thought, he suddenly felt that explaining it one more time wouldn't hurt.","Sheng Mumu looked straight at the man in front of her.","Up close, his deep brows and eyes, and sharp, rugged facial features, made one dizzy and fascinated.","She collected her thoughts, and smiled charmingly: \"Even if it was a real affair, it doesn't matter.\"","The wording was inaccurate. She paused and corrected herself:","\"We are a contractual couple. If you really have a woman you like, it wouldn't even count as having an affair. Just be careful not to let others find out.\"","The man's jawline gradually tensed, and a hint of coldness that was hard to detect flashed through his eyes.","After several seconds, the chill in his eyes finally dissipated a little, but his tone was still icy cold:","\"I don't have a woman I like.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment, her brows and eyes curved up as she blinked: \"A man you like...is also okay...\"","In fact, she had felt strange about this for a long time.","With Qi Mo's good looks and status, why would he rather have a fake marriage with her than truly marry someone?","If it was because he liked men,","everything might make sense.","She tilted her head in thought, unaware that the man's face was getting darker and darker, his pitch black eyes unfathomable.","Qi Mo's body emitted a cold air. He suddenly leaned in close, slowing down his tone:","\"Do I look like someone who would like men?\"","There was nothing particularly wrong with this sentence, but the suddenly shortened distance made Sheng Mumu lose her composure.","Her cheeks flushed red and she shrank her neck back.","Undeniably, she was captivated by the handsomeness of this man who had just gotten out of the bath and was still steaming.","The scent of the bath gel was clearer than before. She even felt like the surrounding air had become hotter.","Facing Qi Mo's piercing gaze, she held her breath and looked up at him.","He seemed angry, but also like he was laughing.","Qi Mo stared at the clueless girl in front of him for several seconds, his expression hard to discern.","Then his brow quirked, his tone mocking:","\"You sure have a vivid imagination.\"","After saying this, he straightened up and walked away.","Leaving behind Sheng Mumu, whose earlobes were red. She blinked at his gradually distant, upright back, confused and not understanding.","*","The next day.","Sheng Mumu was woken up by Su Tingran's phone call.","\"Mumu, it was so lively in the wives' group chat last night. Why didn't you come out and say anything?\"","Su Tingran felt that after knowing each other for so long, calling her Mrs. Qi seemed too formal, so she affectionately changed how she addressed her.","Sheng Mumu rubbed her sleepy eyes, her voice hoarse from just waking up.","\"My phone ran out of battery last night, so I didn't see the group messages.\"","Su Tingran said: \"You don't know, Zhou, Wu, Zheng, oh no, those three Mrs. Zhou, Wu, and Zheng were constantly praising you in the group chat, don't even mention how hypocritical it was.\"","\"I heard that Mrs. Wang moved out with large and small bags in the middle of the night, around 2 or 3 am. And she was wearing sunglasses when she left.\"","With her face and shoulder clamping the phone, Sheng Mumu brushed her teeth while listening to Su Tingran speak.","With foam in her mouth, she asked indistinctly:","\"Why wear sunglasses so late at night? Was she abused?\"","Su Tingran: \"Probably not. Mr. Wang was accompanying the daughter of the steel tycoon. He wouldn't have time to come back. She must have worn the sunglasses because she was afraid of losing face if seen by others.\"","Sheng Mumu rinsed her mouth. \"Ah, the pitiable will inevitably be hateful. This saying is so true.\"","She hadn't forgotten Wang Qinwei's overt and covert ridicule of her at the mahjong table yesterday.","Although she sympathized with her plight, she also didn't conceal her dislike of Wang's character because of that sympathy.","Su Tingran murmured in agreement, as if suddenly thinking of something.","\"Oh, that's right. Mrs. Li said that the 20 million diamond flower necklace Mrs. Wang showed off before was fake. The real necklace was snapped up by your Mr. Qi at an auction last month.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned. \"Huh?\"","She had felt like that necklace looked familiar at the time, but couldn't remember where she had seen it no matter how hard she tried. Hearing this, she suddenly recalled it.","Opening the three-tiered jewelry drawer, Sheng Mumu rummaged through the piles of necklaces and rings.","Sure enough, in an inconspicuous corner, she saw an unremarkable flower-shaped diamond necklace, with neither outstanding design nor outstanding carats.","She silently tsked. Wow, even such an ordinary piece in her jewelry drawer was worth 20 million?","She searched her memory, and suddenly recalled Zhang the butler mentioning in passing—","\"Madam, the jewelry in these drawers are pieces that the master casually bought back from auctions. You can wear them daily if you like the styles. There are still many more valuable ones in the safe for you to choose from when attending important events.\"","20 million? Casually bought back? Wear daily?","Just how wealthy was this Qi Mo?","She awkwardly tugged at the corner of her mouth: ...","How could she have the audacity to let this man of unknown wealth use her bath gel freebie?"]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: What's wrong with Rich women Rich Women don't like handsome men","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu and Su Tingran chatted for a while longer, then Su Tingran asked, \"Are we playing mahjong today? Mrs. Sun said you were in great form yesterday, shall we have a match?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"I won't play today, I have a meeting scheduled.\"","Su Tingran: \"Okay, let's reschedule when you're free.\"","\"Ok.\"","After hanging up the phone, Sheng Mumu started putting on makeup and changing her clothes.","With the increase in membership at Yueji Flower Shop recently, the original four employees were struggling to keep up.","The exquisite business cards prepared before the opening played a key role in promoting the flower shop.","Sheng Mumu put different cards in each flower bouquet order.","Some had horoscopes, flower meanings, some said \"Be Happy Today\" or silly jokes.","With a 1% chance, customers could get a special card for free flowers for life.","This clever idea brought customers the excitement of opening a blind box when receiving flowers, along with the beautiful packaging. Many posted photos online.","Several posts were shared by influencers, instantly attracting lots of attention.","The inevitable result of increased traffic was increased workload.","With rich experience working in foreign companies, Sheng Mumu knew that hiring ten more people would not compare to one professional manager.","So she turned to Dong Assistant for help.","Dong Assistant recommended a reputable headhunting firm in the industry.","This afternoon, she had arranged to meet with them.","At 2pm, a white Porsche parked in the underground garage of an upscale office building downtown.","The car door opened, and a slender, jade-like leg emerged first.","A beautiful woman with exquisite features stepped out in black stilettos, casually brushing back a lock of hair obstructing her view and tucking it behind her ear.","Her light blue blouse was tucked into a pencil skirt, accentuating her perfect curves.","With a great figure and graceful demeanor, she walked steadily toward the elevator hall.","Not far away, four men in their early twenties stared wide-eyed as she passed.","They kept watching until that charming figure disappeared behind the closing elevator doors, before breaking into lively discussion.","\"What a gorgeous girl!\"","\"A goddess on earth!\"","\"Her car costs over 3 million, she's no girl, she's a rich madame.\"","One chimed in, \"I wonder if the rich madame is taken, I'd love to meet her.\"","The one with a Korean-style bangs flipped his hair and said,","\"If you want to meet her, go ahead, coward.\"","\"Did you see her bag? The four of us working a year probably couldn't afford it. On what basis could we approach her?\"","The Korean-bangs guy sneered,","\"So what if she's rich? Rich women don't like handsome guys?\"","Laughing, someone encouraged, \"Go try your luck, rich lady loves Korean flower boys like you.\"","The Korean-bangs guy flashed a roguish smile, somehow producing a sticky note.","\"Anyone got a pen? Let me demonstrate how to seduce a lonely, beautiful, rich lady.\"","...","Top floor of the building.","Dong Assistant knocked on the CEO's office door.","Hearing a low magnetic \"Come in\", he gently pushed open the door.","\"Mr. Qi, the HR department has come up with this year's employee benefits plan for Qi Group.\"","The handsome, deep-eyed man at the desk remained expressionless, still reading documents, using silence to signal him to continue.","Dong Assistant: \"Bonuses are 5% higher than last year's plan. Also, Qi Group directors and above and their families are entitled to a free week vacation at Shen City Resort.\"","Qi Mo, tone flat: \"Mm.\"","As Dong Assistant was about to leave the office, he suddenly recalled something and asked,","\"Mr. Qi, your wife is coming over this afternoon, shall I arrange a car to take her back to Xi Yu Yue Ting?\"","As usual, he asked, not knowing if she would drive over.","Hearing this, the stoic man finally looked up, slowly raising his eyelids.","He finally uttered more than two words:","\"My wife is coming over?\"","Dong Assistant was taken aback, thinking Qi was aware.","Now, realizing he seemed unaware, Dong Assistant recounted how Sheng Mumu had consulted him about a headhunter and his recommendation in full detail.","After finishing, Dong Assistant was puzzled.","He distinctly remembered Sheng Mumu asking warmly about Qi several times at the end of their call.","Their relationship should be good, how could Qi not know about her coming over today?","Could the couple be fighting?","\"Mr. Qi, your wife told me to keep antacids on hand and pay attention to your diet and rest.\"","Holding to the philosophy of \"speaking well of others can't hurt\", Dong Assistant relayed Sheng Mumu's words to Qi Mo's ears.","Before he could pat himself on the back for his tact, he saw the man at the desk narrow his eyes slightly.","...","12th Floor of the Neighboring Building","\"Ms. Sheng, please be assured we will find the most suitable candidate according to your needs.\"","Sister Chen, the headhunter manager, smiled professionally at her guest.","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Thanks for your trouble.\"","Sister Chen: \"It's our job. Ms. Sheng, apart from education and work experience requirements, do you have any preferences regarding the applicant's appearance or age?\"","Often, applicants met all criteria but were rejected over gender, age, or clashing zodiac signs.","In Ms. Sheng's floral industry, appearance standards should be more demanding, so it was prudent to ask.","Just as the seasoned headhunter expected a typical response, she heard:","\"For women, professional competence is enough, but men...\"","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, tapping her chin as she mused:","\"Should be over 180cm tall, under 150kg in weight.\"","\"Above average looks, at least four abdominal muscles, emotionally stable and not prone to anger.\"","\"No history of harassing female colleagues, smoking, alcoholism or other bad habits...\"","One minute later.","Sheng Mumu smiled charmingly, \"That's all I can think of for now. I'll let you know if I have other criteria later.\"","The job market often had harsh standards for female applicants yet was full of tolerance for males.","She had never thought this fair.","Now with a chance to set hiring criteria herself, she did not hold back, raising the bar high.","Sister Chen was astonished but kept her composure. She surreptitiously swallowed.","\"Okay, Ms. Sheng, I've noted down all you said. We will strictly adhere to your requirements in our candidate selection and give you a response within a week.\"","Sheng Mumu stood up, shook hands professionally to say thanks and goodbye. \"You've worked hard.\"","The other party returned the handshake. \"You're too kind.\"","Exiting the headhunter's office and entering the elevator, her phone rang in the enclosed space.","The screen displayed \"Hubby\".","She was stunned for a second before accepting the call.","Over the phone, Qi Mo's magnetic, seductive voice came through:","\"I heard from Dong Assistant you went to the headhunter next door?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Yeah, I just left the headhunter's.\"","Qi Mo: \"Did it go well?\"","Sheng Mumu sounded very happy: \"Quite well, Sister Chen is very professional. She said she could resolve my hiring needs within a week.\"","A soft \"Mm\" came over the phone.","After a pause, they spoke simultaneously.","Sheng Mumu: \"What's up? Any particular reason for calling me?\"","Qi Mo: \"I finished work today. Shall we go home together?\"","In the elevator's reflective surface, Sheng Mumu blinked innocently.","She spoke casually: \"Sure.\"","Over the phone: \"Meet in the parking lot.\""]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Harass the president's wife again, and you're gonna get more than a flesh wound.","paragraphs":["Three minutes later, the sound of leather shoes treading on the ground came from far to near.","Looking up along the direction of the sound, a man with a sturdy and tall figure and handsome features walked out from the elevator hall.","The moment his eyes met Sheng Mumu's, the corners of the man's eyes lazily and gently curled up.","The weather in July was sultry, but the air conditioning in the office building was very strong.","He was still dressed meticulously in a shirt. Only the jacket casually draped over his forearms showed that he was not currently working.","Sheng Mumu didn't see Qi Mo take the car key and asked, \"You didn't drive?\"","As soon as the words fell, she felt the question was quite silly.","He didn't usually need to drive. Wherever he went, Xiao Wang would follow him.","Where was Xiao Wang today?","Before asking her doubts, she heard Qi Mo say, \"I asked the driver to take the car in for maintenance.\"","Sheng Mumu thought of the many luxury cars in the Qi's garage and nodded thoughtfully, \"Having too many cars is troublesome. It must take a lot of time to do maintenance in turns.\"","As she spoke, she rummaged in her bag for the car key while walking to the white Porsche, and asked, \"Do you want to drive or should I drive?\"","After a long silence without a reply, she looked up.","She saw Qi Mo's tall figure standing still in front of the car window.","His slender, bony fingers took down the note stuck in the window frame.","His long lashes hid the light in his eyes, and his jaw tightened into a cold, sharp line.","Sheng Mumu: ?","She went over to take a look.","On the note were a few crooked lines -","\"Hello Miss, sorry for the inconvenience.","I want to make friends with Miss.","I'm 23 this year, 180cm tall, work out regularly and have abs.","If Miss is willing, you can add me on WeChat XXXXXXXXXXX.","Hugs.\"","\"Pff—\"","Sheng Mumu laughed out loud, the corners of her eyes curled up beautifully.","\"Just a few sentences with three typos.\"","\"Invade\" was written as \"worry\", \"work out\" was written as \"key\" and \"willing\" was written as \"义\".","\"What a naughty runaway from Disney!\"","Sheng Mumu hugged her belly and commented with laughter.","The man beside her had a completely different aura, with unfathomable eyes, not knowing what he was thinking.","Until the giggling girl took away the note from his hand and took out her phone, the deep and profound eyes narrowed slightly.","\"Are you going to add him?\"","His voice seemed to be wrapped in ice, low and deep.","\"Of course not.\" Sheng Mumu turned on the camera on her phone, \"Such a funny thing, I have to send it to Ting Ran and let her laugh with me.\"","After speaking, she snapped pictures.","Then she looked around, didn't find a trash can, and stuffed the note back into Qi Mo's hand, \"Help me throw it away, I'm going to send a text.\"","The broad palm that was stuffed with the note trembled slightly at the fingertips. The man's gaze at her became more and more inscrutable.","Sheng Mumu held up her phone and started typing, making a judgment:","\"I dare bet that the little boy who left the note is definitely not 180cm tall. As we all know, there are no 169cm or 179cm men in the world. He must have exaggerated his height.\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","The man's fingers tightened inch by inch, turning white.","The note was crumpled into a small ball.","...","On the way to Xiyu Yue Ting.","Sheng Mumu was very puzzled.","Qi Mo seemed quite normal when they first met in the parking lot.","But after getting in the car, he became aloof and didn't want to talk.","When the car stopped at a red light, Qi Mo typed a few words on his phone with a cold face and sent them out.","Sheng Mumu saw it from the corner of her eye. She didn't try to make small talk, guessing that he was worried about company affairs.","She rolled down the car window a little.","The wind at around 4-5 pm in summer was warm, bringing in the fragrance of trees. The oppressive atmosphere in the car was slightly diluted.","At the same time on the other side.","Dong Assistant's phone dinged twice.","It was the special ringtone for when the boss sent a text.","Dong Assistant looked at the short message on the phone and gasped, with eyes wide open.","Could it be?","Someone actually dared to make a move on the boss's wife?","Dong Assistant had been following Qi Mo for many years and knew the boss's personality well.","He looked aloof on the surface but was actually very controlling.","Whenever it was a land project he had his eyes on, he had never failed to secure it. He would not allow anyone else to touch his territory, like a lone wolf.","Dong Assistant shuddered and swallowed, \"......\"","The young people nowadays were really bold.","Dong Assistant's work style was fast, accurate and ruthless.","In less than ten minutes, he had already retrieved the surveillance footage of the parking lot.","After some investigation, he found several young men bragging in a fast food restaurant outside the office building.","He didn't even get close before hearing their voices.","\"Thinking of that little rich housewife's slender waist and fair arms in the parking lot just now makes me hot all over.\"","\"Who's to say no? With such a slender waist, she must be very soft, right?\"","Someone laughed obscenely.","\"Hey, how long do you think it'll take for the little rich housewife to add Handsome's WeChat?\"","\"With Handsome's looks and physique here, I guess not more than three days.\"","\"Too long. I feel like the little rich housewife will contact him late tonight. After all, you know, it's easy to feel lonely at night.\"","The words were followed by more lewd laughter.","Hearing his companions sing his praises, the confidence of A Shuai in the middle grew.","He tossed his bangs pretentiously and said,","\"Once I succeed in getting her, I'll share the experience with you brothers.\"","Dong Assistant's fists clenched as he rolled his shoulders and neck, making cracking sounds from the joints.","Completely unaware of the impending danger, A Shuai went on and on,","\"It's a pity I only saw the little rich housewife's looks just now and didn't hear her voice. I also don't know what she sounds like when she's——\"","He was interrupted by a sudden muffled bang on his cheekbone as a fist came flying out of nowhere.","He bared his teeth in pain and whipped around,","\"Who the fuck hit me!\"","Seeing the sturdy man standing behind him, a good deal taller than himself, he was stunned.","Though afraid inside, he raised his voice to embolden himself, \"Who the fuck are you!\"","Dong Assistant looked down at him condescendingly. Following the boss's order to \"get it done fast\", he didn't waste words. His fists rained down accurately.","The others with him watched dumbfounded, wanting to come forward to help but also afraid of getting involved when they saw the clearly one-sided situation. They hesitated and didn't dare lend a hand.","Who was this suit-clad thug who had suddenly popped up?","Had A Shuai offended some black boss outside?","Dong Assistant stopped and looked down at the man at his feet. He finally deigned to offer an explanation:","\"Those punches just now were to teach you not to covet what you can't attain.\"","\"If you dare harass our CEO's wife again, or disrespect women again, it won't be as simple as taking some superficial injuries.\"","Then he twisted the man's hands behind his back and squeezed hard,","\"Got it?\"","The beaten up man with a bruised and swollen face cried out in pain.","With his hands pinned back, unable to see the man behind him, he still felt as if the man would pull out a gun any moment and shoot him dead. He pleaded again and again.","\"I'm wrong, I'm wrong, bro, I won't dare anymore.\"","Dong Assistant impatiently let go and brushed the dust off his hands.","His eyes swept over the few stunned young men:","\"Wanting easy gains at such a young age, really fucking disgraceful.\"","The ones his gaze fell on retreated involuntarily in unison, nodding obediently.","\"We won't dare anymore, bro.\"","\"Sorry, bro.\"","..."]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: He Dare Not","paragraphs":["Watching the suited thugs drive away in luxury cars, a few people gingerly went over to help their companion up.","One person still shaken, patted his chest:","\"A-Shuai, who on earth did you offend? That guy was so vicious.\"","\"Idiot, haven't you figured it out yet? The woman we saw at the parking lot today is the boss's woman!\"","One of them looked towards the direction the luxury car had left, and exclaimed in belated realization:","\"Damn...I think I've seen that car drive out from the Qi Corporation headquarters.\"","\"Qi Corporation? You mean that Qi Corporation?\"","\"Oh my god, the woman at the parking lot was Mrs. Qi, the president's wife?\"","\"Too scary, too scary.\"","...","Inside the white Porsche, the phone rang.","Qi Mo answered the call and brought the receiver to his ear.","\"President Qi, as you instructed, I've had a good chat with that kid. He promised not to do this kind of thing again.\"","Qi Mo said lightly: \"Mm.\"","Seeing Qi Mo hang up, Sheng Mumu glanced at him.","She didn't know if it was her imagination, but the cold and overbearing aura around the man seemed to have softened somewhat.","His eyebrows were lightly knitted, the sharp angle of his jaw was right before her eyes. Sheng Mumu couldn't help but narrow her eyes, appreciating it up close.","From the side view, his sexy Adam's apple protruded even more prominently.","The shirt buttons were somehow undone by one, faintly revealing his collarbone.","The light and shadows coming in through the window shone onto his deep and brooding eyes, making them look like a tranquil pool of water.","The hand that was holding the steering wheel had long, slender fingers with slightly bent knuckles, beautiful to look at.","Sensing Sheng Mumu looking at him, Qi Mo suddenly turned his head sideways.","\"What are you looking at?\"","Sheng Mumu was not flustered at being caught, and blurted out: \"Looking for something.\"","Qi Mo raised an eyebrow: \"Oh?\"","Sheng Mumu scanned his face seriously: \"Looking for the needle marks from embalming fluid injections on your face.\"","Hearing this, the man chuckled lowly, as if a thought suddenly occurred to him. He looked meaningfully at Sheng Mumu's hesitant eyes and added:","\"I heard from Assistant Dong that you asked him to get stomach medicine for me?\"","Sheng Mumu paused slightly as she recalled this.","\"Yes.\"","At the time, after her phone call with Assistant Dong, in order to keep up the virtuous wife act in front of others, she had casually mentioned it.","Thinking that a stomach condition was standard for a domineering president, she felt it was quite fitting to say that.","The man slowed his tone, raising his eyebrows: \"How come I don't know that I have a stomach condition?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","In her heart she thought: Whether you actually have it or not doesn't matter, as long as I can keep up the act.","But what came out of her mouth was: \"You work so hard every day, your meals must be irregular. Better safe than sorry.\"","Her years of experience climbing the career ladder in her previous life told her that a bit of sweet talk goes a long way in maintaining good relationships between superiors and subordinates.","The man seemed quite pleased. She saw the corners of his lips curl up imperceptibly.","Then his deep and brooding eyes like a secluded pool lingered on her face for a few seconds, and his voice gently said:","\"The group's newly built holiday resort in Shen City is ready, are you interested in going to take a look?\"","As soon as Sheng Mumu heard this, her eyes lit up brightly:","\"Holiday resort? A five-star one?\"","Qi Mo: \"Not five-star.\"","Sheng Mumu was just about to say \"That's fine too\", when she heard Qi Mo's casual voice.","\"Six stars.\"","Sheng Mumu: ...","The traffic light in front turned red, and he fully turned his head to look at Sheng Mumu's hesitant eyes, and added:","\"A staff welfare benefit from the group.\"","Sheng Mumu tilted her head: \"As the boss, you also get staff benefits?\"","Qi Mo: \"Of course.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and nodded: \"Let's go then. Since it's a benefit, it would be a waste not to go. We can bring Little Qi along too, this is his last summer break before senior year of high school.\"","A soft spot in Qi Mo's heart was stirred by a trace of ineffable emotion. He nodded lightly:","\"Alright, you can go let him know.\"","Sheng Mumu gave an OK gesture:","\"Got it.\"","For the rest of the drive back, Sheng Mumu didn't look at her phone again. She asked Qi Mo what attractions and activities were available at the holiday resort.","Only after getting back to the villa did she see that Su Tingran had sent her several messages.","\"Su Tingran: Hahahaha, are young people these days all so outrageous?\"","\"Su Tingran: Both illiterate and shameless, I really worry for the young girls these days.\"","\"Su Tingran: Your President Qi must have been furious knowing you were given a slip of paper with a pick-up line by a guy in his twenties right? Can't imagine what he looks like when jealous.\"","\"Su Tingran: He definitely can't take it.\"","Seeing the screen, Sheng Mumu's lips curled up. She replied: \"He didn't dare.\"","\"Su Tingran: ...\"","...","*","7:30 in the morning.","The person sleeping soundly felt the bedsheets by her feet being pulled up by someone.","The curtain blocked out the morning light, and dim lighting coming in from the walk-in closet direction faintly illuminated the spacious master bedroom, outlining the silhouettes of a man and a woman.","Oblivious, the person on the bed let out a murmur as her long lashes fluttered lightly with each breath, then turned over.","The man standing at the foot of the bed had a trace of helplessness appear in his deep, brooding eyes. He slowly buttoned up the expensive watch on his wrist.","At some point, Qi Mo had gotten used to pulling up the bedsheets that Sheng Mumu would surely have kicked off the bed every morning when he got up.","He soundlessly shut the door and went to work after washing up and getting ready.","Sheng Mumu also didn't sleep for much longer, getting up around an hour after the man had left.","She went to Yuji Flower Shop to handle the day's work.","Just after arriving in this world, she was content to eat, sleep and play every day.","But over time, she started to feel a sense of emptiness instead.","The flower shop's business was getting better and better, and her sense of living in this realistic world grew stronger.","Arriving at Yuji Flower Shop, the four employees had already orderly begun work.","The delivery service for flowers was handed over to a courier company, so the shop assistants were quite free, tending to the flowers and plants and merchandise in the store.","Based on past experience, it would only be in the afternoon that customers who had heard of their fame online would come to the store.","Sheng Mumu took advantage of the free morning to personally bake some cranberry cookies in the small kitchen at the back. She instructed the staff to give them to customers who came in for afternoon tea in the store.","Leaving the flower shop in the evening, she happened to run into Qi Shaobai who was about to head out.","Sheng Mumu called out to him.","\"Little Qi.\"","The reticent boy turned around, raising his eyebrows to indicate a questioning \"Hmm?\"","\"Your dad's company just completed building a new holiday resort. Let's go spend a few days there as a family to relax before your last summer break in high school.\"","Qi Shaobai was taken aback for a moment.","In his memory, his father had always been very busy with work and had never gone on vacation trips with him before.","Sheng Mumu: \"What do you think? Want to go?\"","Qi Shaobai collected himself, and lazily drawled:","\"What's fun about a holiday resort.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Oh, if you're not interested then forget it.\"","She hadn't expected this young master to be very enthusiastic about a holiday resort anyway. Not one to force others, she was about to turn away when she heard Qi Shaobai's clear yet indifferent voice again:","\"When do we leave?\""]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Dad, do you watch cartoons","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu found that ever since Qi Shaobai learned they were going on a vacation, he had been going out less and less, and had spent nearly every day at home recently.","One afternoon, she noticed Qi Shaobai lazily basking in the sun on the balcony, and on a whim asked him, \"Little Qi, do you want to watch cartoons?\"","A new theatrical release of a hot-blooded basketball anime was coming out soon, and Sheng Mumu wanted to review the previous episodes before it premiered.","Since Qi Shaobai usually loved playing basketball, she extended a friendly invitation.","Qi Shaobai lazily raised his eyebrows, with his usual aloof expression, and spoke disdainfully, \"Do I look like someone who watches cartoons? Do you think I'm in elementary school?\"","Without thinking, Sheng Mumu said, \"Yes, you're free anyway, come watch with me.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Six hours later.","In the home theater.","\"Damn, how could he pass to the wrong person on that last shot? That makes no sense!\"","Qi Shaobai watched the main character on screen crying bitterly, and was still lamenting:","\"What a shame, just two points away. If it were me, I'd commit seppuku to apologize.\"","Sheng Mumu, chewing on some potato chips, spoiled, \"The main character feels really guilty about it too, he's about to shave his head soon.\"","\"Don't tell me!\" Qi Shaobai dramatically covered his ears. \"No spoilers.\"","Sheng Mumu was surprised. \"No way, is this your first time watching this anime?\"","Qi Shaobai neither confirmed nor denied, glancing at Sheng Mumu out of the corner of his eye, before looking back at the screen again and changing the subject:","\"Play the next episode.\"","Seeing the hidden disappointment in the boy's eyes instantly made Sheng Mumu understand something.","The novel mentioned that Qi Shaobai had lived with his great-grandmother since childhood, only moving in with his father when he was in 5th grade.","He thought that when he finally left his great-grandmother's place, he would be able to receive his parents' love and care like other children.","But it was not what he wished for. On the very day he moved in with his father, he learned that his mother had passed away years ago.","After that, his personality gradually became gloomy and independent.","The things that other children loved to play with and watch didn't interest him at all, and he lived like a little adult.","A large part of Qi Shaobai's childhood was probably missing.","Thinking of this, Sheng Mumu's heart softened, and she comforted him imperceptibly in a joking way:","\"Little Qi, I'm so envious that you get to watch this anime with fresh eyes. Lend me your eyeballs, let me dig them out!\"","Qi Shaobai turned his head and looked at her as if she were crazy. \"Huh?\"","Sheng Mumu acted oblivious and continued,","\"Never mind, your eyes aren't as big as mine, not worth it.\"","\"After we finish this series, I'll recommend you another anime about ninjas, it's also super good.\"","\"I'm craving a popsicle now, go grab me one from the fridge.\"","Seeing her matter-of-fact attitude, Qi Shaobai raised his eyebrows, \"Why don't you go get it yourself?\"","Sheng Mumu cleared her throat dramatically, \"Ahem...I'm about to start spoiling things again. The main character, he—\"","Qi Shaobai bounced up from the sofa, \"I'm going, shut up!\"","Sheng Mumu smiled smugly, having gotten her way, and ordered, \"Peach flavor, and bring some beef jerky too.\"","The boy obediently went to the kitchen.","Just as he was holding two popsicles in one hand and beef jerky in the other, passing through the foyer, steady footsteps sounded from the front door.","The man of the house, his father, had returned.","Qi Shaobai's footsteps faltered as he slowly turned his head and met his father's somewhat curious gaze.","\"Dad.\"","Qi Mo's eyes lowered, falling on the snacks in Qi Shaobai's hands that were clearly more than a single portion, and his brow twitched.","Not knowing how to explain how he had become his stepmother's errand boy, Qi Shaobai said somewhat awkwardly, \"I'm watching cartoons with her, just getting some snacks.\"","Qi Mo: \"Mm.\"","Qi Shaobai felt this didn't sound like something he would say, and awkwardly added after a pause, \"...Dad, do you want to watch too?\"","Qi Mo: \"...\"","The two men looked at each other in brief silence.","One was internally processing the fact that his grown-up son actually watched cartoons.","The other regretted asking such a foolish question.","After a few seconds, the corners of Qi Mo's mouth softened slightly as he walked towards the stairs and said lightly,","\"You kids watch, I won't join, I still have work to do.\"","\"Okay.\"","Qi Shaobai was not surprised at all, and was secretly relieved instead.","It would be freaky if his dad had actually accepted the invitation.","He quickened his pace and escaped into the home theater, as if having dodged a bullet.","The man who had just said he had work to do did not go to his study. Instead, he went to the rooftop balcony on the third floor.","Tonight was calm and windless, the night sky pitch black and full of stars.","The handsome man looked up at the sky, as if reminiscing.","He murmured softly,","\"If you could see him now, you'd be very happy.\"","...","*","When Sheng Mumu received a call from Sister Chen at the headhunting firm, she had just left Yueji Flower Shop.","\"Ms. Sheng, we've found a candidate that meets your requirements.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"That was fast, is it a man or woman?\"","\"A man.\"","Sheng Mumu couldn't believe her ears: \"...\"","A man?","With her high requirements, they managed to find someone?","Sister Chen eagerly touted him over the phone:","\"The candidate's name is Cheng Zhuo, 27 years old this year. He studied abroad for 4 years and just returned to the country recently. During his postgrad studies he was a management trainee at a well-known company and handled quite a few projects, very experienced despite his young age.\"","Sheng Mumu clicked open the resume Sister Chen had sent over.","The energetic, crisp look of the handsome photo on the resume caught her attention.","He looked fresh and vibrant, with bright eyes full of drive, matching well with his name.","Sister Chen: \"The interview time is set for 9am the day after tomorrow, is that convenient for you Ms. Sheng?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Yes, thanks for arranging it.\"","Sister Chen: \"My pleasure.\"","That Monday, Sheng Mumu met with Cheng Zhuo who had come for the interview as scheduled.","He was even more outstanding than she had imagined - tall and good-looking, refined speech and manners.","As usual, Sheng Mumu introduced the current state of the flower shop and asked him a few questions.","After gaining a basic understanding of him, she smiled and asked the question she was wondering about:","\"With your experience and credentials, why are you willing to come work with us?\"","It seemed Cheng Zhuo had anticipated this question. He smiled and said:","\"Because I see potential in your company, and I'm very satisfied with the salary you offered.\"","He had seen the promotional webpage Sister Chen sent him for Yueji Flower Shop. He was very optimistic about the flower delivery service, and also very interested in the plans to build the brand.","He paused, then continued:","\"From my understanding, there are no high-end flower delivery services tailored for elites in China yet. Your company has huge potential for future growth. I think this is a great platform, a good opportunity for me.\"","Apart from that, there was another reason that made him unable to refuse this position.","Cheng Zhuo thought to himself, not voicing the second half of his words.","Sheng Mumu nodded, seeming very satisfied with his answer.","\"This position is a general management role, equivalent to being groomed for store manager. Once you become familiar with the work, I'll hand over the daily operations of this store entirely to you. I'll be responsible for developing other business areas. There will be a lot of trivial matters initially as we're just starting out. Does a 1-month probation work for you?\"","\"No problem. I can start working tomorrow.\" Cheng Zhuo's tone was firm.","Sheng Mumu stood up and smiled, extending her hand. \"Welcome aboard.\"","Cheng Zhuo shook her hand. \"It's my honor.\""]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: The man is handsome and powerful.","paragraphs":["A handsome guy came to the flower shop, and not only did the two female employees show more enthusiasm than usual, but the number of customers in the store also visibly increased.","The rich housewives of Yuetting at Xiyu usually have a lot of free time.","Upon hearing that a handsome store manager had arrived at the flower shop near their homes, they made appointments to come to Yueji Flower House for afternoon tea whenever they had the chance.","Cheng Zhuo quickly got the hang of his work and within just three days, he not only sorted out any potential loopholes in the flower delivery process and handed a document to Sheng Mumu, but also suggested keeping records of the favorite bouquets, pastries, colors, and scents of the regular customers who often visited the shop, for future customized birthday gifts for the members.","After observing for a few days, Sheng Mumu was also very satisfied with Cheng Zhuo's character.","Thus, she entrusted the management of the store to him with confidence and took a day off for herself, finally enjoying a lazy sleep.","Sheng Mumu left when the sun was not so scorching in the afternoon.","She planned to buy some equipment for her upcoming skiing vacation.","\"You can drive the car back; I'll take a taxi home later.\"","Sheng Mumu got out of the car and bent down to say to the driver inside.","It had been a long time since she went shopping, and she didn't know how long she would indulge in the shopping spree, so she didn't want to keep the driver waiting in the car all the time and let him go back first.","Jing City is bustling with tall buildings, but this shopping mall is somewhat different from the others, with not many people coming and going.","She just told the driver that she wanted to go shopping and buy things, so naturally, he took her to the mall where luxury stores gathered.","The interior decoration was luxurious and grand, and the air conditioning was turned up to the maximum, as if electricity was free.","Sheng Mumu stood in front of a counter selling sunglasses and subconsciously shrunk her neck.","On one hand, it was to keep warm.","On the other hand, she didn't want the shop assistant to see her slightly open mouth in surprise.","Are these sunglasses studded with diamonds?","Why do they cost six figures?","Her hand involuntarily reached for her handbag, secretly feeling grateful.","Fortunately, she brought the supplementary card given by Qi Mo.","The prices in this mall are so high that it would be painful if she had to pay with her own money.","Thinking of this, her bright eyes turned around.","She took out her phone and sent a message to Qi Mo: \"I plan to buy some skiing equipment. What size do you usually wear for clothes?\"","Since she was planning to spend her sugar daddy's money, naturally she had to understand the principle of being grateful in order to spend it with a clear conscience.","When Qi Mo received Sheng Mumu's message, he was in a meeting.","Sitting in the middle of the conference room, his expression was indifferent.","Seeing the phone light up, he lowered his gaze and picked up the phone with his slender hand.","In the next second, the department heads sitting around the conference table seemed to notice that the cold and dignified CEO's eyes seemed to lift slightly, and then they saw him give a faint glance to his assistant.","His special assistant immediately understood and announced, \"The meeting is suspended. We will resume in ten minutes.\"","After everyone dispersed, Qi Mo leaned back in his leather chair and lightly frowned as he replied:","\"No need to make a special trip. When you arrive at the resort, someone will take care of it.\"","Sheng Mumu typed quickly and soon three messages were sent back:","\"I've already arrived at the mall.\"","\"Qi Boss, you don't understand. Doing the preparatory work before going on a trip is also part of enjoying the trip.\"","\"By the way, prepare a set for Qi Shaobai too, so that he doesn't feel left out. Do you know his size?\"","The man lowered his gaze, his long lashes concealing his gaze, his fingertip hovering above the screen without pressing it, lost in thought.","On the other side, Sheng Mumu rested her chin on her hands, sitting on a tall stool in the shopping mall's resting area, her fair legs swinging back and forth.","After a while, she finally received Qi Mo's message with his measurements.","Following that message was another one: \"Which shopping mall are you in?\"","She looked up at the mall's sign, tapping on her phone, and suddenly a bright idea flashed in her mind.","Sheng Mumu: \"Henglong Plaza, General Qi, may I timidly ask if this mall happens to be one of your businesses?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Could it be that a group of people will suddenly come out and say to me, 'Madam, please choose freely. Qi Young Master will foot the bill tonight'?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"If that's the case, please let me know in advance. I'm afraid I'll be too surprised and embarrass you.\"","Ever since the incident with the jewelry case where she was told to wear anything worth twenty million casually, she had become bolder in speculating about this man's wealth.","If Qi Mo replied to her, saying, \"I happen to own this mall,\" she wouldn't be surprised at all.","Qi Mo looked at his phone, a satisfied arc forming at the corner of his lips, and replied with a low chuckle: \"You have quite the imagination. I was just asking casually.\"","Not hearing the expected lines from the overbearing CEO, Sheng Mumu pursed her lips.","After a brief warm-up with some opening lines, she finally cautiously entered the main topic, dividing her sentence into three parts:","Sheng Mumu: \"Um... You also know... the flower shop recently hired a new store manager. He's good-looking and capable, and I'm paying him a high salary.\"","The other side: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"During the store's development phase, it's better to keep some working capital.\"","The other side: \"Hmm.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"So... can I use your card for shopping today?\"","The other side: \"Once I give it to you, it's yours to use however you want.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes suddenly lit up.","Finally, the line from the overbearing CEO had arrived, albeit late!","She replied to Qi Mo with three emoticons, smilingly:","\"Thank you, Boss.jpg\", \"Boss, you're generous.jpg\", \"Let me massage your legs, Boss.jpg\"","Qi Mo's gaze lingered on the screen, his eyes filled with deep thoughts.","He was still thinking about what she had just said.","Good-looking and capable?","...","Two hours later.","After buying a down jacket, Sheng Mumu went to the sports apparel floor and picked three sets of skiing equipment and some small items.","Loaded with bags, she descended to the ground floor.","As the mall's revolving door turned, a gust of cold wind blew in.","Sheng Mumu reached the entrance and realized that it was pouring rain outside.","The weather in midsummer—bright and sunny one second, stormy the next.","She stood at the door, feeling worried when she heard the sound of her phone receiving a message.","Qi Mo: \"It's raining outside. Tell the driver to go slower when you go home.\"","Sheng Mumu hung the bags on her forearm and took out her hand to reply:","\"I asked the driver to go back earlier, so now I'm forced to wait at the door. It seems like the heavens think I've spent too much of your money today, so they're giving me a wake-up call with rain [crying and laughing emoji].\"","After replying to the message, before she had a chance to open the ride-hailing app, she suddenly heard a familiar voice.","\"Sister Sheng.\"","There was only one person who called her that: Cheng Zhuo.","Sheng Mumu looked through the rain and saw Cheng Zhuo's car parked on the other side of the road, about a dozen meters away.","The window was rolled down a bit, and Cheng Zhuo shouted through the pouring rain:","\"Sister Sheng, are you waiting for a driver? The traffic is terrible now. Where are you going? I can give you a ride.\"","Sheng Mumu looked up at the gloomy sky.","Judging by the situation, the rain would not stop anytime soon, and the road conditions would surely become more complicated.","Without being polite to the enthusiastic new employee, she smiled helplessly and shouted back:","\"Thank you for the trouble. I'm going to Xiyu Yueting.\"","Cheng Zhuo found the only umbrella in the car and ran over.","Seeing the shopping bag in her hand, he reached out to take it:","\"Let me put your things in the car first, so they won't get wet.\"","He took the bag and hurried towards the car.","Just then, Sheng Mumu's phone rang.","It was a call from Qi Mo.","His deep voice carried a sense of stability, but she could tell that he was speaking faster than usual.","\"There's heavy traffic during rush hour. You don't have to wait for the driver at home. I'll come and pick you up. Find a café in the mall to rest for a while, I'll be there soon.\"","Sheng Mumu felt relieved and said, \"No need. I'm lucky. I ran into a new employee who gave me a ride.\"","Qi Mo's large hand holding the phone paused for a moment before he could respond. Then, a young man's passionate and clear voice came through the earpiece.","\"Sister Sheng, I've put the things away. Let's go. We only have one umbrella, so please bear with it.\""]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: The first time I called her \"Muck\"","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu nodded at Cheng Zhuo.","\"I'll hang up first and see you when I get home,\" she said to the person on the phone before hanging up.","Qi Group Headquarters.","The handsome man walking to the elevator with car keys in hand silently tightened his gaze.","A feeling he had never experienced before stealthily wrapped around his heart, wrinkling his brow.","Like a sudden summer storm, he felt stifled.","In the car.","Sheng Mumu sat in the back seat with shopping bags.","She used a tissue to wipe the wet corners of her clothes, and thanked the man in the front seat:","\"Cheng Zhuo, thank you, you've helped me a lot.\"","The man in the front didn't look back, but his voice sounded cheerful.","\"It's nothing, no trouble, it was close by.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"It's after work now, I'll pay you overtime for wasting your personal time.\"","Cheng Zhuo tilted his head to the side and quickly declined: \"No need! Sister Sheng, you're too polite, I was just going to be home alone after work anyway, it didn't delay anything.\"","Sheng Mumu insisted: \"No, then I would be exploiting my employee like a capitalist, I must pay overtime, listen to me on this.\"","Seeing he couldn't refuse, Cheng Zhuo reluctantly compromised: \"Okay.\"","The car slowly drove towards Xiyu Yue Ting in the pouring rain.","Due to rush hour traffic, the car was moving slower than Sheng Mumu expected.","It took nearly half an hour before they reached the villa entrance.","She bid Cheng Zhuo farewell and jogged to the villa.","While changing shoes, she caught sight of a pair of exquisite handmade Italian leather shoes.","They were Qi Mo's shoes.","He's back?","The route from Qi Group to Xiyu Yue Ting was clearly farther than from the mall.","How did he get home before her?","Just as she was pondering this, the ground before her was gradually shadowed.","Looking up, she saw Qi Mo standing in front of her.","The tall, upright man enveloped her entirely in his shadow.","His gaze slowly descended, glancing at the red marks on her fair, delicate hands left by the shopping bag handles. His brow subtly wrinkled.","Sheng Mumu blinked her bright eyes: \"You're back? How...\"","Before she could finish speaking, the bags in her hands were suddenly taken by the man.","Then a low voice followed: \"I'll take them.\"","Sheng Mumu's arms naturally reached forward. \"Okay.\"","Unintentionally touching the man's palm, her fingertips trembled lightly.","Why is it so cold?","Like ice.","She slowly raised her eyes.","The man's face was expressionless, his brows and eyes seemed to be wrapped in chillness, and a powerful aura overwhelmed her.","She really couldn't reconcile this cold, aloof face with the considerate \"I'll take them\" he had just uttered.","\"Have some hot tea.\"","Qi Mo put the shopping bags on the living room table and handed her a cup of hot tea.","Through the thin wisps of steam rising from the tea, Sheng Mumu only then noticed the man's sharp, overwhelming aura had faded somewhat. She said,","\"You're home early today.\"","Usually at this time he would still be at the company. Today he had exceptionally appeared at home.","Qi Mo looked at her deeply and said slowly, \"Mm, I was already in the parking garage when I called you.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't think much of it. \"That explains it.\"","After drinking the tea, she felt warmer. Getting up, she said, \"I'll go upstairs to take a bath.\"","Qi Mo: \"Okay.\"","She headed upstairs.","Just after climbing a few steps, she suddenly recalled something and turned back.","She discovered Qi Mo's gaze was aimed toward her back.","Seeing her look over, Qi Mo didn't shift his stare, looking directly at her: \"What's wrong?\"","Somewhat uneasy under his deep, scorching eyes, Sheng Mumu paused briefly before pointing with her eyes to the shopping bags on the table.","\"Try on the clothes to see if they fit, I didn't buy them in the size you said. I noticed your muscles are tight and your figure is good, half a size smaller should fit better. See if they fit.\"","The clothes sold to mature men were mostly looser to accommodate middle-aged spread.","Sheng Mumu had noticed Qi Mo's clothes were almost all custom-made to fit his build. Clearly the standard sizes would be too big.","The complimented man's eyes shifted subtly, his hard jaw gradually softening as he gently said,","\"Okay, I'll try them later.\"","\"Okay, I'm going upstairs now.\"","Just as Sheng Mumu was about to turn back to the bedroom, she was suddenly called by Qi Mo again.","\"Mumu.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Her eyes blinked uncertainly.","This was the first time he had called her \"Mumu.\"","It felt a little strange.","However...","Hearing him enunciate it in that magnetic, enchanting voice gave her an indescribable feeling of comfort.","Sheng Mumu: \"Hmm?\"","Qi Mo: \"In the future if a situation like today happens again, you can call me instead of troubling someone else.\"","\"No way.\"","Sheng Mumu responded immediately without thinking.","Hearing this, the man paused microscopically, a fleeting anomalous gleam appearing in his eyes.","Low and gloomy.","The next second, Sheng Mumu's eyes curved slightly.","Her bright eyes reflected the living room chandelier's glittering light, two dimples shallowly sinking as she jokingly said,","\"If I trouble someone else I can pay them overtime, but trouble you? Forget it--\"","She exaggeratedly shook her head, \"Your time is worth millions per minute, how could I afford it.\"","Qi Mo was stunned, the corners of his eyes slowly curling up.","\"I'm going upstairs now.\" Sheng Mumu briskly ran upstairs, eager to soak in a hot bath and wash away the day's fatigue from shopping.","That night, Young Master Qi tried on the clothes Sheng Mumu had bought.","They fit very well.","However, the colors were somewhat unexpected.","Young Master Qi ultimately still knocked on the master bedroom door.","Sheng Mumu opened the door with an Iron Man face mask that had a metallic texture on.","As soon as the door opened, Young Master Qi recoiled a step, \"Whoa...\"","Sheng Mumu raised her brow: \"What?\"","Young Master Qi wanted to speak but hesitated: \"Uh...I really have to wear that ski suit?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Doesn't fit? We can exchange it if it's the wrong size.\"","Young Master Qi was utterly hopeless, \"But it's pink.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't understand: \"Pink looks so nice, gentle sunshine.\"","Most suitable for softening the prickliness of a petulant teenage boy.","Young Master Qi: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu patted his shoulder reassuringly: \"Your dad's is bright red, so nice, matching father-son outfits.\"","Young Master Qi's eyes widened incredulously: \"............\"","His dad was bri...bright red???","Young Master Qi was still stunned by the shock when he heard Sheng Mumu continue:","\"You're only seventeen, don't dress like an old man all the time, nothing but black, white, and gray, it's inauspicious.\"","Having said that, Sheng Mumu abruptly shut the door.","Young Master Qi: \"......\"","After a long pause, he reluctantly accepted the facts.","Alright, if his dad could wear bright red, what was so strange about him wearing pink?","After all it was just a ski suit, not a school uniform.","In the room.","The man sitting against the headboard reading a financial magazine heard the conversation at the door, his fingers microscopically stiffening.","Black, white, gray...old man..."]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Why not take the family Jet","paragraphs":["Three days later, the Qi family of three boarded a plane bound for Shen City.","\"Why not take the family private jet?\"","Sitting in the back row of first class, Qi Shaobai suddenly asked while looking at his dad and stepmom in the front row.","The private jet was not as crowded as a commercial plane, so the three of them didn't have to sit in rows.","\"Becau—\" Qi Mo turned his head and had just uttered a syllable when Sheng Mumu, who really couldn't hold back her sarcasm, cut him off.","\"There are first class seats and you're still complaining? You're impossible.\"","Sheng Mumu glared at him.","Qi Shaobai was taken aback at first.","Then he slowly turned his head to look out the window and quietly stopped talking.","Hearing the two people's conversation, Qi Mo imperceptibly curved his lips and slowly closed his eyelids, leaning back to rest.","...","Shen City Airport.","\"Are you sure Mr. Qi is coming today?\"","Qu Hui had her hands clasped together as she kept looking in the direction of the arrival gate and asked her assistant behind her.","\"Yes, Ms. Qu. I've triple checked. Mr. Qi is indeed arriving today.\" The assistant looked at the time. \"According to the information, the plane should land in less than ten minutes.\"","Qu Hui impatiently hmm'd and lifted her sunglasses to walk towards the seats in the arrivals hall.","Seeing her sit down, the assistant finally breathed a sigh of relief and subtly patted his chest.","Phew—","It was difficult to get information on Mr. Qi's flight time. If there were any changes to his schedule, Ms. Qu would definitely blame him. I hope there are no changes.","Come to think of it, it is strange.","Ms. Qu is thirty-two this year. She has looks and figure. There are many prestigious families in Shen City who want to marry her, not just a few.","But over the years, Ms. Qu's heart has been set on that man living far away in Jing City.","Back then, Ms. Qu's feelings were understandable. After all, Mr. Qi is a rare talented and handsome young man. His looks and temperament are extraordinary.","But now...","The man is married, yet Ms. Qu still...","Qu Hui stared at the people coming out from the arrival gate, hoping to see the man who had captivated her heart for many years, her gaze becoming more and more obstinate.","A few years ago, she accompanied her father to a banquet and met Qi Mo for the first time. It was love at first sight.","She begged her father to play matchmaker, but her father told her, \"Don't be silly. He has a son. Do you want to be a stepmother?\"","So what if she did?","Rather than marrying a man she didn't like, she was willing to be a stepmother for the man she truly loved.","Unfortunately, no matter how hard she tried to get close to that man, he always kept her at a distance.","In order to be a match for him, she worked hard to learn business and took over her father's industry, silently keeping up with Qi Mo's every news and development.","Just as she finally made the family business one of the best in Shen City and had the confidence to stand before him again to express her feelings, she received shocking news like a bolt from the blue—","He had a flash marriage.","The news said the woman who became Mrs. Qi came from an ordinary family and looked plain.","She was unwilling to accept this. She ordered people around her not to mention anything about Qi Mo's new wife in front of her.","She was waiting for a chance, a chance to stand before him in person.","She believed that as long as Qi Mo saw her now, he would understand that only she was fit to be Mrs. Qi.","Thinking of the past, Qu Hui's eyes narrowed.","This time, Qi Mo is personally coming to Shen City to inspect the resort. This is the chance she has been waiting for for a long time!","Suppressing the unwillingness in her heart, the only thing left in Qu Hui's eyes was anticipation.","At this moment, a tall figure appeared before her eyes.","The man was still tall and straight. Wearing a black overcoat, his silent and aloof temperament made him exude a majestic aura of a top dog.","Just like the first time she saw him, handsome beyond compare. His pitch-black eyes were like a deep pool, drawing people to sink deep within.","Qu Hui took off her sunglasses. She could no longer see anyone else. With a smile, she walked over to him.","\"Mr. Qi! I've been waiting for you. Welcome to Shen City!\"","The man turned his head and looked at her with an indifferent gaze, his brows slowly furrowing.","There seemed to be an immeasurable distance in his eyes. He said in a low voice,","\"You are?\"","Qu Hui's smile froze, as if doused from head to toe with a bucket of icy water on a snowy day, unable to move a muscle.","The assistant behind her was also at a loss, looking back and forth between them in surprise.","No way. Mr. Qi doesn't recognize Ms. Qu?","How could this be?","This...is so awkward.","Qu Hui pulled at the corners of her mouth and dug her nails into her palms to barely maintain composure.","\"It's me, Qu Hui. We met many years ago. Don't you remember?\"","The man's eyes were as cold as blades, searching for this name in his mind.","Qu Hui pursed her lips and prompted, \"My father is Qu Tangxin.\"","Qi Mo raised his brow. \"Oh, Tangxin Group's Qu?\"","\"Yes, Qu Hui.\"","\"Nice to meet you.\"","\"I know you're coming to Shen City recently, so I came to the airport specially to pick you up. I booked a room at the Qi Resort. I'm very happy to see you again. Let's catch up over the next few days.\"","...","On the side witnessing everything, Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai exchanged a look.","Sheng Mumu lowered her voice and asked Qi Shaobai, \"Has your dad's memory deteriorated after thirty? Should we ask the butler to prepare some health supplements for him?\"","Qi Shaobai's mouth twitched. \"Do you even hear yourself?\"","It was also when Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai were whispering that Qu Hui noticed the two people beside Qi Mo.","A sense of astonishment arose in her heart as she looked at the woman standing just one fist away from the man. With a stiff smile, she asked,","\"Mr. Qi, who is this?\"","Qi Mo lightly tipped his chin. \"My wife and son.\"","Qu Hui was stunned, disbelief in her eyes.","The woman before her was tall and fair. With a small, exquisite face and a pair of captivating fox-like eyes, she lightly smiled, seeming like a greeting, when Qi Mo introduced them. Her whole being was as enchanting as she was lively and cute.","Qu Hui instantly felt like a joke.","She had thought the rumors that Qi Mo's wife was plain-looking were true, arrogantly not bothering to find out anything about her.","Now, seeing with her own eyes, she couldn't find any words.","Qi Mo lightly tapped his chin, and said in a low voice that kept an unbridgeable distance,","\"There's no need to catch up. This is a private trip. I don't want to see too many people. Ms. Qu, if there's nothing else, we'll be on our way.\"","Though this was said tactfully, Qu Hui heard the impassable distance behind it. Without waiting for her to say anything more, the man had already strode away in his long legs, disappearing in just a few steps.","\"Mr. Qi—\"","She swallowed back her last call.","Clenching her teeth tightly as she watched the man's receding figure and the woman beside him.","The assistant hesitantly walked over. \"Ms. Qu...uh...the room at the resort, do you still want it booked?\"","Qu Hui whipped her head around. \"Idiot! Why didn't you tell me Mr. Qi was coming with his wife?\"","The assistant furrowed his brows aggrievedly. \"You told us not to mention anything about Mr. Qi's wife in front of you.\"","\"You dare talk back? Do you want to quit?\"","The assistant lowered his head regretfully. \"I'm sorry Ms. Qu. I was incompetent.\"","\"Keep the room booked for me! Bring the car around and follow Mr. Qi's car. Find out which room they're staying in.\"","\"Yes, Ms. Qu.\"","Qu Hui felt awful and unwilling inside. Just thinking that Qi Mo didn't recognize her made her want to grind her teeth into powder.","In the black Porsche ahead, Qi Mo and his wife sat in the backseat.","Seeing his silhouette, Qu Hui clenched her fists tightly, her nails digging deep into her palms.","She comforted herself in her heart.","It's nothing. Pursuing someone out of reach would definitely not be easy.","The car in front turned right into the resort's villa area. The car behind gradually slowed down.","Qu Hui was puzzled. \"Why drive so slowly? Hurry and catch up!\"","The driver looked back with an awkward expression. \"Ms. Qu, those are exclusive parking spaces ahead. Other vehicles are prohibited...\""]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: The Fairy Couple and Their Little Bodyguard","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu looked out the window all the way.","\"The scenery of Shen City and Jing City is so different. There is still snow this season.\"","Qi Mo's gaze also fell outside the window: \"Well, you can see snow all year round here. This is also why I chose to build the resort here.\"","\"Right, right.\"","Sheng Mumu was just about to praise Qi Mo for his good eye for investment, when she suddenly heard the cold voice of sarcasm from Qi Shaobai:","\"You look like a Southerner who has never seen snow.\"","Sheng Mumu glanced at him and was too lazy to respond.","After the car entered the resort and drove for a long time, passing the ordinary guest room area, it stopped in front of a villa.","This villa was obviously larger than the nearby standalone villas, but still not as spacious as the villas in Xiyu Yue Ting.","But it had a nice open view. You could see the snow-capped mountains in the distance, and the scenery was pleasant.","The air was filled with the fresh scent of snow wrapped around grass and trees, lingering around the nose, and it smelled very good.","The managers of the various departments of the resort knew Qi Mo was coming and were already waiting outside the villa. When they got off, the managers respectfully greeted:","\"Mr. Qi.\"","\"Madam.\"","Qi Mo nodded slightly in response.","Sheng Mumu smiled brightly and greeted, \"Hello everyone.\"","Qi Shaobai looked left and right.","What about me?","Don't I deserve a name?","As if she could read his mind, Sheng Mumu poked his arm with her elbow and whispered:","\"You're just a little brat brought along by your parents for vacation.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","When Qi Mo turned his head, he saw Sheng Mumu with laughter in her eyes and Qi Shaobai at a loss for words.","The sharp line of his jaw lifted in a pleasant arc, and his mood was like the snow-capped peaks in the distance, open and refreshing.","He exchanged a few simple words with his subordinates, then let everyone leave.","The villa was built against the mountain and had two floors. The decor was somewhere between simple and luxurious, appearing solemn without being tacky.","\"It's decorated so nicely. It must cost a lot to stay here for one night, right?\" Sheng Mumu asked while looking around the interior of the villa.","As Qi Mo took off his black coat and hung it on the hanger, he said lightly: \"This villa is not open to tourists.\"","Sheng Mumu stared wide-eyed and looked around warily: \"Why? Was the new decoration not fully rid of formaldehyde?\"","Qi Mo smiled. His hand that was loosening his tie stopped, and he looked at her meaningfully, as if thinking her imagination was too wild.","Qi Shaobai, remembering that he had just been speechless under Sheng Mumu's retort, cheekily interrupted:","\"You're so dumb. This villa is specially reserved for us to stay when we come on vacation. Understand?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","She was only surprised for a second before quickly regaining her \"worldly\" composure. She waved her fist at the cheeky boy and said:","\"Dare to laugh at me? And 'Understand?' How about I give your melon head a 'round of applause'?\"","Qi Shaobai laughed and dodged, \"I'll go check out my room first.\"","After speaking, he very consciously walked towards the secondary bedroom.","Qi Mo pushed the suitcase into the master bedroom, and Sheng Mumu followed him in.","The closed curtains automatically opened when they entered.","The snowy scenery outside the large floor-to-ceiling windows came into view.","But Sheng Mumu had no mind to appreciate the scenery at all. Her eyes were fixed on the open-concept large bathtub in the room without moving.","Sheng Mumu: ......","As if seeing what she was looking at, Qi Mo's Adam's apple rolled lightly. He said in a low voice:","\"You can use this bathtub. I'll go to another room to wash up at night.\"","Sheng Mumu's ears turned red. \"Okay.\"","Their trip to the ski resort was scheduled for tomorrow. Sheng Mumu quickly tidied up a bit and lay on the bed flipping through the Shen City travel guide on a certain red app.","Seeing a place she wanted to visit, she flipped over and murmured: \"Just missing a photography sidekick.\"","After a while, she went to the living room.","She saw Qi Mo sitting comfortably on the sofa, legs slightly apart, reading a business magazine.","Qi Shaobai was curled up on a lazy boy sofa five meters away, earphones plugged in, watching anime.","Sheng Mumu: ......","What's with these father and son?","Do they have some misunderstanding about \"vacation\"?","She walked behind Qi Shaobai and tapped the back of his head.","Qi Shaobai raised his eyebrows and turned his head: \"?\"","The man with the cold and elegant expression also slowly glanced over.","Sheng Mumu crossed her arms and posed as an adult: \"Leave the cartoons until we get back to Jing City. Going out to play but still being such a homebody, like an old man. Come on, adults will take you out for some photosynthesis.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Where to?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Ice and Snow World. It has a super long icy slide, a snowflake Ferris wheel and ice bikes. Sounds fun, doesn't it?\"","\"No fun. Only little kids play on slides,\" Qi Shaobai lazily stretched and slowly stood up. \"But since we're here already, might as well go take a look.\"","Sheng Mumu knew Qi Mo must not be interested in Ice and Snow World, and had only intended to ask him casually if he wanted to go or not.","Unexpectedly, when she looked up, she saw the man had already closed the magazine, taken the coat hanging on the hanger, and stood upright at the door: \"Let's go.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked: \"???\"","...","Ice and Snow World.","At the entrance of the super long icy slide, the line snaked long.","In the middle of the line, three extremely good-looking people attracted particular attention.","A gust of cold wind blew by. Sheng Mumu shrank her neck in and wrapped her scarf tighter.","In the snowscape, her face was glowing white, with two blotches of pink on her cheeks. Her petite pert nose had been blown red by the cold wind, looking pitiful and cute.","In the cold wind, Qi Mo's posture was still tall and upright like a pine tree, his cold and aloof temperament blending seamlessly into the snowy sky.","Beneath his heroic brows, his ink-black eyes were deep and profound, reflecting specks of icy and snowy light. He was like a star hanging in the sky, and also like a clear yet fathomless sea.","In the queue, some craned their necks to get a better look, whispering:","\"Are they celebrities? So pleasing to the eye.\"","\"What an immortal couple, so gorgeous.\"","\"They must be celebrity sweethearts. I want to go over for an autograph and photo.\"","\"Don't, don't. Their sidekick looks fierce and not to be messed with.\"","Qi Shaobai, who was mistaken for a bodyguard, eyed the long line ahead and his expression darkened.","He already had an unruly and aloof look. His eyes were cold and piercing.","Dressed in a full black down jacket today, concealing his slender youthful figure, he looked more sturdy than usual.","With a charcoal gray cold cap on his head and hands in pockets, he looked even more like a young newly-recruited bodyguard.","Twenty minutes later, it was finally their turn to queue.","There were a total of eight slides, all made entirely from ice. Looking down from above, you couldn't see the end.","The staff adjusted the position of the small sled, guiding Sheng Mumu to sit on it.","She glanced left and right, and saw Qi Shaobai was already seated, legs stretched straight and poised, with rare youthful excitement surfacing in his eyes.","On the other side, Qi Mo did not immediately sit on the sled, but stopped in front of the safety instruction sign, brows slightly furrowed.","Shortly after, he crouched down behind Sheng Mumu.","The cold wind carried his magnetic deep voice to her ear:","\"Don't put your hands outside the sled. Be careful.\"","Sheng Mumu slowly turned her head, her gaze colliding with the man's. She paused for a moment: \"...Okay.\"","After speaking, the man stood up and walked towards the slide beside them.","Seeing this, Qi Shaobai's lips pressed into a straight line.","Feeling that his father didn't pay attention to him, his heart inexplicably soured. He looked away and nonchalantly let his gaze fall elsewhere.","\"You too.\"","Suddenly, a low and curt voice rang out.","Passing by Qi Shaobai, Qi Mo casually reminded him.","Qi Shaobai whipped his head around in surprise. After a pause, the thorns in the boy's eyes seemed to melt away. He nodded heavily.","\"Got it!\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: You wait for me right here, don't move, I'll buy you oranges.","paragraphs":["With a clear \"wow~\" cry, Sheng Mumu felt herself flying out.","The cold wind whipped past her face with a roar, and the sudden acceleration made her heart beat faster as the thrill soared.","She couldn't help grinning like a child.","She never let herself bottle things up, whenever she played any thrilling rides, she would scream out loud if she wanted.","She found the fun doubled when she did.","\"Wuhu~\"","\"Hahahaha-\"","\"Ah-\"","Hearing the clear voice occasionally coming from the left slide, Qi Mo's mouth corners slightly lifted, smiling imperceptibly.","He was infected by her cheerful mood, eyes curving.","The three played at the Ice and Snow World until the sun went down.","To be precise, the two Qi's accompanied the eager to play Sheng Mumu until the sun went down.","Sheng Mumu used blackmail of spoiling the plot to force Qi Shaobai to cooperate and take a set of Elsa pose photos for her.","She took a handful of snow and waved her arm to scatter it.","Muttering under her breath: \"let it go\"","Qi Shaobai pressed the brim of his cold hat low, knowing no acquaintances would see this embarrassing scene, hurriedly pressed the shutter.","Click-","Click-","Nearby, a tall and handsome man stood in the snow, eyes flickering as he watched the two.","His chest vibrated slightly, emitting a low laugh.","Suddenly, his coat pocket vibrated with an incoming call.","Qi Mo answered his work phone: \"Hello?\"","On the other end of the phone, Qu Hui's voice was sweet: \"President Qi, it's me, Qu Hui.\"","Qi Mo's brows furrowed slightly, surprised how she got his number. His tone was slightly displeased: \"What's the matter?\"","\"President Qi, I've booked a table tonight at Yuelai Restaurant to welcome you.\"","Qu Hui's hand clutching the phone tightened, stopping the nervousness in her heart.","\"Years ago when my father brought me to a banquet, he kept praising what a talented man you are, and told me that if there was a chance Duangxin Group must cooperate with Qishi Group.\"","\"When I heard Qishi Group was coming to Shen city to build a resort, I was so happy I couldn't stand it. Now I'm fully in charge of Duangxin Group, I wonder if I could have the chance to have a meal with President Qi and discuss possible future cooperation between Duangxin and Qishi.\"","\"It doesn't matter if you don't want to talk business, Yuelai Restaurant is the most famous restaurant in Shen city. I sincerely invite you to come and taste our local flavors.\"","After saying this long speech, Qu Hui laughed and slowed down: \"Also to let me fulfill my host's duties.\"","\"I'm sorry Miss Qu, I'm busy.\"","Qi Mo maintained his business etiquette, suppressing his displeasure, and only spoke to reject after Qu Hui had finished.","Without waiting for her response, he directly hung up and put his phone back in his coat pocket.","Beside him, Qi Shaobai was handing his phone to Sheng Mumu to let her check the photos.","After Sheng Mumu gave a thumbs up, Qi Shaobai let out a relieved sigh, shoulders sinking.","He looked for his dad's figure.","Seeing Qi Mo looking at them, Qi Shaobai called out:","\"Dad, she said she's hungry, I am too. Let's go eat dinner?\"","Qi Mo was a little distracted, silent for a few seconds before nodding and walking towards them.","It was very unexpected.","Qi Shaobai who hadn't been by his side since young, even after living together, was used to eating alone. This was the first time the boy had made such a down-to-earth invitation to him.","...","Yuelai Restaurant.","The crisp sound of shattered plates and bowls came from the private room.","Qu Hui's face was gloomy with anger.","Not only did she not find out which villa Qi Mo was staying at, he wouldn't even come when she invited him to dinner.","Being so far out of reach, how could she get close?","Qu Hui's hand clenched the tablecloth, fiercely biting her lip.","Suddenly, as if struck by inspiration, a gleam appeared in her eyes.","\"Could it be...\"","\"Should I force you to come see me using that matter?\"","Just as she was hesitating, her assistant pushed open the door into the private room.","\"Boss Qu, do you need to order the kitchen to serve dishes?\"","Qu Hui's train of thought was interrupted. Having nowhere to vent her anger, she whipped her head around:","\"He's not even here, what's the point of serving dishes!\"","The assistant was stunned for a moment, conflicted for a while before carefully saying:","\"Boss Qu, people downstairs said they saw President Qi go to a hole-in-the-wall restaurant near the Ice and Snow World.\"","The assistant observed the boss's expression and cautiously asked:","\"What do you think...should we go over too?\"","Qu Hui frowned.","A hole-in-the-wall restaurant?","She had invited him to the city's best restaurant yet he wouldn't come, but was willing to go to the small eateries only common people went to?","\"With who?\"","The assistant looked embarrassed: \"With his wife and son.\"","Hearing this, Qu Hui crumpled the tablecloth even more, practically gritting her teeth: \"I won't go over. I want him to come see me willingly!\"","...","That night, after a satisfying dinner, Sheng Mumu returned to the villa patting her stomach.","\"The restaurant I recommended wasn't bad right, online reviews say it's where the locals go most, affordable and big portions.\"","Qi Mo: \"It was pretty tasty.\"","Qi Shaobai nodded: \"The boss was overly enthusiastic, I even ate two extra bowls compared to usual.\"","Happy that her carefully chosen restaurant was approved, Sheng Mumu suggested: \"Why don't we go for a walk to digest? Just now when we passed the resort hotel, I saw there was a bookstore and souvenir shops.\"","Qi Shaobai also felt too full, and agreed: \"Sounds good to me.\"","Qi Mo: \"You two go ahead, I have a meeting with the management team here tomorrow, so I won't go out.\"","Long used to Qi Mo's workaholic brain, Sheng Mumu made an \"ok\" sign with her hand.","She turned and patted Qi Shaobai on the shoulder:","\"Let's go, us two youngsters go take a look. People over thirty get sleepy after eating.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","How could he tell her he wasn't actually that much older than her...","Sheng Mumu and her head-taller pseudo-son slowly strolled to the resort hotel area.","The pedestrian flow here was obviously much higher than the villa district, the cafes and snack stalls full of people.","This made Sheng Mumu once again marvel at Qi Mo's investment insight in choosing this location. The just newly built resort had already attracted so many tourists.","Sheng Mumu stopped at the souvenir shop entrance. \"Let's go in and take a look.\"","Since they were out, she wanted to get a small gift for Su Tingran.","Qi Shaobai looked over her head at the densely packed tourists inside, frowning: \"So many people, I don't want to go in.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't insist: \"Then just wait here for me, don't wander off, I'll go buy you an orange.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","Why did that sound so weird, like he was being mocked?","Just as he wanted to retort, Sheng Mumu had already ducked into the souvenir shop, vanishing from sight.","He could only generously shrug and find a bench outside the shop to sit on, obediently waiting for her.","Suddenly, an unfamiliar woman's voice came over.","\"Shaobai?\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: On a Very New kind of Snow.","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai turned around in confusion. He saw the woman he had met at the airport walking towards him excitedly.","\"It's really you! I recognized your back right away.\"","A question mark slowly emerged on Qi Shaobai's head: ?","Do we know each other well?","Qu Hui put on the casual smile she had honed in the business world and started to get familiar with him:","\"Shaobai, you look just like your dad when he was young - handsome and eye-catching among the crowd. Auntie recognized you right away.\"","When Qi Shaobai was not smiling, he naturally looked unfriendly. He felt very uncomfortable with the sudden enthusiasm and looked even more annoyed.","Because his dad knew the former president of the Tangxin Group, he could not directly walk away. He reluctantly pulled up the corners of his lips as a response.","Seeing his expression soften, Qu Hui's smile grew even wider. She wrapped her mink coat tighter and sat down on the bench, chatting eagerly:","\"Shaobai, let's exchange WeChat? If you are not familiar with Shen city or don't know where to go, auntie can be your guide.\"","\"I'm an old friend of your dad. I see you as my own son.\"","Qi Shaobai moved a little further away from her to keep some distance.","\"No need. If I want to know these things, my dad's assistant and our butler at home can prepare a list for me anytime. Don't trouble yourself.\"","Qu Hui's smile froze.","She had wanted to get close to Qi Mo through his son, and also prepare for her future marriage into the Qi family and getting along with her stepson. She didn't expect this 17-year-old boy to be a tough nut to crack.","\"Ha ha ha~\" Qu Hui concealed her embarrassment with a smile. \"Auntie grew up in Shen city. I definitely know more than those online travel guides. By the way, where are you guys planning to go play tomorrow?\"","Qi Shaobai had his hands in his pockets, looking nonchalant. \"Don't know.\"","He had seen too many young ladies trying to get close to him with various excuses, wanting to use him to climb up to his rich and powerful dad. He was very familiar with Qu Hui's fake enthusiasm.","He gave the most indifferent and brief replies to end the conversation as soon as possible.","Just as Qu Hui was about to change the topic to continue cracking this tough nut, Sheng Mumu came out of the souvenir shop holding a small shopping bag.","Seeing Qi Shaobai on the bench with someone else sitting next to him, she subconsciously asked:","\"Huh, Qi Shaobai, you also have acquaintances in Shen city?\"","Then she smiled at the \"acquaintance\":","\"Hello.\"","After she spoke, the three of them fell silent for a moment, and the air froze briefly.","Qu Hui's smile became even more stiff. The words on the tip of her tongue stopped. She felt a sense of disrespect.","They had just met at the airport this morning. Why was she pretending not to recognize her?","Amid the awkward atmosphere, Qi Shaobai chuckled lightly to break the silence and looked mockingly at Sheng Mumu.","\"I think you're the one who needs health supplements from Butler Zhang.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","She had to admit she was a little face blind.","Especially someone like Qu Hui wearing a mink coat, she really didn't recognize her for a moment. She had seen at least eight similar wealthy madams just in the souvenir shop earlier.","Qu Hui already had a natural dislike for Sheng Mumu. Now her resentment grew even more.","She really didn't understand why an outstanding man like Qi Mo would be interested in such an airhead.","After Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai left, Qu Hui was still annoyed.","Her belief grew even stronger.","Only she was the one truly worthy of Qi Mo.","Not only because she had taken over the Tangxin Group and could help him take his career to the next level and expand into the Shen city market.","More importantly, she knew his secret, she knew his true self.","*","The next day.","Qi Mo got up early and had a simple meeting with the resort management.","In the afternoon, he went to the ski resort with Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai.","The ski resort was a key attraction of the resort. It was built according to the highest standards from the start. Coming here this time was both for tourism and to inspect whether the facilities met the standards.","The cable car took the three up the slope.","Sheng Mumu came out of the locker room wearing a purple and white ski suit. Seeing the two Qi men who had already changed, her eyes suddenly lit up.","Qi Mo's skin was cold and pale. Against the steady burgundy ski suit, he looked even more handsome and eye-catching, disregarding everyone else.","Sheng Mumu generously praised: \"You look really good in red. My aesthetic sense is spot on.\"","Qi Mo chuckled lightly without replying.","Meanwhile, Qi Shaobai, who had bundled himself up tightly with ski goggles, was not so calm. He still could not accept the fact that his ski suit was pink.","Sheng Mumu tapped her chin, examining the uncomfortable Qi Shaobai. She commented:","\"Although not as handsome as your dad, you also look good. The pink makes you seem gentle.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Gentle?\"","This description sounded like it was for a dog...","Sheng Mumu didn't think there was anything wrong with it. She rubbed her hands excitedly and urged:","\"Let's go, start skiing.\"","Qi Shaobai looked at his dad resentfully. His eyes clearly conveyed \"Are you hearing her say human words?\" But he found his dad wasn't even looking at him. He was holding his ski board in one hand and walking away.","Qi Shaobai paused, then hurried to catch up:","\"Wait for me.\"","Sheng Mumu used to ski a little before, but not much. She only dared to choose gentler slopes to play on.","Qi Shaobai was young and athletic from playing basketball. Although it was his first time skiing, he picked it up quickly. After sliding down the gentle slope twice, he felt it wasn't thrilling enough and started challenging intermediate slopes.","What surprised Sheng Mumu the most was Qi Mo.","On the highest and steepest ski trail, a flash of red rushed down.","Qi Mo leaned to one side on his board, body relaxed, leaning forward slightly, posture casual yet handsome.","The ski board that Sheng Mumu couldn't control no matter what, became extremely obedient under Qi Mo's handling, flexibly changing direction as he adjusted his angle.","After just two runs, he had already attracted many fangirls and fanboys. They stopped skiing and stood by the side to watch.","As the red figure sped by, they couldn't make out who he was. They only felt he looked even better than celebrities on TV.","When they were waiting to see again, they saw him tuck his board under one arm and walk towards the gentle slope.","Sheng Mumu rushed down the not too high slope, snow splashing onto her face. She got a mouthful of wind.","After wiping the snow off her goggles, she saw Qi Mo standing at the side watching her, his eyes smiling.","\"Why did you come here? You have so many fans waiting to see you.\"","Sheng Mumu walked up to him with smiling eyes and teased.","The man's eyes flickered slightly as he smiled. \"Skiing alone is boring.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"But don't people ski alone?\"","Qi Mo: \"Not necessarily.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"?\"","Qi Mo pointed with his eyes not far away and said slowly: \"You can also ski like that.\"","She looked in the direction he indicated.","On the flat snowfield, couples were skiing in pairs.","One person sat on the board while the other held their shoulders and pushed them along.","Or the person sitting held the hand of the person in front and got pulled.","\"Uh...\" Sheng Mumu understood what he meant and slowly turned her head back, embarrassed.","Qi Mo raised his brow. \"Want to try it?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"But...I'm afraid I can't pull you.\"","Qi Mo: \"......\""]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: So warm that he suspected he had a stove on him.","paragraphs":["Qi Mo's long, slender fingers rubbed his brow slightly helplessly. \"Of course you'll sit.\"","Sheng Mumu's bright eyes blinked. \"Really?\"","The man chuckled lowly. \"Mm.\"","\"Let's go!\"","Then...","What Qi Shaobai saw next was a scene he would never have believed if he hadn't seen it with his own eyes—","His aloof father, who was always chauffeured around and had servants bring anything he wanted with a glance, was happily pushing his stepmother's shoulders and sliding down a completely flat snowy slope?","Amidst his shock, he didn't forget to take out his phone and capture this shocking scene.","Sheng Mumu sat with her legs crossed on the sled, smiling radiantly.","She felt it was actually more fun than the small slope from earlier.","After being pushed around playing for a good while, the man behind her still seemed very energetic, as if he wasn't tired at all.","But even though Qi Mo didn't complain of tiredness, Sheng Mumu didn't feel right continuing to play like this.","Firstly, it didn't seem proper for the esteemed President Qi to be used as a sled dog.","Secondly, she overheard a couple next to them using them as a negative example for comparison.","\"Look how much strength her boyfriend has, now look at you.\"","In order not to negatively impact others' relationships, Sheng Mumu called for a stop, \"Let's take a break.\"","The man stopped and looked down at her, \"Was it fun?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled up at him, \"Super fun, should we switch and I'll push you next?\"","Qi Mo's voice was low and magnetic, \"No need.\"","She wanted to stand up and pushed off twice but couldn't seem to use any strength.","After sitting cross-legged for so long, her legs were numb.","Just as she was about to try again, a pair of large, warm hands reached over.","Qi Mo's tall, straight figure cut an imposing silhouette.","From Sheng Mumu's angle looking up, with the light behind him and the crisp blue sky as a backdrop, she couldn't see his expression clearly, but she could feel the air around them suddenly become gentle.","She paused for a moment before placing her hands in his, \"Thank you!\"","At the same time, she mustered her strength and pushed off the ground to stand up.","Right then, a few rowdy little boys came bounding over, and one mischievous child bumped into Qi Mo's leg.","He suddenly lost his balance and lurched forward.","Sheng Mumu was mid-pull and lost the counterforce, her legs went soft and she tipped backwards.","In that instant, the figure carrying the brisk, icy scent of snow enveloped her.","As they were about to collide, Sheng Mumu instinctively closed her eyes.","Suddenly, she felt something soft cushion the back of her head, the clamor around her faded away, and all she could hear was the sound of light panting by her ear.","Qi Mo had thrown out an arm to brace himself and used the other to protect the back of her head, preventing them from knocking into each other.","Sheng Mumu slowly opened her eyes again, meeting that pair of deep, inky eyes gazing at her.","The man's voice was low and magnetic, \"Are you okay?\"","Her heart suddenly clenched.","Her earlobes secretly flushed red.","\"I'm fine.\"","Qi Mo pulled her up and bent down to brush the snow off her knees.","\"Sorry, uncle and auntie,\" the child who had bumped into them said softly from the side.","\"It's okay.\"","\"It's okay.\"","The two spoke in unison.","Their gazes collided in the air.","\"Uncle, you should hold the sister's hand,\" the slightly bigger child in the group looked up at Qi Mo and made a hand-holding gesture, \"That's how my dad holds my mom's hand so they don't slip and fall in the snow.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Uncle? Sister?","This kid needed to spend more time on one of those vibrating kiddie rides outside malls to get the relationships and terms sorted out properly.","Just as her thoughts wandered, she heard the man beside her respond with a hint of laughter:","\"Your dad is right.\"","The next second, a long-fingered, well-proportioned hand appeared before her.","\"Give me your hand.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned.","She slowly extended her hand.","The man's fingertips had slight calluses, unlike the cold feeling when they had accidentally touched before. This time there was warmth.","So warm that Sheng Mumu suspected he had a stove hidden on him.","She didn't overthink Qi Mo's gesture, taking it as normal couple behavior for appearances.","She even foolishly smiled, \"You really are odd.\"","Qi Mo raised a brow, \"Hm?\"","Sheng Mumu explained, \"You're dressed more lightly than me and Qi Shaobai, yet your hands are still so hot. Have you secretly been taking a lot of tonics? Too much inner fire.\"","Qi Mo's breath hitched. \"...\"","The always quick-witted man felt for the first time what it was like to be rendered speechless by a remark.","Evening.","The setting sun slanted over the snowy mountains, bathing the sky and earth in warm yellow hues.","A black Range Rover drove along the mountain road.","\"What should we eat tonight?\"","Qi Shaobai, sitting in the middle of the backseat, propped his hands on the front headrests, and asked hungrily.","Sheng Mumu said, \"Oh shoot, I forgot to check the travel guides ahead of time. I don't know what good restaurants are around here.\"","Qi Mo kept his gaze forward and tilted his head slightly. \"Since you two don't have any ideas, I'll decide?\"","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai said in unison, \"Okay!\"","Twenty minutes later, the Range Rover stopped at the summit.","Qi Mo undid his seatbelt, \"We're here, this is the place.\"","From the outside, the mountaintop restaurant looked like a massive glass house. Aside from the log frame structure for support, it was almost completely surrounded by glass windows, reflecting light and giving the interior a bright, open feel.","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath of the fresh, high-altitude air and sincerely exclaimed, \"Eating here, just drinking in the northwest wind would already put you in high spirits!\"","Qi Shaobai glanced at her, his sarcasm intact. \"Don't worry, our family isn't so poor that we'd make you fill up on northwest wind.\"","The dinner was also arranged by Qi Mo.","Delicate French cuisine was swiftly served.","Not only was the scenery sublime, the plating of the dishes was also a feast for the eyes.","Watching the elegant dining manners of the two Qi men across from her, Sheng Mumu began to wonder if the enthusiastic feedback she got after taking them to that hole-in-the-wall restaurant yesterday was them humoring her.","As dusk deepened and night gradually swallowed up the last remnants of sunlight, small decorative lights in the trees lining the mountain road blinked on.","The exterior lights on the restaurant also came on, making the surroundings resemble a fairytale.","After finishing the last course of lemon tart, Sheng Mumu gave Qi Mo a satisfied thumbs up.","\"This place is amazing.\"","Qi Shaobai also nodded, \"Mm, I agree.\"","Qi Mo elegantly dabbed the corners of his mouth with a napkin, his tone relaxed, \"As long as you two like it.\"","As he finished speaking, Sheng Mumu excitedly pulled Qi Shaobai into a discussion about which dish was the best.","Qi Shaobai didn't really want to participate but Sheng Mumu was brimming with enthusiasm, so he reluctantly feigned interest and responded languidly.","Qi Mo leaned back into his seat, posture casual and lazy. He slowly looked between the two enthusiastically discussing inane topics, a smile in his eyes.","Suddenly, his phone buzzed in his pocket.","It was a message from an unfamiliar number.","\"President Qi, are you free to meet tomorrow night? I have some things I'd like to say to you. Qu Hui.\"","Qi Mo's brows silently furrowed. He was extremely annoyed by this woman's repeated disturbances.","He turned off the screen, not wanting to respond.","Another message came through.","\"I want to talk to you about Gu Wan.\"","His eyes narrowed slightly, his gaze instantly turning icy.","The fingers resting on the table curled inward.","Qi Shaobai noticed his change in expression.","\"Dad, are you okay?\"","Qi Mo put his phone away and said in a low voice,","\"I'm fine.\""]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Qi, you should be able to tell that I like you very much.","paragraphs":["When Sheng Mumu arrived in Shen City, she played for two days straight.","Sheng Mumu was thinking it was time to get down to the real purpose of this trip.","She had discussed this in advance with Qi Mo, and early the next morning Qi Mo had a car and driver arranged to wait for her outside the villa.","Sheng Mumu planned to investigate the business environment in Shen City and see if she could open a branch of her Yueji Flower Shop here.","Just a few minutes after the car set off, they came across Qi Shaobai, who was jogging by the roadside.","When the car window rolled down, cold air rushed in.","Sheng Mumu gasped, looking out the window, \"It's so cold and you're out jogging?\"","Qi Shaobai didn't answer her question but looked inside the car doubtfully.","Besides the driver, there was only Sheng Mumu.","Sounding puzzled, he squinted, \"Where are you going to play? Without me?\"","Sheng Mumu sensed a hint of a child coaxing an adult in his words, which contrasted sharply with his usual lazy image.","Amused, Sheng Mumu smiled and said, \"I'm going downtown to take a look around. If you're not bored, you can come along.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the boy had already pulled open the back door and gotten in.","\"Isn't my dad going with you?\" Qi Shaobai asked as soon as he sat down.","Sheng Mumu maintained the loving couple persona with Qi Mo and lied without blinking, \"Although we have a good relationship, we don't have to be together every day.\"","Qi Shaobai nodded slowly, \"Oh.\"","It was true, his dad wasn't the clingy type.","Sheng Mumu had the driver take them to several famous wealthy districts in Shen City.","She thought many communities wouldn't allow strange vehicles to enter, but after the driver got out to speak with them, the security guards at the gates politely let them through.","Sheng Mumu marveled, \"Impressive, Qi Mo's reputation can even serve as a pass in Shen City.\"","At the same time, she secretly thought that after the flower shop became profitable and she had repaid her debt to Qi Mo, she would give him a big red envelope as a \"name usage fee.\"","At noon, they randomly found a restaurant downtown and had a simple lunch. In the afternoon, the car stopped at the entrance of the Shen City Flower Market.","The climate in Shen City was different from Jing City, so naturally the common varieties of fresh flowers were also different.","To expand her business here, understanding the local flower market situation was a necessary step.","Qi Shaobai followed behind Sheng Mumu and took the business cards she had just collected from the stall owners and helped put them in his pocket.","Including this one, she had already collected more than ten business cards in an hour.","Qi Shaobai glanced around at the scattered branches and dirty mud everywhere, and frowned,","\"Why come do this yourself when Dong Assistant could probably gather information on all the stalls in less than ten minutes?\"","Sheng Mumu looked at the aloof rich kid and raised her eyebrows,","\"Not understanding the market situation and building relationships yourself is an express ticket to being ripped off.\"","Qi Shaobai nodded thoughtfully.","He couldn't help but wonder if his father had also been like her, doing everything himself in the early days of starting his business.","The two continued walking to the next stall when a middle-aged couple passed them.","The middle-aged woman suddenly turned her head and stared at Qi Shaobai's face again and again, her eyebrows furrowed in confusion.","The middle-aged man put his hand on his wife's shoulder, \"What are you looking at?\"","The woman hesitated, \"That boy, his face looks a lot like my friend from the orphanage in the past.\"","The man glanced in that direction along her gaze and smiled, \"Then your friend must have been very good looking.\"","The woman nodded, \"Yes, Gu Wan was always very beautiful. Alas, it's a pity...\"","Before she could take a closer look, the boy had already turned into a stall, and she could only vaguely hear his increasingly blurred conversation.","\"I was your assistant, following you around today. Don't you think you should take me out for a nice dinner? It should at least be at the level of the restaurant on the mountain top yesterday.\"","\"Looks like you're quite bold for your age. Adults bringing you out to see the world is already good fortune, not needing to pay tuition.\"","\"This is also seeing the world?\"","\"For you it is.\"","\"Hmph.\"","...","\"President Qu, Chairman Qi is here.\"","After speaking, the assistant closed the wooden door of the tea room from the outside.","A flash of unexpected joy appeared in Qu Hui's eyes.","Over the years, she had contacted Qi's Group many times under the pretext of seeking cooperation with Tangxin Group, but had never succeeded.","This time, it was just a piece of information about that woman.","Yet he had come.","With a smile on her face, Qu Hui looked at the expressionless man.","\"I didn't expect you to really come.\"","Qi Mo's gaze was as sharp as a blade, exuding chilliness. He got straight to the point, \"Do you know her?\"","Qu Hui chuckled meaningfully and poured freshly brewed tea into the teacup, pushing it in front of Qi Mo.","\"Don't rush, let's chat slowly.\"","Qi Mo didn't speak or sit down, just waiting for her to speak.","Qu Hui pursed her lips and took a deep breath, as if mustering great courage to meet the gaze of the man with the frosty aura.","\"Chairman Qi, you should be able to see that I like you very much.\"","When she finished speaking, she looked at him expectantly.","After a long silence, seeing that the man's expression hadn't changed at all, as if listening to something completely irrelevant, Qu Hui was flustered.","Leaning forward slightly with her hands on the table, she quickened her speech.","\"From the banquet where my dad first brought me and I saw you for the first time, I've liked you.\"","\"Do you know how hard I've worked all these years to make myself good enough for you?\"","\"I know many people like you, but I'm different from those rich ladies who just have looks. Only I really understand you.\"","Qu Hui clenched her fists, with excited light flashing in her eyes.","She recalled the scene when she first saw Qi Mo.","With just one glance, she could tell he was different from the men she had seen before.","His gaze on people had no warmth or emotion, only career and goals.","Qu Hui was convinced that a man like this needed a woman who could assist him in his career.","\"In recent years, I've made Tangxin Group bigger and bigger, becoming one of the top companies in Shen City. I have the same career drive as you. As long as you're willing to get to know me, you'll see how well-suited we are—\"","\"Ms. Qu, I didn't come here to listen to these things. What kind of person you are is irrelevant to me,\" Qi Mo impatiently interrupted her. \"I only want to know, regarding Gu Wan, what do you want to discuss with me?\"","Qu Hui was stunned. The words she had kept hidden in her heart for so long were finally uttered but received no response at all.","Her heart felt gripped and ached.","She suddenly narrowed her eyes and took a deep breath, speaking slowly, \"Qi Shaobai's mother is Gu Wan, right?\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the man who hadn't looked at her directly finally slowly raised his eyelids and glanced at her, his gaze unfathomably deep.","Qu Hui laughed self-deprecatingly.","Sure enough, it was only when Gu Wan was mentioned that he would look at her."]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: She Only Loves Your Money","paragraphs":["\"How did you know about it?\"","Qu Hui's hand clutched the edge of the table to steady her tumultuous emotions as the man's voice resonated with intimidating power.","\"How I found out is unimportant. What matters is that I've never told anyone about it. Nor did I ever intend to use it against you. I just wanted you to know that I truly understand you.\"","Qi Mo's frown revealed his distaste. Oblivious, Qu Hui went on:","\"Your current wife has no idea about the matter, right? If she knew, would she understand?\"","Abruptly, Qi Mo's eyes narrowed dangerously, his jaw gradually tensing as he looked at Qu Hui, his gaze sharpening.","Qu Hui said, \"She only loves your money, but I'm willing to help you raise Qi Shaobai like my own son.\"","\"Enough.\" Though Qi Mo's tone was calm, it failed to conceal the impending storm.","Qu Hui instantly fell silent, her fingertips trembling as they gripped the table edge.","Seeing the somberness of the man's face, she felt a wave of icy aura envelop her, suffocating her throat and rendering her speechless.","The next moment, she heard him state in a low yet cautionary tone,","\"It's not your place to judge what kind of person she is or talk about my personal affairs.\"","...","*","Sheng Mumu still hadn't treated Qi Shaobai to a big meal.","The reason was simple - how could she leave Qi Mo out during their three-person trip?","No sooner had they returned to the villa than a light rain began to fall outside.","Upstairs, Sheng Mumu saw Qi Mo standing silently on the balcony, seemingly lost in thought, oblivious to the rainwetting his shoulders.","Peering at him from the side, Sheng Mumu called out, \"Shall we eat? Qi Shaobai said he wants hotpot.\"","Her gaze was limpid like waves.","Qi Mo's brow flickered subtly as he responded gently, \"All right.\"","By the time the three finished their hotpot dinner and returned, it was almost ten o'clock.","As per their routine the last couple of days, Qi Mo tacitly left the master bedroom to give her privacy to bathe.","Sheng Mumu sank into the bathtub filled with bath bombs, and before long, dense bubbles rose to the water's surface.","She leaned back comfortably with a long exhale, reflecting on the day's gains.","From her investigation, less than half of the affluent districts in Shen City had flower shops nearby, with beauty salons, mini-marts, and boutiques being more common.","It seemed, based on today's reconnaissance, that Shen City was quite suitable as the second location for Yueji Flower Shop's expansion plans.","Next, she would need to engage professional market research firms back home to collect data on local consumer habits, preferences, etc.","Then came site selection.","She could continue using the floral suppliers previously contacted, while transportation and floral arrangement work could be assigned to one of the businesses whose cards she'd collected today.","As for interior design and promotions, she could follow the same process as the Beijing store.","Sheng Mumu absently stirred the bubbles on the water as she strategized.","The rain grew heavier outside, and inky clouds crowded the already gloomy night sky.","Suddenly, a bolt of lightning illuminated the rainy night, followed by a deafening roar of thunder.","At that very instant, the lights in the room abruptly went out, plunging Sheng Mumu's surroundings into total darkness.","\"Ah!\"","She couldn't help crying out in surprise.","She had always feared thunder and lightning. While lights made it somewhat bearable, the current pitch blackness doubled her anxiety.","Hearing the commotion next door, Qi Mo came to the door and knocked twice, asking,","\"Everything okay?\"","But to his surprise, the powered door simply slid open at his light push, and her voice rang out from within,","\"I'm fine, it's just...I can't see without the lights and can't find my robe.\"","Qi Mo fell silent for a few seconds before inquiring, \"Shall I get it for you?\"","Sheng Mumu hesitated.","She wasn't dressed, so if the lights suddenly came on while he was inside, it would be terribly awkward.","But it wasn't a solution to just stay in the tub either.","Her phone wasn't nearby so she couldn't use its light.","Prolonged lack of response might make it seem like she doubted Qi Mo's integrity.","After thinking it over, relying on the trust developed between them these past days, she finally responded,","\"All right, please come in.\"","A low \"okay\" sounded from outside.","In the dark, she heard the door gently slide open, followed by the soft scuffing of slippers on the wool carpet.","Though unable to see Qi Mo, Sheng Mumu could roughly gauge his position by the sounds.","Soon he found her robe and handed it over.","Stepping out of the tub, Sheng Mumu took the clean robe, splashing loudly.","With his back to the tub, the man instinctively tilted his head away upon hearing the sounds.","Sheng Mumu hurriedly put on the robe.","Outside, thunder rumbled heavily amidst the worsening downpour.","Suddenly, a bolt of lightning split the sky, its brilliant flash illuminating the room.","Instantly, a deafening roar ensued, as if cleaving the heavens.","She couldn't help letting out a soft cry, reflexively moving to cover her ears.","In that moment of panic, a voice rang out,","\"I'm here, don't be afraid.\"","The man's clear, gentle voice cut through the air, standing out distinctly in the sudden stillness. She could even hear his barely audible cough at the end.","Next, her wrist was grasped by a large palm, its callused fingertips gently stroking her hand back, as if to soothe her.","When the lightning lit up the sky outside, she vaguely made out the man's rugged, well-defined silhouette.","His faint, crisp scent lingered in her nostrils - his scent.","Senses magnified in the dark, she wasn't sure if it was her imagination, but Sheng Mumu felt the hands holding her wrists grow increasingly warm.","It was as if a vine had crept up her arm to envelope her entire body, surrounding her with a sense of security.","\"Why the sudden blackout?\"","She abruptly spoke to avoid awkwardness.","Qi Mo's voice was right next to her ear. \"The high voltage from lightning can potentially damage electrical and ground facilities, causing power outages.\"","Before she could say anything more, Sheng Mumu heard Qi Mo add, \"Does thunder frighten you?\"","With her wrist still clasped in his heated grip, she found herself speaking slightly faster than normal.","\"I wouldn't say frightened, just a bit rattled by the sudden loud noises.\"","\"Seeing you so cheery every day, I assumed nothing could faze you.\" Qi Mo's low tone seemed to contain a smile.","Jokingly, Sheng Mumu responded, \"Of course not, I do get scared too. But compared to having no money, everything else, thunder and lightning included, is a small problem.\"","At her words, she heard Qi Mo give a low, muffled laugh, deep and pleasing to the ear.","Just then, the room lights came back on.","Their gazes inadvertently met in the glare.","The man happened to be standing under a warm, soft spotlight, the alluring smile still lingering at his lips as he looked down at her slightly.","The tailored shirt accentuated his tall, well-proportioned physique. She noticed his shirt unusually had three undone buttons.","The restrained sensuality and subtle indecency made his handsome, ethereal face even more beguiling and eye-catching.","Dazzled by the sudden brightness and the striking handsomeness right before her eyes, Sheng Mumu blinked blankly.","The man's gaze was unlike his usual coolness, containing an unvarnished aggressiveness as he stared straight at her.","The room was still cloaked in wisps of misty vapor.","She was clad in a white robe, her damp hair trailing down her back, revealing a slender, graceful neckline.","Fresh from her bath, her face glowed with a faint pink flush, and her clear eyes were tinged with moisture.","Simply standing there silently, she exuded a unique charm.","The rosy scent of rose bath oil lingered teasingly between them, subtle yet unignorable.","Scorched by his scalding gaze, Sheng Mumu belatedly retracted her hand.","\"The power's back on.\"","\"Mm,\" Qi Mo's throat rumbled lightly as he clearly felt a soft spot in his heart tighten fleetingly. His clear, mellow voice grew somewhat husky as he abruptly asked, \"Are you free tomorrow?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Hm?\"","\"If you're not busy tomorrow, come with me somewhere.\"","...","At that time,","Qi Shaobai was sleeping soundly with his earphones in, completely unaffected by the sudden storm, unaware that there had even been a blackout.","He never could have imagined that when he woke up the next day, only he would remain in the luxurious villa.","\"Anyone here?\"","Standing in the spacious, opulent first floor living room, he called out hoarsely.","The only response was silence."]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Qi Shaobai's life (life revealed, recommended to see)","paragraphs":["\"Is this the place you said you'd take me to?\"","Sheng Mumu got out of the car and looked at the man beside her.","Qi Mo's expression was calm, but his tone contained a hint of melancholy. \"Yes.\"","In front of them was the entrance to Floating Snow Mountain Cemetery.","Floating Snow Mountain Cemetery was built halfway up Snow Mountain.","Because the mountain peak was covered in snow all year round, while the foot of the mountain was filled with vibrant greenery, it was naturally divided into two distinct landscapes, like heaven and earth. Hence the name.","The sun leapt out from the clouds, shining on the earth that had been washed clean by yesterday's torrential rain. The air was filled with the scent of damp soil.","Occasionally a bird call or two could be heard. The few people around walked with heavy steps.","A hint of confusion crept silently into Sheng Mumu's heart.","Why did he bring her here?","Was someone buried here?","The cemetery stairs were long. Sheng Mumu followed behind him as they walked up.","The man intentionally slowed his pace to match hers.","Soon, they stopped in front of a tombstone.","Qi Mo took out a handkerchief that seemed to have been prepared beforehand from his coat pocket. He bent down to wipe the tombstone clean.","As the dust was wiped away, Sheng Mumu finally saw the photo of the tombstone's owner.","Her name was Gu Wan.","In the photo, her features were exquisite and charming. Her brows were like willow leaves, her lips like cherries, her nose sculpted like jade.","The corners of her mouth curved up slightly, a smile with pitiable charm, yet also like a gentle breeze that made people feel comfortable.","Sheng Mumu: \"She is...?\"","Qi Mo looked back at the sound and their eyes collided. She saw a hint of gloom in the depths of his eyes.","\"She is Qi Shaobai's mother.\"","Sheng Mumu was slightly stunned, her eyes widening in disbelief as she scrutinized the tombstone carefully.","According to the inscription, Gu Wan had died at twenty - in the flower of her youth.","Sheng Mumu knew Qi Shaobai's mother had passed away early, but did not expect it would be at such a young age.","She had barely passed the legal marriage age.","Before she could gather her thoughts, she heard the man's low, gloomy voice beside her.","\"She was my sister.\"","Sheng Mumu's mind buzzed.","The large amount of information she had just received in an instant was a bit overwhelming. She did not know how to respond.","Her red lips parted slightly as she gazed at him in a daze, into his deep eyes.","Qi Mo's eyes gradually tightened, his rich voice a little hoarse.","\"Qi Shaobai is not my biological son. He is Gu Wan's...that is, my sister's child.\"","Sheng Mumu was shocked. Her eyes blinked rapidly, exposing the turmoil in her heart.","Just when she thought this was the most astonishing news she had ever heard, Qi Mo's next words once again overturned her perceptions.","\"After she passed away, in order to bring Qi Shaobai into my care and raise him as my own son, I added six years to my age.\"","Suddenly everything made sense to Sheng Mumu.","The puzzles that had lingered in her heart for so long were finally solved.","She finally understood why Qi Mo didn't look thirty-eight at all.","She also understood why she could find no information about him appearing in public during the first few years after he started his company, when she had searched for him online in the past.","So this was why.","This was why!","Of course. With his real age, he was only fifteen years older than Qi Shaobai.","How could a fifteen year old possibly have a son.","In order to become Qi Shaobai's \"father\", he could only wait until he was older, his face more mature, before he could logically appear in the media and make Qi Shaobai his publicly acknowledged \"son\".","There was still one thing Sheng Mumu didn't understand. \"Why does your sister have the surname Gu, while you...\"","She stopped mid-sentence.","Angry at herself for being so tactless, for prying into his secrets.","They were only contract spouses. What right did she have to delve into his secrets?","She pursed her lips slightly, her clear eyes fixed on him as she smiled gently, \"I'm sorry...I...\"","Before she could finish, Qi Mo's gaze slowly shifted to the distance. His long lashes concealed the look in his eyes as he said in a low voice,","\"It's fine, don't apologize. I brought you here today because I wanted to tell you everything about Qi Shaobai's background.\"","Rather than letting her find out from someone else, he preferred to tell her himself directly.","That was his personality.","Straightforward, no beating around the bush.","Qi Mo: \"I was adopted by the Qi family and took their surname...\"","Hearing this, Sheng Mumu's heart tightened sharply. She stared blankly as she listened to him recount those distant memories, her emotions unable to calm for a long time.","...","Gu Wan and Qi Mo grew up together in an orphanage. She was five years older than him.","The Qi parents came to the orphanage because they couldn't have children of their own. At first sight, they took a liking to him when he was just six years old.","The Qi family at that time was not wealthy and could not afford to adopt another child.","Qi Mo as a child did not have the standing to negotiate with adults either.","Gu Wan had always been frail. Qi Mo was her only kin. Seeing her brother could be taken away by adoptive parents made her happier than leaving the orphanage herself.","Afterwards, although they were separated and seldom met, the siblings maintained correspondence through letters.","When Gu Wan turned eighteen, she became an adult and was admitted into university, finally leaving the orphanage for a new life.","She was kind and gentle. She quickly made friends in her new environment and excelled in her studies.","The story should have gone that both their lives kept improving as they each followed their own paths.","But Sheng Mumu could never have imagined the subsequent developments would go straight downhill...","Gu Wan had just entered university, youthful and hopeful about the future.","Until she met that man during an internship opportunity off campus.","From then on, her life's trajectory was completely thrown off its intended course.","She recklessly fell in love with the man ten years her senior.","Initially, her letters to her brother were filled with the happiness nurtured by love.","But the good times did not last.","The man's wife found out and caused a huge fuss at the school.","Only then did she know he already had a family.","After the man's wife kicked up this fuss, she could no longer continue studying there and left school.","At her most pained and helpless moment, the man disappeared.","He abandoned his family, and abandoned her too.","Gu Wan had been frail since she was little. She was prone to illness.","Going through this ordeal, she seemed to deflate. Her health deteriorated.","It was during this most unsuitable time that she found out she was pregnant.","She had not yet recovered from the blow of the man leaving her.","Stubbornly believing he had difficulties.","Hoping that one day he would come back.","Come back to admit his mistakes, come back to find her.","The story ended in a hurried and messy fashion.","After giving birth, Gu Wan's health continued to deteriorate.","She did not make it to her son's one month celebration, leaving the mortal world.","...","Qi Mo's expression was calm. His cold, sharp profile blended in with the distant snow and ice.","His tone revealed neither regret nor hatred.","He was no longer the tearful fifteen year old boy sobbing outside the hospital room door.","From the day his sister passed away, he was destined to grow up overnight, to become a towering tree.","To protect the last trace his sister left in this world - Qi Shaobai.","Gazing at the man's rigid, unyielding profile, Sheng Mumu's lips moved.","She wanted to say something, but did not know how to offer comfort.","Lowering her eyes for a moment, she saw his fingertips trembling slightly.","Her heart was awash with complex emotions. Someone was grabbing her heart.","That aloof, silent, imposing man.","Even if his heart was filled with fury and grief, he was unwilling to reveal even the slightest bit.","In Sheng Mumu's impression, he was a man of few words. If something could be expressed clearly in one or two words, he would absolutely not use extra words.","This was the first time she had heard him say so much.","It was also the first time she had seen an expression on this man's face with his eternally straight back, that seemed like it could almost be called \"desolate\".","He turned his head and their eyes met in midair.","She heard his low, hoarse voice.","\"I didn't manage to be a good father, did I?\""]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: Keemer: \"Are you trying to kid me\"","paragraphs":["“Of course not,” Sheng Mumu answered decisively, almost blurting it out.","“You’ve already done very well.”","No one is born knowing how to be a father.","Moreover, he was just a fifteen-year-old boy back then.","Being able to earn a huge fortune through his own efforts that was enough to support Qi Shaobai for a lifetime, that was already not easy.","Sheng Mumu's eyes glanced at Gu Wan's tombstone.","In the photo, Gu Wan smiled gently with a faint hint of sorrow between her brows. Qi Shaobai really resembled her a lot.","Sheng Mumu now completely understood why their \"father-son\" relationship was so awkward.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's face, she couldn't help but think of her sister.","Qi Mo loved Qi Shaobai, but also hated him.","He hated why his sister insisted on giving birth even at the cost of her life.","He wanted to take good care of Qi Shaobai, but couldn't break through the barrier in his heart.","He didn't know how to be a father, and there was always estrangement and caution between them.","\"He has always looked up to you as a role model,\" Sheng Mumu said gently with a smile like water, \"Even if he doesn't say it out loud, it shows through his eyes and brows that he is proud to have you as a father.\"","Qi Mo's voice was hoarse, and his speech paused for a moment: \"Is that so?\"","\"Yes, I'm not lying to you,\" Sheng Mumu said firmly with a soft and pleasing voice.","At that moment, her bright eyes shone like autumn water, and her smile was like the first thaw of a snowfield.","Like the most refreshing wind, the warmest spring water, it seemed to be able to soothe all unrest.","Qi Mo was lost in thought for a moment, feeling an unfamiliar and abrupt impact in the left side of his chest.","Although the cold wind was still blowing around them, it felt as if he had fallen into early spring.","\"Why was she buried in Shen City?\" Sheng Mumu changed the topic when she saw him lost in thought.","Qi Mo lowered his eyes to conceal his emotions and answered, \"Because that man's name contained 'snow', and her dying wish was to be buried in a place that snows.\"","Sheng Mumu's beautiful eyebrows furrowed fiercely: \"......\"","She heard Qi Mo let out a mocking, low laugh and say, \"Qi Shaobai's name was also given by her, meaning a young and white as snow boy.\"","Sheng Mumu frowned even tighter and couldn't help but ask, \"That man deceived her and left her like that, so why...\"","\"Why was she so foolish,\" Qi Mo said coldly, \"I can't understand it either.\"","Not only could he not understand it.","Seeing with his own eyes that his sister was still pining for a completely undeserving man until the end of her life buried a seed of disbelief in feelings and distrust in long-term intimate relationships in his young heart.","Until later when he became successful in business, he didn't have the slightest thought of starting a family.","He believed that feelings only consumed people's rationality and made them make incorrect judgments, useless and harmful.","But in recent times, this view seemed to have changed.","Her appearance was like a ray of light.","It pried open the darkness and squeezed into his originally dull life.","It made him feel concretely that the word \"home\" could be warm.","Sheng Mumu clasped her fair hands together and said indignantly, \"So unfair!\"","\"It was clearly that scumbag's fault. He deceived both sides, but the one who suffered the tragic consequences in the end was your sister. She could have had a great future, but it was all ruined by that scumbag.\"","She paused, clenching her fists even tighter, and her long lashes trembled slightly from anger:","\"That saying online really makes sense.\"","Qi Mo stared at her unwaveringly: \"What saying?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Don't get close to men, you'll become unhappy.\"","After she finished speaking, the man's eyes tightened imperceptibly.","Sheng Mumu: \"Women should make money and love themselves, that's the hard truth. All that lovey-dovey stuff are just stumbling blocks. After hearing about your sister, I'm even more convinced that wise people don't fall in love.\"","A fleeting gloom flashed across the man's eyes. He lightly hmm-ed and didn't say anything more.","The corners of his mouth curled up in a faintly self-deprecating smile as his gaze fell on the distance with ambiguous meaning.","After a while, noticing that the person beside her didn't respond, Sheng Mumu glanced over.","She felt that the perpetual coldness and aloofness in his eyes finally found an explanation.","Before today, she would never have imagined that this man, who was always elegant and composed, unflappable, and doted on by everyone outside, actually had such hidden, gloomy, and heavy memories.","Her heart felt like it was being squeezed by a lemon, sour and swollen.","The way she looked at Qi Mo unconsciously also held more sympathy.","Sensing her gaze, the heavy-spirited man suddenly turned his face towards her:","\"Don't look at me like that.\"","The next second, he stood up from the bench.","He reached out his hand over her head and ruffled her hair, the corners of his lips quirked up, the loss in his eyes having just dispersed:","\"It'll make me misunderstand.\"","Misunderstand that she cared about him.","Misunderstand that her impassioned earlier words of \"not falling in love\" were just big talk.","The subtle touch on the top of her head prompted Sheng Mumu to raise her eyes.","Her bright eyes were even more dazzling and charming under the snowy backdrop, like a helpless little deer.","Before she could ponder the meaning behind his words, he had already retracted his hand and strode away.","\"Let's go, back home.\"","...","After getting in the car, Sheng Mumu thought the atmosphere would be very heavy.","But unexpectedly, Qi Mo recovered his composure much faster than she imagined.","He slowly took off his coat, turned on the heater, and started the car.","Sheng Mumu took a piece of candy out of her pocket and handed it to him, \"Want it?\"","Qi Mo turned his face to look at her, his voice concealed laughter, \"Are you trying to pacify me like a child?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"There are no 1.9 meter tall kids like you.\"","Qi Mo's eyes filled with more laughter as he jokingly said something out of character, \"You eat it, I won't snatch candy from a child to eat.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned: \"......\"","Her phone dinged with a WeChat message.","Qi Shaobai finally couldn't stand it and sent Sheng Mumu a message asking where they were and complaining that when he woke up from his nap, he was the only one left in the villa.","Under normal circumstances, Sheng Mumu would definitely fire back with a retort or two.","But today, after finding out about his background, she did a complete 180 and gently replied:","\"We're coming back now, have you eaten breakfast? Good boy, what do you want to eat? I'll bring it back for you. Kindly aunt emoji\"","Qi Shaobai's heart lurched, feeling that something was off.","The next second, she called.","Sheng Mumu picked up with a caring look on her face.","On the other end of the phone: \"Don't say anything, listen, if I've been kidnapped, cough once. \"","Sheng Mumu was speechless: \"............\"","He thought she was sending strange messages as a cry for help????","Sheng Mumu raised her voice: \"I'm perfectly fine, I haven't been kidnapped!\"","After speaking, she turned her head to look at Qi Mo who was driving, and couldn't help but complain:","\"I don't know what's in this kid's head, I asked if he wanted breakfast and he actually thought I was kidnapped???\"","Qi Mo's lips curved up, his handsome face breaking into a smile.","Sheng Mumu: \"It's just absurd.\"","Over the receiver came Qi Shaobai's voice:","\"Your reply was so weird, it's normal that I would think that way, you need to be vigilant, even elementary schoolers know that.\"","Sheng Mumu was rendered speechless: \"......That's called caring, I advise you to be grateful.\"","Qi Shaobai scoffed and ridiculed: \"I advise you to watch your words.\"","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath: \"......\"","Ok, fine.","Don't get angry, don't get angry.","Don't quarrel with a brat."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: She Really Felt the Power of Money.","paragraphs":["Talk is cheap, actions speak louder than words.","When Sheng Mumu returned to the villa, she still brought breakfast for Qi Shaobai.","Not long after she entered, Qi Mo received a phone call from the resort, saying he had to go out again to deal with some work matters.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai were already used to Qi Mo's busyness.","In the past, Sheng Mumu always felt that the world of the rich must be leisurely and carefree.","At the very least, they don't have to work as hard as ordinary people, and have plenty of time to enjoy life.","But in Qi Mo, she saw the opposite.","It seemed like there were always endless projects to handle, meetings to attend, and social engagements to keep up with...","Even with thousands of elites in his conglomerate, no one could make decisions in his place.","At least until Qi Shaobai grew up to stand on his own, he still had to stand alone at the top.","After breakfast, Qi Shaobai lazily leaned on the living room sofa playing with his phone, having nothing to do.","Seeing Sheng Mumu pacing back and forth in front of the floor-to-ceiling window with a worried look, he suddenly spoke up,","\"My dad should be back soon. Just sit and wait for him.\"","Sheng Mumu slowly turned her head, \"???\"","Seeing Qi Shaobai's expression, as if he had eaten too much dog food, she understood instantly.","\"Pfft~\"","He thought she was impatiently waiting for his dad, which was why she was pacing around.","Sheng Mumu didn't bother explaining that she was actually thinking about Yueji Flower Shop opening a new branch.","After all, maintaining a loving couple image with Qi Mo wasn't bad.","Especially after finding out about Qi Shaobai's background.","She thought that if she could provide Qi Shaobai with a warm and harmonious family atmosphere, it might make up for some of the deficiencies in his childhood.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips and knitted her brows, letting out a sigh with a deliberate worried look.","\"Alright.\"","She looked just like a newlywed wife worried about her husband working too hard.","Qi Shaobai was stunned for a few seconds before continuing to play with his phone.","But Sheng Mumu's thoughts were no longer on the flower shop.","She suddenly wanted to pay more attention to the aloof and prickly young master in front of her.","She hugged a pillow and sat cross-legged on the single sofa across from Qi Shaobai, leaning slightly towards him,","\"Stop playing with your phone. I want to talk to you.\"","Qi Shaobai looked up, \"What is it?\"","Sheng Mumu's expression was serious.","\"To be honest, I always thought you were an ill-mannered brat who liked to argue with people,\"","Qi Shaobai looked confused as he listened to Sheng Mumu continue,","\"After getting along these days, I realized you actually have many good qualities.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"???\"","Sheng Mumu said sincerely, \"For example, you're straightforward, tactful, and—\"","\"Wait,\" Qi Shaobai interrupted her, looking at her suspiciously with a raised brow, \"Just say it straight if you want me to get you some snacks, or if you want me to accompany you to the flower market?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Or did you want me to be your assistant again?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Can't I just sincerely compliment you?\"","She was always good at praising others.","For a sensitive teenager like Qi Shaobai, more praise could only be beneficial.","But she didn't expect that in Qi Shaobai's eyes, she was just a stepmother who only ordered him around.","Qi Shaobai said with difficulty, \"Instead of praising me, just order me around. I'm more used to that.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment.","Then, as if making an important decision, she cleared her throat with a smile and said,","\"There's still time, you'll get used to it slowly.\"","Qi Shaobai was even more confused.","What exactly did she want to say?","Sheng Mumu sat up straight, taking on her rare adult demeanor, and said slowly,","\"Before, I was busy with the flower shop, and busy being lovey-dovey with your dad since we just got married. I didn't pay much attention to you.\"","\"Starting today, I'm officially taking on the burden of being a stepmother. I won't spoil you anymore, nor will I indulge you.\"","She had made up her mind to take the stepmother role seriously, one day at a time.","\"When did you ever spoil me?\" Qi Shaobai said with a wry smile.","\"That's not important,\" Sheng Mumu waved her hand. \"What's important is that from now on, you'll be in your last year of high school soon. And your dad is so busy with work. Caring for your studies will be my responsibility.\"","Qi Shaobai looked complicated, \"...\"","The sudden concern made him not know how to react, yet it also brought a subtle warmth to his heart that he couldn't describe.","After a while, though his expression was still disgusted, his tone was gentle as he spoke,","\"Do whatever you want, you can try to manage me. But let me make this clear first, don't expect me to call you mom. I really, really can't say it.\"","At seventeen, it was no longer an age where he could easily accept calling a stranger by that name.","Sheng Mumu was stunned for half a second before her eyes crinkled into a smile. She said,","\"With your 6-foot frame, it would be hard for me to get used to you calling me mom too.\"","They both laughed after she finished speaking.","The weather today was gloomy. Qi Shaobai planned to stay in the villa all day without going out.","So Sheng Mumu went to the resort hot springs alone to enjoy some leisure time.","\"Mrs. Qi, this way please.\"","\"Thank you.\"","The resort manager respectfully stood by Sheng Mumu's side, introducing the services and facilities of the private hot spring pools with the snowy mountains in view.","He was afraid he hadn't properly received the chairman's wife, and his words were full of caution.","Seeing the young chairman's wife smile back and say \"thanks for your hard work,\" the manager finally breathed a sigh of relief. He left after instructing the staff outside to be fully prepared for any needs the chairman's wife may have, and to not make any mistakes.","Wisps of steam rose from the surface of the hot spring water.","The open wooden house structure allowed the distant bird calls to faintly reach her ears.","The tranquil and exquisite courtyard was surrounded by trees, with scenic views all around.","Sheng Mumu slowly lowered one leg into the comfortably warm water, then slipped her whole body in.","She leaned against the side, fiddling with the small wooden buckets floating on the water surface.","As her body warmed up, her fair cheeks also gradually flushed redder than usual, adding a touch of charm.","There were over ten white porcelain plates on a table by the hot spring.","They held bird's nest, various desserts, steeping tea, iced fruit juice, and more.","The variety was so extensive that it seemed if she had any needs at all, anything could be delivered with just a ring of the bell.","Since coming to this world,","she had truly experienced the power of money.","In the past, she had seen many successful businessmen at work.","But those were basically within the range she could imagine, nothing too outrageous.","Now, occasionally hearing the numbers Qi Mo mentioned during phone calls.","Or having assistants and housekeepers arrange everything perfectly wherever she went, with the staff ready to serve her.","All this was reminding her that she had fallen into a wealthy family's dream beyond her past reach.","At first, it was inevitably not easy to get used to.","She wasn't the type who liked ordering people around.","She always wanted to avoid causing others trouble as much as possible.","Later, she realized,","her polite rejections actually made those who were paid to work conscientiously feel uneasy.","Gradually, she became more and more able to accept the identity of a wealthy madam.","She also vaguely understood why Qi Mo always appeared cold and stern, dignified and profound.","For someone in his position of power for so long, being chummy with subordinates would be harder for people to accept than keeping a distance.","When she left the hot springs, it was already close to 5 pm.","Sheng Mumu didn't want to drive back. She slowly walked towards the villa, wanting to enjoy the scenery of this newly built 6-star resort along the way.","She had just walked out of the hot spring entrance when a voice suddenly called out, stopping her.","\"Mrs. Qi—\""]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: Tell me, how much are you willing to leave Kejia","paragraphs":["She looked over upon hearing the sound.","In the backseat of a luxury car on the side of the road sat Qu Hui, who leaned out the lowered car window to look at her.","Strictly speaking, Sheng Mumu had only met her twice before.","Once at the airport, and once outside a souvenir shop.","Both times, Sheng Mumu didn't leave much of an impression on Qu Hui, and her face was rather vague in Sheng Mumu's memory.","She was only able to recognize her this time due to Qu Hui's slightly sharp voice.","Qu Hui got out of the car and walked up to Sheng Mumu, glancing left and right.","Originally there was a polite smile on her face, but after making sure only Sheng Mumu was nearby, her smile gradually froze as a hint of strangeness appeared. Her words also carried some implication:","\"Mrs. Qi, I was thinking about how I could arrange to meet you, and since we've run into each other here, it works out well -\"","Qu Hui paused for a moment, her shrewd eyes turning as she observed the reaction of the person in front of her.","Soon, she raised her chin and took a deep breath before getting straight to the point:","\"Go ahead, how much money would you be willing to leave the Qi family for?\"","Sheng Mumu blinked in confusion: \"?\"","She had imagined this dramatic line ever since she first came over, that one day someone would come to her with a check asking her to leave the Qi family.","But she never expected that she would hear these words from the woman in front of her, and was stunned for a moment.","Before she could respond, Qu Hui crossed her arms in front of her chest, looking fully confident as she continued:","\"I've investigated you -\"","...","On the other side, in a luxuriously decorated reception room.","Qi Mo sat relaxed on the sofa with his legs crossed, occasionally nodding in response as he listened to the person next to him speak.","Each of these people on their own could be considered a major figure in Shen City's business circles.","But in front of Qi Mo, they had to be more restrained.","Because they wanted to build ties with the Qi Group, and get a piece of the Qi Group's real estate projects in Shen City.","One of the older men, after introducing the strengths of his company, smiled and said:","\"In fact, when it comes to real estate projects, the Tangxin Group has always had a good reputation in Shen City. If the Tangxin Group could participate and lend a hand, perhaps -\"","Before he could finish, Qi Mo put his crossed legs down, frowned slightly, and expressionlessly put down his teacup.","The porcelain teacup clinked against the sandalwood table.","The sound wasn't loud, but it was enough to silence everyone else.","The man who had been speaking immediately stopped upon sensing Qi Mo's powerful aura.","He had been asked by President Qu of the Tangxin Group to say some good things about them in front of Chairman Qi.","It was usually just some polite flattery in the business world, but he didn't expect the usually stoic Chairman Qi to show what was almost annoyance.","\"We won't consider the Tangxin Group for this project in Shen City,\" Qi Mo said indifferently.","His prestige built up over many years was fully demonstrated in this moment, and everyone's hearts tightened.","Before they could fully process it, they saw the aura-filled man's eyes take on a faint, perfunctory smile.","This smile didn't reach his eyes at all, and was even chilling. His tone was even colder and more resolute than before as he continued:","\"From now on, none of the Qi Group's projects in Shen City will consider Tangxin.\"","At this moment, personal preferences overrode a businessman's usual cost-benefit analysis.","With him saying no, there was no room for discussion.","The air froze in the reception room for a few seconds.","Everyone present was astonished.","They didn't know what Tangxin Group had done to offend this boss, to make him say such harsh words.","Everyone present was shrewd, and naturally understood the subtext behind these words.","It was basically stating his position - if they wanted to build cooperative relations with the Qi Group, they would have to give up their ties with the Tangxin Group.","With such a dichotomy, there was practically no need to even think about the choice.","In the ensuing discussion, everyone tacitly avoided mentioning the Tangxin Group again.","...","\"I investigated you. Your parents passed away early, and you have a worthless older brother.\"","\"Marrying Qi Mo was your only chance to turn your life around. You're with him for the money.\"","Qu Hui stood in front of Sheng Mumu, still holding her head up high.","But because of her lack of height advantage, she seemed less imposing when saying these words.","Ever since being rejected point blank by Qi Mo yesterday, she had thought things over again and again.","To get Qi Mo to accept her, she first had to get this woman to give up the position of Mrs. Qi.","She had struggled for many years in the business world, and seen many wealthy wives.","Besides those who were born into affluent families, most married into wealthy families for fame and profit.","From the information she had gathered, Sheng Mumu rarely appeared in various social occasions under the name of Mrs. Qi after marrying Qi Mo.","If it wasn't for \"fame\", then there was only \"profit\" left.","Persuading Sheng Mumu to leave with money was the most efficient method she could think of.","\"Although my personal wealth can't compare with Chairman Qi, as long as your asking price isn't excessive, I can think of ways to pay you in one lump sum. With that money, you won't have any worries for the rest of your life. What do you think?\"","Qu Hui's tone was suggestive, but her expression radiated contempt from the inside out.","It was as if she assumed Sheng Mumu would leave the Qi family for a lump sum she could receive immediately.","Sheng Mumu maintained her last bit of courtesy, and the corners of her mouth sank: \"Are you finished?\"","Seeing Sheng Mumu's calm reaction, Qu Hui paused for a moment.","Then she smiled again, her voice growing sharper:","\"Hmph, or could it not be?\"","\"If it's not money, then it must be feelings right?\"","\"If it's because of feelings, then it's even easier to discuss. You should be able to understand my perspective - only a woman capable enough to match his status is more suitable for the position of Mrs. Qi.\"","Qu Hui looked completely confident as she continued:","\"Successful men need women who can help them, not just taking care of the family, but also providing assistance in their careers.\"","\"And I, am the most suitable woman for Qi Mo.\"","\"Mrs. Qi should be me, it can only be me.\"","In terms of age, she didn't have an advantage.","But in understanding human nature and strategizing, she considered herself one of the top women.","Facing Qu Hui's hostile attitude, Sheng Mumu appeared exceptionally calm.","In a contest, if only one person imagines a competitive relationship while the other remains aloof, the former has already lost.","Sheng Mumu never considered any woman a rival, whether in the past or present, whether in relationships or career.","As Qu Hui finished speaking, Sheng Mumu finally had enough of Qu Hui's complete lack of boundaries and unawareness.","She didn't agree with every word Qu Hui said, but had no intention of trying to change someone's deep-rooted beliefs.","She told herself internally:","Respect differences in species, let go of savior mentality, or risk mammary nodules."]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: Don't report to me. I'm not your mother.","paragraphs":["After some self-adjustment, Sheng Mumu looked increasingly composed.","She smiled calmly and slowly said, \"Miss Qu, if you want others to call you 'Mrs. Qi' so much, you can go to the local census registry and change your name once and for all.\"","\"Hmm...let me think, Mrs. Qu Qi, not bad, it sounds quite cute, just as humorous as what you just said, making people want to laugh when they hear it.\"","Qu Hui stared angrily: \"What did you say!?\"","Sheng Mumu shrugged indifferently.","\"You don't need to report to me who you like or what you want to do. I'm not your mother. Likewise, I won't make way for you or cater to your preferences.\"","Qu Hui's face turned red and white, her nails digging into her palms, unable to utter a word for a moment.","It seemed that she had to reveal her trump card.","After a long pause, she bit her lip, glanced at Sheng Mumu, and said in a slow tone, word for word:","\"I won't engage in fruitless verbal battles with you, it's meaningless. But you probably won't stay so composed after hearing what I'm about to say next.\"","\"Let me remind you not to get too excited when you hear it. I hate seeing people's weak and cowardly crying and screaming.\"","Having said that, Qu Hui slowly tidied her hair, snorted, slowly raised her eyelids, and while looking at Sheng Mumu's expression, said:","\"Qi Mo has never told you about Qi Shaobai's background, has he?\"","Sheng Mumu's heart skipped a beat, but her expression remained unchanged.","She neither said \"yes\" nor \"no\", she just wanted to keep listening to what Qu Hui had to say.","Seeing her lack of reaction, Qu Hui became more and more convinced that she was holding an ace up her sleeve. Her smile gradually became more smug:","\"Heh, you've known him for so little time, of course he wouldn't tell you such an important secret.\"","\"After all, without knowing those secrets, you'll always be an outsider to the Qi family.\"","\"You don't know, do you? Qi Shaobai's biological mother was a woman named Gu Wan, and Gu Wan was Qi Mo's sister.\"","Qu Hui felt like a breath of evil air had been released, making her feel much better.","She recalled the scene where she had accidentally learned the secret of Qi Shaobai's birth.","It was many years ago.","She had accompanied her elders to Floating Snow Mountain Cemetery to sweep graves, never expecting to see the man she had been thinking about day and night.","It was just a fleeting side profile as the man got into a car and left.","She took note of the direction he had come from.","Tracing the vines to get to the melon, she found out who he had gone to pay respects to.","Even though she had grown up in Shen City and her family was deeply rooted there, it still took her quite a bit of effort to barely scratch the surface.","She learned that the woman named Gu Wan had died from physical weakness after childbirth, and her brother had stayed by her side while she was hospitalized.","A bold idea popped into Qu Hui's head.","The son that Qi Mo had publicly claimed was not his own, but rather he was taking care of his sister's child.","Thinking of this, Qu Hui felt proud of her own clever guesswork, secretly marveling that even heaven was helping her, allowing her to know his secret.","It was like grasping a magic charm.","She just had to climb to a high enough position, then use this magic charm as a key to make the man willing to open his heart to her.","However, Qi Mo's cold reaction yesterday made her feel unexpectedly thwarted.","She could only attribute this unplanned situation to random unstable factors - the woman who had suddenly appeared by his side, Sheng Mumu.","Qu Hui thought that if she couldn't use money to drive Sheng Mumu away, she could only use the reality that he was not sincere to his wife to shatter her fantasy.","Qu Hui said: \"What do you think, surprised? Are you very angry that I know something even you as his wife don't know about? I told you long ago, only I can—\"","\"I already know all that stuff you just said,\" Sheng Mumu casually interrupted her.","Qu Hui's eyebrows twisted together in disbelief as she stared wide-eyed, shaking her head over and over:","\"Impossible, how could you know...impossible, only I should know, you're lying, you're tricking me.\"","Sheng Mumu shrugged, too lazy to say more.","She knew clearly that at this point in the conversation, they had entered garbage time.","She would not waste time trying to prove to Qu Hui that she really knew.","Nor would she mock and ridicule like Qu Hui.","They were completely different kinds of people.","Just then, a deep brown Bentley was slowly driving out of the resort gate.","The man sitting in the back with a cold and stern expression was massaging his brow wearily, his gaze wandering lazily out the window.","Suddenly his fingertip movement paused, and his eyes shifted slightly.","Qi Mo, who had just finished socializing, did not expect that he would see Sheng Mumu here.","His line of sight shifted, and he saw Qu Hui across from Sheng Mumu.","His eyes narrowed, obvious displeasure surfacing in them.","At this moment, Qu Hui's phone rang.","She came back to her senses from her shame and anger and answered the call.","The person on the other end of the phone was eager to make their stance clear:","\"President Qu, it's not that I don't want to put in a good word for Tangxin, but President Qi's intention is very clear, the real estate investment project will not consider Tangxin.\"","Qu Hui's voice trembled as she asked with the last glimmer of hope:","\"Did President Qi say that in person?\"","He and her father were old acquaintances, would he really avoid her pursuit to the point of not even considering cooperation between their groups?","\"Yes, not just the real estate project, Qi Group will not consider cooperating with Tangxin for any investment projects in Shen City in the future.\"","Qu Hui tightly gripped her phone, having completely forgotten she was still standing by the roadside, and shouted loudly:","\"How could that be?\"","The person on the other end of the phone was also very puzzled, but more than puzzlement, they currently wanted to draw a clear boundary and stance with Qu Hui.","\"President Qu, you also know he has always been a man of his word. Our company values Qi Group's series of investments in Shen City this time. I'm sorry, business dealings with Tangxin in the future will probably...\"","This person spoke tactfully without spelling it out directly, knowing Qu Hui would understand the implications.","It was understandable that he would make this choice.","Although Tangxin Group was one of the top few enterprises in Shen City in terms of assets.","Compared to the Qi family, who were considered top elite even in Beijing circles.","There was a world of difference.","Any clear-eyed person would know which side to stand on.","What surprised him was that a successful businessman like Qi Mo, who had long cultivated the ability to conceal his thoughts and ambitions without showing joy or anger, seemingly born to be dispassionate and desireless.","But today, when Qi Mo spoke, he did not conceal at all the surging undercurrents beneath the calm words.","It was as if he deliberately wanted them to understand.","Thinking of this, the person on the phone felt a chill, glad that he was not the one who had offended Qi Mo.","Then he hurriedly said a few polite words and hung up.","Qu Hui stood by the roadside, her hand holding the phone going limp.","An unprecedented sense of defeat washed over her.","At this moment, she finally realized her enemy had never been Sheng Mumu.","She didn't even have the qualifications to compete with her.","From the moment Qu Hui had picked up the call, Sheng Mumu had already turned to leave.","Sheng Mumu did not like contention, let alone one-sided contention where the other party regarded her as an imaginary enemy. It was pointless and boring.","Qu Hui watched Sheng Mumu's back as tears gradually flooded her eyes.","Blurrily, she saw a car stop next to Sheng Mumu.","The tall, sturdy man with chiseled features and a cold, stern expression got out of the car, leaned down and said a few words to Sheng Mumu.","Qu Hui couldn't make out Sheng Mumu's facial expression, whether she was smiling or something else.","She only saw that man, who was so high above, who she dreamed of standing shoulder to shoulder with, open the car door for his wife."]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: The Blurred Line in the 'consensual' Relationship.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu did not expect to run into Qi Mo by the roadside.","In the spacious back seat of the car, Qi Mo leaned against the leather seat with his legs slightly spread, his posture naturally relaxed.","His knee rubbed against Sheng Mumu's knee, seemingly accidental.","She was about to shift away a little when the man's mellow, deep voice interrupted her train of thought.","\"What did she talk to you about? Did she offend you?\"","Sheng Mumu instantly understood he was referring to Qu Hui.","She glanced at the driver's seat.","The driver kept his eyes steadily on the road.","Being able to work by the side of someone like Qi Mo, keeping one's mouth shut was the top prerequisite.","But with the conversation involving Qi Shaobai's background, Sheng Mumu was reluctant to discuss it with a third person present. She did not immediately respond to Qi Mo.","Suddenly, the small partition between the front and back seats slowly rose up, isolating the two spaces.","\"It's fine, they can't hear anything up front,\" Qi Mo gave her a reassuring look.","At the same time, she noticed the corner of the man's lips quirk up slightly.","It seemed to be a kind of... approval, for her considerate discretion.","Sheng Mumu relayed the main points of what had happened, focusing on Qu Hui baring her heart and looking down on her. She did not elaborate too much on that part.","Firstly, she felt Qi Mo would not want to hear all that. She simply summarized it in one sentence, \"She seems to like you a lot,\" and saw the man's eyebrows furrow, not bothering to hide his irritation.","Secondly, complaining too much would make it seem like she was tattling and asking him to stand up for her. Since she did not take Qu Hui seriously at all, naturally she would not keep mentioning her either.","Qi Mo gazed at her with inscrutable eyes, the color difficult to discern.","He noticed that when she spoke, she was always vivid and beautiful, with bright eyes.","Probably mindful of the driver up front, her voice was lower than usual, yet still clear and melodious.","Recalling how she had hesitated and waited for the partition to fully rise before speaking, a trace of obscure delight rippled through him.","She had been considering him.","Sheng Mumu did not notice the shift in the man's emotions. After finishing what happened with Qu Hui, as if thinking of something, she said,","\"Oh right, I went to the hot springs this afternoon. The manager there asked if I needed dinner arrangements and I asked him to deliver some hot pot ingredients to the villa. We'll just eat in tonight instead of going out. What do you think?\"","Qi Mo mildly responded, \"That's good.\"","\"Then it's settled, we'll eat in the villa.\" Sheng Mumu smiled.","Due to being outside the car earlier, the tip of her nose and ears were still flushed pink from the cold.","Thinking about the spicy hot pot they would have tonight, she felt happy.","It was only July. If they were in Jing City, she would never consider having hot pot.","The stickiness and sweat were unbearable.","But Shen City's weather was completely different from Jing City's. Plus, with the snowy scenery in plain view of the resort, eating hot pot here had a unique flavor.","Qi Mo understood that her sudden mention of these things was definitely not just to discuss what to have for dinner.","Rather, she did not want to keep talking about Qu Hui bringing up Qi Shaobai's background, unwilling to make him recall unpleasant memories.","She was clever, knowing how to subtly steer the conversation away from sensitive topics.","He admired her intelligence, always feeling relaxed around her.","However, this time, he did not intend to go along with her change of topic.","He loosened his tie, fingers deft.","While Sheng Mumu was still thinking about whether to have carbonated drinks or fruit juice with the hot pot, a large hand suddenly covered her hand resting on the seat, patting it twice.","It was like the most natural physical gesture between chatting spouses.","Qi Mo's compelling gaze followed.","\"Did she speak rudely to you just now?\"","His tone was light yet carried a kind of indescribable domineering firmness.","As if determined to get to the bottom of it.","Sheng Mumu paused briefly.","Perhaps it was in this moment that she truly felt the man's aura of control and suppression.","It was not the aloofness cultivated from long-term power.","But the confidence ingrained in him from birth, supported by his innate talents and abilities, fused into his very bones, blood, and sinews.","Enveloped by the powerful aura, Sheng Mumu did not dare lie:","\"The tone was impolite, but she was just talking to herself. I was too lazy to respond.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, she saw him narrow his deep-set eyes slightly.","The hand covering her wrist tightened perceptibly.","The sharp lines of his jaw obviously tensed, his obsidian eyes unfathomable, emotions indiscernible.","This was the second time she had seen such an expression on this handsome, rugged face.","The first time was in the Qi Group building's parking garage when he took the post-it note from her car.","Seeing that he did not want to avoid the topic, Sheng Mumu asked directly:","\"Does she know about Qi Shaobai's background? Could she spread it around and cause trouble?\"","She also hoped this woman would not throw the Qi family into chaos.","Although there was only a monetary and fragile contractual relationship between her and the Qi father and son before, after spending time together, now she truly cared about them.","She did not want to see this man, whose back was always straight, and the outwardly rebellious but inwardly sensitive seventeen-year-old boy, hurt by rumors.","The man's pupils were jet-black as ink, staring at her unwaveringly.","The broad palm slowly moved from her wrist, up, to the top of her head, ruffling her hair.","His long fingers slid down her hair to the ends, lingering briefly for a few seconds before withdrawing.","The motion was gentle and restrained.","Without crossing that blurred boundary line in their \"contract marriage\".","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly, her watery eyes confused and flustered, inexplicably endearing.","Along with the subtle sensation on her head came the man's low, magnetic voice:","\"It's fine as long as you're not affected. Don't worry about the rest, I'll make sure she stays silent forever.\"","That chilling line of words jolted Sheng Mumu out of her daze.","She hesitated, stammering as she lowered her voice to ask:","\"Silent forever...k-kill...\"","The man's expression suddenly relaxed. Low, muffled laughter emanated from his chest.","The handsome corners of his eyes slowly curved up, a smile hinted in his voice:","\"Not what you're thinking.\"","Sheng Mumu clutched her chest and let out a breath.","Scared to death.","If she knew the man sleeping next to her every day was some unfettered outlaw, she really would be scared to death.","Qi Mo's gaze slid to the side, looking out the window.","His eyes did not focus, seemingly lost in thought.","The snowy scenery outside set off his sharp side profile even more coldly.","Sheng Mumu did not ask how he planned to deal with Qu Hui.","Some things were better left unsaid plainly.","The understanding and wordless communication that should exist between adults their age, they had long since developed.","But the main reason she lost the inclination to ask more was not just because of that.","Sheng Mumu lowered her eyes to the culprit that had stopped her curiosity and disrupted her thoughts——","The large hand still covering her wrist.","With the clothing in between, she could not feel the actual temperature.","She guessed his hand must be warm.","Otherwise, why was her palm damp with sweat?","She also could not figure out exactly what this feeling was.","Unlike before at the banquet, or in front of the villa district madams during their affectionate act.","This time, it was completely private, just the two of them.","The tenderness and possessiveness he had unintentionally revealed for that brief moment when stroking her hair.","She could tell.","And he knew she could tell..."]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: When it's a fake couple, Keemer is very generous to her.","paragraphs":["When Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu returned to the villa, the hot pot ingredients had already been delivered.","The large marble dining table that could seat ten was set full of food. At first glance, there were already five or six varieties of mushrooms that she loved to eat.","\"Madam, if there is not enough food or you would like anything else, please let me know and the hotel kitchen will prepare and deliver it immediately,\" the resort manager said obsequiously.","Sheng Mumu shook her head. \"Enough, enough, more than enough.\"","With just the three of them, let alone ten people, there was definitely more than enough to eat.","It turned out there really was too much. Even Qi Shaobai, a growing teenage boy with a big appetite, had only finished three plates of meat.","On the other hand, Qi Mo's appetite today surprised Qi Shaobai.","In his memory, his dad had always been disciplined and restrained.","He was the same when it came to eating. He never overate.","Yet today, exceptionally, even after Qi Shaobai had set his chopsticks down, his dad was still adding mushrooms to the hot pot.","He seemed to be in a very good mood.","\"I'm going to get some drinks, do you guys want any?\" Qi Shaobai asked Sheng Mumu who was picking mushrooms.","After getting their requests, he ambled leisurely towards the kitchen.","He browsed for the sparkling water he wanted to drink, the sour plum juice Sheng Mumu specified, and the mineral water for his dad in the fridge.","After taking these out, Qi Shaobai did not immediately return.","Instead, he hopped up onto the spotless countertop, pulled open the tab on the sparkling water can, and took a sip with his head tilted back.","Dragging out time...","These past two days, it was obvious to him that the atmosphere between his dad and stepmom had gotten ambiguous.","That scene from skiing the other day was unbelievable now that he thought back on it.","Just now when his dad and stepmom got out of the car after returning to the villa, he happened to see it from the balcony.","Even from a distance, with his good eyesight, he could see Sheng Mumu's earlobes were flushed.","They were that intimate even in the car.","As expected of newlyweds.","Strangely though, they spoke less over dinner.","Could it be because he was there, so they were shy?","Qi Shaobai somehow thought this to himself.","Then he would just wait here in the kitchen a bit longer before going back out.","He didn't want to be a light bulb.","The sensitive and quiet seventeen-year-old was thinking this as he took out his phone.","He didn't dare play on his phone during the meal earlier, afraid of getting scolded by his dad.","Now was a good time to indulge.","...","At the dining table outside.","Qi Mo's phone lit up.","He leisurely wiped his hands with a wet tissue before looking at the message.","Putting his phone down, through the thin mist rising from the hot pot, he looked at Sheng Mumu who seemed to have been burnt by the dried chili powder.","He slowly spoke only after Sheng Mumu gulped down a large mouthful of her drink to soothe the spiciness:","\"The return flight plan has been approved. There are two days left, anywhere else you want to visit before we leave?\"","Sheng Mumu's lips were red from the spicy food, and her eyes were a little wet. She raised her head to look at him:","\"Approved?\"","As she spoke, she wanted to drink more water, only to find there were just ice cubes left in her cup.","Qi Mo slid his cup over and gazed at her with deep, dark eyes. \"Mm-hmm.\"","Sheng Mumu hesitated for a few seconds.","The cup before her contained the sour plum juice she had poured for him. It was nearly full since he didn't seem to like sour drinks and had only taken one or two sips.","She picked up the cup and took a sip, finally relieving the spiciness.","With clear thoughts, she asked:","\"We're taking a private jet for the return flight?\"","If they had booked normal tickets, it would just be to Jing City. There would be no mention of \"approval\".","Qi Mo's eyes quirked up imperceptibly as he replied in his magnetic, leisurely voice:","\"Mm-hmm, we left in a hurry this time, and it was peak travel season, so flight plans were hard to get approved.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Then does that mean I can bring more stuff back without having to check baggage?\"","Qi Mo was taken aback for a moment before chuckling in response: \"That's right.\"","He had never considered that she might have worries in this aspect.","Over this period, Sheng Mumu had gained a good grasp of what the world of the wealthy was like.","But she had never actually been on a private jet before.","Back when she was working, she had heard colleagues who loved palace dramas chat about how a single private jet flight, factoring in takeoff and landing fees, fuel costs, etc., would cost at least five to six hundred thousand.","Five to six hundred thousand!","If it wasn't for this ultra-rich man before her eyes, she probably would never get the chance to experience it in her lifetime.","Thinking of this, she couldn't help feeling amazed.","Heaven really was blessing her.","Even though they were only pretend spouses, Qi Mo treated her very generously.","So generously that it gave her the illusion they were a real married couple.","On second thought, Sheng Mumu rejected this notion again.","She was still too narrow-minded.","What she considered generous, sprinkling money like dirt, was probably just a tiny figure in Qi Mo's eyes.","With this in mind, the way Sheng Mumu looked at Qi Mo through the rising steam even took on a shine like twinkling gold coins.","...","At that time.","Outside the gates of Xiyu Yueting Villa Area, Jing City.","Sheng Lei was stopped by the security guard yet again.","Noticing the disdainful looks from those in the luxury car about to enter the villa area, Sheng Lei angrily said:","\"How many times do I have to tell you, my sister lives here, why can't you understand?\"","The well-trained, burly guard stood in his way and sternly warned:","\"Sir, if you keep this up I'll have to call security to drag you away. This is private property, no entry without proof of residency.\"","\"Che, power tripping jerk.\" Sheng Lei spat at the guard's feet and stomped away cursing.","Recently he had invested in cryptocurrency. His investment advisor told him now was a good time to buy in at the low point.","Once news of the currency going public was announced, it could surge multiplied times in value.","Everything was ready, just lacking funds.","Just at this time, he somehow couldn't get in contact with that deadbeat Sheng Mumu at all.","Phone calls were always busy.","A few days ago he sent her a WeChat message, only to find he was blocked.","How dare she block him?","The more Sheng Lei thought about it, the more irritated he got, cursing crudely under his breath a few times.","\"Damn it, I don't believe I can't run into you if I wait here everyday.\"","At thirty-three this year, Sheng Lei had little accomplishments and was restless with steady work, fantasizing about getting rich quick overnight.","Before Sheng Mumu's parents passed away unexpectedly, he was the treasured baby boy doted on.","After his parents' death, the huge drop was difficult for him to adapt to initially.","He remembered his parents' words to him on their deathbeds.","At that time, Sheng Mumu was still just an ordinary office worker before marrying into the Qi family.","\"Lei, if you run into any difficulties in the future, have your sister help you.\"","\"She is destined to dedicate everything to the Sheng family. When she marries, her bride price should also go to you. You must remember to ask for it.\"","Sheng Lei firmly kept his parents words in heart.","Yes, he was the Sheng family's only man who could continue their ancestral line.","Sheng Mumu was just a daughter who married out.","A married out daughter is splashed out water.","Even if this bucket of water that was Sheng Mumu would eventually be splashed out one day, it must first nurture and water the soil called \"Sheng\"."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: Swipe Your Card","paragraphs":["On the last two days in Shen City, Sheng Mumu bought a lot of things.","The single suitcase she brought with her when she came became three suitcases when it was time to return.","In the afternoon when the sunset was fading away, the three of them boarded the return flight's private jet.","Although not as big as commercial airlines, the private jet was still quite spacious and luxurious.","In addition to the standard configuration like sofas, leather seats, dining tables and wine cabinets, there was even a small conference room and a bedroom with its own bathroom.","So Sheng Mumu was able to check off \"lying in a luxurious bedroom on a private jet watching the sunset\" from her bucket list.","After a flight of several hours, the plane landed at Jing City Airport.","Driver Xiao Wang had already arrived at the airport. Seeing the attractive family of three coming out of the airport hall, he hurried over to greet them.","He carefully took over the cart stacked with three suitcases from Qi Mo's hands and gently loaded the luggage into the car.","After getting into the car but before starting the engine, Xiao Wang felt a pat on his seat.","He looked back to see the mistress beaming as she handed him a small box.","\"Xiao Wang, a gift I brought back for you.\"","Xiao Wang was overjoyed. He reflexively glanced at Boss Qi Mo, then at Sheng Mumu.","Not knowing if he should accept it or not.","\"This... Madam, how could I accept your gift?\"","Leaning lazily against the back of his seat, Qi Mo nodded slightly.","Having obtained the boss's tacit approval, Xiao Wang took the small box with both hands and smiled as he expressed his thanks: \"Thank you, Madam.\"","The gift Sheng Mumu picked for Xiao Wang was a sunscreen.","She noticed that unlike other chauffeurs for wealthy bosses, Xiao Wang did not wear white gloves.","She guessed that Qi Mo probably found them pretentious so asked him to forgo this professional custom.","As a driver who was exposed to the sun all day, having arms tanned two different colors would not look nice.","Sheng Mumu gave a charming smile. \"You're welcome.\"","Sunscreen was not a valuable gift. Her habit of bringing back little something for people around her was cultivated over 28 years of interpersonal experience.","When travelling, she would definitely get souvenirs for others.","A token of her thoughts.","The gift receiver felt happy, and so did the gift giver.","From the airport to Xi Yu Yue Ting villa area, Qi Shaobai changed from the cold cap he had been wearing in Shen City to a duckbill cap.","As soon as he got in the car, he pulled the brim low and crossed both arms over his chest, leaning back to rest.","Sheng Mumu couldn't help but quip: \"You're in the prime of youth, yet feel tired after just a few hours on the plane and need a nap.\"","The corners of Qi Shaobai's lips quirked up slightly. For once, he didn't retort back.","It wasn't because he was tired.","He just didn't want to be a light bulb for them and tried to keep a low profile.","He hadn't forgotten Sheng Mumu's reddened earlobes when she got off the car yesterday, and the expression on his dad's face that could only be described as delight.","Eh...just one word: mushy.","The car entered Xi Yu Yue Ting villa area and stopped outside the iron gates of their villa.","Zhang Housekeeper was already waiting at the door with a smile, craning his neck looking out.","Seeing the master and mistress getting out of the car, he quickly instructed the servants to bring over hot towels for them to wipe their hands.","\"Welcome back, Sir, Madam, young master. Hope you had an enjoyable trip.\"","Zhang Housekeeper rubbed his hands, smiling till wrinkles appeared at the corners of his eyes, looking every inch the kindly old head of the household.","He had worked for the Qi family for many years.","Before coming to the Qis, he had also been a housekeeper for other wealthy families.","Those wealthy households were invariably cold and aloof.","In the less populated ones, relationships were just cold and distant. In those with more people, infighting and backstabbing over the family fortune was unavoidable.","The Qi family had never had such issues.","The master didn't impose many rules. As long as they did their jobs well, he gave them ample respect and freedom in other aspects.","Zhang Housekeeper sincerely felt that he had found the best job with the best boss imaginable.","Yet he didn't expect that it could get even better after the mistress joined them.","With her presence, the Qi residence gained a human touch rarely seen in other wealthy homes.","Xiao Wang took out the suitcases from the trunk, intending to help push them in. But Sheng Mumu stopped him.","She opened two of the suitcases. They were packed full with gifts.","Sheng Mumu squatted by the opened luggage and handed out presents to everyone according to the different packaging.","For the housekeepers Sister-in-law Yang and Sister-in-law Wang, she brought branded hand creams. For Chef Cai in the kitchen, a new chef's knife.","For groundskeeper Master Lv who took care of the garden and swimming pool, it was a neck massager.","She didn't miss anyone.","The servants were pleasantly surprised and quickly expressed their gratitude.","\"Thank you, Sir!\"","\"Thank you, Madam!\"","...","Qi Mo, standing on the side, had a relaxed look on his brow and eyes.","\"No need to thank me. It was the madam who brought you all gifts.\"","Hearing this, Sheng Mumu narrowed her bright, shining eyes and shook her head solemnly.","\"You're wrong. Without you, I couldn't have bought these.\"","Qi Mo's straight brows quirked up slightly. \"Oh?\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes glittered playfully as she let out a heh heh laugh.","\"I charged them to your card.\"","As her words fell, everyone burst out laughing.","The small courtyard instantly became immersed in a warm, harmonious atmosphere.","Specks of light flickered in Qi Mo's eyes, threading into strands of mirth.","He was silent for a few seconds before responding in a drawn out tone:","\"What's mine is yours. No distinction.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment.","She had to admit, Qi Mo was more committed to their act than her, always ready to play the loving husband.","How could she let him best her?","With a charming smile, she looped her arm around his. In a sickeningly sweet voice she cooed:","\"Dear, you're so wonderful~\"","As she finished speaking, she tiptoed and moved closer, adding softly so that only the two of them could hear:","\"How did I do? Compared to you I'm not too bad, right?\"","His unique fresh and cool scent drifted to Sheng Mumu's nose, and she was momentarily lost in a daze as his alluring voice brushed past her ear canal.","Before she could ponder the meaning behind his words, her hand was grabbed.","Her fingers were pried open by the man's warm yet powerful palm.","Changing into a pose of tightly interlaced hands.","Being led by him into the villa, Sheng Mumu fell half a step behind. With her hand clasped tightly, it was as if she was possessed. A tingling numbness spread from her palm to her whole body, and inexplicably, her earlobes were flushed with heat.","She was not thin-skinned.","Yet now she felt like she was seeing ghosts, embarrassed and bashful.","Knowing clearly they were just acting, she still couldn't help becoming flustered.","Tall and handsome with chiselled features as if crafted by the goddess Nüwa, the man's thin lips curved up imperceptibly.","Contained satisfaction.","The onlooking servants' mouths were stuffed full of dog food.","If their inner thoughts could be converted into danmu subtitles floating overhead,","perhaps at this moment above the Xi Yu Yue Ting villa district, there would be:","[Ahhhh they match so well!]","[The Sir and Madam look so perfect together!]","[Getting paid to watch this sweetness feels so good!]","...","Zhang Housekeeper was the first to put away his gossipy smile and assume the stern demeanour of a head housekeeper.","He cleared his throat and ordered everyone to disperse:","\"Ahem! Stop gawking, go back to your tasks.\"","Young people nowadays had no life experience and would exaggerate everything.","Scenes like this would occur daily from now on. No need to make a big fuss over it.","Qi Shaobai just stood at the side with a complicated expression, seeming uncomfortable yet content.","He had never seen his dad behave this way.","Not used to it, yet he liked it very much.","He affirmed this judgment in his mind.","His dad was indeed mushy."]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Do married women speak so boldly","paragraphs":["Su Tingran knew that Sheng Mumu had returned to Jing City. Without waiting for her to make plans, she took the initiative to go to Yueji Flower Shop to visit her.","The afternoon sunshine shone through the glass walls of the flower shop, scattering circles of colorful halos on the milky white tabletop.","There were two teacups filled with rose tea on the table, and next to them were the cranberry cookies that Sheng Mumu had made by hand that morning.","Su Tingran took a bite of a cookie and leaned on her arm, saying:","\"The ladies in the WeChat group know that you went on a trip to Shen City, and they're all guessing - isn't it to have a belated honeymoon with Qi Chief? They praise Qi Chief for doting on his wife. At the busiest time of the year for listed groups to release their mid-year financial reports, Qi Chief is willing to go on vacation with you.\"","\"Ahem.\" Sheng Mumu nearly choked on her tea, \"It's not a honeymoon! It's an employee benefit trip, I'd be silly not to go.\"","Su Tingran didn't believe her excuse at all. She gave her a reproachful glance, \"Why are you shy with me?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled helplessly and took a sip of tea without explaining further.","Su Tingran said, \"Oh yes, thank you for the gift you brought me, I really like it.\"","Sheng Mumu put down her teacup and smiled, \"I thought it really suited you too.\"","Su Tingran had the air and temperament of a young lady from a good family. When Sheng Mumu saw that greenish-blue cheongsam in the store, she immediately felt it would be perfect for her, so she bought it as a gift.","As if recalling something, a hint of sorrow appeared on Su Tingran's face. Her lips moved a few times before she said slowly:","\"Actually, I used to really like wearing cheongsams, but since I married my husband, I hardly ever wear them.\"","Sheng Mumu was puzzled: \"Why don't you wear them?\"","\"They're too figure-hugging. He...doesn't like me wearing stuff like that.\" Su Tingran's shoulders sagged a little, but the sad mood didn't linger on her face for long. Her eyes became bright again, \"But the one you gave me, I will definitely wear it, don't worry.\"","\"Of course you should wear what you like, don't care what men think.\" Sheng Mumu was a little indignant on her behalf, \"Don't judge a beauty, a beauty can wear whatever she wants.\"","Su Tingran was amused by her righteous indignation. She nodded, \"Yes, you're right.\"","Since becoming good friends with Sheng Mumu, Su Tingran felt that she had become much more open-minded.","Previously, her heart had always revolved around her family and her husband.","Now, she was putting more thoughts into herself.","She felt that this was good now, that this was right.","\"Sister Sheng, I've emailed you this month's online sales report.\"","A clear voice suddenly came over.","Sheng Mumu looked over at the sound.","Cheng Zhuo was smiling at them with a bright and clean grin.","Sheng Mumu smiled and nodded, \"Great, thanks for your hard work.\"","Cheng Zhuo rubbed the back of his head. His smile revealed two very shallow dimples. He said, \"Just doing my job.\"","After the brief exchange ended, as soon as Sheng Mumu turned her head back, she saw Su Tingran winking meaningfully at her.","\"Mumu, do you know that the aunties in the villa area are all praising how handsome the new store manager you hired is.\"","\"Of course, I wouldn't have hired him if he wasn't good-looking,\" Sheng Mumu said a little smugly, stirring the flower tea with a small silver spoon, making crisp clinking sounds against the cup.","Not only was Cheng Zhuo easy on the eyes, but his work ability was also outstanding.","When she was away from Jing City these past few days, the flower shop's online and offline business had been great, everything handled orderly and efficiently.","She was currently considering how much more of a raise to give Cheng Zhuo.","Su Tingran paused for a moment. \"But there are also quite a lot of rumors.\"","Sheng Mumu looked up, stopping the stirring motion of her little spoon. \"What rumors?\"","Su Tingran glanced left and right to make sure no one else was around before hesitating briefly and deciding to speak plainly:","\"Nothing more than the usual nonsense.\"","\"Saying that you're still young and couldn't resist temptation, having just married into a wealthy family... \"","Su Tingran was very tactful with her wording, but Sheng Mumu could imagine what those people were gossiping about behind her back.","Among the people spreading these words were some upper-class young ladies who admired Qi Mo.","Since they couldn't have him themselves, they wanted to slander her.","Su Tingran was firmly on Sheng Mumu's side. When she heard others discussing this, she would sternly stop them and tell them not to talk nonsense.","But while you can shut people's mouths, you can't control what they think.","There was no shortage of malice among wealthy social circles.","In some wealthy families, husbands and wives each did their own thing, turning a blind eye to each other's affairs.","In other wealthy families, the wife overpowered the husband, and it was an open secret that the wife kept toyboys on the side.","Sheng Mumu didn't have a powerful natal family backing her up, so naturally she became an object of private ridicule for others.","Among the people spreading these words were some upper-class young ladies who had admired Qi Mo.","Since they couldn't have him themselves, they wanted to slander her.","Su Tingran was firmly on Sheng Mumu's side. \"A clear conscience laughs at false accusations. Although we haven't known each other long, I understand what kind of person you are. You wouldn't even think of keeping a toyboy.\"","\"Besides, what other man could compare to your Qi Chief?\" She smiled meaningfully at Sheng Mumu, \"Qi Chief is in his prime. He wouldn't let you have the energy to think of anyone else, right?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............Pfft, cough cough.\"","This time she really choked on the water.","Her face flushed red as she coughed.","Tingran was undoubtedly a woman who had been married for years. She was indeed...very daring with her words.","Do all married women speak so boldly?","With just one sentence, it made people think of naughty things.","The imagery came along with it.","She suddenly pictured Qi Mo's broad shoulders and taut, smooth muscle lines.","And the adam's apple that hit her aesthetic spot the most.","Tsk, thinking about it carefully, he did look pretty sexy and bewitching.","He looked like he had great stamina.","Sheng Mumu suddenly felt parched and poured herself another cup of rose tea.","She drank it all in one go.","As if wanting to flush all the yellow waste material out of her mind.","Su Tingran just smiled without speaking as she watched Sheng Mumu's fair face turn bright red all over.","...","That night after the flower shop closed, Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo came out together.","Cheng Zhuo took out his keys to lock the door while Sheng Mumu waited to the side.","Recalling her chat with Su Tingran that afternoon, she couldn't help discreetly looking him over.","Cheng Zhuo wore casual suits that looked a bit more youthful in terms of cut and style compared to the kind Qi Mo wore, though the quality was far inferior.","He was in profile to her. His short hair was neat and clean-cut, and his handsome features radiated a hint of vitality.","Just like his name, he was like fire.","If she hadn't seen Cheng Zhuo's resume and known he was only twenty-seven, she would have guessed he was a fresh college graduate just based on looks alone.","As Sheng Mumu thought this, she recalled Su Tingran's well-meaning reminder:","\"Just because you don't have any intentions, doesn't mean others don't. You have to be more careful not to be deceived.\"","\"Nowadays there are many good-looking men who specifically target wealthy wives, just to swindle money.\"","\"These kinds of people often have good backgrounds themselves, sweet-talkers who are best at cajoling others.\"","...","As she pondered this, Cheng Zhuo had already finished locking the door and walked over, jingling the keys at her.","\"Sister Sheng, are you hungry? Want to grab a late night snack together?\""]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: College Entrance Examination Mobilization Meeting","paragraphs":["\"No thanks, I have to go back. I'll pass on supper,\" Sheng Mumu politely smiled and declined Cheng Zhuo's invitation.","\"Alright then, I'll get going first. See you tomorrow, Ms. Sheng,\" Cheng Zhuo flashed a smile, waved goodbye, and jogged towards the employee parking lot.","Sheng Mumu stood in place for a few seconds before leaving.","Ran's words echoed in her mind, along with the image of Cheng Zhuo's beaming face.","No matter how hard she tried, she couldn't associate that smile with the words \"ulterior motives.\"","Well, it definitely won't be the case.","She heaved a sigh of relief and shrugged. Then she turned and left.","Not far away, inside the car, Cheng Zhuo didn't start the engine right away.","He slid his hand to the side and rolled down the window.","His fiery gaze intently watched the slender retreating figure in the distance.","His eyes narrowed ever so slightly, as if lost in thought.","*","Jing City No.1 Middle School had started school.","The third year high school students had returned a week earlier than the first and second years to report for duty.","Qi Shaobai walked into the classroom building with a bag slung over one shoulder. As soon as he entered, he saw Wei Zhaonan waving at him excitedly while pointing to the class allocation list posted on the bulletin board.","\"Qi Shaobai, the class allocation is out. We're still in the same class, Class 4.\"","Qi Shaobai didn't have many close friends. Wei Zhaonan was the only one he considered a brother.","Naturally, he was happy to hear this news.","A lazy smile spread across the handsome, delicate face of the youth. He lifted his chin lightly towards the school store.","\"Let's go, I'm dying of thirst.\"","Although summer had passed, the heat remained unrelenting.","Just the short walk from the car to the classroom building had his palms sweating.","Passing the fragrant Camphor trees along the path, the two similar-height seventeen-year-old boys sauntered lazily towards the school store.","The afternoon sunlight shone diagonally from behind, casting Qi Shaobai's slender silhouette onto the ground.","A few girls walking towards them couldn't help but steal glances, unconcealed joy and bashfulness in their eyes. They nudged their companions as if to say \"look at that hottie.\"","The boy's cold eyes swept over them indifferently.","Just a fleeting moment, yet it left the girls' hearts racing several times faster. Shyly averting their gazes, they quickened their steps and scurried away.","Wei Zhaonan was long accustomed to such scenes. He sighed and complained, \"Geez, we're both good-looking guys of similar height, so why are girls always secretly admiring you without even glancing my way? So unfair. Don't you think the girls at our school have poor taste?\"","Qi Shaobai's brows furrowed. He side-eyed his friend and mocked, \"Is it possible they just don't appreciate you?\"","Wei Zhaonan exaggeratedly recoiled. \"What, am I not handsome?\"","Qi Shaobai just shook his head and continued walking, retorting, \"I don't think so, you barely qualify as not ugly.\"","Unexpectedly, Wei Zhaonan didn't fire back. As if a thought had just occurred to him, he clapped his palm and exclaimed,","\"Oh right, did you hear our school is holding the college entrance exam mobilization assembly jointly with the girls' high school this year?\"","Jing City No.1 Middle School and Jing City Girls' High School were brother schools, often holding teaching workshops together.","But it was the first time they would jointly hold the college entrance exam mobilization assembly.","The third year high school boys who heard this news, Wei Zhaonan included, were over the moon.","Having heard the girls' high school had plenty of beauties, he was full of anticipation.","Qi Shaobai responded nonchalantly, \"I didn't hear about that.\"","He wouldn't have cared even if he did.","Seeing his utter indifference, Wei Zhaonan felt even more indignant. He grumbled sourly,","\"Young Master Qi, this is what they call ‘the rich man doesn't know the sufferings of the poor’. Too many girls admire you, so you can't understand the woes of us common folk.\"","Qi Shaobai's brows rose. \"Weren't you just bragging about being handsome? And now you're admitting you're ordinary?\"","Wei Zhaonan: \"......\"","Qi Shaobai pulled open the freezer at the school store and took out a bottle of chilled water.","Too thirsty to even pay first, he immediately twisted open the cap and gulped down a mouthful.","Fine beads of sweat had formed on his forehead, radiating a carefree youthful spirit under the sunlight.","Even in a simple black tee and grey pants, he looked much more stylish than other boys his age.","Wei Zhaonan leaned against the store counter, a troubled look on his face.","\"This sucks, I wanted to get a cool hairstyle before the assembly to impress the girls. Damn it, parents are supposed to attend too. If I get my hair permed, my mom will definitely nag me about it. But if I don't, I won't get to show off my handsome looks to the girls' high girls. This sucks.\"","Qi Shaobai's brows knitted together. \"Parents have to attend too?\"","He recalled that in previous years, only students needed to attend the college entrance exam mobilization assembly.","\"Yeah, we got a new teacher supervisor and changed a lot of teachers this year,\" Wei Zhaonan said. \"The new broom sweeps clean. They have to do things differently from previous years.\"","After speaking, Wei Zhaonan clicked his tongue disdainfully and looked at Qi Shaobai who was paying for the water. \"Hey, how come you don't know anything?\"","Qi Shaobai lazily sprawled on a bench by the door. \"I'm not as gossipy as you.\"","Wei Zhaonan: \"Without me as your friend, you wouldn't even know what day school starts.\"","Qi Shaobai shot him a glare.","Wei Zhaonan ignored it and asked, \"By the way, is Uncle Qi coming to the assembly, or his assistant?\"","Qi Shaobai's gaze turned towards the distant sports field as he murmured,","\"I don't know either.\"","...","That night when Qi Shaobai returned home, he happened to see Sheng Mumu watching TV dramas on the small sofa in the side living room. He mentioned this matter to her.","\"College entrance exam mobilization assembly?\"","Sitting cross-legged on the sofa, Sheng Mumu looked up at him while peeling an orange. \"Is it?\"","Qi Shaobai glanced at Sheng Mumu, then the study upstairs, and said lightly,","\"Yeah, are you or my dad going?\"","Sheng Mumu had no intention of asking Qi Mo's opinion upstairs. She enthusiastically volunteered, \"I'll go.\"","As long as parents weren't required to attend, she was happy to participate in school activities.","It would also give her a chance to check out the snacks around Qi Shaobai's school. She remembered there were a lot.","\"Okay.\" Hearing her reply, Qi Shaobai closed his eyes in acknowledgment, the corners of his lips slightly upturned as he headed to his room.","Back in his room, he lazily sank into his desk chair, absentmindedly spinning a pen in his hand as he spaced out.","Sensing his mood had inexplicably turned cheerful, he paused, the pen dropping onto the desk.","So it turned out he wasn't as indifferent as he thought.","The moment he heard Sheng Mumu would attend the college entrance exam assembly as a parent,","his heart felt a subtle...delight?","In the past whenever school activities required parents to attend, his classmates' seats would be occupied by their mothers and fathers.","While the one sitting in his seat was always Dong Assistant.","Dong Assistant would wear an appropriately pleasant smile to get through any situation.","No matter how high or low Qi Shaobai's grades were, no anomaly would show on his face.","Wei Zhaonan would always sigh enviously, \"It's so nice not having to worry about getting lectured even if your grades fall. I really wish my mom wouldn't attend parent meetings, but sadly she's too free.\"","Hearing this kind of talk frequently, over time, Qi Shaobai also started feeling that perhaps it wasn't so bad this way.","Perhaps parent meetings without parents weren't a bad thing after all.","After all, his exam scores were trivial compared to his family company's projects that easily surpassed hundreds of millions.","Not that important.","\"Knock knock-\"","The urgent sound of knocking interrupted his thoughts.","Opening the door, Sheng Mumu stood outside and blurted,","\"Qi Shaobai, give me your final exam papers from last semester. Tell me which subjects you're weak at and which you're strong in too.\"","\"I want to get a sense of where you stand so I can chat with your teacher without embarrassment. It'll also help me better supervise your studies in the future.\"","She paused, then shook her head and continued,","\"No, just the final papers aren't enough. Can you find your monthly exam papers too? Give them all to me.\"","The seventeen-year-old boy was momentarily stunned, unable to speak past the lump in his throat.","Sheng Mumu tilted her head. She waved her hand in front of him.","\"Hey, why're you spacing out? Don't tell me you don't have any strong subjects?\"","\"Hey hey, can you hear me? This is important.\""]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: I swear I'll never be a black woman driver again.","paragraphs":["Early morning.","Qi Mo was changing clothes in the walk-in closet.","Hearing the alarm clock ringing on the bedside table, Mu's eyebrows furrowed in puzzlement.","Sheng Mumu, who was sleeping soundly rolled up in the quilt on the bed, jumped up when she heard the ringtone.","She went into the bathroom, squeezed toothpaste, brushed her teeth, and washed her face in one go.","The speed was so fast, it was like a commando.","Their walk-in closets were separate but adjacent.","When she passed Qi Mo's closet, she caught a glimpse of the man standing tall and straight, his evenly proportioned, slender fingers holding onto his watch strap.","Sheng Mumu poked half her head out to greet: \"Morning.\"","Qi Mo's brow slightly lifted: \"Busy at the flower shop today?\"","If not busy, she would usually sleep until nine.","Sheng Mumu entered her closet, stood in front of the wardrobe and was at a loss, casually responding:","\"Not going to the flower shop today, Qi Shaobai's school has an activity.\"","Qi Mo: \"What activity?\"","Sheng Mumu switched to small talk mode:","\"College entrance examination mobilization rally, you know, one of those chanting slogans, cheering up high school seniors to get into exam preparation mode quickly kind of activities.\"","\"It looks superficial, but it’s actually quite useful.\"","\"Qi Shaobai is usually lazy, now that he's a high school senior, his mainspring should be wound tighter.\"","Qi Mo listened to her mellow voice coming from the next closet, and his hard jawline gradually softened.","He really enjoyed listening to her talk about these things.","Very mundane conversations.","\"Are you in a hurry to go out?\" Sheng Mumu suddenly raised her voice and asked.","Sheng Mumu poked half her head out of her closet next door, blinked her bright eyes.","Qi Mo turned his head to look at her, and said neither hastily nor slowly: \"No hurry.\"","\"Then can you help me see, between these two outfits, which looks better?\"","Sheng Mumu stretched out her whole body, smiling holding up two pieces of clothing, comparing them to the front of her body in turn.","\"Between these two, which one looks more dignified? More like a parent?\"","Sheng Mumu believed in Qi Mo's aesthetic taste.","His clothes were always exquisite and good-looking.","The ties, watches, cufflinks and so on, were also well-matched.","Qi Mo's hands were still buckling his watch strap, standing lazily.","His tie was not yet tied, his collar slightly open, revealing his cold, white neck, and his prominent Adam's apple was sexy. He turned his head to look over.","His pitch-black eyes narrowed slightly, and his gaze swept over her from top to bottom.","Sheng Mumu felt extremely uncomfortable under his strong, substantial gaze, but she didn't rush him.","She believed that after careful consideration, he would surely give a satisfactory answer.","After a long time, Qi Mo finally buckled his watch strap.","It was so long that Sheng Mumu even wondered if his watch was broken.","\"Both look good,\" the man said sincerely, his voice a little hoarse.","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Little S cold face .jpg","He thought about it for so long just to come up with such a useless conclusion?","For this kind of thing, you really can't ask men.","Even a refined man like Qi Mo who pays attention to every tiny detail, it was pointless to ask.","Sheng Mumu sighed, went back to her closet and started seriously picking out a handbag.","She treated attending Qi Shaobai's school rally as an extremely important matter.","Qi Mo stood in front of the mirror, his slender fingers tying his tie.","In the mirror, the tall-nosed, sharp-jawed man's eyes gradually condensed, falling into thought.","At the banquet that time, would she also carefully pick out clothes like today, and think about how to match with him?","Sheng Mumu eventually chose a light-colored, petite chic outfit, the skirt was not too short, revealing her fair, straight legs.","The lip color should not be too heavy, the earrings and bracelets should also be more low-key styles more appropriate.","Sheng Mumu turned in front of the mirror, pleased with her aesthetic taste.","She was too focused that she didn't hear Qi Mo say as he left:","\"I'll drop by after the meeting too, if time permits.\"","...","After painstakingly picking out satisfactory clothes and handbag, Sheng Mumu was at a loss again in front of the garage with rows of luxury cars.","Which one to drive?","The butler Zhang stood to one side, and asked again:","\"Madam, are you sure you don't need a driver to take you?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"No need, I can go myself.\"","Compared to being chauffeured, she actually preferred being in control behind the steering wheel.","When the driver drove to accommodate her feelings, it was always slowly.","Even on open roads, he emphasized stability, and could not pick up speed.","Sheng Mumu had been exasperated by this driving style for a long time.","Driving like this was completely wasting the good performance of the luxury cars, very unsatisfying.","Seeing the madam's attitude was firm, Butler Zhang did not say any more, only described the terrain of No. 1 Middle School in Beijing three times.","Down to details like \"after you see the riding field, turn right, then after you see the outdoor swimming pool, go straight for 500 meters and enter the auxiliary road.\"","No. 1 Middle School in Beijing was so big.","To ensure privacy, navigation apps could not bring up maps of routes within the school.","Butler Zhang was worried that the madam would get lost.","If he had paper and pen with him right now, he would have drawn the school terrain.","Sheng Mumu did not detect Zhang's worries at all, looked around at the luxury car pile, hesitated between the Bugatti and Koenigsegg for a while.","She eventually chose the black Koenigsegg.","The price was relatively low-key, not flashy, and the speed was fast enough.","Butler Zhang followed behind her, \"Madam, call me anytime if you don't recognize the way.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled confidently, \"Don't worry, I can find it. Anyway, even if I somehow can't find it, I can always ask Qi Shaobai to come out and get me.\"","She was not bragging.","Although she was a little face-blind, her memory for roads was very familiar.","Basically, places she had been to once, the second time going, she could find her way from memory.","Butler Zhang was stunned for a moment.","Would the young master go pick up the madam?","He clearly remembered that the two were still at odds with each other not long ago.","Even though they got along relatively well on a trip together.","The taciturn and difficult to tame young master was certainly not one to go pick someone up.","And on such a hot day, the young master hated heat the most.","But the madam spoke so confidently, as if it were true.","Before he could figure it out, he heard the low roar, and Sheng Mumu drove out of the garage.","Her fair, porcelain-like forearm stretched out of the car window, waved casually.","\"Bye, Butler Zhang.\"","...","On the road.","The black Koenigsegg stopped at the zebra crossing waiting for the red light.","In the sports car next to it, a young man turned his head to look.","Upon discovering the driver of the Koenigsegg was a woman, he exclaimed regretfully to his companion:","\"Look at that Koenigsegg next to us, it's actually driven by a woman.\"","His companion looked over following his gaze, and without even getting a clear look at the person, frowned in evaluation:","\"Women drivers are road killers, the nice Koenigsegg gone to waste.\"","\"Yeah, wasted.\"","\"Can't even drive well, still buying such a nice car, women are just empty-headed show-offs.\"","Before his words fell, the traffic light turned green.","Before they could react, the black Koenigsegg had rushed out already.","The smooth acceleration at start, just barely overtook the cars in front.","A beautiful drift around the corner, turning into the road on the right.","Steady and fast, turning at just the right moment.","The two people in the car were dumbfounded.","They looked at each other in disbelief.","Only when cars behind honked urging them did they come to their senses, unconsciously murmuring:","\"Awesome...\"","\"I swear I'll never diss women drivers again.\"","..."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: This is Where Things Get Interesting.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu rolled down the car window a little, and the wind rushed in.","The sense of speed became more and more obvious.","Driving like this is really cool, she couldn't help thinking to herself.","The wind swept up her slightly curly long hair and blew it all to the back, revealing her fair and slender neck.","On her exquisite earlobes, the diamond earrings glittered brightly.","But they were not even one ten-thousandth as dazzling as her beauty at this moment.","After driving for a while longer, when they were close to the road section near the gate of Jing City No.1 Middle School, a red sports coupe appeared in the rearview mirror.","Sheng Mumu's elegant eyebrows furrowed slightly.","This car seemed to have been following her since the last intersection.","She retracted her gaze and looked ahead. The corners of her eyebrows raised.","Could it be that the car behind wanted to compete speeds with her?","Things were getting interesting.","In the red sports coupe behind.","In the driver's seat sat a woman with stylish short hair and elegant makeup.","Although no longer in the prime of youth, her free and unrestrained aura reduced the feeling of age.","Seeing the Koenigsegg in front suddenly accelerate, the short-haired woman hurriedly stepped on the gas pedal to keep up.","Muttering: \"Slow down, I can't keep up.\"","She was not a deranged stalker.","The reason she was following the car in front was simply because - when they were close to the destination, she didn't know the way.","Damn it, she had just barely memorized the layout of her daughter's school.","It was unnecessary and troublesome that the college entrance examination mobilization assembly was being held at Jing City No.1 Middle School this time.","If it wasn't for her keen observation skills, judging from the rare license plate of the car in front that it was also going to the noble school Jing City No.1 Middle School like her, she wouldn't have known how long she would have had to wander around on the road.","Under the circumstances of not knowing the way, she could only choose to follow others.","Sure enough.","As she guessed, the car in front turned into the gate of Jing City No.1 Middle School.","Soon after, the black Koenigsegg and the red coupe parked in the parking lot in succession.","In the end, the former was a little faster.","Sheng Mumu got out of the car, tidied up her windswept hair, and breathed a comfortable sigh.","Refreshing.","It had been a long time since she had raced so refreshingly.","Glancing at the time.","She had actually arrived half an hour earlier than planned.","Since she was so early, she was in no hurry to go to the gymnasium where the college entrance exam mobilization assembly was being held.","She slowly turned her head and looked towards the small path behind the school building last time.","The bright eyes flashed slightly as a thought came to her mind.","She didn't know how long the mobilization assembly would last.","Why not fill up first?","...","The last time she came to Jing City No.1 Middle School was when she met Liu Zhenzhen with Qi Shaobai.","Coming again this time, she still marveled at the wide variety of snacks here.","Whether it was the high-end Western restaurants catering to the children of rich families, or the roadside hawkers' carts, there were quite a few people everywhere.","It seemed that there were many parents who had the same idea as her.","Considering that she would attend a school event later, Sheng Mumu exercised restraint and did not choose food with too strong a smell to whet her appetite.","She only ate red bean cakes, mango puddings and other little desserts to curb her cravings.","Just as she was looking at the time and about to head to the school, she suddenly heard an exclamation behind her.","\"Ah - Pervert! He just took photos of me secretly!\"","Sheng Mumu turned her head towards the voice.","She saw a girl covering her skirt, her face full of panic and confusion, shouting at a dodgy man who was running away.","The dodgy man ran in Sheng Mumu's direction.","The surrounding people who didn't understand the situation looked towards the girl.","Just as everyone was still reacting to what exactly had happened, Sheng Mumu quietly clenched her purse and pursed her lips.","As the dodgy man passed Sheng Mumu, she suddenly stuck out a leg.","With an \"ah\", the dodgy man tripped and fell to the ground.","The phone he used to take secret photos fell out as well.","The dodgy man suddenly turned his head and glared viciously at the person who had tripped him, his triangular eyes full of shameless anger.","The next second, Sheng Mumu firmly grasped her purse, swung heavily, and slapped it on the dodgy man's face.","The metal buckle on the purse hit him right on the bridge of his nose. He covered his nose in pain and lay curled up on the ground.","More and more onlookers gathered around.","Knowing that he could not escape, the dodgy man began to bluster and vent his anger. Covering his nose, his hideous complexion stared at Sheng Mumu, who was closest to him, looking as if he wanted to tear her apart.","\"You bitch, mind your own f*cking...\"","Before he could say the word \"business\", someone suddenly rushed out from the crowd.","It was a slap to the dodgy man's face from the short-haired woman.","The crisp sound of the slap stunned the dodgy man.","The short-haired woman had already called the security guards at the entrance of Jing City No.1 Middle School at the first moment of the incident.","Jing City No.1 Middle School was a noble school, and the security guards were well-trained. In just a few moments, they had pressed the dodgy man to the ground.","Then the short-haired woman kicked the dodgy man in the abdomen, picked up the phone he had dropped on the ground, removed the memory card, and broke it in half before throwing it into the drain by the roadside.","She also slammed the phone screen-down on the cement ground to further shatter the already cracked screen.","Lastly, she didn't forget to grind it a few more times with her stiletto heels.","When the short-haired woman finally turned to look at the dodgy man who had been pressed to the ground, with contempt in her eyes, Sheng Mumu realized that this woman was the one who had raced with her just now!","She didn't expect that not only did she like racing, she was also a swift and decisive stylish lady.","Sheng Mumu looked at the stylish lady with admiration. The stylish lady also walked over to her.","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly, watching as the stylish lady leisurely took out some wet wipes from her handbag, pulled out two sheets and handed them to her with a smile, saying:","\"Wipe your bag.\"","Following the stylish lady's gaze, Sheng Mumu only then noticed that her bag was stained with the dodgy man's blood when she hit him earlier.","Ew, dirty.","So...","The surrounding onlookers then saw the two beautiful women who had just worked together to subdue the dodgy man.","One was furiously wiping her bag, while the other was furiously wiping her hands.","The scene was rather amusing.","\"Oh, right, thank you for leading the way just now,\" said the stylish lady with a smile.","Sheng Mumu was puzzled for a few seconds before reacting, \"I thought you wanted to race with me!\"","\"I would never lose to you in a race. The car I drove today was not good. Next time, let's get together and compete again when we're free?\"","Sheng Mumu nodded in agreement, \"Sure, I'll take you up on that anytime.\"","The stylish lady reached out her hand and introduced herself, \"Hello, my name is Qin Jiamu. Qin as in Qin Shihuang, jia as in beautiful, and mu as in bathing.\"","Sheng Mumu shook her hand with a radiant smile, \"Nice to meet you. I'm Sheng Mumu. Sheng as in unprecedented prosperity, and mu the same as yours.\"","Qin Jiamu had rather cold looks, but her smile was very nice. \"What a coincidence. Are you also a parent here for the mobilization assembly at No.1 Middle School?\"","\"Yes, what a coincidence,\" Sheng Mumu also felt it was quite a coincidence. She had inadvertently acted as the guide, and they had dealt with the dodgy man together. Their names even shared one character.","Because of these coincidences, the two hit it off and added each other on WeChat, agreeing to go racing together when they had time.","Qin Jiamu glanced at her watch, \"It's getting late, my daughter is still waiting for me. See you next time.\"","Sheng Mumu bid farewell with a smile, \"See you next time.\"","...","At that time.","In the conference room on the top floor of Qi Group headquarters.","The managers of the various branches refreshed their admiration for the president once again.","As expected of President Qi.","His words were as concise and to the point as always.","At the end of the conference table sat the man listening to subordinates take turns reporting project progress. He had a steady and dignified aura, with slightly furrowed brows.","From time to time, he would lower his eyes and glance at his watch."]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Just then, the shadows of the Trees are Dancing.","paragraphs":["The gym was crowded with people.","All the teachers in charge of the senior year classes at Jingshi No.1 Middle School had come for today's college entrance exam motivational assembly.","With the senior students from two schools combined, the scene was very lively.","Temporary sheds had been erected all around the gym, to provide help for senior year students with psychological issues.","On the stage, the head teacher was testing the microphone.","\"Hello, hello, 1...2...hello...\"","Qi Shaobai felt it was too stuffy and noisy inside the venue, so he wandered outside alone.","Little did he know, there were no fewer people outside.","He could only try to take the less crowded paths.","The sun in late August filtered through the camphor tree leaves into speckled dots of light, falling on the cement walkways of the campus.","He dragged his lazy footsteps, hands in pockets, as he walked.","The sunlight wasn't glaring, and the breeze caressed his face, unexpectedly giving rise to a trace of leisure.","A girl walked towards him from the opposite direction, accidentally meeting his gaze.","Just then, the shadows of the tree branches swayed.","A beam of light restlessly broke through the gaps between the leaves and spilled down, falling on the girl's pure and fair complexion.","Her eyes were limpid, her eyebrows arched into two small arcs, her hair pulled back behind her ears, her neck and shoulders slender and smooth, and her soft hair was dyed the color of sunlight, looking warm and cozy.","As she raised her eyes, they met the boy's clear and limpid ones.","Qi Shaobai's features were cold and indifferent, with his chin slightly cocked.","His pupils soaked in the warm sunlight, with subtle rays of light rippling through, making him look especially good-looking.","The cicadas in the trees seemed to have agreed, and suddenly roared loudly, buzzing.","In an instant, it was as if the earth and sky had been isolated into a vacuum.","A breeze blew past the boy's broad shoulders.","His T-shirt hem fluttered in the wind, and his bangs swayed too.","Their gazes briefly overlapped for a few seconds, before quickly parting.","They brushed past each other.","...","By the time he returned to the gym, Qi Shaobai had two bottles of chilled mineral water in his hands.","The air conditioners overhead were blasting cool air into the venue.","He finally didn't feel so hot anymore.","Sheng Mumu followed the stream of people into the gym, and immediately spotted Qi Shaobai, who stood out with his looks amongst the crowd.","She smiled and waved.","\"Qi Shaobai.\"","Qi Shaobai was chatting with Wei Zhaonan. Hearing her voice, he turned his head, and gestured with his eyes for her to come sit over. There were seats behind them.","After Sheng Mumu sat down, he very naturally handed her a bottle of water.","It was one he had gone out to buy just now.","Qi Shaobai had his hands in his pockets, leaning back in his chair. He introduced Sheng Mumu:","\"Our head teacher is very naggy. Get mentally prepared, it may take a long time, delaying you from returning to the flower shop.\"","Sheng Mumu took the water bottle, droplets of condensed water slid onto her hand, cool and chilled, dissipating more than half of the summer heat. She replied:","\"It's okay, no matter how long the speech takes, I've cleared my schedule for the whole day today, just to accommodate you.\"","The corners of Qi Shaobai's lips imperceptibly curled up slightly. \"Mm.\"","The opening act of the motivational assembly consisted of speeches by the head teacher and subject research group leaders, analyzing the current dire situation, and sounding the alarm for parents and students.","The content was dry and boring.","For the first ten-odd minutes, everyone could still listen attentively.","But when the head teacher took the mic again, saying \"Let me just briefly supplement with two more sentences\", the people below had clearly lost patience, and started looking around restlessly.","The head teacher's voice had a soporific power, and Sheng Mumu felt her head getting fuzzy and heavy.","If not for the cold air being blasted at full force in the venue, making it an unsuitable environment to sleep, she might have really dozed off.","Just as she finished a yawn, tears still glistening at the corners of her eyes, a parent sitting in the front row suddenly turned around.","\"Mrs. Qi, hello, pardon my intrusion, I am the procurement head at Zhenyang Group. My son is in the same class as your young master.\"","He held out his name card with both hands, smiling ingratiatingly, with the smoothness of an adult.","Sheng Mumu was taken aback for a few seconds before accepting the name card, politely nodding slightly.","She had thought it was just casual small talk between parents, and it would be fine to just politely take the name card.","But unexpectedly, this was just the start.","Within just five minutes, the parents sitting in a small circle around them had all handed over name cards in succession.","Sheng Mumu suddenly understood.","The parents' association of an aristocratic school was a social circle for the parents.","Previously during Qi Mo's school parents' meetings, it had always been his executive assistant who attended.","That executive assistant, despite his mild and honest personality, looked as unapproachable as his boss on the outside.","These parents had probably wanted to get acquainted with the Qi family to establish connections for a long time, but lacked the avenue.","Now that it was her turn, looking to be of weaker temperament, they swarmed over at once.","She felt bad rejecting them outrightly, so she put on a formulaic smile, accepted everyone's name cards, and only said, \"I'll pass these to my husband when I get home.\"","After dealing with these people, she heaved a silent sigh of relief.","She turned and shot Qi Shaobai a weary look.","Qi Shaobai appeared much calmer than her.","He seemed long accustomed to such occurrences.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's composure, Sheng Mumu was suddenly reminded of Qi Mo for a fleeting moment.","She realized with a start.","Although these father and son had no direct blood ties, they were surprisingly similar in many ways.","Qi Mo hardly showed up at Qi Shaobai's school, perhaps not wanting the slippery sophistication of the business world to be shown too early to the 17-year-old boy.","And Qi Shaobai's aloof and taciturn personality was probably also a protective layer, shielding him from the people around who wanted to ingratiate themselves, preventing such occurrences from reaching Qi Mo.","The two of them, in their own ways, were preserving the purity in the father-son relationship, unwilling to become a burden to each other.","That was reasonable in theory, but Sheng Mumu still felt they were too pretentious.","What couldn't be directly communicated and clarified face-to-face?","If she were the dad, after living together so many years, their relationship would have long reached the intimate stage of being able to drink beer shirtless together.","Sheng Mumu put the name cards into her bag.","She then looked towards the stage, frowning in puzzlement.","The head teacher's \"brief supplement of two sentences\" still had not ended.","Oddly, the dense mass of heads in the front rows seemed to not be looking at the stage, but were instead unanimously facing the direction of the gym entrance.","Following their line of sight, she looked over curiously.","A familiar figure appeared at the gym entrance.","Qi Mo was tall and straight, standing by the entrance. His cold eyes swept across the crowds in the venue, his imposing aura strong.","Finally, his gaze met Sheng Mumu's.","His eyes tightened, the corners lifting slightly, as he walked towards her."]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Dad just... was he... petting","paragraphs":["Due to rushing over after the meeting, the man was still wearing an exquisitely tailored suit.","Parents of high school students are generally around forty years old.","Women of this age group do not look too old as long as they take good care of themselves, and there is not much difference from women in their thirties.","But it is different for men.","After getting married, they often neglect body management, and signs of the cruel passage of time can be seen from their receding hairlines and pot bellies.","The dignified and noble CEO abruptly entering the crowd of parents was like a catfish thrown into a school of sardines, inevitably making the other men feel ashamed.","With his exceptionally handsome features and the perfect physique maintained through extreme discipline, compared to the others now, he stood out even more, leaving them no chance at all.","Sheng Mumu even saw some wives tugging their husbands’ arms and frowning as they passed by the man.","She could guess what those people were saying.","It must be something like “Look at him, now look at you.”","Imagining their voices, she couldn’t help but feel amused, the corners of her eyes curving faintly as dimples appeared.","Her eyes as clear as water curved with laughter as she looked at Qi Mo, using her chin to point at the seat next to her.","Qi Mo pulled out the chair and sat down, his long legs making him look even more slender.","The people sitting around them visibly straightened their backs after he sat down, as if influenced by his powerful aura, involuntarily wanting to make a good impression.","Unhurriedly, he took off his coat and casually draped it over his forearm. His long, slender fingers loosened his tie, and he turned his head to ask Sheng Mumu in a low voice:","“How long has it been?”","“Almost half an hour,” Sheng Mumu leaned in closer, smelling the clean and cold scent on the man as she answered. “The head teacher has been blabbering on and on, repeating himself over and over, enough to compile a book of nonsense.”","Qi Mo chuckled softly.","Sheng Mumu also lowered her voice and said:","“Just now many parents gave me their business cards, it was so awkward. My face almost cramped from smiling.”","“I felt like a heartless business card collecting machine, my hand is so tired.”","“When I get home tonight I’ll have the chef make chicken claws, using food to nourish my body.”","“Should I have it with ginger and chili or sweet bean sauce flavor?”","...","As she complained and grumbled, Qi Mo gazed at her with a faint smile at the corners of his mouth.","Even meaningless conversation, he still listened with great patience.","Occasionally the corners of his lips would curve, and he would nod his head.","He responded to every sentence she said.","Standing to the side, Qi Shaobai was stunned, his brows furrowed in puzzlement.","The moment he saw his father appear in the gymnasium, he quickly ran through it in his mind, trying to figure out what important occasion it was today.","In the end, he concluded that it must be because third year of high school is a very important time in one's life.","Otherwise, his workaholic father would not have come personally.","Qi Mo crossed his long legs leisurely, sitting lazily, his eyes unintentionally sweeping over Sheng Mumu’s fair legs.","He paused for a moment, raising his eyes to glance at the ceiling of the stadium.","The central air conditioning was blowing out cold air.","The next second, his exquisite and expensive suit jacket was draped over her fair legs.","Sitting in the icy cold stadium for a long time, Sheng Mumu was indeed a little cold.","Now that her legs were covered and shielded from the chill, she politely said: “Actually I’m not that cold, you don't have to lend me your jacket...”","Mainly because she was a little worried about wrinkling his expensive suit.","Qi Mo turned his head slowly to face forward again, his magnetic deep voice languid, “I had nowhere to put it, help me hold it for a moment.”","Sheng Mumu: ......","I see!","Turns out that because his assistant and driver weren't around, he was used to ordering people around but couldn't find anyone, so he took her to be a subordinate to order around?","She quickly adjusted her mindset, correcting her position.","It’s alright.","As a sugar daddy after all.","Occasionally serving him a little, she should.","Otherwise she would feel the monthly allowance of 500,000 yuan came too easily.","After a while, the lengthy speech on stage finally ended.","The head teacher announced that parents could go find the class teacher and subject teachers to chat individually for the remaining time.","As soon as his voice fell, the people around started moving.","The parents of third year high school students were more enthusiastic than the students themselves.","It became very crowded all at once.","But in the small area where Sheng Mumu was sitting, not many people gathered.","As they passed by that man with the cold expression and powerful aura, they seemed to subconsciously avoid getting too close.","Sheng Mumu experienced the meaning of “inspiring awe” for the first time.","Just as she was thinking this, the magnetic voice of the man beside her suddenly said:","“And mine?”","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai’s gazes looked over at the same time.","Puzzled about what he meant.","They saw Qi Mo looking down, long lashes lowered, his eyes fixed on the two bottles of mineral water under Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai’s chairs.","Then the handsome arched brows lifted faintly, gazing at her with concealed amusement, his tone relaxed, “I’m thirsty.”","Before Sheng Mumu could respond, Qi Shaobai reflexively replied:","“I’ll go buy another bottle.”","Qi Mo raised his eyes, reaching his arm past Sheng Mumu’s back.","The man’s solid, powerful arm brushed past her back as he pressed Qi Shaobai’s arm, his tone gentle, “No need.”","Qi Shaobai scratched the back of his head and sat back down, his gaze lingering on Sheng Mumu’s bottle of mineral water for a few seconds, realization dawning on him as he murmured:","“Oh right, you two can share a bottle.”","He had indeed been overthinking things.","Sheng Mumu noticed Qi Mo’s gaze towards Qi Shaobai gradually softening, and it seemed a trace of delight was slowly rising in his eyes.","She instantly understood in her heart.","Qi Shaobai's filial gesture of voluntarily offering to buy Qi Mo water must have made the cold and aloof man extremely happy!","She nodded approvingly at Qi Shaobai, praising:","“Little Qi is so thoughtful, he’s such a good son to his father.”","Qi Shaobai: ......","Qi Mo: ......","After about half a minute, Qi Shaobai belatedly recalled what his father had just said - \"I'm thirsty.\"","The teenager's brows slowly creased as he secretly sucked in a breath.","Oh no...that tone, that expression...","Just now, was Dad...pouting?","Mind blown.jpg","Sensing his father's casual cold glance sweeping over.","Qi Shaobai quickly turned his head to avoid eye contact, pretending as if nothing had happened.","Mind secretly blown.jpg","...","When there weren't many parents left crowding the class teacher's office, Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu went in together.","Seeing this attractive couple come in, the teacher's eyes lit up.","The teacher was 47 years old this year, an experienced veteran.","He had been teaching Qi Shaobai's class since their first year of high school.","He had hosted many parent-teacher meetings, but had only seen Qi Mo a handful of times.","It's no exaggeration to say he had seen this face more often in financial magazines than at parent-teacher meetings.","After they sat down across from him, the teacher took Qi Shaobai's file out of the drawer and handed it over, taking the initiative to say:","“Mr. and Mrs. Qi, this is Qi Shaobai's grades for the past year. Please take a look first to understand his learning situation, then we can discuss Qi Shaobai's problems together.”","Qi Mo nodded lightly, taking the folder and calmly flipping it open.","He had just turned a few pages when he heard Sheng Mumu seriously say to the teacher beside him:","“I'm somewhat familiar with Qi Shaobai's test scores for last school year.”","“His math and physics scores are relatively stable, but he occasionally makes some low-level mistakes, able to solve the later big questions but losing points on the basic multiple choice questions in the beginning.”","“His Chinese language, reading comprehension in particular, really gives me a headache. This child's thinking is different from others, his angle of understanding is always novel and unique.”","“And then there's English, it's really...weak.”","Saying this, she paused, glancing at Qi Mo before meeting his eyes. In her heart she finished the second half of the sentence: Not benefiting at all from proximity to an expert.","Qi Mo's English pronunciation was standard and pleasant to listen to, while Qi Shaobai's was so bad even the most basic grammar was wrong.","Wasn't there a saying that nephews resemble uncles?","How come Qi Shaobai didn't inherit any of that at all.","Instead he fully inherited that aloof and cold demeanor.","Only taking the bad and not the good.","Sheng Mumu suppressed the regret in her heart, leaning forward slightly, asking the teacher earnestly:","“Teacher, in your opinion, if Qi Shaobai works hard this last year, does he have a chance of getting into a first-tier university?”","..."]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Got it. I'm a road fool.","paragraphs":["When Sheng Mumu was speaking, the other two people's hearts were stirred to varying degrees.","Qi Mo's eyes flashed, and the slender fingers on the folder bent slightly as a soft tenderness rose in his heart.","He knew she had been very busy recently.","Busy investigating opening a branch in Shen City.","He hadn't expected that even though she was already so busy, she still found time to understand Qi Shaobai's grades.","It seemed she attached great importance to the high school entrance exam mobilization meeting.","Or perhaps, she attached great importance to this family...","Across the table, the Class Advisor's mouth opened slightly, unable to conceal her surprise and delight as she adjusted her glasses frame, wanting to see Sheng Mumu more clearly.","Previously, when Qi Shaobai had angered a professor into calling his parents, the Class Advisor had met Sheng Mumu.","At that time, she had only felt that this stepmother's aura didn't quite match Qi Shaobai's, and the two didn't seem to exchange more than a few words in their conversation.","How after just one summer vacation could she be so clear about Qi Shaobai's grades?","She had obviously done her homework in advance and come prepared today.","As a Class Advisor, she was most willing to see a parent like Sheng Mumu.","Communication with her would not be difficult.","The next ten-odd minutes.","Almost became a one-on-one consultation between the Class Advisor and her.","In the end, the Class Advisor's attitude was:","If Qi Shaobai could bring his English scores up over the next year, he would have a good chance of being admitted to a first-tier university.","The Class Advisor added: \"But the academic workload is heavy in 12th grade. Our school does not recommend students attend cram schools externally, as excessive pressure may be counterproductive. Parents should mainly play a supervisory and supporting role.\"","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips in thought for a moment before replying:","\"Mm, I understand what you're saying. I plan to provide supplementary English tutoring for him during his free time at home, without affecting his other subjects.\"","The Class Advisor looked hesitant.","She thought to herself: You? Tutoring? Can you do it?","One couldn't blame the Class Advisor for looking down on Sheng Mumu. She had seen far too many students' parents after all.","At an elite school like Beijing No. 1 High School, many parents didn't care what their children actually learned in school, caring more about which young masters and noble ladies they befriended there.","Many parents had already planned from the start to send their children abroad after the gaokao, buying admission to foreign universities with sponsorship fees.","Parents like Sheng Mumu who proposed tutoring their children themselves were few and far between.","The Class Advisor naturally assumed she was exaggerating.","She thought this in her heart, but did not say it aloud.","Instead she responded euphemistically: \"The gaokao English is different from everyday English, the difficulty is not small.\"","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu revealed a confident smile. \"I--\"","She had just wanted to say \"I got close to a perfect score on the gaokao English exam\", but her breath suddenly hitched and she stopped herself.","She couldn't speak recklessly. That was from her previous life.","Fortunately she had stopped herself in time. She changed the direction of her words:","\"I... Old Qi is very good at English, and I'm decent too. Tutoring Qi Shaobai should be more than adequate.\"","As she finished speaking, she quirked a brow at Qi Mo.","The man who had just been referred to as \"Old Qi\" maintained a calm composure, unmoving as a mountain.","Only he himself knew that his brow had twitched involuntarily.","Tutoring Qi Shaobai in English? Him?","The Class Advisor still didn't believe it in her heart, but knew better than to show it directly. She responded with a perfunctory sentiment:","\"It's wonderful that you parents can cooperate with the school like this.\"","Next, the topic shifted to \"how to work jointly between family and school to provide comprehensive psychological health guidance to students.\"","*","While her mother was chatting one-on-one, Chi Xia had gone to the backstreet to buy a cup of milk tea by herself.","Yet she hadn't expected to get lost on her way back.","Beijing No. 1 High School was just too big.","The further she walked, the fewer people there were around her.","Hesitantly, she saw a male student resting on a bench not far away.","She deliberated for a few steps, wanting to ask for directions.","But as she drew nearer, the thought instantly dissipated.","Even with his eyes closed, this male student looked like he had an awful temper.","It would be best not to provoke him.","Just then, the male student's eyes slowly opened, and his distant, aloof gaze narrowed.","Their eyes met.","Chi Xia was taken aback, blinking rapidly before turning around.","She sighed inwardly, what a fierce expression.","Qi Shaobai's brows furrowed slightly as he sized up the girl who had suddenly appeared before him.","Bathed in sunlight, the girl's fair and translucent skin glowed, with her hair pinned behind her ears and fluffy bangs across her forehead.","He felt somewhat familiar with her looks but couldn't remember where he had seen her before.","This girl was a bit strange.","Why did she immediately turn and leave upon seeing him look over?","Qi Shaobai's brows knitted together, his gaze still nonchalantly lingering on her.","He saw the girl stop in front of a three-way intersection, looking left and right, seemingly conflicted.","Qi Shaobai's brows relaxed a little.","He understood now, she was directionally challenged.","He rolled his neck and lazily called out:","\"Can't find your way?\"","The girl looked back at him in bewilderment.","Her watery eyes scanned the surroundings. Seeing no one else around, she confirmed he was speaking to her.","She nodded in reply: \"Mm.\"","Qi Shaobai's lips pressed into a straight line, his face taking on an \"how troublesome\" expression.","The next second, he got up from the bench.","Hands in his pockets, he walked over to stand in front of her and coolly glanced her over once, speaking coldly: \"Where are you going?\"","Chi Xia blinked blankly.","The words were clearly well-intentioned, but coming from this guy's mouth and paired with his frosty, piercing eyes, it was like an interrogation.","After a few seconds' pause, Chi Xia replied with a faint smile:","\"The East No. 3 Lab Building.\"","Qi Shaobai didn't know why she had to smile. His brow quirked slightly.","He pointed in one direction at the three-way intersection:","\"Go straight down this way, take a right after the swimming center and you'll arrive.\"","Chi Xia's smile remained. \"Oh okay, thank you!\"","Just as she was about to take a step, she heard his lazy voice drift over again:","\"I'm also going that way, follow me.\"","Upon finishing speaking, Chi Xia watched as he strode ahead of her with languid steps.","Qi Shaobai's gaze lazily swept back once, slowing his pace to allow the directionally challenged girl to keep up.","Beijing No. 1 High School had three swimming centers. Judging by this girl's dazed look, it was highly likely she wouldn't be able to find her way alone.","It was still early now. Killing time by walking wasn't a problem for him.","Chi Xia craned her head to look at the male student a full head taller than her. She hesitated for two seconds before catching up to his steps.","The two of them walked on the fragrant camphor tree-lined paths of the campus about a meter apart from each other.","The whole way, neither spoke another word.","Upon reaching their destination, Qi Shaobai jerked his chin towards the lab building:","\"Here it is, we've arrived.\"","Chi Xia smiled. \"Thanks--\"","Before she could finish the word, a voice cut her off.","\"Xiaxia-- I'm over here--\"","Qin Jiamu had just finished chatting with the Class Advisor and came out of the lab building, immediately catching sight of her daughter.","In a flash, her eyes narrowed, gaining an extra trace of wariness.","Who was that punk beside her daughter?","Seeing her mother, Chi Xia did not go over. She intended to thank the boy who had led her here first.","But when she turned her head, the boy who had been beside her just a moment ago was gone.","Looking into the distance, she saw the boy's tall, slender figure leisurely dragging his feet as he walked back along the way they had come.","Chi Xia stared blankly for a moment.","Hadn't he said it was on his way just now?","Why did he go back again?","As she puzzled it over, her mother had already come down the stairs to stand beside her, following her line of sight.","\"Xiaxia, who was that punk?\"","Chi Xia looped her arm around her mother's. \"A student from No. 1 High School.\"","Qin Jiamu looked wary. \"Did that punk try to hit on you?\"","Because her daughter was so pretty, Qin Jiamu was never short of worries.","As a result, whenever she saw boys of around her daughter's age surrounding her, she would unconsciously take on a scrutinizing gaze.","Ever since elementary school, there had always been punks hovering around her precious daughter.","Entering middle school, there were even more little boys who would approach her daughter under the pretext of \"borrowing books\", \"borrowing pens\", or \"borrowing umbrellas\".","With Qin Jiamu's experience, she could see through those bratty boys' intentions at a glance.","Thus for high school, she specifically chose a school known for its relatively strict etiquette.","It was a boarding school with no male students, putting her more at ease.","Fortunately her daughter had always been very well-behaved, never seeing her get particularly close with any punk.","Thinking of this, Qin Jiamu couldn't help but sigh.","Before giving birth to her darling daughter, where had she known that her previously carefree self would become so paranoid?","Ever since having her precious baby girl, she only wanted to give her the best of everything in the world.","She mustn't grow up to be casually deceived by some sweet-talking man.","Chi Xia knew her mother meant well. She drew out her words teasingly:","\"Mom, no, he's just being nice and helping me find my way. He's not some punk kid,\" Chi Xia explained.","He's a cold-faced but warm-hearted nice guy.","Qin Jiamu was still worried. She stroked her daughter's hair and cautioned seriously:","\"Okay, I'll say it again - I don't care if you do well or poorly in school. No dating allowed, at least not until you get into college. Be wise and find someone gentle and considerate, like your dad.\"","Chi Xia tugged at her mom's arm as they walked, teasing playfully:","\"I know, I know. In your eyes, no one's as good as Dad. He's the best in the world.\"","Qin Jiamu: ...","That's not the point!"]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: This is a notice, not a consultation.","paragraphs":["When Sheng Mumu came out of the head teacher's office, it was already past lunchtime.","Qi Shaobai received Sheng Mumu's phone call and came to meet up in the parking lot.","Driver Xiao Wang saw the three of them coming from afar. He respectfully opened the car door and waited at the side.","Qi Shaobai quickened his pace without betraying any expression, getting into the passenger seat.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo naturally sat in the back row.","Qi Shaobai's phone vibrated.","It was WeChat messages from Wei Zhaonan, sending three in a row to complain to him.","\"Handsome Zhaonan: My mom gave me a good scolding after talking with the head teacher. I'm screwed. She said she's going to get me a home tutor for make-up classes.\"","\"Handsome Zhaonan: Sun Wukong is so annoying.jpg\"","\"Handsome Zhaonan: I'm so miserable!!!!\"","Given Qi Shaobai's personality, of course he wouldn't miss out on such a good opportunity to gloat.","\"Qi: You deserve it.\"","\"Handsome Zhaonan: Hehe, I'll pray to the heavens that you also have to take make-up classes.\"","\"Qi: Impossible.\"","\"Handsome Zhaonan: Do you know that advertising slogan? Nothing is impossible.\"","\"Qi: Cut the crap.\"","Just seeing English made his scalp tingle.","Just as he was about to fire back with more mocking words, he heard Sheng Mumu's voice calling him from the back row.","\"Little Qi, today the head teacher and I chatted and unanimously agreed that you need make-up classes, English.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","No way!","Karma came back so quickly?","If I had known, I wouldn't have mocked Wei Zhaonan.","Can I still take back my messages now?","He looked completely reluctant. He whipped his head around and blurted out:","\"I won't take classes.\"","Sheng Mumu punched the back of the seat in front of her and raised her voice:","\"This is a notification, not a discussion.\"","Qi Shaobai's eyes inadvertently glanced at his dad.","His dad was gazing out the window, seeming as if he wasn't listening to their conversation.","But after hearing his \"I won't take classes\", his eyebrows visibly furrowed.","Qi Shaobai was silent for a few seconds before swallowing and reluctantly saying:","\"When and where is the teacher?\"","Sheng Mumu still had her fist against the back of the seat, but her gaze had already softened:","\"Me, half an hour of tutoring after school every day.\"","\"You?\" Qi Shaobai blinked in disbelief, \"Tutoring me? Not getting a home tutor?\"","Sheng Mumu raised her brows, \"What, your grades are so terrible yet you still dare be picky about teachers? Or should your dad do it?\"","She was just speaking casually.","She didn't expect that as soon as the words left her mouth, Qi Shaobai's expression would instantly freeze.","Qi Shaobai slowly turned his head back around, extremely reluctant as he replied:","\"No need to pick, just you.\"","Just thinking about his dad's icy demeanor, if they were to face each other for English lessons.","It would be...weird.","Hearing their conversation, the man who had been leisurely gazing out the window the whole time slowly turned to face Sheng Mumu and said:","\"No need for me to tutor him?\"","The dazzling afternoon sun shone on Qi Mo's cold, pale face, accentuating his sharp features with a warm golden glow.","Sheng Mumu waved her hand: \"Why use an ox-cleaver to kill a chicken?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","Qi Mo paused briefly, the corners of his mouth quirked up in an imperceptible smile. \"Alright.\"","The car drove on for a stretch.","Qi Shaobai still couldn't accept the reality that he also had to take make-up classes.","He sent WeChat messages to Wei Zhaonan to complain.","In the quiet car, only the tapping sound of him pounding on the screen could be heard.","Sheng Mumu seemed to suddenly think of something. Her eyes lit up as she smiled at Qi Mo.","Mysteriously, she reached into her bag.","When she took her hand out, there was an extra paper bag in it.","Sheng Mumu grabbed the paper bag and shook it in front of Qi Mo:","\"Got this for you, maltose candy.\"","She hadn't forgotten her earlier promise to him.","If she came across a stall, she would get him some.","Just now on the street behind the school, she had specially lined up to buy a bag.","Qi Mo's gaze flickered slightly. Just as he was about to take it, Sheng Mumu withdrew her hand and said:","\"Let me try one first.\"","As she spoke, she happily opened the bag.","Suddenly, her expression sank.","Qi Mo asked, \"What's wrong?\"","Sheng Mumu regretfully said: \"They're crushed.\"","It was probably from when she used her bag to hit the lecherous man earlier.","Qi Mo's voice was gentle. \"It's fine, they can still be eaten when crushed.\"","Sheng Mumu hadn't intended to throw them out to begin with. Hearing him say this, she became curious instead.","She leaned back to scrutinize the man in a crisp suit with refined features.","The esteemed CEO of a huge conglomerate, was he tired of exotic delicacies that he'd take a liking to plain maltose candy?","It's just maltose candy.","He likes it this much?","Even when crushed, he's unwilling to waste it.","Qi Mo took the paper bag from her hand, his dark pupils contracting as he asked: \"What are you looking at?\"","Sheng Mumu's thoughts snapped back. She shook her head: \"Nothing.\"","Although she was curious, she wasn't so curious that she had to get to the bottom of it.","A CEO was bound to have some eccentricities.","It was understandable.","...","The car didn't drive straight back to Xiyu Yuedian Villa.","At Sheng Mumu's suggestion, the three of them went to a bookstore to buy English reference books.","They also ate at a nearby dining area.","By the time they left the mall, dusk had already fallen. Only then did the car slowly make its way towards Xiyu Yuedian Villa.","Just as they were about to turn into the villa district entrance, a figure suddenly darted out from the roadside, blocking their way."]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: Sheng Lei = Garbage","paragraphs":["Sheng Lei leaned forward, trying to get a better look inside the car. He wanted to see more clearly if it was really Sheng Mumu inside.","The security guard pulled him away.","\"What? It's you again. Can't you leave?\"","Sheng Lei pointed at the person in the car. \"That's my sister. I told you I'm a relative of the homeowner.\"","The security guard tightened his grip and pulled him aside.","\"Who are you trying to fool? If you're really a relative, why don't you make a phone call to prove your identity? Go, go, stop making up stories.\"","A crack in the car window allowed the sound of their argument to drift in. Sheng Mumu heard it and furrowed her brows, lost in thought.","Sheng Lei continued to argue with the security guard. \"She's really my sister, and he's my brother-in-law.\"","The security guard glanced at the license plate and his disbelief became more apparent on his face.","It was the license plate of the Qi family's vehicles.","Was this man suggesting that Qi Mo was his brother-in-law?","That couldn't be true.","Taking advantage of the security guard's momentary relaxation, Sheng Lei broke free and ran to the window. He bent down and said, \"Mumu, come down. This person won't let me in. You tell him who I am.\"","Sheng Mumu instinctively leaned back and created some distance.","At the same time, she fully understood that this man was the original host's vampire brother, Sheng Lei.","She had been enjoying herself lately and almost forgot about this scumbag's existence.","Now, he suddenly appeared before her, surprising her a little, but not enough to lose her composure.","Sheng Mumu gave him a cold glance and moved her hand to the side.","She slowly raised the car window.","Sheng Lei was surprised and tapped on the window, his shouting weakening.","\"Hey! What are you doing?\"","\"Why did you close the window?\"","...","Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai saw Sheng Mumu's actions and witnessed the earlier argument.","The man's cold gaze swept past them, his expression turning serious.","Before their arranged marriage, he had seen this face in the information sent by Dong, his assistant.","Sheng Lei, a worthless man who was always involved in shady deals, either losing money or on the verge of losing money.","He was one of those common failures who aimed high but lacked the ability to reach their goals.","Qi Shaobai, on the other hand, had no idea this person existed. When he heard Sheng Lei's words, he looked completely confused.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips.","She had to deal with this once and for all.","Her shoulders sank slightly, and she slowly turned her head to speak to the two men in the car.","\"I'll get off for a moment to handle some personal matters. Wait for me here.\"","The car door was pushed open, and Sheng Mumu got out.","Seeing her finally come out, Sheng Lei instantly felt triumphant.","He loudly shouted at the security guard, \"Now you know who I am, you watchdog!\"","Sheng Mumu calmly glanced at him and started walking towards the security guard.","Sheng Lei felt like he had vented his anger. However, he didn't forget the purpose of his visit. He followed beside Sheng Mumu, walking and questioning her at the same time.","\"Why didn't you answer my call? Did your phone break?\"","\"You even blocked me on WeChat. What do you mean by this? Are you too high and mighty to recognize your own relatives now that you're successful?\"","\"Sheng Mumu, I'm talking to you. Are you deaf?\"","Sheng Mumu seemed to ignore him, her eyes radiating a calm light as she lazily glanced at him.","To be honest, the original host's brother didn't look ugly.","His facial features were average when seen individually, but when combined, they were somewhat pleasing.","Even though he may look like a person, he's no better than a dog.","She hadn't forgotten the WeChat messages Sheng Lei had sent to the original owner.","Whenever he appeared, it was always about money.","The long chat history could be scrolled back several years.","At that time, the original owner was just an ordinary office worker.","How much could an office worker's salary be? It couldn't withstand his constant requests for money.","The stubborn and arrogant attitude in his words made Sheng Mumu feel disgusted whenever she thought about it.","When the original owner advised him not to speculate on virtual currencies, as it was a scam targeting people who didn't understand the market, Sheng Lei would say,","\"You think you know best, everyone else is an idiot. How come you're so capable? Haven't seen you earning much money either.\"","When the original owner mentioned how hard she worked to earn money and told him to find his own way instead of relying on her all the time, Sheng Lei shamelessly replied,","\"I don't rely on you, who else can I rely on? I'm still unmarried, and my parents passed away early. Who else can I count on?\"","When the original owner's bonus was deducted and her work became difficult, and she wanted to confide in her only relative, Sheng Lei showed no concern for his sister and instead said,","\"I told you to change jobs, but you didn't listen. Regretting it now, aren't you?\"","\"I heard from a friend that you can earn more money by working abroad. You should give it a try.\"","Damn it!","Thinking about all this, Sheng Mumu's fists clenched, as she struggled to suppress her anger.","This despicable person didn't care about the original owner's well-being at all!","Is it so easy to go abroad for work?","What if something happened to him, and he might not even come back alive!","The distance from getting off the car to reaching the security guard wasn't long.","But it was enough for Sheng Mumu's anger towards Sheng Lei, this stranger, to skyrocket from 0 to the maximum.","Sheng Lei noticed that his sister was completely ignoring him and walking toward the security guard.","After pondering for a few seconds, he suddenly understood.","Oh, his sister probably wanted to support him by scolding the security guard who had just pulled him away.","Well, isn't it said that the rules are strict, and only the owners are allowed to enter?","Now that the real owner has arrived, let's see how they apologize.","If that damn security guard doesn't give him face, it's the same as not giving Sheng Mumu face.","Naturally, he should teach him a lesson.","Thinking that he would soon sweep away the humiliation of being driven away for days, Sheng Lei's face became even more triumphant, and he excitedly bit his lower lip.","Sheng Mumu stopped in front of the security guard.","She lowered her gaze and nodded slightly.","With a genuinely apologetic expression, she spoke slowly,","\"I'm sorry, this person has caused you trouble.\"","\"Sheng Mumu, what are you saying?\" Sheng Lei's smug smile instantly froze, and he shouted in confusion, \"Why are you apologizing to him?\"","The security guard was also taken aback and quickly said,","\"No, no, Mrs. Qi, this is part of our job. We didn't know she was a relative of yours, so...\"","Sheng Mumu slowly raised her eyes and said, \"Thank you for your hard work. If you see this person again, please don't let him in. I have no relationship with him.\"","Sheng Lei: \"!!!!\"","He heard her words.","He couldn't control his emotions anymore.","Just like the countless times he scolded her when they were children, Sheng Lei suddenly raised his voice:","\"You explain to me, what nonsense are you talking about?\"","Sheng Mumu frowned and rubbed her ear, which had been affected by the impact. She turned around slowly and spoke calmly, \"I'm saying that I don't have a brother like you. From now on, you are you, and I am me. Do you understand?\"","Her words were neither fast nor slow, and her eyes held a confidence and composure that Sheng Lei had never seen before.","Sheng Lei couldn't believe his eyes as he looked her up and down, anger surging from the soles of his feet to the top of his head.","How could his obedient sister, who had never dared to defy him, suddenly become a different person?","What had changed her?","\"Fine! Fine! You don't answer my calls, you block me on WeChat. Have you grown wings and want to cut off ties with me?\" He took a few steps forward and raised his voice again, \"You ungrateful person! Marrying a wealthy man and disregarding even 'kinship.' Do you still see me as your brother?\"","Sheng Mumu enunciated each word:","\"Although you probably won't understand, I'll explain it to you anyway.\"","\"To be precise, people who only know to cling to others and demand money are not worthy of being called family.\"","\"Call them tr—ash—\""]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: You didn't call Mu Mu, you don't deserve it.","paragraphs":["Because he was angry, Sheng Lei's eyes were bloodshot and red,","His lips stammered for a long time, and what he said didn't make sense:","\"You...you......you said I was trash?\"","As he spoke, his pace quickened forward.","His hands were open, looking like he was about to pounce.","Sheng Mumu's heart tightened, and she instinctively took a step back.","Suddenly she stumbled.","Her back unexpectedly bumped into a broad chest.","Stopping the trend that she was about to fall.","The next second, her waist was gripped tightly by a big hand.","The warmth of the man's palm came through the thin clothes.","The familiar clean and crisp scent also came through.","Looking up, she was looking directly into Qi Mo's deep black eyes like a secluded pond.","Then, she heard his low, reassuring voice in her ear.","\"Are you alright?\"","Before Sheng Mumu could respond, a figure passed by from the side, taking away her attention.","Qi Shaobai didn't know where he came from, mustering all his might, and kicked Sheng Lei in the knee.","The temper of the seventeen-year-old boy was as unruly as his tone:","\"Who the hell are you? Shouting like that.\"","He really didn't know who Sheng Lei was.","He just happened to glance back in the car earlier and saw his dad's face as black as could be.","His dad got out of the car, so he followed along.","He hadn't gotten close yet when he heard Sheng Mumu being shouted at loudly.","He didn't know how angry his dad would be when he heard it, anyway his anger surged up in an instant.","Kicking him once didn't relieve his anger, so Qi Shaobai threw a few more punches before he was satisfied.","How could Sheng Lei's 30-something-year-old body withstand the fists of a seventeen-year-old hot-blooded youth.","With a few muffled sounds, Sheng Lei fell to the ground with a cry of pain, clutching his knee.","He suddenly looked up, just about to curse, but when he saw the two tall men next to Sheng Mumu, he couldn't get out half a word.","It was different now.","A married daughter is like splashed water after all.","In the past, Sheng Mumu only had him as a relative.","No matter how he treated her, she would never say words about cutting ties with him.","But now, not only did she say it, she was also very decisive.","The well-dressed, calm and composed Sheng Mumu before his eyes was completely different from what he remembered.","What made him feel most unfamiliar was the fearlessness and confidence she exuded.","What made the previously docile little sister change?","Was it the two men beside her?","After silently staring at this family for several seconds, Sheng Lei finally figured out the situation.","When he spoke again, his momentum had dropped a lot, and he pleaded:","\"No matter what, we are family, I'm in trouble now, you have to help me, you have to help me.\"","The more Qi Shaobai listened, the more confused he became. He frowned and glared over, \"Who the hell is family with you?\"","Sheng Mumu noticed that the big hand around her waist was gradually tightening.","Glancing to the side, Qi Mo's pale face was extremely gloomy.","His already cold and hard jaw was now clenched in a straight line.","In a low voice, as if wrapped in blades of ice, his thin lips lightly opened:","\"We are family.\"","He pronounced the \"we\" especially heavily.","It was emphasizing, and also warning.","Dark currents were churning in his black eyes, like an angry lone wolf.","The big hand stroking Sheng Mumu's waist slowly loosened.","He strode forward with steady, powerful steps, like the death knell.","Sheng Lei's face turned white with fear, the powerful aura pressed towards him inch by inch, and he couldn't help but retreat, just wanting to escape.","Too scary.","As if he was going to be eaten.","The man looked down at him with sharp eyes and deeply furrowed brows.","Being stared at by such piercing eyes, Sheng Lei felt his whole body burning.","The surrounding atmosphere was as cold as an ice cellar.","The places on his body that had been beaten still hurt, he didn't dare to imagine what kind of horror he would face next.","Without waiting for the man in front of him to speak, he pleaded for mercy first:","\"Don't...don't hit me, I'm not trying to hurt Mumu, I'm her brother, how could I hurt her.\"","Hearing this, Qi Mo's lips tightened, his pupils constricted as he leaned down and picked up the already terrified Sheng Lei.","The icy eyes narrowed, his tone very light:","\"Mumu is not for you to call, you don't deserve it.\"","Sheng Lei's whole body stiffened, not daring to look directly at those eyes, his gaze dodged around.","Accidentally catching sight of the bulging veins on the man's forearm, his whole body shuddered.","Although he was only grabbed by the collar, it felt like his lifeline was seized.","He didn't dare say a word, only kept nodding desperately.","Qi Mo let go of his collar and stood up.","A compelling light flashed in his eyes as he said in a deep voice:","\"Don't ever appear in front of Mumu again in the future.\"","\"That's not okay--\" Sheng Mumu heard this and raced to Qi Mo's side, shouting before Sheng Lei could speak.","\"You have to pay back the money first,\" she said, \"Then disappear.\"","Qi Mo paused and turned to look at her.","The fierceness that burst out of his dark eyes had not completely dissipated.","Sheng Mumu was frightened.","Taking a shallow breath, she stopped the fluctuations in her heart, and continued to say to Sheng Lei:","\"I will have my lawyer contact you. The money you took from me, down to the last cent, must be paid back.\"","Sheng Lei didn't dare say anything else, only resented that he hadn't nodded fast enough.","Not until that family of three got back in the car and left.","Sheng Lei's mind kept circling back to that gloomy, terrifying face.","Not far away, the gatekeeper glanced at the Kurinan that had already gone far, then glanced at the man on the ground.","He scratched his head in puzzlement.","From what he heard, this man was Mrs. Qi's brother?","How strange.","These two people didn't have a trace of a sibling resemblance, whether in looks or temperament.","...","Back at the villa.","Qi Shaobai finally figured out from their conversation who that man was.","As soon as he entered the door, he turned to Sheng Mumu and said uneasily:","\"Luckily Dad and I were both there today. If you had been alone, how would you have dealt with your brother's shamelessness.\"","He might have pestered you for money, he might have followed you home.","Qi Mo followed Sheng Mumu inside without responding to Qi Shaobai's words. Instead, he spoke up heavily:","\"Tomorrow, I'll arrange some bodyguards to follow you.\"","Sheng Mumu was sandwiched between father and son.","One stood in front, looking at her with great concern.","One stood behind, his eyes burning, not hiding his desire to control.","She waved her hand, \"Having bodyguards is too dramatic, I don't need them.\"","Qi Shaobai supported his chin with his hand and nodded: \"I think it's necessary.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Really, it's not needed. I ran into a creepy guy on the street behind your school this morning, shook him off with a flick of my hand, look, I don't need bodyguards to protect me, I can protect myself.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the two men's brows furrowed in unison.","Qi Shaobai cried in alarm: \"What? You ran into a creep today too?\""]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: You really have to listen to my dad on this.","paragraphs":["“When did this happen, are you okay? Why didn't you say it earlier? Where is that man?” Qi Shaobai fired off questions like bullets.","With great difficulty, Sheng Mumu found an opening to respond:","“It wasn't that I bumped into him, that man was secretly photographing others, he ran past me, so I acted out of a sense of justice.”","Hearing her words, Qi's frown did not relax in the slightest, and creased even tighter.","He tugged at his tie with long fingers, and spoke in a tone that brooked no argument:","“The bodyguard matter is decided.”","Having said that, he walked straight towards the second floor study, not giving her any chance to refuse.","Qi Shaobai casually slung his schoolbag over one shoulder, his manner lazy, and leisurely added:","“You really have to listen to my dad on this, he has experience. When I was little--” Qi Shaobai thought for a moment, “--probably around second or third grade, I had bodyguards who followed me to and from school too, they were worried about kidnappings.”","Sheng Mumu: “Emmmm......how is that the same as me? You know that was second or third grade.”","Qi Shaobai also felt his analogy was off, and shrugged:","“Anyway, no matter what is said, having someone to protect you will be safer.”","Sheng Mumu reluctantly accepted this line of reasoning.","Seeing that she had accepted the suggestion to hire bodyguards, Qi Shaobai felt relieved, and turned to go back to his room.","Just as his hand had just grasped the door handle, his shoulder was suddenly patted.","“Stop right there, don’t go yet.”","Qi Shaobai turned around in puzzlement, and saw Sheng Mumu standing behind him with her arms crossed.","Her expression was serious, and her tone carried an interrogative meaning:","“Little Qi, didn't you just swear earlier?”","Qi Shaobai was stunned for a moment.","His eyes slowly widened, “...Ah?”","Was she referring to when he had kicked that guy at the villa district entrance?","Then perhaps...probably...maybe...","He did.","Sheng Mumu increased the force of her palm on Qi Shaobai's shoulder, as if afraid he would slip away:","“Don't think I didn't notice just because the situation was chaotic, you said it.”","Qi frowned, his gaze wandering away: “I didn't.”","Sheng Mumu's gaze was fixed on him, “You did.”","Qi continued to pretend to be ignorant, “Did I?”","“Stop playing dumb with me.” Sheng Mumu flicked his forehead, “I'll let it slide this time, but don't say it again in the future. Although you'll be an adult soon, you still can't swear casually.”","She had unconsciously stepped into a maternal role, unable to refrain from wanting to discipline this aloof and unruly young master.","“Oh, I know.” Qi rubbed his reddened forehead, his expression pitiful and helpless, “Can I go to my room now?”","Sheng Mumu thought his appearance was funny, and tried hard not to laugh.","Her brows furrowed slightly, she lifted her chin, fully assuming an authoritative air, and said:","“Mm, you may.”","Qi Shaobai: ......","On the other side.","Qi Mo pulled out the chair in the study and sat down, immediately dialing his assistant Dong's number.","The energetic voice of Assistant Dong came through the receiver without even three rings:","“Chairman Qi, what instructions do you have?”","Qi Mo said in a low voice: “Arrange four bodyguards. Usually when my wife goes out, protect her safety.”","He paused, and changed his mind: “Make it eight.”","Four seemed a little few.","\"Okay, Chairman Qi, I'll get right on it and bring the people to see you tomorrow morning.\" Assistant Dong responded at once.","\"Mm.\" Qi Mo's slender fingers tapped lightly on the antique desk, making muffled sounds.","Only then did the perpetually gloomy expression on his face relax a little.","Suddenly, there was a faint glint in his dark pupils, as if he had thought of something. He said:","“Instruct them, usually just follow from afar, don't affect her.”","“Don't worry Chairman Qi, I guarantee they won't disturb Madam's life.”","After the phone call ended, Assistant Dong smiled knowingly.","He had only known that his boss was diligent and meticulous at work, attentive to every detail.","He didn't expect that privately he was also an attentive husband who doted on his wife.","His admiration grew.","Assistant Dong secretly clenched his fist.","He swore to take his boss as a model.","Whether at work or in life.","The next morning.","Sheng Mumu stood on the third floor balcony, calling her lawyer to discuss recovering the debt owed by Sheng Lei.","Suddenly she heard a loud and uniform voice.","“Good morning, Chairman Qi!”","Looking down to find the source of the voice, her hand holding the phone couldn't help but stiffen.","Eight brawny men were standing in the yard, hands held behind their backs, spines ramrod straight.","Beside them were Assistant Dong and the others.","And on the outdoor seat across from them, Qi Mo was drinking tea.","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment, and slowly swallowed.","Could they be the bodyguards arranged for her?","Also a bit...over the top.","If she didn't know the villa district had strict security and outsiders couldn't get in,","She would suspect a gangster movie crew had come to film.","She wasn't the only one who thought this.","Qi Mo also felt the same.","He put down his teacup, and lightly massaged his brow. He said lightly to Assistant Dong:","“No need for uniforms, and no need to loudly greet all the time.”","His gaze inadvertently swept over the row of eight burly men standing at attention, and he couldn't help pinching the bridge of his nose again, lowering his eyes somewhat helplessly.","“Take off the sunglasses too.”","These exaggerated things that could expose their identities in a second were all unnecessary.","At Assistant Dong's relaying, the bodyguards took off their sunglasses, and stood more relaxed, no longer at attention.","Only then did Qi Mo give a slight nod, indicating satisfaction.","He didn't want her to feel pressured, to feel monitored.","She only needed to be at ease being herself.","*","It was Qi Shaobai's first day of school, and he didn't get home from self-study until 8:30 at night.","As soon as he entered, he looked around in confusion at the great changed appearance of the house.","The sofas, curtains, decorations, even the dumbbells and treadmills in the gym, were all plastered with colored sticky notes.","Before he could figure out what was going on, a tennis ball suddenly flew towards him.","The tennis ball bounced off the floor, and he reflexively caught it firmly.","Sheng Mumu came down the stairs from the second floor, smiling radiantly:","“Little Qi, look, this is the exam preparation paradise I've made for you.”","As she spoke, she spread her hands open, with quite the air of someone who had conquered a kingdom.","Qi Shaobai was utterly confused: “...???”","What was going on here?","As Sheng Mumu came down the stairs, she explained to him:","“Starting today, except for the study and bedrooms, I've plastered colored sticky notes all over this villa. The content on them was all personally written by me this afternoon.”","This was a method she had seen on TV before.","It had a bit of a fun English vibe.","She took the tennis ball from Qi Shaobai's hand.","Casually throwing it to the floor, it bounced onto a sticky note on the wall.","The two of them moved closer to look.","It was an example sentence about the past tense.","Sheng Mumu smoothly began to explain it to him.","Her spoken English was fluent and standard.","Together with her clear voice, it was very pleasant to listen to.","But no matter how standard and good she sounded, Qi Shaobai still had an expression of hopeless despair.","He had thought the English tutoring she spoke of was exam-focused.","Just dealing with it casually, churning through papers would be fine.","He didn't expect it to be such an immersive 3D experience.","At that moment, he felt just like Sun Wukong.","He desperately wanted to clutch his head and plead for mercy, to say \"Master, stop reciting.\"","But he didn't dare."]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Help Is Coming","paragraphs":["When Qi Mo got off work and returned home, he hadn't even made it to the living room before he heard Sheng Mumu's voice.","\"No, again, follow me and read it -\"","Walking past the foyer, he saw Sheng Mumu smacking a paper fan on Qi Shaobai's head.","\"You read it wrong, again.\"","Qi Shaobai slowly turned his head, and saw Qi Mo who had just gotten home.","He didn't expect that at seventeen, he would still get hit for not being able to recite words.","He felt both ashamed and helpless, but deep down he knew Sheng Mumu was doing this for his own good and didn't dare to talk back.","However, when he looked at his dad, his eyes unavoidably held a hint of pleading.","Qi Shaobai was very clear that his cold dad wouldn't help him.","But he still stubbornly tried asking:","\"Dad, there's a limited edition Lego set I've wanted to buy but haven't been able to get. Can you ask Assistant Dong to help me find one?\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes narrowed slightly as she clasped Qi Shaobai's head, forcibly turning it back and glaring at him:","\"What's that about? Even if the King of Heaven himself came, you still have to learn these grammar rules today.\"","\"Don't try to change the subject.\"","\"Come on, let me test you again...\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Qi Mo's eyes curved up slightly, but he didn't say anything.","He calmly took off his suit jacket, draped it over his arm, and headed upstairs with light footsteps.","Qi Shaobai took a deep breath and resigned himself to reality.","As expected.","His dad wouldn't take his side.","...","Ten minutes later.","Sheng Mumu finally understood how difficult it was to be a teacher.","Especially when dealing with a student like Qi Shaobai.","She could clearly feel that.","Qi Shaobai didn't lack the ability to learn English well, he was fundamentally opposed to it.","She secretly thought that she needed to find an opportunity to properly talk with Little Qi and get to the bottom of why he was so prejudiced against this subject. Only when he eliminated those feelings from his heart and found motivation could his grades possibly improve.","While Sheng Mumu was pondering this, Qi Shaobai was still holding sticky notes, checking example sentences from the study guide, and forcing this bitter medicine into his head.","His expression was growing more and more pained.","Suddenly, his phone screen lit up.","Seeing the flashing name on the screen, Qi Shaobai's eyes brightened.","The savior had arrived.","He answered the video call.","A familiar voice came through.","\"My little one.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked in confusion, and noticed a rare look of warmth that could be called \"enthusiastic\" appear on Qi Shaobai's usually cold and aloof face.","Qi Shaobai smiled brilliantly at the phone, \"Grandma.\"","Sheng Mumu was taken aback.","Grandma?","Qi Mo's grandma?","Sheng Mumu's gaze subtly shifted towards the screen.","An old lady with white hair appeared on the screen.","\"What are you doing, my little one?\" The old lady asked caringly.","Qi Shaobai angled the phone slightly, intentionally letting the old lady see the study guide on the table, and said:","\"Studying English.\"","The old lady said: \"Oh, good, good. It's a good thing to work hard since you're a high school senior now.\"","Because the camera angle had changed, Sheng Mumu accidentally came into view.","\"Mumu, you're tutoring my little one?\" The old lady was surprised to see Sheng Mumu there, and her smile grew even wider as she asked, \"Where's the big one? Is he home?\"","Qi Shaobai responded, \"Dad's upstairs.\"","Sheng Mumu was startled.","Pfft!","The big one!","She really hadn't imagined that Qi Mo, with his imposing aura, and Qi Shaobai, prickly as a sea urchin, were \"big one\" and \"little one\" in the old lady's eyes.","Who would believe it if she told others?","From the old lady's words, Sheng Mumu sensed that she wanted to see Qi Mo. She instantly switched into an obedient and sensible mode.","Facing the screen, she said: \"Grandma, I'll go get him to come down.\"","She understood very clearly that for a loving couple's act, they had to commit fully, especially in front of the old lady who had matched their marriage. They had to appear seamless.","She went to the bottom of the stairs and called up:","\"Dear, grandma's on the phone.\"","She said it extremely naturally, without any sense of dissonance.","Qi Mo was looking over documents in the study. Hearing the sound, his writing hand suddenly stopped.","And so, Qi Mo the \"big one\" also joined the video call.","With three people squeezed together on the phone screen, it was a bit difficult to all fit in frame.","Qi Shaobai held the phone further away.","Seeing this, Qi Mo very naturally put his arm around Sheng Mumu's shoulders.","He leaned his head in.","He was much taller than her. Sheng Mumu could feel that if she raised her head just a few more centimeters, it would bump his chin.","She was surrounded by his scent.","It smelled especially good.","Qi Mo's eyes curved into a smile, his face taking on a grin as he called towards the screen: \"Grandma.\"","This was a tone Sheng Mumu had never heard before.","Gentle, tender, warm.","Completely different from his usual keep-others-at-a-thousand-miles-away manner.","Seeing the three gathered together, the old lady smiled from ear to ear.","She had previously been worried whether the marriage she arranged was suitable.","Would the big one and Mumu get along harmoniously?","Although Auntie Zhang from the Qi house called her every few days to reassure her, since it wasn't seeing with her own eyes, how could she completely set her mind at ease?","Seeing their little family of three interacting affectionately today, her hanging heart finally settled.","After chatting for a bit, the old lady suddenly asked:","\"Mumu, are they treating you well? Have they bullied you at all? If they bully you, tell grandma and I'll stand up for you.\"","Hearing these words, Sheng Mumu's nose suddenly went sour, and her eyes grew hot.","Although today was the first time she had seen the old lady, she inexplicably felt very familiar with her.","She was reminded of her own grandma.","Bad elders could be malicious in all sorts of bizarre ways.","But good elders were always affectionate in the same way.","Thinking about how in the original book, the old lady only had less than a year left before passing away, she felt stifled and her eyes grew moist.","Taking advantage of bowing her head for a moment, she secretly dabbed at the corners of her eyes to stop the oncoming tide.","When she raised her head again, she put on a smile.","\"Grandma, don't worry. They wouldn't dare bully me. Rather, you have to pay attention to your health. Come to the city sooner, we all want to see you.\"","The old lady said: \"I'm busy recently, so I'll come visit you all later.\"","Qi Mo smiled upon hearing this. \"What are you busy with recently?\"","The old lady proudly lifted her chin.","\"I signed up for a Tai Chi Sword class at the senior university. It's three classes a week. The teacher praised me for learning no slower than the people in their 60s and 70s. When I come to the city, I'll show you some moves.\"","Sheng Mumu gave a chuckle. Her dimples sank in as she enthusiastically responded: \"Great, I'll record it for you then, make it into a photo album with lots of colors and flourishes, and make you the coolest granny at the senior university.\"","The old lady eagerly nodded. \"Good, good!\"","After Qi Shaobai asked the old lady a few more questions, the video call ended amidst a happy and harmonious atmosphere.","The phone screen suddenly went dark.","In the now blackened screen, the reflections of three people appeared.","Sheng Mumu suddenly saw that Qi Mo's reflection was looking at her, his eyes still rippling with laughter.","Her breath hitched.","The atmosphere became a little subtle.","The big hand resting on her shoulder made its presence felt even more."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: Three hundred fast gift package out of thirty thousand momentum","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai was very observant.","Taking advantage of when her father and stepmother were not paying attention, she quietly walked towards her own room.","Yet once again, when she was just about to slip away, she was stopped in her tracks by a cough from Sheng Mumu.","\"Come back, there's still two more, finish reciting them.\"","Qi Shaobai slowly turned her head: .........","Ahhhhh, why was she still caught!","She must have eyes growing on the back of her head!","*","Sheng Mumu was strict with Qi Shaobai, and also did not go easy on herself.","Recently, the flower shop's business was especially good.","The numbers on her bank card had increased several fold.","Making money was addictive, once you start you can't stop.","That day.","When she arrived at the flower shop, a well-dressed young couple happened to be leaving the store.","Cheng Zhuo saw that she had arrived, and greeted loudly:","\"Sister Sheng, you're here, I was just about to call you.\"","Sheng Mumu raised her eyebrows slightly: \"Oh? What's the matter, did something happen?\"","Cheng Zhuo tidied the documents in his hands while explaining:","\"The couple who just left are from Hai City. They saw someone promoting our flower shop online, and specifically flew to the capital to ask if we can be responsible for the floral arrangements and designs for their wedding. Price is not an issue.\"","Finally, he added:","\"I recognized the girl, so I secretly looked her up online. Turns out she's the only daughter of a hotel tycoon in Hai City.\"","Sheng Mumu understood the implied meaning in Cheng Zhuo's words.","For such wealthy families, the guests invited to the wedding were usually local elites.","If they could be responsible for the floral arrangements at their wedding, it was very possible for the \"Yueji\" name to gain traction among Hai City's rich circles.","Sheng Mumu fell silent in thought, and did not respond to Cheng Zhuo.","Expanding the flower shop's business to more cities was something she had always wanted to do.","But for some reason.","Now that an opportunity had presented itself.","She hesitated.","Was this the right thing to do?","Would she be overreaching, and cause undesirable results instead?","\"Let me think about this issue a bit more. How did you respond to them earlier?\" Sheng Mumu asked.","Cheng Zhuo: \"I gave them my business card, and told them I'd get back to them.\"","Sheng Mumu was very satisfied with how he handled it. \"Mm, good.\"","The two exchanged a few more work-related matters briefly, then Sheng Mumu hugged her laptop and found a seat more inside to sit down.","She browsed the various posts on Weibo about Yueji Flower Shop.","With just a casual search, she could find many posts from wealthy madams.","Most were sharing photos of the fresh flowers they received daily.","The comments section was filled with discussions.","Some asked where they bought them, some asked if delivery was available nationwide.","There were also those who complained the prices were too expensive, only people with more money than sense would buy them.","Sheng Mumu's shapely eyebrows knitted slightly as she fell deep in thought.","The initial target customer base for the flower delivery service was the high net-worth population living in wealthy neighborhoods.","But with the influence of the internet, quite a few white-collar workers chasing lifestyle aesthetics had also taken interest in Yueji's flower delivery service.","Sheng Mumu wondered.","Should she take advantage of the momentum and move aggressively - open branch stores while also launching a sub-brand?","After rough consideration.","The \"daily bouquet\" concept of the sub-brand could be changed to \"weekly bouquet\".","And the $388 to $988 price range could be lowered to around $200 per bouquet.","Targeting a wider audience.","Two little people in her heart kept pulling and fighting.","One urging her to take it slow, one telling her entrepreneurship was all about speed.","Branding and corporatization.","It was a threshold for entrepreneurs.","The world was completely different on either side of it.","Once she really decided to do this.","Things would get extremely busy.","It would definitely be beyond what the current few flower shop employees could handle.","Sheng Mumu asked herself in her heart.","Was she prepared and did she have sufficient courage to venture into the unknown?","She spent the entire afternoon pondering the issue of branding the flower shop.","And researched many examples of brand establishment domestically and abroad.","Gradually, of the two little people in her heart, the one yelling \"be brave\" had quietly gained the advantage.","Near closing time, Sheng Mumu gathered the employees for a short meeting.","There was only one topic - giving out bonuses.","The flower shop's income had been considerable recently. Just focusing on Xi Yu Yue Ting, over 20 households in the luxury apartment had subscribed to Yueji's flower delivery service.","Attracted by the reputation, quite a few households in the surrounding high-end neighborhoods had also come to become customers.","A rough calculation showed the income over the past few months had already reached what she envisioned when first starting the business.","Even if she left the Qi family in the future, relying solely on this flower shop, she would have no issues supporting herself.","She gave all the shop employees a raise.","Cheng Zhuo, who handled the most tasks and had the strongest work abilities, received the highest raise.","When they got off work, everyone was elated, continuously praising how great it was to have Sheng Mumu as their boss.","Two days off per week without overtime, timely salary payment with no delays, an approachable boss who won't suddenly call after work hours, and good relations between colleagues.","Sheng Mumu was praised until she felt light as air, laughing as she waved her hands:","\"It's only right, it's only right, this is all just the basics.\"","\"Stop praising me, stop praising me, or I might get arrogant.\"","......","After bidding the staff farewell, Sheng Mumu did not head straight home.","Instead, she drove to a nearby bank.","She decided on the spot to share this joyful news with father and daughter Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai.","She withdrew 20,000 RMB cash from the ATM, then went to a small supermarket next door to buy a red envelope.","Treating it as a formal occasion, she carefully put the cash into the envelope, and borrowed a marker from the supermarket owner to write a few sentences on the back.","This was for Qi Mo.","A mere 20,000 was probably negligible to Qi Mo.","But she thought, for a businessperson, nothing beats a good luck charm.","She used this rationale to conceal her distress over being unable to think of what else to give him.","It was much simpler to prepare a gift for Qi Shaobai.","She thought of it almost instantly.","She drove to a nearby bookstore.","Making a beeline for the \"High School Entrance Exam Essentials\" shelf.","She spent a full 20 minutes picking out 5 sets of English past exam papers for Qi Shaobai.","When checking out, she noticed there were gift wraps and boxes next to the cashier counter.","A hint of mischief flashed in her clear eyes.","She suddenly thought of a way to tease Qi Shaobai a little.","\"Boss, can you wrap these up as a gift for me?\"","The boss looked puzzledly at the thick stack of high school entrance exam test papers, and asked to confirm, \"You mean, wrap up these stacks of paper?\"","\"Mm-hmm, use this gift box,\" Sheng Mumu nodded while pointing to a gift box that looked the most expensive, \"Tie it with a ribbon outside, wrap it carefully please, thanks!\"","Ten minutes later, looking at the exquisitely wrapped gift box in her hands, the corners of Sheng Mumu's eyes curved in satisfaction.","Very good, a $300 gift wrapped to give off a $30,000 vibe.","She placed the gift box and red envelope in the passenger seat, and started heading home.","While waiting at a traffic light near the entrance to Xi Yu Yue Ting and the surrounding high-end neighborhoods.","A familiar figure suddenly appeared up ahead.","Her eyes froze, and she looked closely.","Cheng Zhuo walked towards a black Maybach, chatting on his phone while pulling open the driver's door and driving into that luxury neighborhood.","Sheng Mumu's hands gripped the steering wheel tightly.","Many suspicions that she had suppressed floated back up in her mind.","She recalled running into Cheng Zhuo at the mall when buying ski gear.","At the time, Cheng Zhuo had said - \"No trouble, it's close by.\"","Back then she didn't think much of it, assuming he meant his home was close to the mall.","She didn't expect it to be close to Xi Yu Yue Ting.","This area was prized real estate in the capital, with every inch of land worth its weight in gold.","The only people who could afford houses here were the rich and powerful, and they certainly wouldn't rent their places out.","Driving a luxury car, yet not renting...","Just who was Cheng Zhuo?"]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: You call that... a gift","paragraphs":["\"Our flower shop business is getting better and better. In the spirit of shared prosperity, I've prepared a small gift for you both,\" Sheng Mumu announced as they were finishing up dinner. She took out the gifts she had prepared and presented them to the two handsome men sitting across from her.","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows furrowed slightly, finding the phrase \"shared prosperity\" to be used strangely.","But before he could complain, he saw Sheng Mumu's fair and radiant face light up with a brilliant smile.","She pulled out a gift box from under her chair and solemnly placed it on the table.","Then she fished out a red envelope from her pocket and handed it to her father, saying in a cheerful voice:","\"Here, I didn't know what to get for you. I thought and thought about it, and realized you don't lack anything. So I could only give you this red envelope to bring you good luck and fortune, and let you bask in my joy.\"","Qi Mo's gaze lingered briefly, the corners of his eyes slowly curling up.","His tender eyes fell upon the red envelope, and after a moment's hesitation, he reached out and took it.","His voice hinted at smiles as he said, \"Alright, I'll bask in your joy.\"","In Qi Mo's memory, he had only received red envelopes from his grandmother when he was little during Chinese New Year.","No one had given him money as a gift since he grew up.","Compared to the paintings, wine, and flattery he received from people currying favor in the business world, the red envelope before him, though not very fat, felt especially meaningful.","Running his fingertip along the edge of the red envelope, an unfamiliar sense of warmth and emotion washed over him.","But then his eyes suddenly contracted when he flipped the envelope over. He stared blankly in surprise.","On the back were the words: May all of life's surprises and good fortune flow ceaselessly towards you.","It was signed with a cute little ingot drawn in colored pencil.","Seeing the crooked little ingot, the mature and steady man couldn't help but curl his lips into a smile, his dark eyes brimming unconcealed with mirth.","Sheng Mumu had found this message by searching online for \"inspirational words.\" She immediately felt it was perfect for Qi Mo.","And it was, wasn't it?","Only with all of life's surprises and good fortune flowing towards him could he make money without end.","Only with him getting continuously richer could their family live free from worry and in comfort.","She guessed this would be the kind of blessing he would like.","Sheng Mumu blinked, looking at the man before her with expectation in her eyes, and asked:","\"Do you like it?\"","The man slowly lifted his eyes to meet hers. He looked at her very seriously and spoke at an unhurried pace:","\"I like it very much.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"That's good that you like it.\"","Beside them, Qi Shaobai had been unable to restrain himself for a while now.","Seeing his father receive a red envelope as a gift, he guessed the exquisitely wrapped gift box must be for him.","It looked very formal.","He was wild with joy inside.","The corners of his mouth couldn't help but turn up.","His previously sullen face was no longer sullen at all, as if the words \"Let me open my present\" were written all over his face.","Qi Shaobai gave Sheng Mumu a toothy grin and asked full of anticipation:","\"This is for me, right?\"","The corner's of Sheng Mumu's mouth curled into a meaningful smile.","\"Yes, I picked it out just for you after a long time of consideration.\"","Wow, she took a long time to consider it.","Then it must be a very special gift!","Qi Shaobai couldn't wait to unwrap it.","He carefully pulled at the ribbon tying the gift box closed.","Doing his best not to damage the wrapping paper, he slowly peeled it back bit by bit along the edges.","His gaze was full of concentration.","Sheng Mumu leaned in and whispered, \"I think you'll like it.\"","Qi Shaobai said, \"Of course, I'll definitely rea-\"","He cut himself off mid-sentence, freezing abruptly.","What is this?!","A...stack of test papers?","He whipped his head around to look at Sheng Mumu.","\"Did you pack the wrong thing?\"","Sheng Mumu narrowed her eyes with an impish grin. \"No, this is the custom gift I prepared just for you.\"","Qi Shaobai's expression shifted from delight to grievance in a second. \"You call this...a gift?\"","Sheng Mumu tilted her head and twisted the knife. \"Well...why wouldn't it count as one?\"","Qi Shaobai: ........................","Qi Mo also saw the pile of test papers in the gift box, the corners of his eyes slowly curling up. But when Qi Shaobai shot him an accusing look, he lowered his gaze to hide his smile.","He raised a pale, long-fingered hand to his lips, barely suppressing a cough, and said in a low voice:","\"Hmm, it counts.\"","Qi Shaobai: ........................","How is this any kind of gift???","Were they ganging up to mess with him?","It wasn't April Fool's day today.","Just as he was about to protest further, he realized Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu had already left the dinner table at some point, headed upstairs one after the other.","Qi Shaobai looked at the test papers before him, then at their retreating figures.","He made a silent, exaggerated sighing expression.","The servants hiding their laughter nearby found it amusing.","Upstairs, Sheng Mumu lounged bored on the couch in the sitting area, idly scrolling through her phone.","She hadn't checked the wives' group chat in a long time.","Today she happened to open it and saw some people discussing the gaokao (college entrance exam).","She immediately sat up straight, and started reading their conversation intently.","She had been wanting to bring up this topic with Qi Shaobai.","Several wives in the group had kids in their last year of high school.","Maybe...she could gain some insight from these \"real mothers'\" chat?","However, the more she read, the more uneasy she became.","Eventually her eyebrows knitted tightly together.","The chat started out just discussing which foreign universities they should send their kids to for the best education and resources.","But then the tone gradually changed:","- [Mrs. Chen, which senior did you ask for a recommendation letter when sending your child to Harvard before?]","- [How much donation is appropriate now if you want to send your child to Harvard or Cambridge?]","- [No need to go through so much trouble, just find a famous tutor for the kids to intensively prep their artistic talents for a few months and pull some connections, they can still get into top schools that way.]","- [I can help make introductions if needed.]","Sheng Mumu found it hard to pinpoint what exactly made her feel strange about this chat.","After all, it was common knowledge that some foreign universities granted admission in exchange for donations.","Recommendation letters from prestigious alumni also carried heavy weight for certain schools.","This was all very normal among the upper class.","She turned her head towards Qi Shaobai's bedroom.","Her gaze gradually tightened as she fell deep in thought...","Did Qi Shaobai also take it for granted that he could get into a good university easily without trying hard, and that's why he didn't care about his grades?","She pressed her lips in a tight line, agonizing over it for a long time before finally deciding to knock on Qi Shaobai's door.","The door opened from the inside.","Seeing Sheng Mumu's solemn expression, Qi Shaobai paused briefly in confusion and asked, \"What's up?\"","Sheng Mumu took a light breath and got straight to the point.","\"Do you have time to chat?\""]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: Why do you need a bike when you have money like this","paragraphs":["This was the first time Sheng Mumu had come to Qi Shaobai's bedroom.","The decor was simple, in cool gray tones.","Against the wall was a full display case of sneakers, filled with various limited edition shoes.","The wide array of colorful sneakers softened the overall cold color scheme of the room.","Next to the display case were two shelves full of CDs, and in the corner leaned an acoustic guitar.","Only from these details could you tell this was a teenage boy’s bedroom.","Qi Shaobai gave the chair to Sheng Mumu and sat down on the beanbag chair himself.","Sensing Sheng Mumu's serious demeanor, he sat up straighter than usual, raising his eyebrows quizzically.","\"What did you want to talk about?\"","Sheng Mumu got right to the point, “I was chatting with your homeroom teacher last time. She mentioned that many students in your class are planning to go abroad right after the college entrance exams?”","Qi Shaobai nodded, not quite understanding why she was asking. “Yeah, that’s true.”","Sheng Mumu continued, “Is that what you’re thinking of doing too?”","“Think what? Going abroad?” Qi Shaobai looked puzzled.","He felt that China was good enough, and that you didn't have to go abroad just to be successful.","Just as he was about to answer \"No,\" he heard Sheng Mumu ask again:","\"Have you ever considered having your father use his money to get you a spot at a famous foreign university?\"","\"I've never thought about that. And-\" Qi Shaobai answered without hesitation.","Then he glanced away, shoulders sinking down.","\"And he would never do something like that for me anyway.\"","From elementary to middle to high school.","His father had never donated equipment, libraries, or even school buildings to his schools like other parents.","He would only tell Qi Shaobai: Do your best.","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows furrowed slightly as he used an indifferent expression to hide the sense of loss in his heart.","He didn't want his inner emotions to show.","But at seventeen, he was not yet able to conceal his feelings with ease.","Even if Sheng Mumu had not read the original book and did not know of his sensitive nature, she could still read between the lines of that awkward adolescent face.","Perhaps to every boy, their father was like a great mountain looming before them.","They wanted to look up to it, and also to climb over it.","Qi Mo's personality and life experiences meant he could never give Qi Shaobai the most pure and flawless paternal love, as other parents did.","Over time, Qi Shaobai both longed for his approval, yet resisted wanting to prove himself in his own way.","Sheng Mumu did not want the atmosphere to become too heavy.","She casually grabbed two grape soda cans from the desk.","Tossing one to Qi Shaobai, she lightly said:","\"You're doing very well, little Qi. Very impressive!\"","Qi Shaobai reflexively caught the can with one hand, raising his eyebrows, \"Hm?\"","Sheng Mumu explained, \"Having money and resources is an advantage. But being able to think that you shouldn't use these advantages to squeeze others who may not have your upbringing, that's a very rare mindset.\"","For a rich young master raised in this kind of environment to not be assimilated by it, that was truly commendable.","Qi Shaobai's eyes flashed a hint of light, a faint smile finally appearing on his cool and aloof face.","A little embarrassed by the praise, he changed the subject, \"So does that mean I don't have to study English anymore?\"","\"You wish!\" Sheng Mumu rolled her eyes at him, \"What I mean is, the college exams are important, but not THAT important.\"","Qi Shaobai wondered if he had heard wrong.","Ever since he entered senior year, everyone around him had been telling him how important and life-changing the college exams were, that he must make them his top priority.","Yet she was saying they weren't that important?","Sheng Mumu said, \"More precious than your test scores is your experience this year, the satisfaction from trying your best, and the feeling years later of looking back fondly at your younger self that year. That's what matters.\"","Qi Shaobai's gaze flickered, seeming to understand yet not fully grasping it.","Sheng Mumu paused, then continued gently:","\"I believe as long as you try your best, no matter what scores you get, your dad will be proud of you.\"","Qi Shaobai suddenly looked up, \"Really?\"","Would he really be proud of him?","If the class advisor, butler Zhang, assistant Dong or others had told him this,","he would have just thought it was a ploy to make him study more.","But strangely, coming from Sheng Mumu, it had a convincing power.","Sheng Mumu's expression was firm as she nodded slowly, \"Definitely.\"","Qi Shaobai was silent, eyebrows knitted lightly.","After a long while, they finally relaxed.","His eyes showed a hint of determination.","\"Then I'll try.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Good, try it.\"","Sheng Mumu was always good at encouraging others. She seized the opportunity and continued:","\"Lately there are fewer sticky notes left around the house, you've grasped almost half of them already. See, you definitely can remember them if you want to.\"","The complimented boy's eyes curved up smugly as he leaned back into the beanbag chair.","Revealing his arrogant nature.","Raising his eyebrows disdainfully, \"Of course, who do you think I am?\"","Strangely, upon seeing his arrogant attitude, Sheng Mumu for once didn't feel like mocking him.","She even found it a little cute.","Qi Shaobai rarely made promises.","But when he did make a commitment, he would do his utmost to fulfill it.","He had truly made an effort, seen in:","Taking the initiative to cancel his weekly basketball meetups with Wei Zhaonan.","And having butler Zhang put away all his Legos into the storeroom.","Afterwards he solemnly made a pledge - he would not touch them again until after the college exams.","In the mornings he appeared in the dining room on time without the butler needing to knock on his door.","He would grab a few slices of bread and hurriedly go out the door.","At night after dinner he would bury himself in his room.","The noisy music from his stereo was replaced by the sound of English listening comprehension recordings.","The butler and servants all felt it was freakish.","If not for Sheng Mumu stopping him, the butler really considered getting a mystic master to inspect the young master's body.","To see if he had been possessed.","Yet Qi Mo did not witness any of Qi Shaobai's changes firsthand.","That's right.","The workaholic had gone on another business trip.","This time for a full two weeks.","Sheng Mumu acted as a messenger.","Like a pet shop employee tasked with looking after a boarding puppy.","Every now and then she would send Qi Mo updates on Qi Shaobai's situation.","With pictures and text.","When Qi Shaobai was holding two slices of bread in his mouth, grabbing his schoolbag and accidentally dropping it, trying to hook it with his foot but tripping over it instead, and losing the bread in his mouth.","Sheng Mumu would send Qi Mo:","\"Shocking! Rare early footage of humans domesticating quadrupeds [video]\"","Upon receiving the message, the handsome man's face was full of smiles as he slowly replied:","\"Clickbait.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"You flatter me, how about hiring me as the creative director for the Qi Corporation?\"","When seeing Qi Shaobai's language test paper where he got the whole reading comprehension section wrong.","Sheng Mumu sent: \"Qi Shaobai's test paper which he randomly filled out and got everything wrong looks just like my life - not sure what I'm busy with.\"","Qi Mo replied: \"Hmm...at least you have a sense of humor.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Why thank you.\"","When Qi Shaobai was frustrated from repeatedly getting a difficult word wrong.","Sheng Mumu would send:","\"This brat is always messing up his hair taking advantage of his thick head of hair, should I arrange ginger shampoo for him in advance? Get you a bottle too?\"","Qi Mo replied:","\"Just get it for him, I don't need it.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Better safe than sorry, you might need it in a few years.\"","Qi Mo: \"Thank you.\"","When Qi Shaobai reluctantly put his Legos into the storeroom with a pained expression.","Sheng Mumu jokingly sent: \"Is there a spare key to the storeroom? I could sneak in and assemble all his unfinished Legos, bet he'd blow his top when he finds out! [laughs evilly.jpg]\"","Qi Mo replied: [Hold on.]","Half a minute later, butler Zhang knocked on the bedroom door.","\"Madam, this is the spare key to the storeroom. The master told me to give it to you.\"","Sheng Mumu: ......","She increasingly felt that getting along with Qi Mo was simply delightful.","No matter what nonsense she said, he would always reply.","Never complaining that she talked too much or was boring.","Even when he didn't know how to respond, he would at least send six dots to indicate he saw it.","It was like they were old friends who had known each other for ages.","Sheng Mumu was very touched.","With such a generous sponsor, what more could she ask for!","She just wanted to work for the Qi family forever."]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Rich Woman Tea Party","paragraphs":["That day.","Sheng Mumu had just gotten out of bed when she received an enormous piece of good news.","The lawyer sent her a message:","\"Ms. Sheng, with the retrieved WeChat chat records and bank transfer records, Sheng Lei has a very good chance of winning this lawsuit. If he wins, it's estimated that he would receive repayment and compensation totaling 1,229,436.46 yuan.\"","The lawyer was very professional, maintaining professional rigor amidst confidence. He didn't make any overly optimistic claims.","But when Sheng Mumu saw this string of numbers, she was completely awake, overwhelmed with joy.","She rubbed her eyes and carefully counted again.","She didn't get it wrong - it was over a million.","Awesome.","She didn't expect the accumulated amount to be so much.","Probably enough for three private jet trips.","It really came right when she needed it.","She was just thinking of establishing the Yueji Flower House lifestyle brand, and now money was about to come in.","Too great.","She still hadn't paid back the 2 million she owed Qi Mo, and she really felt bad about writing him another IOU.","That evening when she got off work from the flower shop, she thought about how Qi Mo was away on a business trip and no one was home, and Qi Shaobai had a late self-study session so he wouldn't be back until late. She gave Su Tingran, who was often home alone, a call.","Ten minutes later, the two appeared at the entrance of a popular local Sichuan restaurant with long lines.","While waiting in line for their number to be called, Sheng Mumu told her about her idea of starting a sub-brand.","\"Mumu, you want to start a company?\" After listening to her, Su Tingran asked in surprise.","Sheng Mumu nodded and then shook her head, explaining:","\"Not starting a company, a sub-brand. Yueji currently does online flower delivery business, we already have a company. Starting a sub-brand is like having a child - one parent raising two kids.\"","With this explanation, Su Tingran understood and laughed:","\"Then you'd better hire more nannies, otherwise you'll definitely be overwhelmed.\"","Sheng Mumu sighed, her cheeks puffed out, and she looked at the passing crowd in the mall with melancholy.","\"Yeah, but business partners are not so easy to find.\"","Su Tingran: \"Isn't President Qi ready-made?\"","Sheng Mumu shook her head: \"Him? Forget it.\"","How would he be interested in her little venture?","\"When the brand is successfully established, and becomes nationally renowned where one thinks of Yueji when ordering fresh flowers, maybe then I could seek his investment.\" Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Of course, right now that's still just a dream.\"","She was still tens of thousands of miles away from her envisioned goal.","\"It's not just a dream.\" Su Tingran said, \"I think you can do it.\"","Sheng Mumu was so moved she hugged Su Tingran's arm.","\"Tingran, you're so nice, you really know how to encourage people.\"","The two laughed.","Suddenly, she felt her phone vibrate in her pocket.","Checking it,","it was a message from Qin Jiamu:","\"Little Mumu, are you free tonight? Want to go racing cars?\"","Qin Jiamu was 9 years older than Sheng Mumu. Now 37 years old, because both their names contained \"mu\", Qin Jiamu would address her as \"Little Mumu\" like addressing a younger sister.","Before knowing Qin Jiamu's real age, Sheng Mumu had always guessed she was also a stepmother like herself.","It was only when they met up to go racing cars that they happened to chat about it, and she found out that Qin Jiamu was actually so much older than her.","Sheng Mumu simply couldn't believe it.","Judging only by Qin Jiamu's face and figure, there were no visible signs of age.","What she admired most was that Qin Jiamu was never anxious about her age, but was instead carefree and confident - a beautiful, charming lady whom anyone would like upon interacting with her.","Sheng Mumu's eyes lit up, \"Tingran, are you free later? Want to go racing cars?\"","\"Ah? Racing cars? Video arcade or real cars?\" Su Tingran was confused for a moment, \"Or real cars?\"","\"Pfft~\" Sheng Mumu laughed, \"Of course real cars, it's really fun, come on, let's go together.\"","And so, the hot pot restaurant check-in trip changed on the spot into a rich lady tea party.","After racing four or five laps on the private track, Sheng Mumu was evenly matched with Qin Jiamu.","Su Tingran didn't dare drive, and took turns sitting in the passenger seat, frightened pale and grabbing the handle after just three laps, repeatedly saying \"I'm done\" and going to watch from the sidelines.","In the final lap, Sheng Mumu won by a slight edge.","According to their prior agreement, the loser Qin Jiamu would treat them to dessert.","As Sheng Mumu drank avocado yogurt, she told Qin Jiamu about her entrepreneurial troubles.","Unexpectedly, as soon as Qin Jiamu heard, she became interested at once, \"I'm a ready-made partner right here.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes widened: \"Really?\"","The two chatted for over an hour, ordering wave after wave of desserts.","The more they talked, the more starting a sub-brand seemed promising.","By the end, they were almost ready to sign a contract on the spot.","Listening on the side, although Su Tingran didn't understand, she was also caught up in the excitement:","\"Mumu, Sis Jiamu, you two are so amazing. I used to think the business world was a battlefield for men, but now that notion is completely gone. Turns out women can also have grand aspirations, and don't have to be confined to household affairs all day.\"","The two Mus smiled at her.","Su Tingran thought of herself, and her expression faltered for a moment, a hint of inferiority surfacing in her heart.","Looking at them, then back at herself, she felt that just dealing with household chores and trivial matters every day was really shameful.","Sheng Mumu keenly sensed Su Tingran's discomfort, and gently smiled:","\"Who says doing business is grand aspirations, and taking care of family is just household affairs?\"","Su Tingran looked up at her blankly.","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Women who devote themselves to taking care of their family and educating their children are no less than career women. They have gentle feminine power, tolerance, and wisdom that others cannot match.\"","Su Tingran was quite moved to hear their words - she had never thought that the things she did every day were just as amazing in Sheng Mumu's eyes as pursuing a career.","The hint of inferiority had already vanished without a trace.","Transforming into endless energy, brewing in her heart.","\"We should all work hard, regardless of what path we choose.\"","\"Mm!\"","\"Mmhmm!\""]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Qi always miss you on a business trip","paragraphs":["It was around 9 pm.","Qin Jiamu received a call from her husband, saying that he was coming to pick her up.","Ten minutes later, Sheng Mumu and Su Tingran saw Qin Jiamu's husband.","He had thick eyebrows, somewhat dark complexion, wearing a well-tailored suit, and looked like a refined gentleman.","Seeing Qin Jiamu, he immediately smiled and naturally held her hand.","Qin Jiamu rarely showed a shy expression, smiling at her husband.","Her husband knew she was shy in front of her friends, but still did not let go of her hand, smiling and greeting Sheng Mumu and Su Tingran.","Seeing that Sheng Mumu and Su Tingran were two girls, he politely asked if they needed a ride home.","Qin Jiamu also asked, \"Shall we go together?\"","At this moment, Qin Jiamu's phone rang.","After speaking for a few sentences, she hung up and turned to her husband,","\"Our little ancestor is at the bookstore, let's pick her up on the way home.\"","Her husband gently smiled, \"Okay.\"","The two women who had inadvertently become light bulbs smiled at each other and declined their kindness, \"You two go ahead, it's still early and there's nothing unsafe.\"","Qin Jiamu: \"Alright, be careful on the road.\"","Sheng Mumu gave an \"ok\" gesture and walked to the parking lot hand in hand with Su Tingran.","On the other side.","Assistant Dong was tidying up the project files he had just shown Qi Mo.","Out of the corner of his eye, he saw his boss pick up his phone again.","From his observation, this was already the seventh time the boss had picked up and put down his phone today.","Assistant Dong scratched his head in puzzlement.","Qi Mo sat lazily in his chair.","The screen's faint light was reflected on his sculpted face.","His long, slender fingers were slightly bent, tapping lightly.","The last message in the WeChat dialog box showed the time as this morning.","Now, it was 9:17 pm.","During this business trip, he had received several messages from her almost every day.","But today was very unusual.","The man's brow furrowed slightly.","Not far away, Assistant Dong secretly glanced up to observe his boss.","He was confused again.","Even when facing projects worth billions, he had never seen such a complex expression on Chairman Qi's face.","Could there be a mistake in the documents he had prepared?","Assistant Dong stiffened.","He took out the files he had just sorted and archived.","Planning to check them word for word from beginning to end again.","Five minutes later.","Qi Mo lit up his phone again.","He switched the mode from 5G to WiFi, then back to 5G.","The WeChat page was still empty.","There was a desk lamp on the desk.","The warm light outlined the man's cold, hard contours.","His jawline gradually tensed.","Finally, he typed a few words into the chat box and pressed send.","Soon.","His finger hovered over the screen and stopped.","When he put it down, the words he had just typed were deleted together.","Forget it.","This was not like him at all.","On the way back, Sheng Mumu drove very slowly.","The air conditioning was off, letting the night breeze blow in.","The air had a warm woody scent.","Upbeat rock music was playing in the car.","Following the rhythm, Sheng Mumu's slender fingers tapped on the steering wheel.","It was so pleasant.","Just as they were about to reach the chorus, the music suddenly stopped.","Puzzled, she looked over.","She saw the words \"Husband\" suddenly pop up on the central control screen.","Her phone was connected to the car's Bluetooth, and Qi Mo's low, magnetic voice came directly through the speakers.","Carried by the summer breeze, it echoed in the car.","\"Hi, Mumu.\"","Sheng Mumu was in a good mood. Her tone was upbeat as she responded with a smile, \"Hi~\"","On the other end of the phone, Qi Mo's clenched fist slowly relaxed inch by inch.","\"Are you home?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"I'm on my way back. I just went out with Tingran. We're driving with the windows down listening to music. Your call came in while I was jamming out, hubby~. What's up, is something wrong?\"","In her heart, Sheng Mumu was actually a little worried.","After all, there was someone else in the car with her.","What if... Qi Mo brought up their arranged marriage? How awkward would that be?","But she had already said half of what she wanted to say. Hanging up now would seem too deliberate.","She could only subtly remind him by deliberately emphasizing \"hubby\" at the end.","She hoped the clever man on the other end would understand.","Qi Mo paused before relaxing his fingers silently and tightening them again unseen.","Although he understood why she said those two words, he still couldn't help curving his lips.","His voice was even lower and gentler than before: \"Nothing's wrong.\"","Sheng Mumu frowned in confusion and blurted out, \"Then why did you call for no reason?\"","Such a blunt question not only made the person on the other end fall silent for a few seconds.","Even Su Tingran next to her stiffened and glanced over.","The next second.","Qi Mo's voice came through again.","\"I left a file at home. Can you check my study when you get back?\"","\"Okay, I'll call you when I get home.\" Without thinking too much, Sheng Mumu readily agreed.","After hanging up, the music resumed playing.","But Sheng Mumu could no longer continue the upbeat mood from earlier. She turned to Su Tingran and grumbled:","\"Men are just forgetful.\"","Su Tingran: \"...\"","Su Tingran: \"Mumu, can't you tell Chairman Qi just missed you while he's away on his business trip, so he called to chat with you?\"","\"Huh?\" Sheng Mumu's eyes widened as she blinked.","How could that be? He was clearly the type who never had enough hours in a day.","Would he really be bored enough to call her just to chat?","Impossible.","But she couldn't say that out loud.","The loving couple act must go on.","\"How could that be...\" Sheng Mumu drew out her words, putting on an experienced expression, \"How could I not realize that?\"","At that time.","Having heard his boss's entire conversation, Assistant Dong had fallen into deep self-doubt.","He clearly remembered double and triple checking everything.","The documents needed for this cooperation project should have all been prepared, right?","Which file could he have missed?","When Sheng Mumu got back to the villa, she took the slippers handed to her by a servant.","Hearing leisurely footsteps outside, she turned her head to see Qi Shaobai walking in, holding a bag.","Sheng Mumu casually asked while changing into her slippers,","\"Did your evening self-study session end late today?\"","She assumed Qi Shaobai had come home much earlier.","Qi Shaobai put his bag on a nearby chair and took the slippers handed to him by the servant, answering:","\"Yeah, I stopped by the bookstore after school and bought some books.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Oh.\"","After the brief exchange, they each went about their business.","Qi Shaobai took his newly purchased books and buried himself in his room, reading late into the night.","Sheng Mumu went to the door of Qi Mo's study.","After calling Qi Mo, she held the phone to her ear.","Soon, the ringing stopped and Qi Mo's low, intoxicating voice came through:","\"Hi, are you home?\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned and took a light breath.","His voice made her melt.","Even though she had heard it so many times already.","It could still catch her off guard.","Sheng Mumu wrinkled her brows and thought resentfully: What a demon.","No wonder so many famous ladies and daughters of rich families secretly admired him.","If you're going to blame someone, blame him for unconsciously being so charming.","Sheng Mumu leaned against the study door and got back to the point:","\"Yeah, I'm at the door of your study. Where did you say you left that file?\"","As she spoke, she pressed down the door handle and the door opened.","Sensing someone had entered, the lights came on automatically.","Sheng Mumu froze."]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: She Believes in a Ghost","paragraphs":["Earlier, she had never been to Qi Mo's study before.","In just a few days, she had unlocked two new locations in succession.","Qi Shaobai's bedroom and Qi Mo's study.","In her imagination, a study should only be a few dozen square meters, with a desk and a few bookshelves.","She didn't expect Qi Mo's study to be so extravagant.","At least one hundred and fifty square meters.","To be honest, with this area, it was a bit too modest to still call it a \"study\".","The room was spotless, and everything was arranged very neatly.","Behind the desk was a whole wall of bookshelves extending down from the high ceiling.","Across from the desk was a tea table, unlike the tea house outside, there was only one chair next to the tea table.","Facing the door was a floor-to-ceiling window with an open view. There was a small cushion next to the window,","with a half-read book on it, a bronze bookmark peeking out from between the pages.","The moon was bright and the stars were sparse, moonlight streamed in through the floor-to-ceiling window.","Sheng Mumu felt as if she could imagine Qi Mo sitting there with his eyes closed in contemplation, or turning the pages of a book.","The study gave off the same feeling as Qi Mo's temperament.","Straightforward and efficient.","Rather than calling it a study.","It was more like his personal domain.","Under Qi Mo's guidance, Sheng Mumu found three safes.","Standing in front of one of the safes, she pressed her lips together tightly.","Suddenly feeling a little nervous.","The president's safe.","What would be inside?","Curiosity and nervousness in hand, she entered the password and pulled open the safe door.","Inside there wasn't the bundles of cash or piles of gold bars she had imagined.","Divided into two layers, the top was some documents and contracts.","The bottom, small books like property deeds, were stacked neatly.","Sheng Mumu's breathing slowed, and she silently estimated.","At first glance, at least fifty or sixty books.","Sheng Mumu: ......","This man, he's too rich!","There were three safes of the same size in the study.","As the old saying goes, crafty rabbits have three burrows.","Moreover, Sheng Mumu believed that the places where Qi Mo kept his assets were definitely not limited to these three safes in front of her.","Thinking of this, her hand trembled involuntarily.","Not having seen much of the world, she was timid.","Fortunately her tone was still calm, she asked, \"What do the documents you mentioned look like?\"","Qi Mo patiently described them, and Sheng Mumu quickly found the document.","When she closed the safe door, a familiar piece of paper caught her attention.","That piece of paper with the little cherry blossom pattern stood out conspicuously among the contract documents and property deeds.","Uh......","She was dumbfounded.","Wasn't that the loan agreement she had randomly found a template for online and handwritten before?","She felt a little ashamed.","She really didn't expect that the agreement she had casually found a template for online and transcribed would be placed together with a pile of valuable contracts and property deeds.","If she had known,","she should have used better quality paper.","She should have signed it more carefully too.","Sheng Mumu awkwardly laughed and said to the earpiece,","\"Why did you put my agreement here? My agreement is of what level, and your documents are of what level, I'm embarrassed.\"","Low, pleasant laughter came from the earpiece.","The slightly vibrating frequency was like a feather tickling her ear.","\"This agreement is very important. You still have it, right?\"","Sheng Mumu paused, \"Of course I do.\"","She really didn't believe Qi Mo would think a 2 million yuan agreement was important.","A man's mouth, lies like a devil.","She didn't believe him one bit.","Qi Mo: \"That's good.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"President Qi, you're not asking this because you're afraid I'll break the agreement and run away, right? To be honest, now that I know the password to your safe, if I did run away, I'd take more with me.\"","It was obviously a joke, and they both laughed.","After a long time, Qi Mo stopped laughing, and solemnly responded in a low voice:","\"Breaking in is fine, but don't even think about leaving.\"","Sheng Mumu only took it as the man's sense of humor, and said,","\"I know, I know, even if I wanted to run away I wouldn't be able to.\"","Until she fell asleep that night.","She was still thinking about Qi Mo's words.","What exactly did \"Breaking in is fine, but don't even think about leaving\" mean?","Could it be...","A dark poke reminding her that the repayment date was approaching?","At this time, she was planning to establish a sub-brand.","There were many places that needed money for this critical juncture.","Besides, it wasn't the agreed time yet.","There was no way around it.","She'd have to earnestly talk it over with Qi Mo when the time came.","And ask him to extend the time again.","She turned over under the quilt.","No, that wasn't the right attitude to ask someone for something.","She should at least treat him to a meal right?","She looked at the time.","10:48 pm","Estimating that Qi Mo was usually still awake at home at this time,","Sheng Mumu sent him a WeChat message:","\"I want to treat you to a meal when you get back, do you have time? [bouncing puppy.jpg]\"","He immediately replied:","\"Ok, what time?\"","After Sheng Mumu set a time, she also sent a message to Su Tingran.","She must know which restaurant in the capital would be suitable for entertaining.","As usual, Su Tingran asked, \"What's the nature of the dinner, business?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"No, just me and Old Qi, just a casual meal.\"","Su Tingran: \"Ok!\"","Su Tingran immediately understood, and recommended the restaurant she had been keeping in her favorites folder, planning to go check it out with her husband after he returned.","*","Sheng Lei received a call from a lawyer.","Informing him that the court had frozen his accounts through judicial procedures, and was returning the assets to compensate Sheng Mumu.","Bang—","\"Piss off!\" Sheng Lei, reeking of alcohol, yelled into the phone.","He threw his glass at the TV that was playing news footage.","Glass fragments went flying everywhere.","The TV flickered a few times then continued playing.","Cursing, he got up from the sofa barefoot, wanting to go to the door to get his bag and check how much cash he had left.","Dizzy from the drunkenness, he fell over on the ground.","The glass shards sunk into his palm, the piercing pain sobering him up halfway.","The more he thought about it, the more furious he became.","Why?","They were both surnamed Sheng.","Now she, Sheng Mumu, was living a rich and luxurious life in mansions, while he was reduced to such circumstances.","Why!","If his parents were still alive.","They would surely protect him, give him anything he wanted.","Just then, the phone rang.","It was his investment advisor calling to ask why all the money in his investment accounts had been forcibly transferred out.","He didn't respond, just hanging up the phone.","Now, he had nothing left.","Only the house his parents had left for him in his hometown.","Would he have to slink away from the capital in shame?","The TV was broadcasting financial news.","Reporting that Qi Enterprise and a leading Singapore company had reached a long-term cooperative intention, and today the president of Qi Enterprise and the other party had signed a letter of intent.","Hearing the two words \"Qi Enterprise\".","Sheng Lei suddenly looked up, his expression becoming fierce.","In the picture, the man in an exquisite suit was shaking hands with someone, a faint smile at the corners of his mouth.","Loftily overlooking all, gaze aloof.","Annoyingly lofty!","Sheng Lei could no longer restrain his anger and jealousy, picking up the ashtray and smashing it at the TV.","With two crisp cracking sounds, the screen went dark.","It was also in this moment that a crafty gleam flashed across his bloodshot eyes.","Qi Mo wasn't in the capital?","Sheng Lei rolled over to pick up his phone from the floor, heedless of the stinging pain in his palm.","He immediately started flipping through the message he had seen earlier that morning.","After flipping for a long time.","His eyes narrowed deeply, and a sinister smile appeared on his face. That was it.","Yueji Flower House.","That was the name.","That morning he had seen someone's video tour promoting this shop, and Sheng Mumu had appeared on camera as the boss.","He clenched his phone tightly, squeezing out a sentence from between gritted teeth:","\"If I can't have a good life, don't expect to have one either!\""]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Flower Shop Smashed","paragraphs":["The next morning.","Sheng Mumu seized the opportunity to talk on the phone with Qin Jiamu for several hours while the iron was hot.","The final result was that Qin Jiamu bought a 20% stake in Yueji Flower Shop.","Qin Jiamu served as creative director at the advertising company she co-founded with her husband.","In recent years, as the company developed better and better, her subordinates were gradually able to work independently.","In her family life, her husband treated her well and her daughter was obedient and sensible.","In her career, she hardly needed to get involved anymore, as many things were already handled in an orderly manner.","It was precisely because of this that she often felt her life was boring and meaningless, having lost her purpose.","Joining Yueji could be said to have rekindled the fire in Qin Jiamu's heart that had not yet gone out.","Not only was it a professional fit that could satisfy her regret of being unable to expend her energy,","she was also fortunately able to have a like-minded friend as her partner.","There was no reason not to invest.","The cooperation was basically settled, and Sheng Mumu was also in a very good mood.","In the afternoon when she came to the flower shop, she immediately dived into the storeroom, busy taking stock of the packaging materials and calling suppliers to have them send over some new packaging materials to prepare for the young customer base they would soon be facing.","While busy, she suddenly heard the sound of shattering glass from outside.","The sound was very close, and her heart sank sharply.","She immediately put down what was in her hands and walked outside.","Her footsteps gradually quickened.","Out of the storeroom, she saw several shop assistants with panic-stricken faces, all looking in the same direction.","Following their gaze, Sheng Mumu suddenly froze on the spot.","In front of her was a mess.","There was a huge gaping hole in the glass outer wall of the flower shop.","Shattered glass was scattered all over the floor.","Flower pots were overturned, soil and foliage tangled together.","And the perpetrator of all this - Sheng Lei, was holding a stainless steel folding stool, madly pounding the glass wall.","After a few more loud shattering sounds, Sheng Lei swung the stool out as if venting his anger.","Panting, he looked around, and his eyes met Sheng Mumu's.","His eyes suddenly narrowed.","He had found his target.","His chest heaved faster as he pointed at Sheng Mumu and shouted:","\"All my money is gone, are you satisfied?\"","\"I have nothing left now, I can only go back to my hometown, are you happy!\"","\"It's all because of you, you broom star.\" He walked into the flower shop, grabbed a chair off the ground, and approached Sheng Mumu, \"I'm going to teach you a good lesson on behalf of my dead parents, you unfilial daughter!\"","It all happened too fast for Sheng Mumu to react.","There was chaos all around.","Beside her were the shop assistants shouting loudly for help.","There was the smell of earth in the air.","Before her, Sheng Lei was about to smash down the chair he held high.","In that flash, a figure rushed towards Sheng Lei quickly.","Cheng Zhuo reached out and grabbed the chair leg.","He gritted his teeth and pushed hard.","He held back the already crazed Sheng Lei, forcing Sheng Lei back with his strength.","Almost at the same time.","Several burly men rushed in and instantly pinned Sheng Lei to the ground, his face pressed tightly against the floor.","Sheng Mumu's eyes widened in shock, feeling as if her heart was about to jump out of her chest.","If it had been just a little later, just a tiny bit later.","The chair would have smashed down.","The bodyguards held Sheng Lei on the ground and rained blows on him, fists falling like rain.","Sheng Lei had completely lost his mind, cursing incessantly:","\"You're just a money losing bastard!\"","\"What have you done for the Sheng family after dad and mom raised you to adulthood?\"","Seeing this, the bodyguards randomly grabbed a handful of dirt from the ground and stuffed it in his mouth.","The curses gradually weakened but did not stop.","\"Sister Sheng, are you okay?\"","Cheng Zhuo's voice brought Sheng Mumu back to her senses.","She nodded blankly.","\"I'm fine.\"","Her gaze dropped down and suddenly tightened as she caught sight of Cheng Zhuo's hand stabbed into the splinters on the wooden chair.","\"Your hand!\"","Cheng Zhuo hid his hand behind his back, acting as if it was no big deal, and slowly said: \"It's nothing.\"","\"You say it's nothing when it's bleeding.\" Sheng Mumu frowned.","She quickly found a first aid kit and bandaged Cheng Zhuo's wound.","A few minutes later, the police arrived at the scene.","Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo went with the police to the police station to assist in understanding the situation.","While recounting to the police, Sheng Mumu's thoughts were very chaotic the whole time.","It took her several rings to hear her cell phone ringing in her pocket.","Qi Mo got the news from the bodyguards and called her at the first opportunity.","Although the bodyguards had repeatedly assured him that Madam was not hurt at all.","He still interrupted his work to call her.","He had to hear it with his own ears before he could feel at ease.","Halfway through the call, beeping sounds came from the earpiece as a new call came in.","\"I'm really fine. Thanks to the bodyguards you sent, and Cheng Zhuo, just now. I didn't even break my skin. Wait, there's an incoming call.\" Sheng Mumu held the phone away to take a look. \"It's Qi Shaobai. I'll hang up first and talk to you when you get back.\"","Qi Mo still wanted to say something, but the earpiece was already filled with the busy tone.","This was the first time the aloof, formidable man had encountered having the phone hung up on him.","A trace of anomalies flashed through his dark pupils.","But he was very clear that the inexplicable emotions roiling in his heart now were not anger.","The call switched to Qi Shaobai's line.","Before Sheng Mumu could speak, the teenager on the other end couldn't wait to ask:","\"Was it your brother again? Damn is he sick or something.\"","Dad wasn't in Beijing, so Qi Shaobai felt he should fulfill the duties of the only man in the house.","He continued to ask:","\"Is he still at the police station? Let me ask the head teacher for leave and come over.\"","Sheng Mumu felt somewhat warmed but also helpless, and gently spoke as if coaxing a child:","\"No need, I'm completely fine, you should go to class.\"","She really felt it was no big deal.","At most, she was startled by the sudden situation, but had already calmed down.","Now her mind was full of how to clean up the mess at the flower shop.","That had always been her personality.","Unwilling to dwell too much on things that had already happened.","Rather than sinking deep into negative emotions, she preferred to consider solutions to the problem as soon as possible.","Maximizing the reduction of losses.","Today Sheng Lei had come to make trouble, perhaps this bad thing could be turned into something good.","Just this morning she had been considering whether to expand the scale of the shop and renovate when establishing the flower shop's sub-brand.","Now, the problem was solved.","Out with the old, in with the new.","Sheng Lei had directly made the decision for her.","Hearing her tone calm and composed, not at all like someone who had just gone through danger, Qi Shaobai couldn't help feeling puzzled.","\"How come you sound like you're in a pretty good mood?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Of course I'm happy. Someone else paid for the shop renovation. Wouldn't you be happy if you were me?\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned for a moment before squeezing out: \"...Huh?\""]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: One Heaven, One Earth","paragraphs":["Sheng Lei was detained by the police on charges of intentional destruction of property and provoking trouble.","After the incident, Sheng Mumu called a lawyer to explain the situation. The lawyer was on the way.","The lawyer told her on the phone that she could also charge Sheng Lei with intentional injury. According to the sentencing, he might be sentenced to fixed-term imprisonment of less than three years.","Sheng Mumu admired the lawyer's professionalism and efficiency again, and left the police station with peace of mind.","When she returned to the flower shop, Sheng Mumu was surprised to find that none of the employees had left. They took the initiative to stay and clean up the messy scene.","Putting oneself in another's position, everyone had been frightened to some extent today.","She couldn't bear to let everyone deal with this mess that was not originally part of their job because of Sheng Lei.","She stopped everyone's work and let them go home first.","She would hire a professional cleaning company to come and clean up the remaining mess.","Cheng Zhuo insisted on staying with her to wait for the cleaning company's people to come.","Sheng Mumu rejected him several times to no avail, so she had to let him stay here with her.","When there were only the two of them left in the flower shop, Cheng Zhuo picked up a chair, patted off the dust on it, moved it next to Sheng Mumu, and motioned for her to sit down.","Then, he found two cans of drinks from somewhere and handed one to her.","\"Ms. Sheng, here you go.\"","Sheng Mumu took it and smiled gently, \"Cheng Zhuo, thank you for today.\"","Cheng Zhuo opened the pull tab of the can, with a natural and casual expression,","\"Pfft, I should do that. Protecting the boss's safety is also part of my job.\"","After speaking, he laughed heartily and took a sip of the drink.","Sheng Mumu held the can without drinking it, her brows slightly furrowed as she looked at Cheng Zhuo's profile.","A thin layer of water droplets condensed on the outer layer of the can, sliding down her fair and slender fingers to her wrist.","It dripped down.","The sunny and cheerful Cheng Zhuo in front of her overlapped with the image of Cheng Zhuo sitting in the driver's seat of the Maybach in her mind a few days ago.","Sheng Mumu's fingers curled slightly as she smiled faintly without saying anything else.","She knew this man had many secrets.","Perhaps his purpose for coming to Yueji Flower Shop was not simple either.","But when she thought of how he had stopped Sheng Lei at all costs even with blood dripping from his palm just now.","Sheng Mumu decided not to ask about it.","She was certain.","He had no malice.","With a \"hiss\", Sheng Mumu pulled open the tab of the can and drank from it indifferently.","Cheng Zhuo's gaze shifted sideways, glancing at her from the corner of his eye.","Her nose was straight and delicate.","When she was not smiling, her eyebrows were gentle yet faintly heroic.","When she smiled, they curved into two small arcs.","She resembled her so much.","It was so similar.","Cheng Zhuo's thoughts wandered off without realizing Sheng Mumu had already put down her drink and looked over.","\"What are you daydreaming about?\" Sheng Mumu smiled gently, her eyes curved, \"You don't have to keep me company actually, the cleaning company's people will arrive soon.\"","Cheng Zhuo's lips moved a few times before he couldn't help but ask,","\"Ms. Sheng, was that man your own brother today?\"","Sheng Mumu didn't expect Cheng Zhuo to ask this suddenly.","She didn't know how to answer for a moment.","Sheng Lei and her had the same surname Sheng. There was no reason they didn't have the same mother, right?","But if she said they had the same mother.","Why was there such a heavy bias towards men over women?","Was it possible that the original owner was adopted from a relative's family?","Before she could rule out any possibilities, she did not give an accurate answer, using a counter-question to steer the topic away.","Her brow quirked slightly, her gaze clear, \"What? You think I don't look like his family?\"","\"You don't look alike. Your appearances are different, and so are your personalities.\" Cheng Zhuo answered very decisively. \"One is heaven, the other underground.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes smiled at his words, dimples sinking in, \"You're quite good at complimenting people.\"","Seeing her smile, Cheng Zhuo also smiled.","His eyes were bright and focused, with two shallow dimples.","If it wasn't for his resume clearly stating his age as twenty-seven.","Just looking at his appearance, one would mistakenly think he had just graduated from university, with the stubborn immaturity not completely faded away yet.","Cheng Zhuo leaned his elbows casually on the chair arms, and asked again,","\"By the way Ms. Sheng, did you grow up in Jing City since you were little?\"","Sheng Mumu knew how to answer this one.","She had briefly investigated the original owner's experiences before.","When she was little, she had lived in a small city in the south with her parents and brother.","After graduating from university, she went to work in Guang City.","It was also there that she happened to come across old Mrs. Qi who had fallen into a coma, and sent the old lady to the hospital, catching the best time window for emergency treatment.","Later, under the matchmaking of the old lady, she got to know Qi Mo, chased him to Jing City, and got married per agreement.","\"I didn't grow up in Jing City.\" Sheng Mumu replied.","Cheng Zhuo's eyes flashed imperceptibly. He leaned forward in his seat, no longer sitting casually and lazily. \"Then—\"","He had just uttered one word when four or five people from the cleaning company entered the flower shop one after another.","Sheng Mumu went to greet them, telling them which areas needed cleaning and where they should be careful when scrubbing.","Cheng Zhuo's lips tightened.","He held back the words that had reached his throat.","Never mind.","No hurry.","He could ask again next time there was a chance.","He took a deep breath and got up to help.","*","The news that Yueji Flower Shop was smashed spread quickly among the ladies.","Where there are people, there is society.","In the small community of rich ladies in Xiyu Yueting,","someone had recorded a video when passing by during the incident and posted it in the group chat.","-【Mrs. Qi, why did that person suddenly smash your flower shop for no reason?】","-【He must be a madman, right?】","-【Oh, this person looks so familiar. I've seen him at the entrance several times when entering the estate recently.】","-【Ah! Now that you mention it, how scary. Could he be a habitual offender? @Property Manager, please be sure to strengthen security.】","-【Yes, yes. Although Yueji Flower Shop is some distance away from the villa area, who knows if this madman might break in someday.】","To reassure everyone, Sheng Mumu replied: 【Everyone can rest assured. He has been detained by the police and won't be released for a very long time.】","-【That's good then. Mrs. Qi, you're alright, aren't you?】","-【Didn't you see the video? The handsome shop manager at the flower shop resolved the situation in time. I've rewatched that scene many times. Covering mouth laughing emoji】","-【Finally found someone who's on the same page as me, haha. This young man is really great. I've gone to the shop several times for afternoon tea just to feast my eyes.】","-【I didn't see it though. I only saw a group of bodyguards rushing out and pinning down that madman. 】","-【Mrs. Qi is indeed thoughtful to have bodyguards by her side. Otherwise who knows what danger she might have encountered.】","-【It's fine if it's someone just after money. Just give them money and get it over with. But there's no solution when encountering psychopaths like this who smash things in madness.】","Everyone chatted leisurely.","Suddenly, a sentence appeared in the group chat that instantly silenced the lively ladies' group.","A person with the nickname 【l】 sent out a sensational message.","-【I happened to pass by at that time and heard that madman say Mrs. Qi was his sister.】","Like thunder from a clear sky, for nearly half a minute, no one in the group replied a single word.","It was as if everyone was digesting this sentence on their own.","Right after, messages poured in like tidal waves.","-【?????】","-【You must have misheard. How could that be possible for Mrs. Qi's brother?】","-【If he's her brother, why would he smash his sister's shop?】","-【Are they blood-related siblings?】","The messages on the screen scrolled quickly.","The ladies in the group seemed to be waiting for Sheng Mumu to come out and clarify things.","Or they were looking forward to [l] providing more convincing evidence to corroborate her words.","Sheng Mumu tightened her grip on her phone and was silent for a few seconds before heaving a long sigh.","She replied:","-【That's right. He is indeed my brother.】","Since someone had already seen and heard it, it was better to tell the truth straightforwardly than try to cover it up deliberately. Moreover.","From any perspective.","The shameful one was Sheng Lei.","Sheng Mumu should not have felt ashamed about this to begin with.","At that time.","In a certain villa in Xiyu Yueting,","someone clenched their palm tightly, eyes fixed firmly on Sheng Mumu's words, a cold glint in them."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Mother-in-law Is Coming","paragraphs":["The discussion sounds from the ladies' chat group gradually diminished as Sheng Mumu calmly responded.","In many cases, people's attitude towards gossip is just like this - the more candidly the person involved faces it, the less interest onlookers have in discussing it.","Sheng Mumu didn't bother anymore about who exactly that '[l]' was in the group.","Perhaps the person really just happened to pass by and overhear it.","One week later, over 100,000 yuan was suddenly transferred to Sheng Mumu's bank account.","Soon after, the lawyer called to explain the situation to her:","\"Ms. Sheng, this is the defendant's repayment of previous arrears, and compensation for the flower shop attack. We expect a conclusion within a week.\"","Sheng Mumu was puzzled: \"He still has money to compensate?\"","The lawyer spoke proudly:","\"I found that the defendant still owns a property in his hometown. If he refuses to pay compensation, the court has the right to forcibly auction the property for compensation.\"","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu suddenly remembered that Sheng Lei had indeed said in person at the time that he had no choice but to return to his hometown.","It seems that after he gets out of jail, he won't even be able to return home.","Sheng Mumu had considered whether doing this was too harsh on Sheng Lei.","But that thought flashed by very quickly.","If it wasn't for him constantly causing trouble and pressing her step by step, things wouldn't have reached this point.","For people like him, simple verbal warnings without him paying anything substantial, he would never understand the golden rule of 'do not impose on others what you do not want for yourself'.","If he really could realize his mistake, the money left from selling the property after he gets out, would be enough for him to start over.","Thinking of this, Sheng Mumu strangled the last shred of sympathy in her heart.","She completely stood for herself, and also for the original owner, drawing a clear line between them and her vampire-like brother.","After hanging up the phone, Sheng Mumu simply ate lunch then went out.","She and Qin Jiamu had agreed to go look at houses together with a real estate agent.","They planned to rent a reasonably priced office in the CBD area for their future office location.","The journey towards turning the Yuyi brand into a proper business was officially underway.","When going out, she happened to run into Zhang Ma, the housekeeper who had the day off today. Zhang Ma had made plans with a few of her old lady friends to go shopping.","Sheng Mumu chatted with Zhang Ma for a bit, and found out that their destinations happened to be along the same route, so she offered to give Zhang Ma a ride.","\"Madam, this...this is too irregular.\" Zhang Ma declined again and again.","Sheng Mumu pressed the car key fob, and her white Lamborghini let out two \"beep beep\" sounds. She smiled and asked, \"Zhang Ma, are there any Qi family rules against catching a ride when it's convenient?\"","Zhang Ma was taken aback.","Uh...there were none.","Although there were no rules against it, it still didn't seem right. Zhang Ma declined again:","\"Madam, I'm just a servant in the household, while you are the mistress of the house...\"","\"It's 2023, Zhang Ma. No more of this master and servant separation. Besides, today is your day off,\" Sheng Mumu smiled and interrupted Zhang Ma, pushing her shoulder towards the passenger seat. \"Let's go, Zhang Ma. You sit in the front.\"","Seeing that she couldn't refuse, Zhang Ma carefully and cautiously sat down in the luxury car's leather seat.","Only when the vehicle drove out of the villa's front gate, and soothing music came on in the cabin, did Zhang Ma finally completely relax.","The car took a turn around the man-made lake in the villa district, driving down a straight road.","Suddenly, a long-haired woman rushed out from a villa by the roadside.","She was dressed all in black, with her hair covering most of her face, carrying a bag of items, running towards the other side.","She completely ignored whether there were any cars on the road.","Sheng Mumu immediately slammed the brakes while honking the horn at the same time.","Hearing the car horn and screeching brakes, the woman was utterly unconcerned. She coldly glanced at the car, then quickly looked away and continued on, disappearing into a path next to the green belt.","When that woman had looked over, Sheng Mumu vaguely glimpsed her appearance.","Sallow complexion, emaciated, with not a hint of liveliness in her eyes.","If they had encountered her at night, it would definitely have scared them witless.","Sheng Mumu was still shaken up.","Heart racing, she clutched at her chest.","\"What a nutcase. Doesn't even look at the road, we almost crashed into her.\"","Zhang Ma seemed to know this woman. Looking in the direction she had vanished, Zhang Ma said:","\"Madam, this woman is well known as the freak of our villa district.\"","Sheng Mumu turned her head: \"Freak?\"","Zhang Ma had worked at the Qi residence many years ago, and was even more knowledgeable than Manager Zhang regarding the gossip about each family in the villa district.","\"Yes Madam. She's always alone, and it seems only she lives in that villa. Let me think...I think her name has the character 'Lan' in it. I heard the other servants mention it when chatting.\" Zhang Ma racked her brains trying to remember, then suddenly clapped her hands. \"That's right, the name has 'Lan' in it. I heard them mention it.\"","Sheng Mumu started the car again, frowning and muttering:","\"What a weird person.\"","This little episode didn't affect her mood.","In the afternoon, the professional real estate agent brought her and Qin Jiamu to look at several office buildings that were for lease.","She brought a small notebook and wrote down the pros and cons of each location in detail.","Everything from area, direction, how many elevators each floor had installed, and more.","Renting an office wasn't something that could be rushed. The two of them were prepared to come out frequently in the near future to look at places.","After coming out of the last office building, on the way to the parking lot, Qin Jiamu made a phone call to her daughter, planning to have dinner together with her.","\"Dear, where are you? Mum wants to come get you so we can have dinner together?\" Hearing the response on the other end, Qin Jiamu's rising smile gradually faded away, and she said listlessly: \"Alright then, I'll just have to go find your dad to eat with.\"","After hanging up, Qin Jiamu shot Sheng Mumu a helpless look, sighing:","\"Oh, kids grow up so fast. She said she already ate at a cafe with her classmates, and here I was looking forward to spending a mother-daughter weekend with her. Yet she didn't think of me at all.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and joked while taking out her car keys:","\"Maybe she was hoping you could spend a husband-wife weekend?\"","Qin Jiamu's face lit up with a smile. She glared at Sheng Mumu, then walked off with an unrestrained wave goodbye: \"Off I go. See you tomorrow.\"","The two got into their respective cars and drove out of the parking lot.","Back home, Sheng Mumu was tidying up the information she had recorded today in her room.","After just a few minutes, there was a knock at the door.","Opening the door, Qi Shaobai was standing outside holding a takeout bag.","\"Brought this for you.\" Qi Shaobai held out the bag towards her.","The bag had the Wenhua Ice Cream Parlour logo printed on it.","Sheng Mumu accepted the bag: \"What is this?\"","\"Iced lemon tea and curry puffs,\" Qi Shaobai replied, hands tucked into his pockets. \"I was eating out just now and happened to buy these for you on the way back.\"","Sheng Mumu revealed a delighted smile. \"Little Qi, you're awesome! How did you know I like to eat curry puffs?\"","\"Mm,\" Qi Shaobai scratched his head somewhat awkwardly and lazily mumbled a response before heading downstairs. \"I'm going to do homework now.\"","Seeing Qi Shaobai's immature yet aloof manner, Sheng Mumu strangely felt like a proud mother seeing her child grow up.","An I'm-so-proud.jpg expression on her face.","Qi Shaobai's peripheral vision caught her exaggerated expression, and he couldn't help shuddering as he quickened his pace down the stairs.","Just then, there were sounds coming from the front door downstairs.","An unfamiliar middle-aged woman's voice floated upstairs.","\"Ah, I'm exhausted. Went all over the world, but still feel Jing City is the best.\"","Downstairs, the servants chorused loudly: \"Welcome home, Madam— Welcome back, Miss Qiao—\"","Sheng Mumu: \"??\"","Madam?","Could it be that her mother-in-law, whom she had never met, had arrived?","And who was Miss Qiao?"]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Qi, I knew I couldn't hide it from you.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu wracked her brains but couldn't recall anyone with the surname Qiao from her memory.","Zhang Housekeeper heard the commotion and came to the front hall.","Upon seeing Feng Yaoqin, he quickly took the leopard-print handbag from her hands and respectfully said, \"Madam, you've arrived, Miss Qiao is here too, but Master is not at home. I'll go and fetch Madam.\"","\"Fetch?\" Feng Yaoqin glanced at Zhang Housekeeper.","She seemed dissatisfied with the word \"fetch.\"","Her tone rose, as if she deliberately wanted the person upstairs to hear, and she said, \"What? Do daughters-in-law need to be 'summoned' to come and greet their mother-in-law? They won't move unless they're 'invited'?\"","Zhang Housekeeper realized he had misspoken and hurriedly explained, \"Look at me, as I grow older, I lose the ability to speak. I'll go and call Madam downstairs. Madam, please wait a moment.\"","Only then did Feng Yaoqin nod slightly and sat down on the sofa.","She turned her head and looked at the young woman behind her, patting the sofa and beckoning her to come over, saying, \"Come, Lili, sit beside your aunt.\"","Qiao Li, the daughter of a distant relative of Feng Yaoqin.","Although she called Feng Yaoqin \"Aunt,\" their blood relationship had taken many twists and turns.","Before Feng Yaoqin and her husband adopted Qi Mo from the orphanage, they had always treated Qiao Li as their own daughter.","At that time, the Qi family was just an ordinary family living near Jing City, and they often interacted with the Qiao family.","However, as Qi Mo's career became more successful, he purchased many properties in the inner city for his parents, and the relationship between the Qi and Qiao families gradually drifted apart.","It was not until a few years ago, after Feng Yaoqin's husband passed away and her son Qi Mo became busy with work, that she began to reconnect with Qiao Li, her niece by marriage.","When the old lady insisted on matchmaking Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo.","Feng Yaoqin had expressed opposition.","She thought, why marry a woman who knows nothing about her background?","If it were Qiao Li who became her daughter-in-law, it would be a perfect match.","However, as a son, Qi Mo respected filial piety and was unwilling to follow her arrangements in this major matter.","Even though she spent time bringing Qiao Li to their home every day during that period, and even had her son purchase another villa in Xiyu Yueting for Qiao Li to live with them, Qi Mo always maintained a polite distance from Qiao Li and showed no intention of deepening their relationship.","Over time, Feng Yaoqin gave up on this idea.","Today, she had just returned from a trip abroad and called Qiao Li over.","Mainly, she wanted her daughter-in-law, who had barely met her, to see that there were many outstanding women around her son.","Her son had chosen Sheng Mumu, and Sheng Mumu should be grateful and fulfill her duties as a good wife.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai sat on the sofa opposite them.","With the mindset of a dutiful daughter-in-law, Sheng Mumu assumed the role and as soon as she sat down, she affectionately called out, \"Mom~\"","Feng Yaoqin was taken aback, as if she wasn't accustomed to it.","Qi Shaobai also followed suit and called out, \"Grandma.\"","Feng Yaoqin said, \"Oh~\"","For the next fifteen minutes, the entire living room became Feng Yaoqin's stage.","She kept praising Qiao Li, subtly reminding Sheng Mumu, never pausing for a moment.","\"This niece of mine is truly outstanding.\"","\"She has a high education level, good looks, and a particularly gentle personality.\"","\"She just won't get married, and it's driving me crazy.\"","Feng Yaoqin adjusted the leopard-print silk scarf on her shoulder and continued, \"If it weren't for Qimo... sigh, let's not talk about it.\"","Upon hearing herself described as \"well-behaved\" by her cousin aunt, Qiao Li's eyelashes trembled involuntarily.","Sheng Mumu caught a glimpse of her slightly furrowed brows.","That expression looked familiar.","It was like being praised by parents during the New Year's and feeling particularly awkward about it.","Because of unintentionally noticing her subtle expression, Sheng Mumu started to carefully assess Qiao Li.","She had fair and beautiful features, and her eyes were especially lively, embodying the popular trend of a delicate and charming beauty.","Combining Feng Yaoqin's words, Sheng Mumu had already guessed about seventy to eighty percent of the situation.","Her supposed mother-in-law probably once wanted Miss Qiao to become her daughter-in-law but failed. Today, she brought her here specifically to assert her dominance through Miss Qiao's presence.","Thinking this way, everything made sense.","Sheng Mumu shifted her gaze and let out a shallow breath.","It seemed that her mother-in-law couldn't be considered an evil mother-in-law commonly seen on TV.","The method she employed to put her daughter-in-law in her place seemed a bit... childish.","Finally, among the four people in the living room, Qi Shaobai, the youngest, couldn't sit still anymore.","He placed his hands on the armrest of the couch and said, \"I still have a pile of exercises to do, so I'll go back to my room first, Grandma. Take your time chatting.\"","Qi Shaobai and Feng Yaoqin didn't have a particularly good relationship. Compared to his relationship with the old lady, it was like night and day. Talking to her felt much more unfamiliar.","Feng Yaoqin's face showed a belated realization, \"Right, you're in your final year of high school, focus on your studies, go ahead, go ahead.\"","After speaking, Feng Yaoqin's gaze fell on the bag of uneaten egg puffs that Sheng Mumu had brought down from the coffee table.","She turned her head to look at Sheng Mumu and sternly reprimanded, \"Mumu, I have to say, in the future, buy less of these junk foods for Shaobai. He's in his final year of high school, don't you know how important food safety is?\"","Sheng Mumu listened to her mother-in-law's scolding with a bewildered blink of her eyes.","Just when Qi Shaobai had escaped the situation and was halfway out, he turned back.","\"Grandma, you misunderstood... I bought those for her.\"","Feng Yaoqin looked at him in astonishment, \"? ? ?\"","Qiao Li, who had remained silent all evening, burst into laughter upon hearing Qi Shaobai's words.","She suddenly felt that the laughter was untimely, so she immediately covered her mouth, suppressing her laughter.","The atmosphere momentarily became awkward.","The situation was gradually changing.","Sheng Mumu's face once again showed the expression of a contented mother.","On the other side...","Qi Mo walked out of the international terminal of Jing City Airport.","Xiao Wang was already waiting outside in the car.","Seeing him come out, Xiao Wang approached, took his luggage, and put it in the trunk.","As he was about to get into the driver's seat, he saw his boss raise his phone to his ear.","Xiao Wang turned to the side and waited outside the car, ready to get in after his boss finished the call.","Inside the car...","Qi Mo dialed the phone number he had just learned.","With deep eyes, he gazed out the window, exuding a chilling sense of oppression.","The call connected.","A clear and clean voice came from the other side, \"Hello?\"","Qi Mo's gaze tightened, and he spoke in a deep voice, \"I am Qi Mo.\"","As his words fell, the person on the other end fell silent for a few seconds before letting out what seemed like a short sigh and said,","\"President Qi, I knew I couldn't hide it from you.\"","The contours of Qi Mo's jawline were accentuated by the harsh lights from the outer edges of the airport.","Although phrased as a question, it carried an irresistible sense of urgency:","\"Do you have time to meet now?\"","The person on the other end of the line stiffened, then slowly replied:","\"Alright, where should we meet?\""]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: What is your purpose in approaching her","paragraphs":["Half an hour later.","In a private lounge in Beijing.","Cheng Zhuo was led by a waiter to the innermost private room.","Walking down this corridor, Cheng Zhuo's pace was unhurried.","But he was far from as calm inside as he appeared on the surface.","From the day he started working at Yueji Flower House, he had already mentally prepared himself.","That omnipotent man would eventually find out that something was off about him, and track him down here.","He had imagined what he would say if he met Qi Mo face to face.","But now that the moment had arrived.","Nervousness still welled up in his heart one wave after another.","The words he had planned out earlier completely slipped his mind.","The waiter pulled open the door of the private room and ushered Cheng Zhuo in.","Qi Mo sat sideways on the sofa next to the floor-to-ceiling window, one long leg crossed over the other.","Most of his face was sunk in shadow, his expression unclear.","Cheng Zhuo took a shallow breath, gritted his teeth and sat down on the sofa opposite Qi Mo.","He forced a casual smile and greeted,","\"Mr. Qi, nice to meet you. I'm the shop manager of Yueji Flower House, Cheng Zhuo.\"","Qi Mo looked up, a hint of chill in his deep, dark eyes.","His gaze slowly swept over Cheng Zhuo's face.","Every second that his gaze lingered felt like he was scrutinizing him.","Cheng Zhuo felt nervous under his substantial gaze.","Just as he was about to open his mouth to say something to break the tension, he heard Qi Mo's cool, low voice softly say,","\"Nice to meet you, Cheng Zhuo, or should I call you, second young master of Fangcheng Group.\"","As the last syllable fell, Qi Mo's compelling gaze looked straight at him.","Cheng Zhuo's breath hitched abruptly, as if his heart was being choked.","The smile was still on his face, but he couldn't hide the tension within.","The hand hidden under the table clenched slightly.","Too frightening.","This man's gaze seemed to see through everything.","Cheng Zhuo was no coward.","On the contrary, having grown up under his elder brother's overbearing education, he was bolder than most people his age.","At this moment, Cheng Zhuo felt the same powerful sense of oppression from Qi Mo as he did from his brother.","As if not saying anything would make him seem weaker.","Cheng Zhuo clenched his fists a little tighter to calm his nerves, put on a frank expression, and met Qi Mo's gaze steadily.","\"As expected, nothing can be hidden from Mr. Qi.\" He paused, then circumvented the issue and said, \"But don't get me wrong, Mr. Qi. I'm not working two jobs. Fangcheng Group is run by my brother and has nothing to do with me.\"","Having said that, Cheng Zhuo blinked his clear, bright eyes innocently.","His demeanor was very similar to Sheng Mumu's.","The hostility in Qi Mo's cold, stern brows and eyes receded slightly as he reassessed Cheng Zhuo.","When he spoke again, his voice was gentler than before:","\"Thank you for helping my wife at the flower shop that time.\"","Qi Mo kept his professional and personal lives separate, as well as gratitude and grudges.","These words expressed gratitude as a husband to someone who had helped his wife.","But his next sentence marked a change in attitude.","His brow quirked slightly as his aura suddenly became icy.","And as a man, he questioned:","\"What are your intentions for getting close to her?\"","Xiyu Yingting.","Feng Yaoqin, who had other plans in mind, glanced at her wristwatch.","Seeing this, Zhang the butler immediately asked,","\"Madam, are you staying here tonight, or...?\"","Feng Yaoqin waved her hand. \"I won't stay. When Qi Mo comes back, I'll come over for dinner.\"","Her words implied that she would be staying in the city for a while after this trip, and would have plenty of opportunities to discipline her daughter-in-law.","Zhang spoke respectfully, \"I'll send madam and Miss Qiao over.\"","\"No need for you to send us.\" Feng Yaoqin's tone grew sharper, and she looked meaningfully at Sheng Mumu.","Sheng Mumu immediately understood. She leapt up from the sofa,","\"Mom, I'll take you.\"","Feng Yaoqin's brows knitted slightly.","\"... \"","She was quick to respond, having said nothing for half a day.","Sheng Mumu saw Feng Yaoqin's expression. She pretended not to notice.","And sighed to herself in her mind.","She finally understood today why so many said the mother-in-law daughter-in-law relationship was the hardest to maintain.","Being too enthusiastic doesn't work, being too cold doesn't work either.","Lukewarm is even worse, as that would be seen as perfunctory.","Compared to reading a boss's face at work, reading a mother-in-law's face and acting accordingly was a hundred times more difficult.","She had just smoothed things over with her pretend husband and cheap son, and now this hard-to-handle mother-in-law popped up.","Ahhhhh, save me.","She took a deep breath and adjusted her mindset.","Just keep thinking of the ¥500,000 every month.","Sheng Mumu, you can do this.","Quickly get into the role of a \"virtuous daughter-in-law\"!","Sheng Mumu sent Feng Yaoqin to the entrance of a slightly smaller villa about eight buildings away from theirs.","Looking up, it was a little smaller than the one they lived in.","But it would be more than enough for just Feng Yaoqin and Qiao Li.","Sheng Mumu smiled amiably as she bid Feng Yaoqin farewell, and considerately said,","\"Mom, come over to eat at our place when you have time.\"","Feng Yaoqin suddenly said, \"Don't rush back, come inside. I'll teach you a few of Qi Mo's favorite dishes. Learn to make them and cook for them.\"","\"Ah?\" Sheng Mumu almost reflexively wanted to decline, \"Learn to cook this late at night...\"","How presumptuous of you.","Seeing her reaction, Qiao Li at the side couldn't help but stifle a laugh again.","Amid the drone of cicadas, Feng Yaoqin didn't quite catch what Sheng Mumu said. \"What did you say?\"","Sheng Mumu enthusiastically looped her arm around her mother-in-law's, \"It's so late, and you want to teach me to cook. How tiring for you. You just got back from overseas and haven't adjusted to the time difference here yet, right?\"","Feng Yaoqin was very pleased with this show of concern. The corners of her lips curved up in a barely discernible smile.","\"My previous stop was Korea. No need to adjust for time difference.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"..................\"","The smile had just hung on Feng Yaoqin's lips for a few seconds before it was abruptly withdrawn.","Something's not right...","Strange.","How did she end up smiling at her daughter-in-law without realizing it?","This wouldn't do. She hadn't even started establishing her authority yet, and was already giving in.","Feng Yaoqin knitted her brows and glanced at Sheng Mumu's hand looped around hers. She twisted her body uncomfortably and said,","\"Don't hold on to me. It's so hot out, just walk by yourself.\"","Sheng Mumu quickly retracted her hand. \"Of course, mom. Just watch your step for any loose pebbles on the ground. It's dark in the yard at night, be careful not to trip.\"","Feng Yaoqin did not expect such acquiescent words from her daughter-in-law. She immediately felt a little smug, but still remembered to maintain her mother-in-law status. She gave a little cough and sternly lectured,","\"Back to cooking. Don't just readily agree. Pay close attention later and learn properly.\"","Sheng Mumu dragged her feet as she followed behind.","Her face was brimming with enthusiasm.","But she was beyond hopeless inside.","Her voice was full of motivation.","\"Mm-hmm, I'll definitely learn carefully. What's that saying again-\" She thought for a moment. \"That's right, watch and learn from the best. I'm waiting for you to show me your skills.\"","Feng Yaoqin stopped in her tracks and glanced at this somewhat odd daughter-in-law, muttering under her breath,","\"Is that how the saying goes...\"","Qiao Li burst into laughter and suddenly chimed in, \"Auntie, that's right, you can use it that way.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and nodded at her mother-in-law.","The picture of obedience.","Under the moonlight.","Mother-in-law, daughter-in-law, niece.","The scene was getting stranger and stranger."]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: The Dark Side of Keemer","paragraphs":["Inside a private room at the bar.","Cheng Zhuo didn't beat around the bush and directly told Qi Mo what had been buried in his heart for a long time.","\"Chief Qi, actually, I suspect your wife is my sister.\"","Qi Mo's deep and obscure eyes suddenly tightened.","Cheng Zhuo said, \"This is just my one-sided guess, but really... Sister Sheng looks so much like my mom, with the same smile that makes her eyes curve and form a pair of dimples.\"","As if to prove what he said, he added with palms together,","\"My brother also has dimples. I'm the only one in my family who was born differently, my dimples became eye bags.\"","Qi Mo's eyebrows furrowed tightly.","Judging kinship based on dimples, what kind of logic is this?","The brother Cheng Zhuo mentioned should be none other than Cheng Xin, the current president of Fangcheng Group, if Qi Mo guessed correctly.","That young businessman who has established a foothold on Wall Street at the age of only thirty-four.","In just five short years, he has turned Fangcheng Group from an unknown small company into one of the top 30 companies in the United States.","The reason why Cheng Zhuo suspected that Sheng Mumu was from the Cheng family was not only because of their looks.","He looked steadily at Qi Mo.","Perhaps it was because they were both successful at a young age and had started their own businesses early.","He felt that Qi Mo and his brother shared subtle similarities in temperament and demeanor.","Thinking this way, he involuntarily felt a sense of affinity.","His lips moved for a few times before he finally told this long-kept secret of the Cheng family to the man he met for the first time.","\"Twenty-two years ago, my family still lived in a small city in the south. One day my parents heard that a theme park had just opened in the neighboring city, so they took us three kids there to play.\"","\"That day the amusement park was very crowded. My brother kept yelling that he wanted to ride the pirate ship. I was eyeing the cotton candy in the hands of kids next to me. We went in separate directions.\"","Cheng Zhuo lowered his eyes remorsefully. \"It was then that my mom's and sister's hands, which were holding each other, got separated by the surging crowd...\"","\"My sister got lost.\"","\"My parents were extremely anxious and exhausted all possible means they could think of, but still couldn't find my sister.\"","Qi Mo's eyes flickered slightly, and he said lightly in a barely noticeable comforting way, \"There was no video surveillance coverage in many places during that era.\"","\"Yeah.\" Cheng Zhuo looked up. \"Searching for a six-year-old little girl in the vast sea of people was like looking for a needle in the ocean.\"","\"After that, my mother blamed herself tremendously. No matter how my dad comforted her, she blamed the separation of my sister entirely on herself and lived in sadness every day.\"","\"In order for my mother to stop indulging in self-blame, my dad made the painful decision to immigrate with the family to the United States, hoping that the change of environment could make her feel better.\" Cheng Zhuo's tone was a little choked up, and his shoulders sank. \"But my mother still passed away shortly after immigrating.\"","\"My dad aged overnight. In just a few years, he followed my mother as well.\"","In just a few brief sentences, Cheng Zhuo recounted the tremendous changes that happened in the Cheng family over the years.","But it left indelible marks in the hearts of each Cheng family member.","\"After that, my brother took care of me like both a brother and a father...\"","Cheng Zhuo adjusted his emotions and looked straight at the silent man across from him, speaking faster,","\"Until a few months ago, when I saw Sister Sheng's photo with employees on the promotional webpage of Yueji Flower Shop.\"","\"She looked so much alike that after checking, I found out even the age matched my lost sister's. What surprised me most was her name also contained the character 'Mu'.\"","After listening to Cheng Zhuo's words, even a man as rational and aloof as Qi Mo was touched. His brow slightly furrowed.","He remained silent for a few seconds before rationality finally prevailed over emotion. He spoke heavily,","\"Other than looking alike and having the same age, do you have any other evidence that can prove Mumu is your Cheng family member?\"","A fleeting bleakness flashed across Cheng Zhuo's eyes. His lips pressed into a straight line.","\"No.\"","Upon hearing this, Qi Mo's tense jaw relaxed slightly.","He lowered his eyes to conceal the complicated emotions within.","He was clearly aware.","At this moment, a despicable thought had emerged in his heart.","He had to admit.","When he heard Cheng Zhuo say \"no\", he felt a trace of relief for some reason.","The relief stemmed from fear.","He was afraid that Cheng Zhuo really had evidence to prove she was from the Cheng family.","If the Cheng family wanted to find her back.","Would she immediately ask for a divorce and terminate the agreement?","He had no reason to keep her in the Qi family.","Qi Mo had never faced the darker side of himself like he did now.","He had said that she was free.","He had said that she could leave anytime if she wanted.","So why, would he suddenly be unwilling to let go.","Cheng Zhuo couldn't discern the emotions from the frowning man across from him. He went on,","\"I've been struggling with whether I should directly tell Sister Sheng or not, but I also feel it would be too abrupt, so I wanted to investigate secretly first.\"","Cheng Zhuo said, \"I thought about directly taking some hair samples to do a paternity test—\"","As soon as he said this, Qi Mo's eyes narrowed slightly, and his palm grasped tightly again with fingers turning white.","Cheng Zhuo noticed his abnormal behavior and quickly explained, \"I didn't do that.\"","Collecting someone's hair without permission and taking it for testing would be very unethical.","\"I think when the timing is right, I will tell Sister Sheng in person and do the test together with her consent.\"","After a long silence, the man finally let out a muffled \"hmm\" from his chest. The sharpness in his eyes faded away.","Cheng Zhuo leaned forward a little, a slight furrow between his brows, \"When the timing is right, I will explain everything to Sister Sheng. Chief Qi, can you please not tell her about today for now?\"","Qi Mo looked straight at Cheng Zhuo and responded in a deep voice,","\"Okay.\"","Even without Cheng Zhuo stressing it, he would not let this unverified matter affect her.","Affect them.","Cheng Zhuo showed a grateful smile, \"Thank you, Chief Qi.\"","Qi Mo looked away, tone flat, \"No need to thank me.\"","After Cheng Zhuo left, Qi Mo stayed in the private room for a long time.","The lighting in the private room was very dim. There was a finished glass of red wine by his hand.","The profound eyes of the man were blurred by the wine.","His gaze vaguely fell outside the floor-to-ceiling windows.","Outside the windows, lights of thousands of households.","As if a thought suddenly occurred to him.","He impatiently loosened his tie and lazily leaned back into the sofa, withdrawing his gaze.","Unwilling to look at those lights outside the window representing families anymore.","Just then, the screen of his phone on the table lit up.","Taking advantage of her trip to the restroom, Sheng Mumu sent several complaining messages in a row:","\"Mr. Qi, your mom suddenly came over. I'm at her place now. She wouldn't let me leave and insisted on teaching me to cook dishes you like to eat.\"","\"Help, SOS, what sin did I commit to suffer the torment of learning to cook late at night. [crying emoji]\"","\"You'd better like eating them, otherwise I would have pretended to be a virtuous wife for nothing. I'll really feel wronged.\"","The faint light of the screen shined on the exquisite face of the man.","Unnoticed ripples of smile emerged in the unfathomable eyes as he typed a reply:","\"Wait for me.\""]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: The Man Who Schemes","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu was confused after receiving the message.","What did \"wait for him\" mean?","Wait for him to come back from Singapore?","The food was already cold.","\"Don't get distracted, why are you playing with your phone again?\" Feng Yaoqin nudged her with her arm, \"You young people, always clinging to your phones, I don't know what's so fun about it.\"","Sheng Mumu's thoughts returned and she lied smoothly, \"I'm using the memo app to write down the steps so I remember, you can't rely on just your memory, right mom?\"","Feng Yaoqin looked at her suspiciously, with a skeptical expression, but didn't say any more.","Fifteen minutes later.","Feng Yaoqin was explaining to Sheng Mumu how to slice the beef along the grain when sounds came from the front door.","\"Cousin—\" Qiao Li was the first to notice Qi Mo, and called out in surprise, eyes widening.","The handsome man with deep-set eyes lightly nodded his chin in response.","Taking long strides, he headed straight for the kitchen.","Hearing the noise, Feng Yaoqin poked her head out to look.","Seeing her son, her face lit up, revealing the ordinary mother in her.","She spoke happily but reprimandingly:","\"Didn't Manager Zhang say you wouldn't be back in the capital for a few more days? How come you're back so late? Did you just get off the plane? Aren't you tired?\"","Although the two were not related by blood, after so many years together, their relationship was no different from a real mother and son.","In front of others Qi Mo was a taciturn and cold businessman.","But in front of Feng Yaoqin, although he was still sparing with his words, his cold, chiselled features softened with rare warmth.","Even his tone of voice became gentle and mellow.","\"I finished up early so I came back ahead of schedule.\"","As he spoke, he slowly walked over to Sheng Mumu's side.","Naturally he wrapped his arm around her slender waist, tied with an apron.","Standing side by side, he said to Feng Yaoqin:","\"Mom, you just got back from vacation, don't tire yourself cooking. Get some rest early.\"","Hearing this, Feng Yaoqin raised her voice and said,","\"What's tiring about making a few dishes? Back when we didn't live in such a big house, I made breakfast, lunch, dinner, and late-night snacks every day. You wouldn't have grown so tall and strong otherwise.\"","She smiled and her tone hinted at seeking credit, \"Isn't that right?\"","Qi Mo's lips curved up slightly, his smile gentle, \"Yes mom, you're right, but it's getting late today.\"","As he finished speaking, he slowly turned his head to look at Sheng Mumu.","She happened to glance up, suddenly meeting his wine-blurred gaze.","The next second, he leaned down slightly.","The cold, crisp aroma of alcohol wafted over.","The man's long, slender fingers moved to her lower back, gave a light tug, and undid her apron.","Taking advantage of the alcohol, Qi Mo acted boldly beyond his usual restraint.","After removing her apron, his large hand rested on the back of her neck, massaging lightly.","Like a caring husband concerned for his wife, asking if she was tired from learning to cook.","Qi Mo's eyes smoldered as he gazed at her, his voice low and hoarse:","\"Are you tired?\"","Sheng Mumu's radar went \"buzz\".","A tingling sensation spread from her neck to her scalp.","Wow, not bad. She almost forgot what she was supposed to do.","Receiving his signal, Sheng Mumu instantly smiled, shook her head, and clung to his arm coquettishly, responding in a playful tone:","\"Not one bit, I'm so happy to be learning from mom.\"","Qi Mo's body stiffened.","The faint buzz from the alcohol amplified his senses.","He could clearly feel the soft, delicate hands circling his arm.","She was very close, her light floral perfume teasing his nose.","A sudden desire to tease her flashed through his mind.","He swallowed, the corner of his lips slowly curving up mischievously, \"Since you want to learn, I'll join you.\"","Sheng Mumu's smile froze on her face.","The hand gripping Qi Mo's arm unconsciously squeezed tighter.","Her eyes reminded him - I'm lying! Don't tell me you can't read between the lines?","The man's muscular arm didn't budge.","The corners of his eyes lifted ever so slightly as he feigned ignorance, \"Hmm?\"","Sheng Mumu slowly loosened her grip and took a deep breath.","She understood completely now.","What else could she not get?","This sly man.","And to think she believed he came to rescue her.","Turns out he just wanted to freeload dinner after seeing the message.","Feng Yaoqin couldn't see the undercurrents passing between them and thought her son and daughter-in-law were being lovey-dovey. She frowned and coughed.","Just as she was about to say something, the knife in her hand was suddenly snatched away and placed on the counter.","It was Qiao Li who took Feng Yaoqin's knife.","Qiao Li pulled Feng Yaoqin's arm, \"Auntie, it's late, why not listen to cousin and not cook tonight? I still want to hear about all the fun things that happened on your trip. Oh, is Korean food really delicious?\"","Hearing this, Feng Yaoqin tipped her head back, brows knitting together, \"Don't believe everything you see online, everything there tastes like kimchi, it's not delicious at all. Let me tell you, the tastiest is still—\"","Seeing that auntie had started chattering, Qiao Li quickly shot a look at cousin and his wife, signaling them to slip away quickly.","Qi Mo understood Qiao Li's intention but still politely told his mother, \"Mom, Mumu and I are heading back now, rest early.\"","Feng Yaoqin realized, \"Oh wait, I just finished cutting the beef.\"","Qiao Li dragged Feng Yaoqin upstairs, \"It's so late, cousin must have eaten already so don't worry about him. Auntie, did you have ice cream in Turkey?\"","Feng Yaoqin seemed to recall some infuriating memory, gesturing animatedly, \"Turkish ice cream? Don't even mention it, can you believe how they trick people, Li Li don't you think...\"","Qiao Li smiled, eyes curving into crescents. With his hands behind his back he waved twice at his cousin and cousin's wife, saying bye-bye.","Seeing Feng Yaoqin get distracted by Qiao Li again, Qi Mo chuckled. Voice lowered, he said to the woman beside him:","\"Let's go home.\"","Sheng Mumu finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Realizing he had been teasing her earlier, she glared at him.","The man was amused rather than angry, the flickering light in his deep eyes full of mirth. Still smiling, he held out his arm to her.","Sheng Mumu secretly rolled her eyes where only he could see. She looped her arm around the rich dad's arm.","In her heart she snarked:","Men.","No matter their age.","They all love these childish tricks.","So immature."]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Hidden Belly Black Attributes","paragraphs":["The villa district was especially quiet at night.","Two people walked on the roadside, one in front and one behind.","Sheng Mumu was in a good mood, walking briskly in front, having escaped the ordeal of cooking.","Qi Mo's steps were a little heavy, with his hands behind his back.","He looked like an old cadre, half a step behind her.","Qi Mo lowered his eyes, his gaze falling on the shadow she cast stretched out by the street lamp.","There was a fleeting bleakness deep in his eyes.","Just from her back, you could see she was in high spirits at this moment.","Such a lively and vivacious her.","She shouldn't be shackled.","The next day.","Sheng Mumu got up as soon as she heard the alarm clock.","She had scheduled her day to be especially full today. She had made an appointment with Qin Jiamu in the morning to go house hunting, she was going to the flower shop in the afternoon, and she had arranged to have dinner with Qi Mo in the evening.","When she pushed open the bathroom door with her tousled bed hair, intending to wash up, she suddenly stopped and her eyes widened slightly.","In front of her.","The handsome man was seriously shaving, leaning in close to the mirror.","His gaze was lowered, eyelashes thick.","Wearing casual black clothes, the neckline slightly open.","From the side, the arc of his adam's apple was very sexy.","It was the moment she had pushed the door and walked in.","He looked over through the mirror's reflection.","Sheng Mumu had already been stunned by this handsome face many times.","But this time was different.","His unconscious actions seemed extremely appealing and ambiguous to Sheng Mumu, completely hitting her aesthetic spot.","Freezing any frame would look like a magazine pictorial.","Qi Mo's lips were covered with shaving foam, his sharp and rugged jawline hidden within.","He held a razor in one hand, the other lightly supporting his chin. His deep and profound gaze looked at her through the mirror, his magnetic voice low: \"You're awake.\"","This sentence was neither a question nor a statement.","Actually it was superfluous.","But hearing it in the quiet bedroom in the morning somehow created a subtle sense of ambiguity.","Sheng Mumu withdrew her gaze and murmured \"Mm\".","She walked casually to his side as if nothing had happened.","She started squeezing toothpaste and brushing her teeth.","Qi Mo unhurriedly used a towel to wipe away the remaining foam on his chin.","While Sheng Mumu was washing her face, she thought more and more something wasn't right.","Usually this man washed up very quickly.","Why was he dawdling today.","And carefully shaving too.","She didn't notice he normally had obvious stubble.","What was he shaving? Shaving loneliness?","Could it be he had an important meeting to attend today.","Would he forget they had arranged to have dinner together tonight?","Just as she was about to ask, Qi Mo's voice came lightly behind her, \"I'm going to the company. I'll pick you up from the flower shop tonight.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment, then nodded belatedly.","*","In the evening.","Qi Mo picked up Sheng Mumu from Happy Yourself Flower Shop.","Just as driver Xiao Wang was about to ask where the boss wanted to go, Sheng Mumu suddenly gave Qi Mo a mysterious look and said,","\"I won't tell you which restaurant yet. You'll know when we get there. It'll be a surprise for you.\"","Hearing this, Qi Mo was startled at first, then the corner of his lips curled up in an \"this seems interesting\" domineering smile, and said lightly, \"Okay.\"","Sheng Mumu handed her phone to Xiao Wang, \"Go here.\"","Xiao Wang saw the restaurant address on the screen, and his gaze paused slightly as he instinctively glanced at the boss in the backseat.","This wasn't...","Sheng Mumu was full of anticipation, unaware of Xiao Wang's complex expression, and urged, \"Let's go.\"","Xiao Wang quickly withdrew his gaze and swallowed his words, concentrating on driving.","All the way, Sheng Mumu was in great spirits.","She had checked online beforehand.","This restaurant was a newly opened revolving restaurant on the top floor of the tallest building in the city.","She heard you could overlook the night view of the entire city.","It wasn't cheap.","But if it could make the rich dad happy and get him to agree to her request to postpone the loan repayment, any amount of money would be worth it.","Best of all, this restaurant had only been open for a month.","Based on her understanding of Qi Mo, he should have been to all the high-end restaurants in the city.","But he happened to be away on business last month.","So there was a high probability he hadn't been to this restaurant yet.","When treating someone to a meal, you had to show sincerity.","Clearly, in choosing this location for dinner today, she was demonstrating utmost sincerity.","Twenty minutes later, they arrived at the destination.","Sheng Mumu no longer pretended to be mysterious. She smiled brightly and revealed the answer to Qi Mo:","\"Here it is, the new revolving restaurant. You haven't been yet, right?\"","Qi Mo looked up at the tall building outside the car window.","A momentary surprise appeared on his handsome face.","He seemed to seriously think back, then after a few seconds, said slowly,","\"Mm, haven't been yet.\"","At these words, Xiao Wang's hand on the steering wheel tightened slightly.","After the two had gotten out of the car, he scratched his head in confusion.","Muttering to himself:","\"Strange, it's a restaurant owned by the Qi Group, how could Boss Qi say he hasn't been...\"","From the ground floor to the top, the elevator ran for a full two minutes.","As the elevator doors opened, it revealed a spacious and luxurious front lobby.","After Sheng Mumu gave the waiter their reservation information, he led them to a private room.","Sheng Mumu observed the restaurant's decor.","She was increasingly satisfied with this restaurant.","A good start was half the success.","Dinner today would definitely go very smoothly.","Suddenly, a loud voice came:","\"Boss Qi!\"","Looking in the direction of the voice, a manager at the end of the corridor suddenly stood at attention upon seeing Qi Mo, his hands tightly clasped in front of him, as if he had encountered something frightening.","Seeing the manager's reaction, the surrounding waiters followed suit, calling out in unison:","\"Boss Qi.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"?????\"","Sheng Mumu looked baffled and asked the man next to her in a low voice, \"This is your restaurant???\"","Qi Mo didn't deny it. \"Mm.\"","Sheng Mumu was extremely chagrined. \"Then why did you just say you hadn't been before?\"","Qi Mo was calm, even with a hint of a smile. He said slowly,","\"I've only seen the project blueprint. I really haven't been up here yet.\"","Not a lie.","Sheng Mumu took a shallow breath: \"......\"","What kind of thing was this?","Treating someone to a meal, only to end up in his own cafeteria?","Just as she was feeling dejected, the manager had already come to their side and naturally took over the previous waiter's job, leading them to the largest private room.","The decor of the private room was luxurious and prestigious.","Crystal chandeliers refracted dazzling beams of light, making the surroundings seem dreamlike.","Sheng Mumu had lost her appetite for ordering dishes. She pushed the menu Qi Mo handed to her back to him.","\"You order.\"","Let me be quiet.","Qi Mo smiled lightly and told the chef to freely improvise based on today's *** menu.","Not until a dish after dish of exquisite cuisine was served did Sheng Mumu's attention get snatched away by the delicious food, and her unhappy mood gradually improved.","Outside the window was the night view of the entire city.","As dusk deepened, below the ink blue sky, traffic flowed ceaselessly, and neon lights flickered.","Dinner was lighthearted and enjoyable.","Sheng Mumu chatted with Qi Mo about recent progress at the flower shop.","Qi Mo patiently listened to her ideas for establishing sub-brands, and shared with her some of his experiences sparring with competitors back when he was just starting his business, for her to use as reference.","Wine and food had satiated them. Sheng Mumu rested her cheek on her hand and sighed, helplessly saying,","\"I wanted to surprise you by being all mysterious earlier, but turns out the clown was me.\"","Qi Mo laughed softly, his dark and deep eyes looking over, \"I actually was very surprised.\"","Sheng Mumu scooped up some dessert and put it in her mouth. \"Guess if I believe your words?\"","As she got to know Qi Mo more deeply.","She discovered this man had hidden petty attributes.","Like last night at Feng Yaoqin's house.","And just now downstairs.","He could lie without batting an eye, and always somehow talk his way out of it.","Qi Mo lazily leaned back in his chair, long legs crossed, a faint smile in his eyes, \"That's not it.\"","His gaze was blazing, his tone slowed, voice low and clear,","\"The point isn't the meal, it's you asking me to eat with you.\""]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Monthly Test Results","paragraphs":["The dessert after dinner was lemon yogurt ice cream.","The creamy yogurt ice cream melted in the mouth.","Refreshing, sweet and sour.","But Sheng Mumu's mood was not refreshing at all...","She felt uneasy under the burning gaze of the man before her.","Qi Mo's eyes contained emotions she could not discern, staring at her unblinkingly.","Sheng Mumu thought to herself.","It's not the first time.","He always seems to have something behind his words.","Sheng Mumu could not figure out what kind of feeling it was.","She simply did not try to figure it out.","Following Qi Mo's words, she replied naturally:","\"Yes, I was thinking the same thing. Actually, the important thing I wanted to discuss with you today is...\"","Qi Mo's eyes narrowed, and his brows raised slightly: \"What is it?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled brightly, \"Can I pay you back later for the money I owe you?\"","As soon as she finished speaking, she saw the man's shoulders sink almost imperceptibly.","Qi Mo pinched the bridge of his nose, feeling a sudden throbbing pain in his temples.","\"That's the important thing you wanted to talk about?\"","Sheng Mumu grinned and nodded.","Qi Mo was silent.","After a while, the corners of his lips finally curved up in a helpless arc, and his voice was low and gentle:","\"Okay.\"","In the car back to Xiyu Yutian,","Sheng Mumu noticed that Qi Mo's mood seemed a little low.","He kept looking out the window, lost in thought.","After thinking for a while, she patted his arm and smiled, saying in a voice only the two of them could hear:","\"Let's not count today.\"","The Rolls-Royce was driving through a dimly-lit tunnel.","Half of Qi Mo's face was shrouded in shadows, and his voice was as dark and ambiguous as the light:","\"Don't count what.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Let's not count today's meal as my treat. Another day, I'll properly invite you out to eat again, okay?\"","When they left the private room earlier, the two rows of employees who stood neatly to see them off bypassed the step of paying the bill.","The money she had prepared to spend today remained unspent.","She should find an opportunity to make up for it.","The tunnel was very short.","The Rolls-Royce drove out of the tunnel.","The streetlights suddenly shone in the man's deep and obscure eyes.","Tiny specks of light, profound and attractive.","A trace of delight was slowly rising.","Driver Wang didn't say a word as he gripped the steering wheel.","He saw the boss's expression clearly in the rearview mirror.","He couldn't hear what they were saying, but he saw it all too clearly, and couldn't help but look surprised.","Boss Qi's face was clearly gloomy just now, yet after Madam said a few words, he actually smiled.","Who would've thought that Boss Qi was so easy to coax.","Indeed.","The soft can overcome the hard.","Even Boss Qi can't escape this law.","When they returned to Xiyu Yutian, it was close to nine o'clock.","Qi Shaobai heard the sound of the door and gripped the things in his hands a little tighter.","Then, as if wanting to let Dad and Stepmom know he was there, he cleared his throat twice.","\"Cough, cough—\"","After changing her shoes, Sheng Mumu walked in and found Qi Shaobai.","He was neither watching TV nor playing on his phone, just sitting on the sofa.","Sheng Mumu suddenly had a bad premonition.","When she was little, she would sit obediently like this waiting for her parents to come home after doing something wrong, not daring to do anything.","What mistake did this kid make?","Qi Mo followed behind Sheng Mumu and casually handed his thin coat to Butler Zhang.","When his gaze swept over Qi Shaobai, his brow furrowed slightly.","As the saying goes, it takes one to know one.","With just a glance, he could tell from Qi Shaobai's expression that something was off.","Qi Shaobai's current appearance was exactly like a subordinate in the group who had just completed a big project and wanted to be praised for it, but was too shy to actively invite merit.","Sheng Mumu asked in confusion:","\"Why are you just sitting here blankly? Have you finished your homework?\" That was exactly what Qi Shaobai was waiting for her to say!","\"Yeah, I'm done.\" He lazily stood up, waved the test paper in his hand a few times, and said arrogantly, \"The monthly exam results came out today. Do you want to see?\"","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu walked over briskly and peeked at the test paper, \"Let me see.\"","His scores in Chinese, math, and science were stable.","It wasn't until she saw the English test paper.","A hint of delight gradually appeared on Sheng Mumu's bright and fair face. She exclaimed in surprise:","\"You passed, your score is 29 points higher than last time!\"","With his hands in his pockets, Qi Shaobai lifted his chin slightly, a hint of pride in his upward lilting tone: \"Mm-hmm.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and took away the English test paper, holding it up for the mature man behind her to see, unfolding it:","\"Look, the English failure Qi Shaobai has made progress on his exam.\"","Qi Mo's eyes were gentle as he slowly moved his gaze away from her smiling eyes and scanned the test paper.","Next to Qi Shaobai's name, the red number 91 stood out clearly:","91.","The darkness in his eyes suddenly contracted, gentleness no more.","After improving by 29 points, he still only got 91.","Qi Shaobai's eyes didn't look at Dad.","But his full attention was on this side, his heart hanging in midair.","The exchanged gazes between father and son.","Each had their own thoughts, and neither spoke.","Qi Shaobai looked slightly innocent, cautious.","Inner os: 29 points, 29 points isn't a small number.","Qi Mo was deep in thought, his brow furrowing gradually.","He remembered that sister Gu Wan's grades were always excellent.","But Qi Shaobai...","Seeing their awkward father-son interaction, Sheng Mumu was anxious.","Qi Mo ah Qi Mo, is it going to kill you to praise him a little?","Little Qi ah little Qi, if you're happy, hold your dad's hand and spin around in circles. Don't tell me you think being silent makes you look cool.","Sheng Mumu looked at Old Qi, then looked at Little Qi.","Just as she was about to say something, she saw Qi Mo seem to have figured something out, his eyes softening.","The cold and overbearing aura surrounding him eased, and he said to Qi Shaobai:","\"You've improved a lot this time, keep up the hard work.\"","His tone contained affirmation.","Although it was very reluctant affirmation.","But still affirmation.","Qi Shaobai's body stiffened, his expression unchanged, but it was as if fireworks had exploded in his heart.","Did he hear that right?","Dad was praising him?","The teenager lowered his head to hide his excitement, not wanting to look too much like a child.","His lips, originally pressed in a straight line, twitched, wanting to smile but holding back.","He responded in a curt and certain tone: \"Mm, I'll work hard.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled like a loving mother.","That's right.","This is how it should be.","Positive encouragement, yay!","After Dad went upstairs, Qi Shaobai completely relaxed.","It was as if he had become a different person, instantly transforming from an obedient puppy into a cocky kitten.","He bragged to Sheng Mumu:","\"I had the biggest increase in single subject scores in the class, pretty awesome right?\"","Sheng Mumu: ......","She didn't want to discourage him. The big improvement was because he started from a low base.","Adhering to the principle of petting the cat in the direction of fur growth, she encouraged him along his train of thought:","\"Awesome, I should give you something as a reward for your exam improvement.\"","Upon hearing the word \"gift\", Qi Shaobai instantly froze.","He held up his hands in an X shape and firmly refused:","\"I appreciate the thought, but no need for gifts, I'm scared.\"","He hadn't finished the past papers she gave him last time yet.","He didn't want to reminisce about that.","Sheng Mumu tapped her chin in thought as she headed upstairs.","She casually responded:","\"Pshh, no need to stand on ceremony with me.\"","Qi Shaobai: ............????","No.","Who's standing on ceremony with you.","How do you get that meaning?"]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Mr. Keyes, come and open your presents.","paragraphs":["The Next Day.","Sheng Mumu arrived at the flower shop early in the morning, continuing to refine the details of the branding and promotional plan for her boutique.","With a creak, the chair across from her was pulled out.","Cheng Zhuo sat down opposite her and placed several pages of paper on the table, sliding them in her direction.","\"Sheng Jie, take a look at this,\" he said.","On the paper were several names that appeared to be company names.","[Daily Flower Language, Flourishing Flower Shop, Gift of Flowers]","Cheng Zhuo said, \"These are the newly launched flower delivery platforms in the past month. Our competitors are increasing.\"","Sheng Mumu had anticipated that this day would come, but she didn't expect it to happen so soon.","Using the advantage of information from her past life, she could replicate many business templates from the previous world in this one, but she couldn't avoid competition when others saw the business opportunities.","Cheng Zhuo pointed to the names on the paper and explained them one by one:","\"Among them, Flourishing Flower Shop is rooted in Shen City.\"","\"Gift of Flowers adopts a strategy of avoiding first-tier cities and is piloting stores in second and third-tier cities, also emphasizing daily flower delivery.\"","\"Both of these are relatively far from us.\" Cheng Zhuo paused and pointed to a spot on the paper, emphasizing, \"Sheng Jie, take a look at this. Daily Flower Language, the registered location of the company is in Jing City. It seems to have the biggest impact on us at the moment, and coincidentally, I found out that the person in charge of this company lives in the same neighborhood as you, with the last name Lu.\"","Sheng Mumu looked surprised.","Not surprised that the person in charge of \"Daily Flower Language\" also lived in Xiyu Yue Ting.","But surprised that Cheng Zhuo managed to find out where the boss of another company lived in such a short amount of time.","The young man had some connections...","Cheng Zhuo continued, \"The target customers and promotional strategies of Daily Flower Language are almost identical to ours.\"","Sheng Mumu furrowed her brow, nodded thoughtfully.","Cheng Zhuo said, \"Sheng Jie, for the branding of the boutique, we need to come up with some unique selling points.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled lightly, \"With the appearance of competitors, it was within my plan. We'll proceed at our own pace without being influenced by others.\"","Seeing Sheng Mumu looking confident, Cheng Zhuo felt relieved and patted his chest, saying:","\"If there's anything I need to do, just let me know. Don't worry about me feeling overwhelmed with work.\"","Since experiencing the truth game with Qi Mo, Cheng Zhuo's psychological burden had lightened considerably.","He didn't worry about Qi Mo misunderstanding him as someone with ulterior motives.","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Alright, I won't hold back then.\"","A week later, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jia Mu finally rented a suitable office building.","After deducting six months' rent, deposit, office equipment, and the expenses of hiring employees, there was less than six million left in the company's account.","After careful consideration, the two discussed the result.","They decided to use one-third of the remaining funds to order raw materials.","And two-thirds for advertising and promotion.","Drawing on Sheng Mumu's years of experience in her previous job, combined with successful brand marketing strategies from the previous world, they established the selling point of the boutique as \"One Life, One Bouquet.\"","They focused on single-item rose flowers, priced at 5200 yuan per bouquet.","Buyers could only purchase one bouquet for their entire lifetime, based on their personal information.","It represented that for every person who received the flowers, they were unique and irreplaceable to the person who sent them.","The promotional materials were quickly produced.","Overnight, the elevator advertising frames in almost all the upscale residential areas of Jing City were adorned with advertisements for \"Yueji Flower Shop,\" captivating the attention of the residents.","Simultaneously, the online channels were also promoting the brand.","Sheng Mumu spared no expense and sent a gift to every customer who had subscribed to the annual service of Yueji Flower Shop.","For a while, she spent each day in the flower shop with her computer, meticulously studying and analyzing the preferences of each customer.","She took into account various factors such as age, gender, zodiac sign, favorite colors, and fragrances.","The contents of the gift boxes sent to each customer were unique and tailored to their individual preferences.","A handwritten thank-you card was included as well.","These one-of-a-kind gifts became the perfect embodiment of the brand's \"uniqueness\" concept.","Among the recipients of these gift boxes were not only the elite ladies of Jing City but also popular internet celebrities and key opinion leaders.","Many of them shared photos online, inadvertently generating buzz for Yueji Flower Shop's new concept of \"One Life, One Bouquet.\"","After a series of marketing promotions, Yueji Flower Shop's official Weibo account gained an additional 200,000 followers within three days.","The excitement continued until the official launch day of the \"One Life, One Bouquet\" concept on the website.","The webpage displayed that the number of reservations had already exceeded 6,000.","Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo nervously refreshed the page in the meeting room, their palms sweaty.","As they repeatedly saw the numbers on the screen surpassing their expectations, they couldn't contain their excitement.","They embraced each other and shed tears of joy.","Amidst the busyness, Sheng Mumu didn't forget the promise she made to Qi Shaobai.","On that day, when Qi Shaobai returned home after his evening self-study, as soon as he stepped inside the door, he heard a cheerful and pleasant voice:","\"Qi Xiaoxue, come over and open your gift.\"","Qi Shaobai froze for a moment, instinctively turned around, hoping to quickly return to his room and lock the door before Sheng Mumu noticed.","But before he could slip away, someone suddenly grabbed the collar of his clothes from behind.","Sheng Mumu held his collar and forcibly dragged him into the living room.","Pointing at the box on the coffee table, she commanded:","\"Open your gift!\"","Qi Shaobai followed Sheng Mumu's gaze and looked at the box. His expression suddenly turned serious.","This box was twice as big as the previous gift box.","What shocked Qi Shaobai the most was that she didn't even want to deceive him even for a moment.","On the outside of the box, it was clearly printed with the words \"Three Years of College Entrance Examinations, Five Years of Mock Exams.\"","A box full of test papers.","To be completed whenever.","Qi Shaobai turned his head leisurely, his expression filled with bitterness:","\"You didn't consider my feelings at all. You even couldn't be bothered to wrap it in a gift box...\"","Suppressing the urge to burst into laughter, Sheng Mumu nodded and urged Qi Shaobai to open the gift quickly.","\"Yeah, I've come clean. No more pretending. Face reality and quickly take your gift back to your room, it's taking up space in the living room.\"","Qi Shaobai became even more resentful as he retorted, \"Is that even something a human would say...\"","While he continued to complain, he lazily picked up the box.","His expression suddenly froze, his brows furrowing with confusion.","Something wasn't right.","Why was this box so much lighter than he had anticipated?","Qi Shaobai shook the box gently and heard a familiar sound coming from inside, his surprise evident on his face:","\"Could it be...?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and said softly,","\"You'll know once you open it.\""]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: A Little Sweetness","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai opened the box with the words \"Three Years of Gaokao, Five Years of Simulation Tests\" printed on it.","He was pleasantly surprised to find that inside was the Lego racing car model he had always wanted but could never find anywhere.","\"How did you find this? Vice President Dong tried so hard to get it for me for so long, and even tried contacting the original foreign manufacturer, but still couldn't find it.\"","Sheng Mumu raised her eyebrows smugly, \"I have my ways.\"","Someone from a prestigious family like Qi Shaobai would of course not know about the existence of second-hand trading platforms in this world.","She had searched online for a long time.","Through introductions, and more introductions.","She finally got in touch with some foreign Lego enthusiasts.","Sheng Mumu asked them if they had any new, unopened editions of that racing car Lego set, and said she was willing to pay any price.","But people who could afford rare Legos usually didn't lack money.","She really couldn't think of a way.","Sheng Mumu had no choice but to employ the art of language.","She artistically embellished the reasons why she wanted to buy that model -","\"Brother, hello. A few years ago, an accident took away my son's legs.","Having lost his legs, he placed all his hopes for life in his hands, and only had Lego building left as a hobby.","As his mother, I only hope he can be happy. Please, brother, sell me this model!","My child really likes it. I'm willing to pay any amount.\"","With the idea of trying her luck, she sent it out, not expecting to actually find a willing seller.","The seller was a brother with an anime character as his chat avatar, who readily sold her the model, and even left a message telling her that if her son wanted any other rare Legos in the future, he could help her find them.","Sheng Mumu thanked him profusely, and immediately changed the otaku brother's nickname to \"Dream Maker.\"","Sheng Mumu thought that Qi Shaobai wasn't really her son in the true sense.","So...those words...shouldn't really count as cursing Qi Shaobai, right?","Sheng Mumu comforted herself, while tapping an electronic wooden fish for ten minutes.","Asking the Buddha to forgive her for lying.","Of course, she didn't tell any of this to Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai was simply ecstatic to receive a rare model, practically wagging his tail.","If he knew that she knew an otaku brother who could help her find all kinds of limited edition Legos, his tail would surely wag right off!","Qi Shaobai squatted next to the coffee table, eager to rip open the packaging, excitement written all over his face.","He had just found the opening when a hand suddenly pressed down on his shoulder, and a voice sounded from above his head.","\"Have you forgotten what you said?\"","Sheng Mumu glanced at him, emphasizing her words.","Qi Shaobai's hands froze: \"...\"","On the day he decided to study hard for the Gaokao and put all his Legos away in the collection room, he had made a solemn vow - that he wouldn't touch them again until after the Gaokao.","Dear Heaven...","How could her memory be so good???","The delight in Qi Shaobai's eyes gradually turned to grief, and he painfully squeezed out a few words from between gritted teeth.","\"I won't play with it, I'll just look.\"","Having said that, he reluctantly handed the Lego to Butler Zhang, and went back to his room with clenched fists to do some English listening exercises.","As he walked, he whispered to himself:","\"No rush, no rush, time will fly by in the blink of an eye...\"","Seeing Qi Shaobai like this, Sheng Mumu covered her mouth to keep herself from laughing out loud.","It wasn't actually that she was too harsh and didn't allow Qi Shaobai any entertainment.","Rather, this racing car model was extremely complex.","With a total of 19,000 pieces, once he started building it, it would take at least tens of hours.","With models, as soon as you pick up that first piece, you get totally obsessed and can't stop thinking about it.","Before it's completed, you can't focus on anything else.","Now was not the right time to be building models.","That night, Sheng Mumu wanted to share with Qi Mo the amusing reaction Qi Shaobai had when opening his gift, but never found the right moment.","After getting home from work, the workaholic immediately buried himself in his study.","By the time Sheng Mumu came out of the bathroom, she heard him talking to someone in the room.","The master bedroom had an semi-open space of about 10 square meters, with a desk.","Qi Mo would occasionally handle some temporary work there.","Passing by, Sheng Mumu glanced over.","The man with the steady aura was holding his phone, standing next to the desk, talking on the phone.","Their eyes met.","The usual hardness of his jawline softened a little, as if in greeting.","Then he was absorbed in the call again.","Some of Qi Group's real estate projects in the UK were stalled due to local circumstances.","He was discussing countermeasures with several core employees who had been with him since the group's founding.","Sheng Mumu leaned against the headboard playing on her phone, her gaze occasionally falling on Qi Mo.","The man had rolled up his shirtsleeves, revealing strong, pale forearms.","His collar was slightly open, posture relaxed and casual.","As he spoke, he would slowly pace occasionally.","More often, he stood facing the floor-to-ceiling window, posture tall and slender.","Sheng Mumu really enjoyed watching him work seriously.","It was like an enjoyable movie scene.","His voice was low and magnetic, decisive and steady.","He spoke concisely and directly, cutting to the key points.","Not only was it pleasing to her ears.","She could also learn a lot of business management experience from his brief words.","As Sheng Mumu listened, her eyes suddenly lit up, and she took out a notebook.","The pen is mightier than the memory.","She quietly stole some lessons, taking notes here and there.","On the phone, a subordinate was reporting some feasible solutions to Qi Mo.","As Qi Mo listened, his gaze inadvertently shifted away, looking at Sheng Mumu. His dark eyes paused briefly.","She had originally been sitting at the head of the bed, but somehow had moved to near the ottoman without him noticing.","She was now sitting cross-legged on the wool carpet, leaning over the ottoman, writing and drawing, looking very focused.","A trace of puzzlement rose in the man's eyes.","After a while, when he looked over again.","The puzzlement grew thicker.","She had moved to the chaise lounge now.","The man's brow twitched slightly, not understanding at all.","It seemed like every time she moved, it was a little closer to him.","Qi Mo's eyes were deep and confused.","After a while, Sheng Mumu quietly closed her notebook.","Listening to Qi Mo's long phone call had given her quite a bit of inspiration, and several ideas had sprung up in her mind.","She couldn't wait to discuss them with Qin Jiamu.","Qin Jiamu also felt the same when Sheng Mumu messaged her, so the two impatient people simply met up directly.","An hour later.","Seven Coffee Shop.","Qin Jiamu breathlessly pulled out a chair.","\"Little Mumu, sorry I'm late. I was just watching a movie with my husband in East Town, and rushed over when I got your message. I'm exhausted!\"","Sheng Mumu poured a glass of water for Qin Jiamu, \"Don't worry, have some water first.\"","Qin Jiamu took a sip, \"I didn't get anything out of that movie at all, my mind was full of ideas for the brand promotion.\"","Sheng Mumu looked apologetic, \"Did I interrupt your date night?\"","\"No way, we're an old married couple.\" Qin Jiamu smiled and lowered her voice, \"Plus, I gave him a little treat before leaving, to appease him a bit.\"","As she finished speaking, a sweet expression appeared on Qin Jiamu's face.","It was hard to imagine such an expression on a woman married for nearly 20 years.","Sheng Mumu's gossipy soul suddenly ignited, and she narrowed her eyes, \"What treat?\"","\"Little Mumu, you're so gossipy!\"","Qin Jiamu's ears turned red, and she glared at her.","Then cunningly shot her a look, and slowly asked in return:","\"What about you, out so late discussing work, did your man at home say anything?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, eyes curving.","\"I also gave him a little treat.\""]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Who is [L]","paragraphs":["Qi Mo finally finished the phone call. His eyes scanned the room, but he didn't see Sheng Mumu anywhere.","Just then, there was a knock on the bedroom door from outside.","Opening the door, Zhang Housekeeper stood outside.","He held out the tray respectfully, with a subtle laugh in his tone:","\"Sir, this is prepared by Madam for you. She asked me to tell you to remember to moisten your throat after being on the phone for so long.\"","On the tray, a bowl of honey pear slices was steaming hot.","In an instant, the man's ink black pupils were softened by the faint steam.","In a low, gentle voice he asked:","\"Where's Madam?\"","\"Madam went out in her car,\" Zhang Housekeeper recalled. \"Madam was on the phone when she went out. It seems like she mentioned going to discuss work.\"","Qi Mo thought for a few seconds and quickly figured it out.","With her impulsive personality, she most likely had a sudden idea and wanted to discuss it with someone.","Qi Mo lightly hmm'd and brought the soup back to the bedroom.","The outer layer of the bowl spread warmth to his palms.","The man lowered his eyes, his long lashes concealing the gentle light in his eyes.","He took a spoonful of the sweet syrup.","A strand of warmth also rippled through his heart.","Sweetness rose up.","*","The \"One Bouquet for Life\" brand was successfully launched.","In the Madam group chat that didn't miss any news, the ladies excitedly discussed:","-【Congratulations Madam Qi for being the first madam in our group to successfully start a business.】","-【Building 12 sends congratulations. [Flower][Clapping hands]】","-【Haha, Building 5 also sends congratulations.】","-【Madam Qi, I admit I had some misunderstandings about you before, thinking you were just playing around with the flower shop. I didn't expect that in just a few months, you've managed it into a brand, and done it so well. [Thumbs up][Thumbs up][Thumbs up]】","-【Today when I was getting my beauty treatments, I heard people next to me talking about Yueji Flower Shop, and I proudly told them that it was opened by our district's madam [Proud][Laugh out loud]】","-【I already got my husband to buy a 'One Bouquet for Life', using up his one-time purchase chance. [Covering laugh]】","-【Seeing Madam Qi's resounding business success, I also got the idea of starting my own business.】","-【I'll be honest with you, recently I've been thinking of opening a snack shop. Want to do it together?】","The chat was lively in the group.","Suddenly, a forwarded news link appeared on the screen.","The headline was: 【A certain up-and-coming flower brand is suspected of using \"hybrid peonies\" to pass off as imported roses】","The news didn't directly reveal the company name, but hinted towards \"Yueji\" in every line.","The lively chat atmosphere in the group stopped abruptly.","Sheng Mumu's eyebrows furrowed as she tapped into the comments section.","Several comments condemning \"Yueji\" were prominently ranked at the top, with exceptionally high numbers of likes.","-【Ineffectual mosaic, no need to guess, it must be the recently heavily advertised \"One Bouquet for Life\" brand.】","-【Pfft, a bouquet of broken roses selling for over 5,000 yuan, I thought it was something impressive, didn't expect it was using peonies to pass off as roses, taking consumers for fools?】","-【Unethical company, unethical boss.】","-【Boycott this kind of consumer deception, friends, call on those around you to boycott together.】","Sheng Mumu's fingers flexed. Her brows were tightly knitted.","As expected.","What was bound to come, still came.","Where there are profits, there will be competition; where there is competition, all kinds of tactics are inevitable...","She had anticipated all kinds of situations that could happen, just didn't expect it to come so quickly.","As she contemplated countermeasures in her mind, it took several rings of the phone before she heard it.","She picked up the call.","Su Tingran's voice sounded very anxious.","\"Mumu, did you see what's in the group?\"","Sheng Mumu's tone was calm. \"Yeah, just saw it.\"","Su Tingran: \"How come it's that [l] again, it was her last time too.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't notice earlier.","Only after Su Tingran's reminder did she realize the person who shared this news was the same one who revealed Sheng Lei was her brother in the group last time.","Su Tingran: \"I asked Madam Sun and Madam Qian, asked if they knew who this person was, but neither could answer.\"","[l] didn't use a name as her nickname, and rarely talked about herself in the group.","It was as if she appeared overnight.","Su Tingran worriedly asked: \"She seems prepared, targeting you every time, Mumu. Why don't I add her as a friend and ask who she is and what she wants.\"","Sheng Mumu squeezed the phone a bit tighter, her tone calm:","\"No need, Tingran. If that person is really targeting me, since she dares to post in the group, she must have prepared follow-up responses. Even if we directly ask her, she won't reveal any flaws, it'll only let her know we've noticed her.\"","Su Tingran felt Sheng Mumu made sense, but was still worried. She asked:","\"Mumu, have any strange people with a 'l' in their name appeared around you recently?\"","Perhaps Su Tingran had been watching too many mystery shows lately, thinking to analyze the person's identity from their online name.","Sheng Mumu murmured: \"l?\"","Among all the people she knew, three had an l in their names.","Liu Zhenzhen, Sheng Lei, Qiao Li.","Sheng Lei was still in jail, it couldn't be him.","Liu Zhenzhen was just a high schooler.","Although they had conflict before, they had clarified face-to-face. Liu Zhenzhen was probably avoiding her, there's no reason she would take the initiative to stir up trouble.","Plus, most crucially.","Sheng Lei and Liu Zhenzhen couldn't possibly appear in the Xiyu Yue Court madam group chat.","So the only one left with an l in their name who could appear in the madam group was Qiao Li.","Qiao Li's face appeared in Sheng Mumu's mind.","Recently, Feng Yaoqin had been coming over every few days, eating meals together with them.","She would occasionally bring Qiao Li along.","Through several interactions, Sheng Mumu had a great impression of Qiao Li, she was a very outstanding girl.","Usually quiet, you could tell she was very smart and clever.","Sheng Mumu didn't believe Qiao Li would be [l], and she didn't have any motive or reason to sabotage Yueji either.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips and slowly said:","\"Among the people I know, there are none that can be associated with the letter 'l'. Perhaps l doesn't represent a name, but has some other meaning.\"","After chatting with Su Tingran a bit more, Sheng Mumu hung up.","She decided to not agonize over finding out who [l] was for now.","Even if [l] was standing in front of her now, there was no evidence to accuse the other party of hiring internet water armies to smear Yueji.","She couldn't confront someone just because they forwarded news in the group chat, or said a couple things related to her.","At present, dealing with Yueji Flower Shop's PR crisis was more important than finding [l].","On the other side.","Qi Group headquarters building, top floor CEO office.","\"President Qi.\"","The executive assistant knocked and entered, handing his phone to Qi Mo. His speech urgent:","\"There is bad news spreading online about Madam's company.\""]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: From \"Sister Sheng\" to \"General Sheng\"","paragraphs":["Negative information spread online almost instantaneously.","As the news gained more attention, several competing brands jumped out.","Some tried to take advantage of the hype, while others tried to add fuel to the fire.","\"Flower Gift\" and \"Luxuriant Flower Lane\" successively posted on their accounts, claiming that their products would never engage in passing off inferior goods as high-quality ones.","\"Daily Flower Talk\" directly started a livestream, teaching netizens how to distinguish real roses.","The backdrop banner in the live studio conspicuously read \"Jing City's First 'Real' Flower Shop.\" The satirical meaning was unambiguous.","Sheng Mumu drove to the company. Before she even stepped into the office building, she could already hear the noisy chaos coming from inside.","Rings of the telephone, clacking of keyboards, customer service staff answering calls...","However, when she went in, it was not quite like what she had imagined.","Although everyone had grave expressions, they were not in a frenzied rush.","Before Sheng Mumu arrived at the company, Cheng Zhuo had already instructed the employees: try to appease the customers as much as possible, be courteous in attitude, neither servile nor overbearing.","Seeing that the boss Sheng Mumu had finally arrived, everyone's expressions relaxed to varying degrees.","They were all waiting for her to take charge of the big picture.","Sheng Mumu stood in the middle of everyone, not wasting any time on superfluous words:","\"Meeting in the large conference room in ten minutes.\"","With that said, she strode towards her office.","Glancing back, she lifted her chin at Cheng Zhuo:","\"Come to my office. Jiamu will be here soon. Let's sort out the meeting agenda first, we three.\"","Cheng Zhuo froze for a moment.","During his studies abroad, Cheng Zhuo had been a management trainee at many renowned companies.","The Sheng Mumu before his eyes now overlapped with the images of those corporate leaders he had seen in the past.","Decisive, composed, orderly.","Watching her slender yet powerful back, Cheng Zhuo quickened his pace to catch up.","Without noticing, he had unconsciously changed how he addressed her, responding:","\"Sure, Boss Sheng.\"","Soon, Qin Jiamu arrived at the company.","Sheng Mumu fetched a cup of water at the water dispenser. Her slim, fair hand held the cup as she lightly leaned against the wall.","After glancing at the clock on the wall, she quickened her speech:","\"We have eight minutes to discuss this. Cheng Zhuo, brief me first on the current situation.\"","Cheng Zhuo felt the urgency of time. He furrowed his brows and nodded, speaking concisely.","\"Right now, online opinion is very unfavorable to us. Black posts are continuously being shared and upvoted.\"","\"Many media outlets have called asking about the authenticity of the rumors and requesting interviews with us.\"","\"Customer service has received many complaints. After explaining and trying to pacify their emotions, still over half of the customers want to cancel their orders.\"","Having conveyed the current circumstances, Cheng Zhuo's frown deepened even more.","\"Boss Sheng, Sis Jiamu, we didn't use mums as roses like the news reports said. Why don't we just send lawyer's letters directly and go after those spreading rumors and defamation? That's the simplest and most effective method.\"","\"You're thinking too simply,\" Qin Jiamu took over the conversation. \"Just trying to clarify is a bad approach. Now that things have escalated to this point, many onlookers won't even verify if the news is real or fake. They just want to participate in the condemnation and stand on the side of the louder, greater number.\"","Sheng Mumu nodded in agreement and added:","\"Jiamu is right. Once we fall into the self-defense trap, we become the passive party. We'll be subject to all kinds of attacks and nitpicking from the outside, even if we have a clear conscience. Our brand image would still be affected.\"","Qin Jiamu: \"Let's hurry and discuss my thoughts—\"","Having worked in advertising planning for many years, Qin Jiamu had handled quite a few crises.","She quickly proposed several methods to redirect public opinion and prevent the situation from deteriorating further.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips tightly. As she listened to Qin Jiamu speak, she absentmindedly tapped her chin with her fingers.","This was a habitual tic of hers when pondering something.","Suddenly, her eyes lit up as she calmly stated: \"How about we just let the black posts continue to spread and make good use of the momentum?\"","She and Qin Jiamu exchanged a look. Qin Jiamu quickly understood her intention. Though slightly uneasy, she still chose to trust Sheng Mumu and gave a firm nod.","On the side, Cheng Zhuo, the youngest with the least experience, was still clueless.","Several minutes later, the three entered the large conference room.","The company's thirty-odd employees had all arrived, with expressions of anxiety or unease.","Sheng Mumu would be leading the meeting.","Under everyone's gaze, she stood before the conference table.","Her fingertips rested on the table surface as she slightly leaned forward.","After scanning the room, she spoke in a calm tone:","\"Thank you all for staying dutifully at your posts when this emergency came up. Firstly, please rest assured and believe that Yueji has a clear conscience and does not fear false accusations and smears.\"","This simple yet powerful line brought some tranquility to everyone's hearts.","Sheng Mumu narrowed her eyes slightly. Her tone suddenly became completely different from earlier.","Cool, resolute.","\"Next, we'll mainly take three steps to seize this opportunity and expand our brand promotion.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, faint cries of surprise sounded in the conference room.","Some murmured to each other, some looked doubtful.","Did they mishear? Boss Sheng actually said to \"seize the opportunity\"?","Whether they could even get through this was uncertain, yet she wanted to promote their brand?","Some of the more seasoned employees showed faint disdain. They started doubting if they had chosen the wrong boss.","If they had known the Yueji leader was so incapable yet still so confident, they wouldn't have joined a start-up even for a higher pay.","Sheng Mumu tapped the table, the crisp sound ringing out.","Her calm gaze swept over everyone. She raised her voice and continued:","\"First, do not close the commentary sections or delete negative posts on our website, app, Weibo, public account, etc.\"","\"Second—\" She turned to look at Cheng Zhuo. \"Cheng Zhuo, you handle the media contacts. Arrange individual interview times for every media outlet that reaches out. Not a single one is to be declined.\"","She looked towards the group again. \"Third, the procurement department will contact our overseas suppliers to increase the quantity of our next batch of orders. Have them provide timestamps and photographic proof of the entire planting, harvesting, and transportation process for all the flowers.\"","She paused, then looked towards the corner of the room at a few men in plaid shirts.","\"Engineer Yu, you and your team will add a dynamic feedback feature to the website and app backends within two days. Every customer can trace each bouquet back to its origin, harvest date, packaging date, etc. based on their order information. Can you make it work?\"","The one Sheng Mumu called Engineer Yu was the head of the technical department and the employee with the highest salary in the company.","Engineer Yu held a ballpoint pen under his chin. He pondered for around ten seconds, mentally running through the backend logic.","Then he looked up confidently and responded in a neither servile nor overbearing tone:","\"No need for two days. Our department will work overtime tonight and definitely launch it by midnight.\"","Engineer Yu glanced left and right at his subordinates. \"Come with me now. Each person take one module and get started.\"","\"Okay!\" Hearing their boss's command, the programmers in plaid shirts responded in chorus and followed him out of the conference room.","When hiring Engineer Yu, Sheng Mumu had given him a great deal of autonomy.","She now tacitly approved of the technical department's early departure.","Sheng Mumu understood very clearly that the purpose of a meeting was to solve problems, not to make the employees sit there listening to the boss talk big.","\"The UI and product departments can go get to work first too. Cooperate fully with Engineer Yu. Although time is tight, I still hope the pages won't be too shabby. Show me your professional capabilities.\"","The product and UI department employees responded in chorus:","\"Got it, Boss Sheng.\"","Having made all the arrangements, Sheng Mumu clapped her hands together.","The corners of her bright eyes slightly lifted as she encouraged everyone:","\"Go on and get busy, thanks for the hard work.\"","Everyone: \"Yes ma'am!\"","In less than ten minutes, the meeting ended.","Those employees who had doubts about Sheng Mumu at first now had them completely dispelled as they left the conference room.","She was confident, clear, and decisive.","She had won over all the employees with her own abilities.","After everyone gradually left the conference room, Sheng Mumu heaved a long sigh of relief. Her palms were slightly damp with sweat, but she felt an indescribable sense of exhilaration in her heart.","It was a feeling she had long missed.","The sense of achievement in overcoming obstacles in her career.","She enjoyed it very much."]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: When are you going to have kids","paragraphs":["Qi Group headquarters building.","Qi's assistant: \"Chief Qi, do you need someone to delete the negative comments about your wife's company?\"","The man sitting in the leather chair frowned with knitted brows, not responding to the assistant's words.","The phone on the desk suddenly lit up.","He was particularly concerned about the page, and a notice from the Yueji official blog popped up.","After reading it, the man's eyes darkened slightly as he walked to the floor-to-ceiling window.","The glass mirrored surface reflected his sharp and stern profile.","Suddenly, the thin lips curved up in an imperceptible arc.","It seemed to be a kind of tacit understanding, and also seemed to be a silent approval.","He read between the lines and understood her decision.","After a long time, Qi's low and calm voice was heard:","\"Don't get involved in my wife's company affairs, go check out the people behind those news reports.\"","Qi's assistant: \"Okay, Chief Qi.\"","*","Without any help from the Qi Group, Yueji managed to complete an extremely successful public relations crisis management in less than twenty-four hours entirely on its own.","In an instant, online public opinion was reversed, and the official website page views increased tenfold.","The number of customers subscribing to the \"One Bouquet for Life\" flower service afterwards gradually exceeded the number of people who cancelled orders after the incident.","Many netizens who were not very interested in the online incident also joined in the discussion.","-【This is how you make an effective clarification, face the problem directly, accept media interviews, and respect consumers' right to know.】","-【Finally it's not a lawyer's letter, I'm almost traumatized by lawyer's letters.】","-【I didn't have much impression about this brand before, but I have quite a good impression after this incident, at least it's a company that does not evade problems.】","-【So the question is, if Yueji did not deceive consumers or use inferior products to substitute fine ones, how did those initial reports come out in the first place?】","Even netizens noticed this point, and Sheng Mumu certainly would not miss it.","But having just dealt with a public relations crisis and orders for flowers surging, there was no time to look into this matter.","She had to postpone it for a few days before investigating in detail.","Feng Yaoqin was completely unaware of the sensational incident on the Internet.","She had always advocated staying away from the Internet and experiencing life, which was why she was so enthusiastic about traveling around the world.","Having just returned to the capital for not long, she was restless again.","The day after the Yueji public relations incident, she wandered to her daughter-in-law's house.","But the butler Zhang told her: \"Madam, the master and madam are not at home, they went to work.\"","Feng Yaoqin left dejectedly.","How strange, going to the company on a weekend.","She knew her son Qi Mo was a workaholic.","She didn't expect the daughter-in-law he married to be a workaholic too.","Feng Yaoqin estimated the time, and called Sheng Mumu in the early evening, asking Sheng Mumu to come home earlier and take a walk with her in the garden before dinner.","Sheng Mumu's hand holding the phone stiffened, and she secretly took a deep breath.","She knew the \"walk\" mentioned by her mother-in-law would take at least half an hour.","Although extremely reluctant internally, she sweetly agreed:","\"Okay, Mom, I'll be home right away and come over to pick you up directly.\"","Ah, what else could she do.","The hard-earned good wife and daughter-in-law image certainly could not be abandoned halfway.","Feng Yaoqin was still quite satisfied with her reply.","She grunted in a tone.","In the evening.","The mother-in-law and daughter-in-law with things on their minds walked side by side on the lakeside trail in the neighborhood.","Birds with white wings and green tails fluttered past in front of them.","The air was filled with the rich fragrance of grass and trees.","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath, suddenly feeling relaxed in body and mind.","The busy days and fatigue of the past few days were healed by the greenery before her eyes.","The evening wind at the end of summer was no longer sultry.","There was no one else around except them.","Feng Yaoqin put on the mother-in-law manner, walking while sharing with Sheng Mumu how she had organized her husband's life in an orderly manner when he was alive.","Sheng Mumu responded with \"uh-huh\", half-heartedly perfunctory. Her mind was on the company affairs.","Suddenly, Feng Yaoqin stopped, grabbed her arm, and asked in a slightly accusing tone:","\"When are you planning to have a baby? You've been married into the family for so long, yet there's not the slightest sign in your belly, what on earth is going on?\"","Sheng Mumu's thoughts were abruptly pulled back to the present, and her breath hitched.","She blinked blankly at Feng Yaoqin, at a loss for how to respond to this question for a moment.","\"Uh...\"","Let her think about how to make up a reasonable story...","Seeing Sheng Mumu's hesitant look, Feng Yaoqin's face sank.","She tightened her grip on Sheng Mumu's arm, and said gravely:","\"You don't have any health issues, do you? If there are any problems you need to see a doctor promptly.\"","Sheng Mumu's neck jerked back instinctively, and blurted out:","\"What health issues could I have!\"","As soon as the words came out, Sheng Mumu regretted it.","She saw Feng Yaoqin's expression becoming more and more complicated, her lowered eyes rolling in puzzlement.","\"Could it be... Qi Mo's problem?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............\"","Done for.","It seemed the more she talked, the more dubious it sounded.","There was no way to prevent her mother-in-law from imagining weird things.","Her mind raced to come up with a reasonable response, when her arm was suddenly jerked hard.","\"Ah--\" Feng Yaoqin's body shuddered, looking terrified as she pointed ahead.","\"Did you see that, just now...just now a woman ran past, dressed all in black with long hair, carrying a bag in her hand.\"","Looking in the direction Feng Yaoqin was pointing,","it was empty with no one there at all.","Sheng Mumu seemed to suddenly think of something, and her brows furrowed sharply.","Her mother-in-law's description was exactly the same as the strange person who had suddenly rushed out when she was driving last time.","Could it be that the person her mother-in-law saw was that weirdo?","The evening sun completely sank below the horizon.","The deserted lakeside colonnade inexplicably took on an eerie color.","Feng Yaoqin lost her mood for walking. \"It's getting late, let's go back.\"","Just then, a scream came from not far away."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: A Man like a clear breeze and a bright moon came to her from the crowd.","paragraphs":["There was a splash in the water.","Sheng Mumu and Feng Yaoqin looked at each other, their hearts skipping a beat. They hurried through a lakeside recreation area towards the sound.","To their surprise, they saw the strange, long-haired woman in black clothes fall into the lake.","She held her hands high over her head.","Looking closely, they realized she was cradling a tiny kitten about the size of her palm.","It seemed she had jumped into the water to rescue the drowning kitten.","On the lawn near where she fell in, there were several more little white kittens, mewling piteously.","There was no time to think further.","Sheng Mumu slapped Feng Yaoqin firmly on the back.","\"Mom, just wait here for me. Don't go near the lake.\"","She quickly surveyed her surroundings, assessing the situation.","After just a few seconds of deliberation, she jumped into the lake.","Though the late summer air was sweltering, the lake water still held a trace of chill.","Luckily, the woman hadn't fallen far from the recreation area, so Sheng Mumu was able to swim over quickly and circle her chest, pulling her towards shore.","By the time the two were hauled ashore by the rapidly arriving bodyguards, a circle of onlookers had gathered.","\"Please put it... cough... somewhere safe, cough cough... Thank you,\" the woman sputtered, having swallowed several mouthfuls of water.","Before she had fully caught her breath, she carefully handed the kitten to someone on shore.","Only now did Sheng Mumu get a good look at the woman's appearance.","Very fair, with dull eyes and round cheeks and nose.","Sensing Sheng Mumu's gaze, the woman turned and looked at her, forcing an awkward smile: \"Thank you.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"You're welcome.\"","Before Sheng Mumu could ask further, Feng Yaoqin hurried over, face etched with anxiety.","\"You scared me to death! How could you do something so reckless?!\"","It had all happened in an instant, and thinking back now, Feng Yaoqin felt terrified.","What if something had happened to Sheng Mumu? How would she explain to her son, how would she explain to the old matriarch?","Feng Yaoqin was both anxious and angry. Seeing Sheng Mumu's state, she swallowed back the rebukes on the tip of her tongue.","The woman before her was drenched from head to toe, yet still smiled gently, soothing Feng Yaoqin instead.","\"Mom, I'm fine. I worried you.\"","Feng Yaoqin's severe frown did not ease one bit. She turned Sheng Mumu's body back and forth, double checking for any bumps or injuries.","\"You're too reckless! Just because you're capable, you have to show off?\"","\"The bodyguards were clearly nearby. Did you really need to rescue her yourself? Huh?\"","\"What if something had gone wrong, what if no one was around? Tell me, what would you have done then! A girl not even in her twenties, with no regard for her own safety whatsoever.\"","A gust of wind blew by and Sheng Mumu couldn't help but shiver.","Beside her ear was the matriarch's stern yet affectionate admonishment.","For a moment, she seemed to see her own mother's figure overlapping with Feng Yaoqin's.","All mothers in the world wore the same face.","Even scolding warmed one's heart to hear.","Suddenly Sheng Mumu's nose prickled.","In an instant, she understood her mother-in-law.","Arrogant, but kind at heart.","Liked to mock and lecture others, but not for her own gain.","That's right.","Someone who adopted Qi Mo from an orphanage and raised him so well could not be a wicked mother-in-law.","Sheng Mumu smiled lightly and looped her arm through Feng Yaoqin's.","\"Mom, I wasn't being reckless. I analyzed the situation before jumping in.\"","One had to ensure their own safety first when attempting to help others. Sheng Mumu was very clear on this.","After giving her a long silent glare, Feng Yaoqin clicked her tongue. \"Ah... You... reckless child...\"","As they spoke, more people gathered at the shore.","Bodyguards, security patrol, residents drawn by the commotion.","Night had fully fallen.","The lakeside trail lights were set on timers.","It had just turned 6:30pm, and a row of lamps switched on in unison.","Droplets of water clung to Sheng Mumu's lashes, blurring the lamplight into rings in her vision.","Through the haze, she made out a familiar tall, straight figure.","The refined, gentle man walked towards her through the crowd, face darkened and exuding an icy aura.","His strides were long.","Behind him, the driver Little Wang struggled to keep up while cradling a blanket.","Before Sheng Mumu could react, Qi Mo had draped the blanket around her.","The next second, a large hand wrapped around her waist and drew her into his embrace.","She let out a soft gasp, hands instinctively grasping the man's broad shoulders.","The warm yellow lamplight blurred her vision.","The man's profile was illuminated in a thin halo of light.","His scent enveloped her, and caught in his powerful aura, she found herself at a loss for words despite wanting to say something.","Her petite, exquisite face was pressed to the man's chest. She could clearly feel his heartbeat.","The surrounding noises seemed to fade away, the clamor dampening.","She vaguely heard the matriarch telling Little Wang to contact the family doctor quickly.","The security patrol seemed to be apologizing to Qi Mo.","It was all a chaotic jumble around her ears.","Sheng Mumu couldn't focus her thoughts.","All her attention was occupied by that steady, powerful heartbeat she couldn't ignore.","The intimate posture, the clean, crisp scent...","After long deliberation, Sheng Mumu decided she should say something.","She shifted uncomfortably and her rosy lips parted.","What came out was a line so foolish she couldn't believe she had uttered it.","\"Qi Mo... you're off work?\"","Qi Mo's expression was cold and devoid of warmth. At her words, his dark eyes glanced down.","Those obsidian orbs brimmed with light, his handsome visage right before her.","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched.","She heard him say in his low, magnetic voice,","\"Hold on tight. Don't move.\""]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: The Smell of Ambiguity","paragraphs":["Back at the villa.","The two went upstairs under the surprised gazes of Butler Zhang and the servants.","All the while, Qi Mo held her in his arms.","Sheng Mumu was not a shy person, yet for some reason, she felt a little embarrassed and tucked her face into the man's embrace.","Noticing her reaction, Qi Mo looked down at her.","His voice was low and gentle:","\"Bath first or see the doctor first?\"","Hearing this, she raised her head and their eyes met in the air.","The ambiguous atmosphere barged in recklessly and unbridled.","She averted her gaze, \"No need to see a doctor, I was only in the water for a short while.\"","Qi Mo seemed not to understand her words. He murmured \"hmm\", and said, \"Then bath first.\"","Entering the master bedroom, she was placed on the couch outside the bathroom.","Qi Mo walked into the bathroom while rolling up the wet sleeves of his shirt.","He frowned again and took off the bothersome tie, tossing it aside casually.","Soon, the bathtub was filled with hot water.","When he came out intending to carry her in, he saw her figure flash past him quickly, entering the bathroom and shutting the door with a whoosh.","As they brushed past each other, he noticed her ears seemed slightly flushed.","The man froze for a moment...","Silent for several seconds.","The corners of his eyes slowly lifted with belated, faint amusement.","By the time Sheng Mumu finished her bath and came out, the family doctor had arrived.","In a daze, she had her temperature taken, was asked if she felt discomfort anywhere, and even had her pulse checked.","After confirming she was fine, the family doctor left.","Butler Zhang knocked on the door and placed two bowls of hot porridge by the bed before going back downstairs.","Sheng Mumu leaned against the headboard. Qi Mo sat at the edge of the bed.","He scooped up a spoonful of porridge from the bowl and brought it to her lips.","Without saying a word, the silent action made Sheng Mumu's eyebrows twitch involuntarily.","How strange, how strange.","Why did the doctor say she was fine when she clearly felt her ears burning hotly.","She pursed her lips tightly, snatched the bowl and spoon from Qi Mo's hand.","Wanting to ease the bizarre atmosphere, she casually laughed:","\"No need to feed me, I only fell into the water, I'm not paralyzed.\"","Qi Mo gazed at her, eyes tinged with laughter, \"Alright.\"","Under his tangible stare, Sheng Mumu felt something was off, but couldn't figure out exactly what was strange.","Enduring the man's deep stare, she awkwardly took a sip of the porridge.","Two sips.","Three sips...","Really couldn't stand it anymore, she put down the bowl and spoon.","Smiling at Qi Mo, she said helplessly:","\"With you staring at me like this, are you hungry and want to eat too?\"","Qi Mo paused briefly, the corners of his eyes slowly lifted, and he chuckled softly.","\"I won't look at you, eat.\"","Qi Mo looked away, leaning back with one hand on the mattress.","One leg outstretched, the other slightly bent, he sat lazily, shirt hem curling up along the loose, casual arc.","His undone collar revealed the contours of his handsome collarbones.","Looking at the man posing like a poster in front of her, Sheng Mumu picked up the porridge and took a satisfying big gulp.","A feast for the eyes indeed.","It really improved her appetite.","Downstairs in the living room.","When Qi Shaobai heard that Sheng Mumu had just fallen into the water, his expression instantly changed.","He strode toward the stairs, intending to go upstairs and ask about the situation.","Suddenly, he was called to a stop by a voice.","\"Little Bai, come here and help me see, how do you work this?\"","Feng Yaoqin held up her phone and beckoned her grandson over.","Qi Shaobai was too anxious to care about anything else at the moment. He turned his head impatiently.","\"Grandma, I'll go upstairs to check the situation first, I'll come back down to teach you later.\"","\"With your dad there, what could possibly happen.\" Feng Yaoqin waved at Qi Shaobai again, her tone becoming a bit stern, \"Come here, help me see how to make the font size bigger on this phone.\"","Qi Shaobai's figure paused, then he slowly changed direction and returned to the sofa.","Alright, grandma was right too.","With his dad there, even huge problems would be fine.","Qi Shaobai took Feng Yaoqin's phone and taught her how to enlarge the font.","Feng Yaoqin responded sporadically, a wisp of shrewdness and cunning appearing in her eyes.","After what had just happened, Feng Yaoqin's opinion of Sheng Mumu had completely changed.","Previously, she thought Sheng Mumu was extremely scheming.","Trying every means to win over the old lady and marry into the Qi family, eyeing their son's assets and status.","But today, Feng Yaoqin suddenly discovered Sheng Mumu's good qualities.","Kind, optimistic, smart, calm in the face of events.","These traits were what Feng Yaoqin looked for in a daughter-in-law.","She decided the torment for her daughter-in-law ends here.","From now on, she would truly treat her as family.","Thinking this, Feng Yaoqin smiled contentedly.","\"Grandma, did you hear what I said?\" Seeing her distracted, Qi Shaobai shook the phone, \"If you want large font to read news in the future, tap this, it's the same for this app too, first go to Settings——\"","\"I saw it, I saw it.\" Feng Yaoqin responded somewhat perfunctorily.","Her attention had only been focused on the screen for one or two seconds before thinking of something else.","Just now, she had noticed her son's expression when carrying his wife.","It was fair to say with just one glance, she could foresee they were truly in love.","That gaze was exactly like her unfortunate late husband's when looking at her in the past.","Thinking this, Feng Yaoqin glanced upstairs with laughter in her eyes.","She gently exhaled in relief.","Fortunately she had stopped this silly boy Qi Shaobai.","Qi Mo and Mumu were so in love.","Maybe they were making little brothers and sisters for Qi Shaobai right now.","How could she let this silly boy go up and disturb them.","Ah, kids will be kids.","They don't understand anything.","*","The next day.","Sheng Mumu didn't expect that woman to take the initiative to come visit.","The woman she had saved yesterday was now sitting on the living room sofa. Her hands were somewhat awkwardly placed on her knees. Her eyes were dull and lifeless, but she was clearly trying her best to relax.","Sheng Mumu spoke first with a smile, \"What's your name?\"","The other party bit her lip and slowly responded, \"I'm the homeowner of Building 21, just call me Shen Lan.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"Alright, I'm Sheng Mumu.\"","\"Thank you for saving me and that kitten yesterday.\" Shen Lan pursed her lips, a shallow smile slowly appearing on her fair face. Her gaze didn't look directly over as she said, \"Really, thank you so much.\"","\"You're welcome.\" Sheng Mumu politely laughed and gestured for the servant to bring over two cups of coffee, \"Were you usually the one feeding those kittens?\"","Shen Lan nodded slightly, still avoiding eye contact as she answered:","\"Yes, I used to feed them often. Yesterday when I went, I noticed the mother cat was gone. Then I happened to see a kitten fall into the water and wanted to fish it out, but accidentally fell in myself.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly understood.","No wonder when she saw Shen Lan last time, she was carrying a bag and walking towards the lake. So it was to feed the cats.","Recently, someone in the madame WeChat group had suggested to the property manager to drive away the stray cats in the community.","Perhaps because of this, the mother cat had been chased away, and the hungry kitten fell into the water.","Sheng Mumu looked puzzled. So Shen Lan didn't know about the property management's decision to expel the stray cats. She wasn't in the madame WeChat group.","Just as she was thinking this, the servant brought the coffee over.","The cup bottoms tapped the table, making a faint sound.","Shen Lan's eyes opened wide for a moment, her brows knitted tightly before relaxing again quickly.","Seeing her expression, Sheng Mumu couldn't help but feel strange, falling into contemplation.","The living room was silent.","Shen Lan's gaze wandered, not knowing where to look.","After a while, as if to conceal her discomfort, she picked up the coffee and took a perfunctory sip before putting it down again.","Watching her manner, Sheng Mumu found some clues to her puzzlement. She suddenly called out:","\"Shen Lan—\"","Shen Lan's eyes instantly tightened, somewhat nervous and awkward as she raised her head.","Now Sheng Mumu understood in her heart, firming her judgment. She said gently:","\"If I'm not wrong, you should be...severely socially anxious, right?\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Shen Lan's eyes widened in shock, finally meeting Sheng Mumu's gaze directly:","\"Uh, is it that obvious?\"","I was trying so hard to be active and sociable though.","How could she still see through it?"]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: It's really good to have him around","paragraphs":["Actually, from the moment Shen Lan walked into the room and sat down, Sheng Mumu noticed something was off.","After chatting for a few sentences and observing Shen Lan's facial expressions, she felt more and more that the symptoms were similar to those of people with social anxiety.","Earlier, Mom Zhang had said that although Shen Lan had lived in the villa area for many years, she was not familiar with the neighbors around her.","This showed that she was very withdrawn and afraid of socializing, preferring the company of small animals over people.","(Social anxiety score +1)","Since coming into the room, her expression had remained unnatural. Even when conversing, she always felt awkward and rarely looked Sheng Mumu in the eyes.","(Social anxiety score +10)","In almost every conversation, Sheng Mumu was the one who spoke first. As long as Sheng Mumu didn't say anything, Shen Lan didn't know how to initiate a topic.","(Social anxiety score +100)","When she saw the coffee being brought to the table, she froze instantly. There was a high probability that she was imagining \"Oh no, what if she wants me to stay for afternoon tea, so much pressure!\"","(Social anxiety score +999)","Finally, when Sheng Mumu suddenly called her by her full name, she became alert, as if facing a formidable enemy.","(Social anxiety score +10086)","Based on all these characteristics,","Sheng Mumu could almost assert that Shen Lan undoubtedly suffered from severe social anxiety.","Shen Lan finally opened up to Sheng Mumu.","Shen Lan came from a family of scholars. Her parents were both diplomats and the family was well off.","As for her, she had been introverted since she was little and preferred solitude.","Her parents hoped she could become an outstanding diplomat like them.","Her parents' expectations were like asking for her life. When she still lived at home, they would fight and clash all the time.","Later, she simply moved out to live alone. Absence makes the heart grow fonder, and in recent years, her parents had not nagged her as much. Their expectations of her had changed from \"becoming a diplomat\" to \"being optimistic.\"","Speaking to this point, Shen Lan let out a soft sigh, revealing her helplessness:","\"Actually, I'm not that withdrawn. I have a lot of gaming friends. I can chat with them all night, until my keyboard catches fire. But when facing real people, I don't know how to get along. It's hard to make friends.\"","Sheng Mumu's bright eyes blinked. She volunteered, \"...If you don't mind, I can be your friend.\"","Shen Lan's eyes lit up. \"You don't think I have a weird, gloomy, and scary personality?\"","Sheng Mumu shook her head and smiled, \"If you want to talk about weird, wouldn't you find my talkative personality that can chat with anyone overly outgoing, like a neurotic?\"","Shen Lan was stunned for a moment. She didn't hide what she really thought and nodded, \"Well... indeed.\"","After she spoke, the two of them laughed.","At this moment, the two people with vastly different personalities reached an understanding.","The other's personality was different from theirs, but that didn't prevent them from both being interesting people.","After finishing the coffee, Sheng Mumu saw Shen Lan to the door of the yard and said,","\"If you don't want to be alone, you can come find me to hang out.\"","Shen Lan felt grateful. Her expression relaxed and she was no longer ill at ease.","\"Mm, Mumu, I'm very happy to meet you. Turns out talking with a stranger isn't so scary after all.\"","\"Is that so? Friends start from being unfamiliar to becoming familiar.\" Sheng Mumu smiled and seemed to think of something. \"Oh right, our villa district has a housewives' group chat. Do you want to join?\"","Maybe interacting and getting to know more neighbors could alleviate her social anxiety symptoms.","\"Ah? Um... that... no thanks.\" Shen Lan shook her head reflexively and answered very quickly, \"Next time for sure, I'll join next time.\"","After speaking, she waved goodbye and escaped as if for dear life.","Afraid that if she walked slowly, Sheng Mumu would catch her back and make her scan a QR code to join the group chat.","Sheng Mumu was left standing in place, staring blankly for a moment before laughing softly.","Ever since she came to this world, she had met many interesting girls.","Su Tingrang, Qin Jiamu, Shen Lan.","And there was also Jiao Li, whom she didn't interact with too much.","They each had different personalities, but were all extremely cute.","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath of the fresh air.","She marveled, life is so beautiful. All the girls are so cute. Everyone needs to work hard, she needs to work hard too!","On the other side,","Shen Lan stepped through the door of her villa. She kicked off her slippers and flopped onto the sofa.","She heaved a sigh of relief, as if a weight had been lifted.","She thought to herself, it's nice to make new friends.","But socializing is still so tiring. She hasn't had to talk this much in a long time.","She'll need to lie down like Ge You to rest for at least half an hour to unwind.","*","Qi Mo investigated and found the person who posted the smears.","When he handed the information folder to Sheng Mumu, Sheng Mumu couldn't hide her surprise.","She didn't expect him to have secretly investigated everything so clearly.","According to the information, the culprit was named Lu Zhiying.","She was the person in charge of the \"Daily Flower Language\" company.","Within less than half a month after Yueji Flower Shop opened, she quickly established the \"Daily Flower Language\" brand.","\"Daily Flower Language\" imitated Yueji in every way, but its market share in Jing City still couldn't match Yueji.","In order to occupy the Jing City market, Lu Zhiying chose to hire a large number of internet water armies to slander Yueji when its new brand was launching.","Sheng Mumu suddenly recalled that Cheng Zhuo had mentioned before that the person in charge of \"Daily Flower Language\" lived in Xiyu Yue Court.","Combining the information Qi Mo investigated,","they could confirm that Lu Zhiying was [L] in the housewives' group chat.","Sheng Mumu immediately shared what she knew with Qin Jiamu.","Qin Jiamu frowned slightly.","\"Mumu, what do you plan to do? Sue 'Daily Flower Language' for damaging business reputation?\"","Sheng Mumu gently tapped her chin with her fingers, pondering for a long time before her eyes flashed slightly. She slowly said,","\"I could sue, but I'm conflicted about whether I should do that or not. Driving someone to desperation will surely backfire.\"","Qin Jiamu understood what she meant and supplemented,","\"Once the other party is punished for damaging business reputation, they could face up to two years in prison in severe cases. Lawsuits like these usually drag on for a long time.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Currently, 'One Life, One Bouquet' orders are increasing day by day. This is a crucial period for the company's growth. Getting caught up in a lawsuit now wouldn't be ideal. Rather than stopping to tangle with the opponent, it'd be better to take bigger and faster strides to leave them unable to catch up even if they try.\"","Qin Jiamu looked approving. \"It puts my mind at ease that you can think this way.\"","In the business world, one needs to have means and make decisions.","More often, flexibility and subtlety are also required.","Not everything is black or white, and must lead to a resolution.","Sometimes, leaving the opponent a way out is to allow one's own path to extend further.","Before hearing Sheng Mumu's thoughts, Qin Jiamu had thought that no matter what decision Sheng Mumu made, she would support it.","Now, this was undoubtedly the decision that put her most at ease, and also surprised her the most.","She didn't expect Sheng Mumu to understand these principles at such a young age.","Qin Jiamu suddenly narrowed her eyes and smiled, teasing her,","\"Little Mumu, it seems you've learned a lot from being around that person at home. It really makes me look at you in a new light.\"","Hearing this, Sheng Mumu was slightly stunned.","She couldn't help but think of the small notebook she used to take notes on things she picked up.","It was true that just occasionally listening to him take work calls at home, she had learned a lot.","A smile crept up her fair face unconsciously, and her voice also revealed delight.","\"Mm, it's really great having him around.\""]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: The Relationship between mother-in-law and Daughter-in-law Makes Rapid Progress","paragraphs":["Although Sheng Mumu didn't sue \"Everyday Flower Language\" for slander, she still had Cheng Zhuo go see Lu Zhiying in person and make their stance clear.","First, warn them that evidence had already been gathered. If there were any more malicious competitive behavior, no matter how big or small, they would investigate and follow through.","Second, don't engage in meaningless petty actions in non-business settings anymore.","Facing Lu Zhiying, Cheng Zhuo exhibited a decisiveness and severity completely unlike his usual self.","At first, Lu Zhiying was still unwilling to admit to it. After he brought out the evidence, she finally hung her head low and kept confessing remorsefully to him:","\"I'm sorry, I...shouldn't have done that. Please tell your Boss Sheng, I really am very sorry.\"","Cheng Zhuo glanced at her coldly: \"Save that fake repentance.\"","If she really regretted it, she wouldn't have waited until he came to find her to admit to it.","Seeing her real thoughts being exposed, Lu Zhiying bit down hard on her lip, speaking in a trembling voice:","\"Can I see your Boss Sheng? I'd like to apologize face-to-face and thank her for not pursuing this matter.\"","Cheng Zhuo got up and leisurely straightened out his shirt hem, saying:","\"The reason I came today instead of Boss Sheng, do you know why?\"","Cheng Zhuo didn't wait for her to answer, continuing:","\"Because you're not worthy. Your malicious slandering of a peer and spreading rumors in private chat groups exemplifies your narrow-mindedness and limited vision. You don't even deserve to be her opponent, let alone rival.\"","Lu Zhiying's hands suddenly clenched tight, nails digging into her palms, tears falling to the floor.","After Cheng Zhuo left, she finally couldn't control herself and burst into loud sobs.","It turned out that Sheng Mumu was just her own wishful thinking as an imagined enemy, a competitive rival.","Admitting this hurt even more than admitting her own failure.","That night, in the housewives' group chat.","The person called \"l\" took the initiative to exit the group.","*","The matter was finally settled, but Sheng Mumu discovered that she was getting busier and busier lately.","In the past, Feng Yaoqin would come over to their place around once every three days. Now her frequency had increased to three times a day.","Sometimes pulling her out for a stroll.","Sometimes asking her opinion on which outfit looked better.","Sometimes when she was tutoring Qi Shaobai in English, she would drag over a chair and sit next to them, saying she wanted to \"listen in\" too.","Sheng Mumu didn't find it annoying at all, and understood her mother-in-law very well.","Feng Yaoqin was a typical woman who had busied herself for half a lifetime.","When she was young, she had taken care of her husband and son.","After her husband passed away, she traveled the world.","She was never idle for a moment.","Now, spending every day in a luxury villa with no need to worry about anything, she instead felt bored and wanted someone to accompany her.","Her previous strolling buddy was her niece Qiao Li, now it had changed to Sheng Mumu.","The two saw each other almost every day, and their mother-in-law daughter-in-law relationship improved tremendously.","That day.","Sheng Mumu and Feng Yaoqin were leisurely sitting on the sofa cracking melon seeds.","Neither noticed Qi Mo, who had just gotten off work and come home, standing at the entrance looking at them with slight astonishment.","On the TV, the protagonist was saying:","\"All you lost was a leg, while Xuan Ling lost love.\"","Right after the words fell, Feng Yaoqin instantly frowned. Pointing at the TV, she criticized:","\"Is he speaking human words, bastard!\"","Sheng Mumu firmly nodded, chiming in:","\"I think he lost his brainstem.\"","Qi Mo's footsteps halted as he silently processed this scene in his mind.","In just a few days, how did they get along so harmoniously already.","Qi Mo unconsciously slowed his pace, his gaze towards them tinged with a hint of probing meaning.","Sheng Mumu was carefully searching for something on the coffee table and sofa.","Suddenly, she looked to the person beside her with suspicion:","\"Mom, did you sit on my phone?\"","\"No I didn't,\" Feng Yaoqin pleaded innocent, straightening up to check behind her, \"I didn't sit on your... Oh, how is it here?\"","Sheng Mumu had an \"I knew it\" expression as she found her phone from under Feng Yaoqin's butt.","\"See, I said you sat on it.\"","Feng Yaoqin changed the subject, \"What do you need your phone for, are you going to order milk tea? I want the kind you bought for me yesterday.\"","\"Mom, do you want taro or boba?\"","Feng Yaoqin answered very proficiently:","\"Both, add some red bean too, half sugar.\"","Qi Mo's pupils shrunk slightly: ............","His mom even knows half sugar...","Right at this moment, Qi Shaobai walked out from his room.","Unintentionally, he caught sight of his frowning father who seemed to be pondering some problem.","Qi Shaobai called out loud:","\"Dad, you're home.\"","Hearing his voice, Sheng Mumu and Feng Yaoqin looked over.","Just one second, then their attention was again focused on the phone.","Continuing to order milk tea.","Qi Mo: \"......\"","He mildly \"mm-hmmed\" at Qi Shaobai, then casually strode towards the study.","From the corner of his eye he saw Qi Shaobai shuffling in slippers to sit on the other side of the sofa, naturally joining in their conversation.","\"Add one for me too, same as yesterday.\"","A complex and subtle expression appeared on Qi Mo's face.","It seemed like he was smiling, yet also helpless.","In less than a week's time.","He seemed to have become the most marginal person in this family...","*","Feng Yaoqin's biggest annoyance now was having too much free time.","Qi Mo's work was as busy as always, and Qi Shaobai had to prepare for the college entrance exam.","Her daughter-in-law and niece both had their own jobs and couldn't accompany her often.","Most of the time, she could only pass the time alone watching TV dramas in the empty villa.","Sheng Mumu keenly noticed this point.","One day after dinner.","Sheng Mumu pulled Feng Yaoqin along, mysteriously bringing her to a small garden plaza near Xiyu Yue Court.","\"Why did you bring me here?\" Feng Yaoqin looked around, puzzled, and asked.","Sheng Mumu: \"To bring you to dance. There are many people around your age here every day who come to dance in the plaza.\"","\"Dance?\" Hearing this, Feng Yaoqin showed reluctance: \"I'm not interested in dancing.\"","She had been overseas during the years when square dancing became a trend in China.","She had never experienced it herself, and didn't know what magic square dancing held.","Suddenly, the sound of music rang out.","\"I'm like a fish in your lotus pond, just to keep you company under that bright moonlight—\"","\"After going through the four seasons, the lotus fragrance remains—\"","Huh, wasn't this her cell phone ringtone?","Feng Yaoqin slowly turned her head to look towards the sound source.","The people who had been gathered in groups of three or two before were now in loose yet orderly rows.","Those middle-aged women around her age, following the lead dancer in front, lightly and cheerfully started dancing.","Everyone's faces were brimming with smiles, filled with the mundane warmth of human life.","Somehow, she couldn't help but sing along the second half of the verse:","\"Waiting for you amidst the water~\"","Next to her, Sheng Mumu peeked out, grinning smugly at her success, eyes bright and lively:","\"Since we're already here, Mom, why not give it a try?\""]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: Going to the Bar with my Mother-in-law","paragraphs":["Feng Yaoqin's world opened a brand new door.","After that, she would go to the square to dance almost every day, rain or shine.","She didn't need Shen Mumu or Qiao Li to accompany her, but she was over the moon dancing by herself and got to know many friends.","She had become the most beautiful elderly lady in the square.","Every evening, the driver would take her to the square.","After dancing, the driver would pick her up and take her home, as punctual as going to work.","Day by day, it was visible that Feng Yaoqin was becoming happier and happier, with a smile always on her face.","That day, after dinner, Shen Mumu noticed that Feng Yaoqin didn't leave immediately as usual. Instead, she was listless and leaning on the sofa.","\"Mom, aren't you going dancing today?\"","Shen Mumu asked curiously.","Feng Yaoqin shook her phone with a unhappy expression on her face:","\"The group announced that the sound system is broken. Sister Fang who is responsible for the music took it for repair. Everyone is taking a break today.\"","Shen Mumu: \"Then you can take a good rest today.\"","Feng Yaoqin suddenly straightened up as if a thought struck her, and looked over joyfully.","\"That's right, Mumu. I heard Xiaoye and Old Zhao mention that there is a very lively street in Xicheng District at night where many young people dance. Do you know about it?\"","Ever since mother-in-law integrated into the square dancing community, Shen Mumu kept hearing unfamiliar names from her, like Xiaoye and Old Zhao, who seemed to be active members of the dance group.","As for that street in Xicheng District, Shen Mumu had heard of it before.","It was a famous bar street in the city.","Shen Mumu: \"Mom, that's not a place for square dancing.\"","Feng Yaoqin: \"I know. Their main thing is dis...disco? And live bands and stuff?\"","Shen Mumu smiled and nodded, \"Yeah, that kind of thing.\"","Feng Yaoqin rubbed her fists eagerly and straightened her neck.","\"Let's go. Take me to broaden my horizons. Tomorrow when I see Xiaoye, Old Zhao and the gang, I can tell them I've been there too.\"","Seeing her enthusiasm, Shen Mumu didn't know how to dissuade her.","On second thought, why should she even try to dissuade? It's not like there was a \"No entry if over 50\" sign at any bar entrance.","Oh well, there should be no harm going there.","Shen Mumu grabbed her little lambskin bag, tilted her chin, \"I can accompany you there, but remember we have to come back before 11pm. You can't stay up late.\"","\"Alright, alright.\" Feng Yaoqin laughed, wrinkles appearing at the corner of her eyes.","The role relationship between the elderly and the young would often reverse over time.","Just look at this - Feng Yaoqin following her daughter-in-law looked exactly like a little girl being taken out by her parent to see the world, how amusing.","Arriving at the door, Feng Yaoqin's expression suddenly changed.","\"Wait, stop.\"","\"Hmm?\"","Shen Mumu thought the mother-in-law had changed her mind and was about to ask why, but saw that Feng Yaoqin was looking at her own clothes in disgust.","\"I need to go change into better looking clothes before going out.\"","\"Pfft~\" Shen Mumu laughed out loud.","Indeed, women of all ages love beauty.","15 minutes later, Feng Yaoqin came out in a new outfit, happily hopping into the car.","The car stopped in front of the bar street in Xicheng District.","Stepping out of the car, Feng Yaoqin gasped in surprise at the sight in front of her.","She felt the generation gap instantly in the form of a sense of dissonance.","The men and women she saw were colorful and dressed in all kinds of styles.","Feng Yaoqin scoffed, \"Their dancing is mediocre, no aesthetic sense, just shaking randomly.\"","After locking the car, Shen Mumu walked over, saw her mother-in-law's hesitant expression, and smiled, \"Or, shall we just take you to wander around some other neighborhood park instead?\"","Maybe they could run into other square dancing troupes from different districts.","Feng Yaoqin waved her hand decisively, \"No, like you said, we're already here, might as well go take a look no matter what.\"","She did say she wanted to broaden her horizons, no backing out now that they were here.","Shen Mumu was surprised, then smiled, \"Alright.\"","Considering the loud music may be too much for the mother-in-law's ears, Shen Mumu chose a bar that sounded the quietest from outside.","As soon as they entered, Feng Yaoqin was dazzled by the colorful strobe lights. On stage, a band was performing.","They were singing an English song, not too noisy, so ears were not under attack yet.","Sitting down in a booth, Shen Mumu waved to call over a server.","Seeing the mother-daughter pair, the server's pupils shrank almost imperceptibly.","What an odd combination.","A daughter bringing her mom to a bar?","Maintaining professionalism, the server suppressed his doubts.","\"Good evening, what can I get for you?\"","Feng Yaoqin glanced at him and casually said,","\"Longjing tea before the rain.\"","Server: \"???\"","Shen Mumu: \"......\"","The server and Shen Mumu were visibly taken aback.","Shen Mumu leaned in close to Feng Yaoqin and said,","\"Mom, this is just a small bar, they don't have nice tea. How about I order you a glass of orange juice instead?\"","Feng Yaoqin frowned and looked around.","What a rundown little joint, they don't even have Longjing tea before the rain.","\"Do you at least have corn juice, jujube juice?\"","Shen Mumu: \"......\"","She really didn't know how to explain to her mother-in-law that drinks favored by middle-aged and elderly patrons would definitely not be available here.","She thought for a few seconds, then smiled and suggested,","\"Mom, how about I order you some watermelon juice? It would match nicely with your outfit today.\"","Listening on the side, the server wondered privately.","Choosing drinks based on outfit colors, what kind of logic was that?","Before he could ponder further, a voice rang out from the table,","\"Good idea, watermelon juice it is.\"","As Shen Mumu expected, Feng Yaoqin, being a fellow woman, quickly understood this line of reasoning.","Just like how she would pick handbags and hair ties in matching colors.","That inexplicable obsessive-compulsive need for coordination, all women shared a bit of it regardless of age.","Shen Mumu ordered a Long Island Iced Tea for herself, and some random snacks.","This being Feng Yaoqin's first time at a bar, she was curious, but maintained a dignified demeanor as she looked around appraisingly.","In the dance area, young men and women swayed to the beat.","Feng Yaoqin scoffed, \"Their dancing is mediocre, no aesthetic sense, just shaking randomly.\"","Shen Mumu put a french fry in her mouth, playing the yes-man, \"You're absolutely right.\"","Feng Yaoqin glanced at the huge speakers on stage, \"The music is unpleasant too, noisy enough to deafen someone, the vibrations make my feet shake.\"","Shen Mumu the bootlicker: \"Too true.\"","From the corner of her eye, Feng Yaoqin noticed a young couple kissing, and tutted, \"Tsk, young people these days. Hanging out at places like this every day, how will they ever learn properly? If you want to date seriously, you should go to matchmaking corners. People you meet at bars are mostly unreliable.\"","Shen Mumu didn't chime in this time, because she suddenly noticed a familiar figure.","Beside her, Feng Yaoqin kept exclaiming:","\"Look at those girls over there around Li Li's age, twenty-three or twenty-four, what kind of weird clothes are they wearing?\"","\"Tsk tsk, that one even has pink hair.\"","\"Our Li Li is still the best, gentle and demure. Girls should be more low-key.\"","\"Don't you agree, Mumu?\"","\"Mumu?\"","Noticing that Mumu hadn't responded, Feng Yaoqin withdrew her gaze and looked over.","Shen Mumu's fine brows were slightly knitted, her attention fixed on the stage with a hint of confusion in her eyes.","On stage, a new band was setting up their equipment, seemingly a rock band based on their style.","The lead singer was a young woman with grayish-green dyed hair.","Wearing a cropped tank top and mini skirt, she had a sizzling hot figure.","With a smile at the corners of her lips and fiery eyes,","she casually flipped her hair and parted her red lips.","Her clear and unique voice resonated powerfully through the speakers, infectiously charismatic.","Adjusting the mic stand height and angle briskly with one hand, she grabbed the mic with the other and exchanged a look with the drummer.","Immediately, the muffled beats of the drums rang out, followed by the low throbbing bass.","The electric guitar came in sweeping the strings.","The young crowd downstairs was instantly ignited, cheering excitedly.","The lighting also adapted to the music, focusing on the female lead singer.","She was completely at ease, seemingly long accustomed to this reaction from the audience.","Nonchalantly lowering her eyes, she flipped her long hair, and her red lips parted lightly.","Shen Mumu was frowning slightly at first, feeling like this female lead singer looked very familiar, resembled someone she knew, but couldn't remember who exactly.","At this point, infected by the on-site atmosphere, she forgot her pondering and couldn't help vocalizing along with the music, \"o~\"","So cool!","Suddenly, her wrist was grabbed.","Turning to look, Feng Yaoqin's eyes had widened in shock as she stared at the stage, stupefied.","\"Mumu, isn't that colorful woman on stage Li Li?\""]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: niubility","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu's mind buzzed, and she focused her gaze.","Surprise and delight simultaneously appeared on her fair and radiant face.","Oh my goodness.","It's really Qiao Li!","So handsome!","One hour later, backstage of the bar.","Feng Yaoqin caught Qiao Li, who had just finished her performance.","Qiao Li was frightened to see her cousin appear here, and her soul almost scattered.","The arrogant expression she had on stage disappeared in an instant, replaced by a different demeanor (obedient and sensible version).","\"Cousin, sister-in-law, what are you doing here?\" Qiao Li asked.","\"How did you end up here?\" Feng Yaoqin frowned. \"If I hadn't found out, how long were you planning to keep it a secret from home?\"","Feng Yaoqin had practically seen Qiao Li grow up.","She couldn't imagine that the quiet and obedient niece would have such a rebellious side.","Seeing her cousin getting increasingly angry, Qiao Li lowered her gaze and pursed her lips, unsure of how to respond.","Feng Yaoqin glanced suspiciously at the people coming and going backstage and asked, \"Tell me honestly, did you start dating a hoodlum and let him corrupt you?\"","\"No, cousin, I just like singing,\" Qiao Li raised her eyes and said helplessly, \"I haven't made any bad friends, let alone dated a hoodlum.\"","Feng Yaoqin fell silent for a while before speaking slowly, \"Then I'll arrange a proper blind date for you, and you must not refuse. Only then will I believe what you're saying.\"","Qiao Li was stunned, \"? ? ?\"","It was only now that she realized.","Her cousin was not so much surprised about her band performing at the bar, but more concerned about her meeting the wrong people in such an environment.","\"If you don't agree, I'll tell your parents about this and see if they can bring you back,\" Feng Yaoqin threatened.","Hearing the words \"parents,\" Qiao Li's face instantly changed color.","From childhood to adulthood, her parents had been very strict with her upbringing, so she had to suppress her true personality in front of them.","She became closer to her cousin because they both lived in the city, and another important reason was that her cousin was much more open-minded than her parents.","Seemingly strict, she was actually more accepting of new things.","In order to appease her cousin, Qiao Li smiled and looped her arm around her, compromising, \"Alright, I'll go on the blind date. I'll show you with my actions that I won't go astray.\"","Upon hearing these words, Feng Yaoqin's brow finally relaxed slightly...","Because Sheng Mumu had been drinking, a driver was taking them home.","Inside the luxurious car.","Feng Yaoqin sat with her arms folded in the passenger seat.","Sheng Mumu sat in the backseat with Qiao Li.","Seeing that the atmosphere had eased up, Sheng Mumu quietly took out her phone.","During her college years, she was an avid fan of various music festivals and a rock enthusiast.","When she learned that her cousin was such an amazing lead singer, she couldn't contain her excitement. However, she didn't dare show it too obviously in front of her angry mother-in-law, so she secretly messaged Qiao Li.","Expressing her love and admiration for her cousin from three different dimensions: Chinese, mathematics, and English.","Sheng Mumu: \"Li Li, you're amazing! So cool! You sing so well, your stage presence is steady, you're like a professional singer!\"","Sheng Mumu: \"We are sworn brothers, you are He Ruxiu, and I am not as good as you.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"66666666666\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Niubility!\" [Note: This phrase is a slang term used to express admiration or awe.]","Upon receiving the message, Qiao Li couldn't help but chuckle, quickly covering her mouth to avoid being noticed by Aunt Feng.","She discreetly glanced at Sheng Mumu.","Sheng Mumu's eyes sparkled as he made a heart shape with his hands, continuously sending little hearts to her.","Using lip movements, he said, \"Wow, wow.\"","\"Cough!\"","Feng Yaoqin saw the interaction between the two through the rearview mirror and cleared her throat.","Instantly, both of them sat up straight obediently.","Feng Yaoqin let out a sigh and assumed the authoritative demeanor she hadn't used in a long time. She sternly said to the troublesome younger generation in the back, \"Li Li, tomorrow, I will arrange a blind date for you. Get yourself ready.\"","\"And you, Mumu—\"","Sheng Mumu blinked in confusion.","Huh?","What about her???","Feng Yaoqin paused, wearing an expression of \"Don't think I forgot about you,\" and said sternly, \"Last time, I asked you and Qimo why you still don't want children, and you didn't answer. Today, I won't press you further. Think about it in a few days and come find me when you've made up your mind.\"","Sheng Mumu's pupils suddenly contracted: \"...\"","So, it's about this.","I almost forgot about it!","Suddenly, she felt like she was being called to the principal's office back when she was in school.","Quite intimidating.","On the way back to Xiyu Yuting.","The two people in the backseat no longer whispered to each other, each pondering how to deal with the situation.","Sheng Mumu was the first to think of a solution.","The next afternoon.","As soon as Qi Mo returned home and entered the bedroom, she cornered him by the window.","\"Mom asked me when we plan to have a baby,\" Sheng Mumu furrowed her brows, anxiously discussing with him, \"I thought about it, and it's hard to explain. How about we say it's your issue? What do you think?\"","Upon hearing this, Qi Mo's nerves snapped, and he immediately furrowed his brows, looking straight at her with a slightly faster tone:","\"What issue do I have?\"","Sheng Mumu didn't expect him to react so strongly. She smiled, bending her lips, and patiently explained, \"If I say it's my issue, she will definitely drag me for a check-up.\"","She paused.","\"But if I say it's yours, it's more reasonable. There's no way to verify it.\"","Qi Mo's handsome eyebrows furrowed, and a barely noticeable glint of darkness flashed in his eyes.","\"It's not easy to prove, but it's good enough to deceive her and buy us some time,\" Sheng Mumu spoke candidly, continuing as she saw Qi Mo's cold and serious face approaching her slowly.","She stood with her back to the floor-to-ceiling window, unintentionally taking a step back due to his approach.","However, he didn't stop, and instead, he continued to advance, completely cornering her, with her back pressed against the glass.","The atmosphere suddenly became delicate.","Facing that face so close, Sheng Mumu felt her breath slow down.","Qi Mo stared at her, slightly leaning forward.","A cold breath instantly enveloped her, gently and slowly.","Like the fragrance of pine after a winter snow, low, mellow, and intoxicating.","She raised her gaze, helplessly blinked her eyes, captured by his compelling and scorching gaze.","Those beautiful eyes, at this moment, were as dark as ink, deep and unfathomable.","The scent of pine wrapped around him, together with his low and hoarse voice, drifted to her ear:","\"I can prove whether I have any issues or not.\""]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: Inch By Inch, Slowly Drawing","paragraphs":["How do I prove it?","Sheng Mumu could not help but think crooked.","Her eyes, moist like water, blinked and looked helpless and pitiable.","Seeing her fair cheeks slightly flushed, Qi Mo's expression softened a little, and his dark eyes showed a trace of laughter.","The afterglow of the setting sun slowly spilled in from the floor-to-ceiling window outside.","The man's exquisite and elegant side face was covered with a layer of warm light, so handsome that people could not move their eyes away.","The deep eyes that hid the smile looked at her steadily.","The beam was warm, and Sheng Mumu also felt her cheeks warmed up.","Thump-thump—","A soft place on the left side of the chest suddenly accelerated and jumped a few times.","Her heart was like being grabbed by a pair of invisible hands, and her breathing became slower.","She was stunned.","Sheng Mumu, Sheng Mumu.","What are you doing, lost your mind because of desire, and fell for a man?","The man opposite you is your sugar daddy.","Even if you fall for him, it can only be filial piety.","Anything else, you shouldn't even think about it!","She quickly averted her gaze, pressed her palm against the man's firm chest, and gently pushed.","The man's body paused slightly.","Through the thin fabric, he felt that the pair of fair and delicate hands pressed against his chest were a little hot.","His eyes became deep and gloomy, and his adam's apple rolled slightly.","Taking advantage of his distraction, Sheng Mumu dodged sideways.","Pulling the corners of her lips, she used an awkward smile to cover up her uneasiness.","\"Ahaha, Chairman Qi, you are very humorous. Don't be so humorous next time.\"","After saying that, she almost fled the bedroom like her life depended on it.","Only when she reached a place where she was out of sight of that scorching gaze, did her heart begin to boil silently.","Damn, what's wrong with this man!","Many times, the way he looked at her was like looking at...prey.","Could it be that he wants to make the fake become real?","That's another...","matter.","In the bedroom.","Qi Mo slowly straightened up, his eyes falling on the door where she had fled in panic.","Closing his eyes, a muffled laugh came from his chest.","The flat shirt on his chest, where she had touched it, wrinkled slightly.","The place wrapped in the shirt also produced wrinkles...","Like a drop of colored paint falling into the calm lake, ripples spread out.","Even after the ripples disappeared.","It was no longer the still clear water it used to be.","After that day, a subtle change took place in the relationship between the two.","Details she had never noticed before.","Floated to the surface one by one.","This feeling appeared suddenly one morning.","At that time, she was half asleep.","She vaguely felt the man next to her get up.","In a daze, she opened her eyes a slit.","In the dim light.","The man stood at the end of the bed, his back tall and straight.","He leaned forward and picked up the end of the quilt that had fallen to the carpet.","Covered her again properly.","The man's figure gradually approached, and she quickly closed her eyes.","Then, she felt a gentle force under her neck, and the edge of the quilt was tucked in carefully.","Her long eyelashes fluttered lightly, breathing evenly, trying not to let him find out that she was awake.","Not until the man went into the bathroom, and the sound of trickling water could be heard.","Then he went to the walk-in closet.","The sound of clothes hangers being flipped and collided, the light buckling sound of the belt, and the sound of opening the watch drawer.","Although they were all very faint sounds.","But it kept her thoughts running wild, unable to fall asleep.","Not until she was sure Qi Mo had gone to the company.","She suddenly opened her eyes and sat up.","Carefully recalled, and suddenly realized.","When Qi Mo was on a business trip, she would wake up in the morning with the quilt fallen to the ground.","But as long as he was at home, she would wake up with the quilt still on her.","So it turned out... it was because he was silently tucking in the quilt.","The second time she had this subtle feeling was one day when the family went to Feng Yaoqin's house for dinner.","It was drizzling outside.","Not heavy, but the raindrops were blown by the wind, fluttering. It was very annoying.","Qi Shaobai was too lazy to use an umbrella. He put up the hood of his hoodie, put his hands in his pockets, and jogged ahead.","Qi Mo took a long-handled umbrella from the butler Zhang, opened it.","He moved his arm towards her, his gaze lingering and gentle, hinting for her to hold on.","The umbrella isolated the two in a small space.","Not a drop of rain leaked into her side.","While his shoulders were soaked.","The expensive and delicate shirt stuck to his smooth and well-shaped arms.","She was momentarily lost in thought.","When they arrived at her mother-in-law's house.","Feng Yaoqin was preparing to wrap dumplings.","Qi Shaobai knew he would mess things up if he tried to help, so he sat on the sofa playing with his phone very sensibly, waiting for dinner to be served.","Sheng Mumu tied up her long hair with a hair tie, washed her hands, and went into the kitchen to help.","Qi Mo was already inside with his sleeves rolled up a little, holding a large glass bowl filled with meat filling, and mixing it.","While chatting with her mother-in-law, Sheng Mumu casually took an apron and put it around her neck.","She tied the waist straps behind her back with one hand.","Qi Mo's gaze followed her movements and looked over. He put down the bowl in his hand, walked naturally behind her.","Without saying a word, he took the ends of the straps from her hands and tied them unhurriedly.","The man's slender and well-proportioned fingers inadvertently brushed across her lower back.","At the back of her neck, she could feel the faint breath.","Feeling the straps being tightened, his low and magnetic voice came from behind.","\"It's tied.\"","At dinnertime.","Qi Mo's phone on the table lit up.","His hands were peeling shrimp, he glanced at the phone with his eyes, then turned to look at her.","His tone was casual and natural:","\"Help me see who sent the message.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment, slid open the screen, and tapped into WeChat.","The chat list was very Qi Mo-esque.","The friend nicknames were all in the format of full name + note.","The suffixes were sometimes company names, sometimes departments.","Even Qi Shaobai and Feng Yaoqin were coldly noted with their names.","Only the pinned conversation at the top was different from others.","The words \"My Wife\" were particularly conspicuous.","There was even a small sun emoji embellishment.","Sheng Mumu's eyes paused for a moment.","It was hard to imagine the scene of the silent and majestic man editing her WeChat nickname.","She pretended not to notice, tapped into the work group.","On the screen was the branch manager reporting project progress, a string of professional terminology and data, the information was very long, like a short essay.","However, Qi Mo just glanced at it casually, his eyes stayed for less than three seconds.","Then he retracted his gaze and said in a deep voice:","\"That's enough.\"","After turning off his phone for him, Sheng Mumu was absent-minded for the rest of dinner.","Why did Qi Mo pin their conversation?","After all, most of the messages she sent him were meaningless nonsense.","Why did he clearly not care much about the group message just now, yet still wanted her to open his phone for him, and also glance at it during dinner?","Was he deliberately letting her see it?","She was no fool, she couldn't help but guess this.","She secretly glanced at the cause of her complicated feelings with the corner of her eye, and her eyes tightened inexplicably.","At this moment, the aura of that man, who was always cold and aloof, was on the verge of a smile.","Revealing a kind of restrained and pure delight.","She felt her chest shudder on the left.","His actions were careful and meticulous.","Hard to notice without deliberate observation.","It seemed like trying it out, yet also natural.","As if afraid she would know, yet afraid she wouldn't know.","On the blurred boundary line of their \"contract marriage\", he went close but did not cross.","Inching closer, plotting.","A little by little, seeping into her life.","Sheng Mumu asked herself.","If there was any change taking place between her and Qi Mo.","She really couldn't produce conclusive evidence.","But to say things were still the same as before.","That would be deceiving herself."]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: Miss pua You're a little young.","paragraphs":["Recently, Qiao Li has also encountered similar troubles.","Feng Yaoqin charged for a diamond VIP membership on a matchmaking website.","She urged the website's matchmaker to arrange two blind dates for Qiao Li in a row.","The first one was a university professor.","He looked scholarly and was well-mannered. He was seven years older than Qiao Li.","They met at a Japanese restaurant.","At first, the conversation was normal until the man asked:","\"Do you mind if I check your hotel check-in records before marriage?\"","Qiao Li was shocked and couldn't believe it.","Hey, bro.","Isn't it too outrageous to say this at the first meeting?","The other party noticed her dislike and explained with a smile:","\"Miss Qiao, don't mind. I've been blind dating for a long time and haven't met a suitable partner. To be honest, I quite like you today, so I asked you this question. If it was someone else, I probably wouldn't have thought to ask...\"","\"I don't like you,\" Qiao Li interrupted him, \"People with no boundaries, stay away from me.\"","After saying that, she left directly with her bag.","The second one was a fitness coach.","He was the same age as Qiao Li and looked good with a fit body.","When she went to see that man, she had just come out of the band's rehearsal studio.","She didn't dress up on purpose. Her fair and delicate face had a very natural beauty.","Unexpectedly, the first thing the other party said when he saw her shocked her.","That man looked her up and down with a frown, and asked in a puzzled tone:","\"Why didn't you put on makeup?\"","Qiao Li's face sank: \"????\"","Are you polite?","The man seemed oblivious to her displeasure. He squinted and looked her up and down again, and said:","\"The profile said you are 1.7 meters tall. You don't look like 1.7 meters to me. I'm 1.5 meters tall.\"","Qiao Li was already cursing in her heart.","Who asked you?","On the surface, she maintained her calm and said lightly: \"Oh, you don't look 1.8 meters either. Did you exaggerate?\"","The other party became impatient and spoke faster: \"I really am. I just measured yesterday.\"","Qiao Li shrugged and smiled: \"If you say so, then so be it.\"","The other party still wanted to argue, but she had already called the waiter to order food and ignored him.","Trying to pick up girls? You're still too young.","It took Qiao Li less than ten minutes to quickly finish the meal.","She wiped her mouth, picked up her bag, and pushed back her chair to get up.","Seeing that she was about to leave, the man also got up from his chair:","\"Let me pay the bill first, you can wait for me by the car. The Mercedes-Benz outside is mine.\"","Qiao Li showed a polite smile and said:","\"I've already paid through my phone.\"","The man looked surprised and said: \"Oh, is that so? Then I'll pay for the late-night snack.\"","Qiao Li: \"......\"","He actually thought she would stay with him until late-night snack time.","His self-perception was too good.","\"No need for late-night snacks, I'm going home.\"","The man was stunned for a moment, and blurted out, \"What about me?\"","Qiao Li instantly showed an innocent and naive expression, blinking her eyes:","\"Ah? Don't you have a home?\"","She was used to playing the role of a well-behaved girl in front of her elders. Her innocence and confusion were portrayed just right, skilled and adept.","Her mocking words made the other person unhappy, yet unable to really take offense.","The man was dumbfounded, only to finally realize that Qiao Li was not interested in him.","In order not to lose too much face, he raised his eyebrows:","\"Alright, let's each go home then. I also feel that today's blind date was not very satisfactory.\"","\"Okay, bye,\" Qiao Li perfunctorily responded a few words and walked towards the door with her bag.","After taking a few steps, she suddenly remembered that she hadn't gotten back at him for mocking her height when they first met.","She immediately stopped, slowly turned around, and raised an apologetic smile:","\"Oh, right, I forgot to say, your sneakers look fake.\"","Her voice was slightly loud, just enough for the surrounding diners to hear.","The curious gazes of the surrounding diners fell on the man's sneakers. His face instantly turned red, and he wanted to defend himself.","Qiao Li didn't wait for his response and walked away swaggeringly.","She knew that for a man, these words were damaging enough to piss him off for the whole night.","Phew~ That felt good.","Walking out of the restaurant, Qiao Li couldn't wait to vent to Sheng Mumu.","The two had been in the same trench for a few days, and their relationship was much better than before.","Qiao Li: \"Sis-in-law, you don't know what weirdos I met on the blind dates these past two days.\"","Sheng Mumu immediately replied: \"[Ear emoji] I'm all ears, I really want to hear about it.\"","Qiao Li: \"@##¥%@¥%......(800 words omitted)\"","After a round of venting, Sheng Mumu laughed until she couldn't stand straight.","Qiao Li sent over a distressed emoji.","Qiao Li: \"If a normal man could just drop down from the sky now, pretend to be my boyfriend, and help me smoothly get past Auntie's scrutiny, that would be so great.\"","Sheng Mumu was drinking milk tea. Seeing her message, she choked and started coughing violently.","Damn.","When faced with blind date requests from elders, the first reaction of this family is to find someone to pretend, huh?","\"Sister Sheng, are you choking?\"","Cheng Zhuo walked by her open office door and heard her coughing. He poked his head in and asked.","Sheng Mumu patted her chest to catch her breath.","Seeing Cheng Zhuo, a hint of ambiguous smile suddenly flashed in Sheng Mumu's eyes.","Seeing that she had stopped coughing, Cheng Zhuo turned to leave and continue working.","\"Cheng Zhuo, wait.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly called out to him.","He turned back to see Sheng Mumu looking at him with a beaming smile, gesturing for him to come over.","\"Come, sit.\"","Cheng Zhuo was puzzled. He felt her smile was very strange but still obediently pulled out the chair across from her and sat down.","\"What's the matter, Sister Sheng? Is there a work issue?\"","Sheng Mumu arched her brows playfully.","\"If I remember correctly, you are twenty-seven, right?\"","Cheng Zhuo nodded.","The topic of age suddenly made him realize this was a good opportunity to subtly find out about Sister Sheng's background.","He wrapped the question in his reply: \"Yes, I was born in December of xx year. Sister Sheng, you are one year older than me, born early in the year?\"","Sheng Mumu was caught off guard by the question.","She seemed to have not paid attention to when the original host was born.","Her brows knitted slightly as she carefully recalled the information on her ID card.","\"Yeah, early in the year.\"","Because it took her some time to think about it, her tone was a bit slow.","In Cheng Zhuo's eyes, this slowness took on a completely different meaning.","Could it be that Sister Sheng was also unclear about her exact birthdate?","This makes it very likely that she was adopted by the Sheng family.","The probability that she is his sister has increased again!","A hint of joy appeared on Cheng Zhuo's face. He directly dropped the \"Sheng\" and called out:","\"Sis, why did you ask about my age?\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes glinted. She smiled and said:","\"Sis wants to introduce you to a girlfriend, a really cool one. What do you think?\""]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: Your gentleness and my gentleness Seem different.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu did what she said she'd do. She quickly arranged for Qiao Li and Cheng Zhuo to meet.","Qi Mo noticed something was off about her one day when she came out of the bathroom after showering. He saw Sheng Mumu smiling happily as she lay on the bed sending a voice message on her phone.","\"Li Li, that guy is called Cheng Zhuo. He's about 1.8 meters tall, good-looking, and has two little dimples.\"","After sending it, she opened the chat again to listen.","Seemingly satisfied with her own objective assessment, she pursed her lips in a slight smile and flipped over, speaking to her phone again:","\"Cheng Zhuo, do you have any photos? Send one over, if not, take one now.\"","Qi Mo was drying his hair with a towel, water droplets sliding down his stiff, coarse hair.","Hearing Cheng Zhuo's name mentioned, his eyes flickered slightly.","The fingers holding the towel stiffened.","He couldn't help but recall the last time he spoke with Cheng Zhuo.","He wondered how Cheng Zhuo planned to verify his guesses about her background.","But it probably wouldn't be much longer.","If she really was one of the Chengs, would she leave?","Thinking of this, the man's strong brows furrowed deeply.","Various possibilities flashed through his mind as his eyes churned with darkness.","Suddenly, a complaining voice came:","\"What is this, a daily life photo? I asked for a photo, not some weird baby picture!\"","The extremely social Sheng Mumu, after sending her grumbling voice message, held her phone up to the towel-drying man beside her.","\"See, I told Cheng Zhuo to send me a photo so I could show Li Li what he looks like, but he sent me this kind of photo instead.\"","Qi Mo chuckled softly and looked at the screen.","In the photo, three children sat lined up on a rocking car.","Two boys and a girl.","The tallest boy on the left side of the frame had his lips pouted, an unwilling expression, as if forced by an adult to ride the rocking car.","Qi Mo guessed this was probably Cheng Zhuo's brother, Cheng Xin, the president of Fangcheng Group.","His gaze moved to the middle, and Qi Mo's eyes suddenly tightened.","The little girl in the pale yellow dress held an ice pop, tilting her head at the camera with her two tiny dimples full of smiles.","The shortest little boy on the right couldn't sit still. He stood waving his hands on the rocking chair, as if wanting his older brother and sister to look at him.","Qi Mo's eyes narrowed slightly.","The intention behind Cheng Zhuo sending this photo was very obvious.","He wanted her to see a childhood photo of the three Cheng siblings together.","The man's motions of drying his hair stopped as he gazed at her with deep, brooding eyes.","Sheng Mumu didn't notice his subtle expressions. She still looked at her phone, joking:","\"What do you think, isn't this guy silly for using a baby picture with split pants when trying to impress a girl?\"","Qi Mo was silent for a few seconds, making sure he didn't see any abnormal expressions on Sheng Mumu's face, before slowly answering with a faint laugh in his voice:","\"Mm, he doesn't seem too bright.\"","Sheng Mumu nodded in agreement, \"Mm\"-ing before sitting back on the bed.","She sent Cheng Zhuo a threatening voice message:","\"If you don't have any normal photos, I'll just use your old ID photo!\"","Watching her enthusiastically care about and meddle in other people's relationships, Qi Mo's lips curled up slightly as he laughed helplessly.","That night before bed, Sheng Mumu told Qi Mo the truth.","\"Actually, Li Li wants to find someone to pretend to be her boyfriend to get out of the matchmaking dates my mom arranged.\"","Leaning against the headboard reading a business magazine, Qi Mo's brow quirked slightly. \"Pretend?\"","\"Yeah, pretend.\" Sheng Mumu nodded and said, \"Just like us.\"","At her words, the man's hand flipping the pages suddenly paused, and his eyes clouded with obscurity.","With her back to him as she played on her phone, Sheng Mumu didn't see his expression as she continued:","\"It would be best if it works out, but if not, a pure, platonic arrangement like ours is pretty good too.\"","The sounds of page-flipping behind her stopped completely, and after a few seconds of silence, the man's low voice rang out:","\"Success depends on the person.\"","Hearing his words, Sheng Mumu blinked in confusion.","He rarely gave opinions on other people's matters, yet today he uncharacteristically stated a clear stance.","It seemed a bit strange.","Curious, Sheng Mumu turned her head.","The man's profile was stern and determined. Sensing her gaze, he turned to look at her and asked in return:","\"What do you think?\"","Caught off guard by the question, Sheng Mumu thought his expression was very subtle, as if there was meaning behind his words.","After pondering for a while without deciphering his intent, she answered belatedly:","\"Hard to say, depends on Cheng Zhuo's performance.\"","Hearing her reply, the man's gaze suddenly softened as he murmured deeply:","\"Right.\"","*","Three days later.","Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li finally met up.","Sheng Mumu had arranged for them to meet at the bar where Qiao Li's band performed.","On the way there, Sheng Mumu conveyed Qiao Li's thoughts to Cheng Zhuo.","\"My cousin actually wants to find someone to pretend to be her boyfriend, act out a play. But the dates she's gone on have all been super weird.\"","Cheng Zhuo had seen many posts online complaining about bad matchmaking dates, so he could guess this Miss Qiao was probably hurt from the experience.","He gave a cheerful laugh:","\"I understand. I'm not here today thinking it's a matchmaking date. Let's just treat it as making friends with Miss Sheng's cousin.\"","Plus, who knows, maybe in the future they'd become family.","As the two chatted while walking to the bar, Sheng Mumu smiled and said, \"Right, right, you're all peers, you should be able to chat happily.\"","\"Let me first introduce my cousin's personality to you.\"","Cheng Zhuo wasn't here for matchmaking to begin with. He just wanted to chat more with Sheng Mumu and find out more.","He nodded: \"Sounds good.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"She seems gentle, delicate and demure on the outside, loves music--\"","After saying the first half of the sentence, they stepped through the bar's doors.","The surrounding sounds suddenly grew noisy.","Cheng Zhuo only saw Sheng Mumu's lips moving but couldn't make out the second half over the din.","He figured Sheng Jie probably wanted to say Miss Qiao liked music and enjoyed playing the piano and such.","As expected, Miss Qiao was likely a very gentle and tranquil girl.","The atmosphere in the bar was fiery.","Cheng Zhuo focused on finding an empty booth and didn't notice the rock band performing on stage.","Sheng Mumu smiled and leaned in closer to be heard over the noise, looking at the stage proudly as she yelled:","\"The one singing on stage is my cousin!\"","Cheng Zhuo was stunned for a moment before following Sheng Mumu's gaze to look at the stage.","Suddenly his eyes widened in surprise.","On stage, one of Qiao Li's fair, petite arms was casually draped over the mic stand.","She had a beauty mark at the corner of her eyes, which looked upward in a lazy, casual manner.","Her attitude was unrestrained and at ease, perfectly in control.","Her burgundy spaghetti straps and black cargo pants and combat boots exuded a sweet yet spicy vibe.","Cheng Zhuo's eyes held traces of shock and stunned admiration, along with great astonishment.","He slowly turned his head:","\"Sister Sheng, I think we have different understandings of gentle.\""]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: One Word: 06","paragraphs":["After finishing her performance, Qiao Li came to the booth. Sheng Mumu briefly introduced them, then made an excuse to leave early.","The rest was up to fate.","She got into the car but didn't leave right away. Instead, she took out her phone and sent a message to Qi Mo, who was still at the company, to share what had happened today.","\"Li Li met with Cheng Zhuo today. I lied to them that you wanted to take me out for a midnight snack so I left early to give them some alone time. Aren't I clever?\"","She smiled and gently tapped \"Send.\"","Just as the message was sent out, her eyes suddenly tightened and her fingers hovered over the screen.","Strange.","Since when did she get used to telling him about everything that happened?","The vibration of the phone in her palm brought her thoughts back.","Qi Mo: \"Clever, 100 points matchmaker.\"","\"Pfft~\" Sheng Mumu laughed out loud.","Just as she was about to send back some emoji stickers, her phone vibrated again with the words \"Hubby\" flashing on the screen.","The call connected.","The man's low, magnetic voice came through the receiver:","\"Where are you? I'll come pick you up.\"","Sheng Mumu was puzzled and blinked: \"Huh?\"","Qi Mo seemed to chuckle lightly, his tone faintly cheerful:","\"You already told them, so we have to go for that midnight snack.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Uh...look here, there's an honest one who can't tell the difference between truth and excuses!","*","Three days later.","Sheng Mumu received a call from Qiao Li.","Qiao Li told Sheng Mumu on the phone that she and Cheng Zhuo had a wonderful chat.","The two agreed to pretend to be a couple to get through that hurdle with Auntie Feng.","Feng Yaoqin soon learned of Qiao Li's \"new relationship\" and was overjoyed.","After seeing the \"cheek-to-cheek intimate selfie\" that Qiao Li had posed for a long time, she became even more elated. She was completely convinced of Qiao Li's new romance and insisted on having her bring Cheng Zhuo home for dinner, no matter what.","She also solemnly called Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu to remind them to arrange their work schedules to avoid any conflicting dates.","\"Sure, Mom. I'll coordinate the schedules.\" Sheng Mumu readily agreed.","As the matchmaker, she felt quite proud whether Qiao Li and Cheng Zhuo were fake or just acting.","She also vaguely felt they could become real.","After hanging up, Sheng Mumu casually opened the WeChat group.","She saw they were discussing a new movie that would be released soon.","- [The tickets for the premiere of \"Fiery Delusions\" are so hard to get. I couldn't buy them even with connections.]","- [The premiere is when the cast and crew will meet with fans. Tickets were snapped up by fans long ago.]","- [Sigh, famous directors are famous directors. Even our group couldn't get tickets, how rare.]","- [Let's just watch it at home after the theatrical release. Home theaters are better than movie theaters.]","- [That's all we can do now, what a pity. I was really looking forward to this movie.]","- [Right, it's Director Qiu's movie that took 3 years to make, and it's his specialty genre too. The hype online is already off the charts.]","- [So envious of those who get to go to the premiere.]","Sheng Mumu skimmed it a few times then exited WeChat without paying much attention.","It wasn't until the day Cheng Zhuo came for dinner that she heard the name of the movie again.","\"Little Cheng, you and Li Li just started dating, you should go out more to grow your relationship.\" Feng Yaoqin smiled at Cheng Zhuo, obviously very satisfied with her niece's boyfriend whom she just met.","As she spoke, she took out two movie tickets from her pocket and handed them over, \"Auntie has two movie tickets here, for that trendy new movie, what was it called...\"","Qi Shaobai's eyes lit up as he reminded: \"Fiery Delusions?\"","\"That's right, that's the name.\" Feng Yaoqin stuffed the tickets into Qiao Li's hand, \"Li Li, go watch it with Little Cheng. Old Ye's daughter pulled some connections to get these tickets, I heard they're not easy to come by.\"","When she finished speaking, Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li looked at each other.","They quickly reached a tacit understanding and said in unison:","\"Thank you, Auntie.\"","The atmosphere at the dinner table was harmonious.","Only Sheng Mumu noticed Qi Mo's expression freeze for a moment when he heard Feng Yaoqin's words.","She guessed he was probably wondering who \"Old Ye\" was.","So she leaned over and tugged at his shirt under the table.","The man with deep, handsome features turned his head, his gaze lowering as he looked over.","The lines of his side profile were elegant and noble, his long lashes casting a small shadow beneath his eyes.","His voice was gentle and mellow, drifting to her ear, \"Hmm? What's wrong?\"","She lowered her voice and explained for Qi Mo:","\"Old Ye is a friend of Mom's who does square dancing with her.\"","Her tone was a little proud.","After all, she was the only one at the table who knew these things.","Qi Mo was stunned for a moment, then the darkness in his eyes began to gleam with laughter, growing thicker and thicker.","\"What are you two whispering about over there?\"","Feng Yaoqin suddenly called out to them, interrupting their \"whispering.\" Not knowing where she got them from, she took out two more movie tickets and handed them over.","\"Got these ready for you too.\"","Qiao Li maintained her gentle and well-behaved image, smiling happily, \"Auntie, you're so resourceful. These premiere tickets are impossible to find outside. Money can't buy them.\"","Cheng Zhuo chimed in to agree with Qiao Li, remembering his \"niece's boyfriend\" role.","As they spoke, Sheng Mumu glanced at the ticket information.","She started thinking about who to ask to go see the movie together.","That afternoon, she overheard Qi Mo on the phone in his study saying he would be going on a business trip to a nearby city for a few days that weekend.","The premiere was on the weekend so he couldn't make it.","Just as she was thinking about it, the ticket in her hand was gently taken away by a pair of slender, well-shaped hands.","\"Sunday, 8:30 pm,\" Qi Mo murmured, confirming the time as he lowered his eyes.","After looking it over, he returned the ticket to her hand.","Sheng Mumu: \"Do you have time to go watch it that day?\"","Qi Mo's brow quirked slightly as he unhesitatingly said: \"Of course.\"","Suddenly, a plaintive voice broke the warm atmosphere at the dinner table.","\"Grandma, what about me???\"","Looking in the direction of the voice, Qi Shaobai had a face full of gloom.","Qi Shaobai had been waiting and waiting for Grandma to hand out tickets one by one.","He didn't expect her to stop when she got to him.","He saw Feng Yaoqin rummaging through her pockets in puzzlement:","\"Oh... ran out... Old Ye only gave me four tickets.\"","Seeing Feng Yaoqin teasing her grandson in amusement, everyone at the table except for the person in question, Qi Shaobai, couldn't help but laugh.","In Qi Shaobai's eyes, their laughter doubled his pain.","He really wanted to see this movie too.","Director Qiu was one of the top directors in China. His previous mystery/thriller films had intricate logic and profound meaning, which Qi Shaobai particularly liked.","Just as he was feeling dejected, his shoulder was suddenly patted.","He turned his head to see it was Sheng Mumu patting him.","A glimmer of hope suddenly sparked in his eyes.","Was she going to give him her ticket?","That must be it.","The little flame grew brighter and brighter.","Under his hopeful gaze, Sheng Mumu slowly opened her mouth:","\"The premiere is on Sunday, the movie and premiere event don't end until midnight. You have your monthly exam on Monday, remember?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"............\"","The flame in his eyes was doused.","What else could he say?","One word: Ouch","He could forever trust Sheng Mumu's memory.","She actually remembered his exam schedule more clearly than him!!!","Ahhhhhhh! (silent scream)"]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: Just Call me Brother-in-law","paragraphs":["After dinner, Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li took a walk home with Feng Yaoqin, chatting about family affairs.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo, both workaholics, were busy with their own things.","One was in the study looking over financial statements.","The other was in the bedroom writing marketing plans.","Qi Shaobai dragged his reluctant feet back to his room, with disappointment all over his cold eyes.","Buzz- The phone on the desk vibrated.","He opened it to see a message from Wei Zhaonan.","\"Handsome Zhaonan: Dad got two tickets.\"","\"Handsome Zhaonan: [Picture]\"","Suddenly, Qi Shaobai's eyes lit up when he saw the premiere tickets for \"Intense Delusion\" on the screen.","\"Shaobai: Not bad, where did you get them?\"","\"Handsome Zhaonan: Come to school tomorrow and call me Dad, then I'll tell you.\"","\"Shaobai: I don't want to smack you in front of teachers and classmates.\"","\"Handsome Zhaonan: I'll tear up the tickets now.\"","\"Shaobai: Oh.\"","Though he said so, it was just joking around.","Qi Shaobai knew that his good buddy Wei Zhaonan had saved him a ticket.","His mood leapt from the bottom of a valley into the sky.","The corners of his lips curled up as he hummed a tune and turned on his computer.","He would play some games to celebrate.","But as soon as he opened the game interface, his eyebrows furrowed.","Wait a second...","He seemed to have overlooked something important.","What if he ran into his dad and stepmom at the movie theater?","The mood for games vanished instantly.","He sat there with a serious look, opening his high school entrance exam preparation books.","As if making a painful decision, he ruffled his own hair and started working on practice questions.","One must know when to compromise. There are no such things as having your cake and eating it too in this world. A man must be willing to pay the price for his decisions.","That was what his dad had told him before.","And at this moment, Qi Shaobai deeply agreed.","Doing practice questions was the price he had to pay.","He must go to the movie premiere.","He also had to take Monday's monthly exam seriously.","Since he wanted both fish and bear paw, he could only give up his daily gaming time.","Plus, if, by any chance, extremely unfortunate event, he got caught by his dad and stepmom at the theater, he could use the practice questions he did as proof to mitigate some scolding.","He and Wei Zhaonan agreed to get into the theater early on premiere day, to avoid running into his family when getting tickets checked.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's message, Wei Zhaonan snorted contemptuously.","Without exaggerating, he felt Uncle Qi was the smartest adult he had ever met.","He did not believe at all Qi Shaobai could sneak this past Uncle Qi.","So he kindly gave Qi Shaobai a suggestion:","\"Handsome Zhaonan: Qi, I think you should start practicing your kneel down pose in advance. Make it look good, maybe you'll get less reprimanding when Uncle Qi catches you.\"","\"Shaobai: Nonsense?\"","*","Sunday.","Though it was not time for the premiere to start yet, many fans had already gathered outside the commercial area where the theater was located.","Under a ginkgo tree fifty meters from the mall entrance.","A tall, slender boy surveyed his surroundings vigilantly, pulling down the brim of his hat a little.","With more than half his face covered by a black mask, one could still tell he had an aloof and cold look from his brow and eye contours.","Some passing girls glanced back at him a few times.","Noticing that, the boy moved further behind the tree.","He impatiently took out his phone and texted Wei Zhaonan.","\"Shaobai: Where are you?\"","They agreed to get in as soon as it opened, but he didn't see Wei Zhaonan around.","Soon a reply came:","\"Handsome Zhaonan: Fxxk, wait for me, I suddenly have an upset stomach, must've eaten something bad, going as fast as I can, wait for me a bit.\"","Qi Shaobai looked at the smelly message and clicked his tongue, turning off his phone.","He looked around again.","Just then, a black Rolls-Royce parked at the intersection outside the theater.","People's eyes were drawn to it.","The car came to a full stop, and the driver in the front seat got out and jogged a few steps to open the rear door.","Then, a man got out of the car.","His features were sharp and clear-cut, his eyes pitch black, his expression steady and aloof.","He was carrying his coat loosely in one hand instead of wearing it.","The crisp lines of his black casual shirt outlined his broad shoulders.","He had casually rolled up the cuffs a few times, and the hem was slightly billowing in the wind.","Though still in formal business attire, he exuded an air of leisurely nonchalance.","Under the night sky, the tall and upright man stood out.","In just a few seconds, more and more eyes focused on him, and whispers arose among onlookers.","The man bent down slightly and reached his hand into the car.","Soon, a fair and delicate hand was placed over his rugged, well-defined one.","He gripped Sheng Mumu's hand and gently exerted some strength to lead her out of the car door.","Their eyes met. The coldness in Qi Mo's dark eyes evaporated, replaced by wisps of tenderness.","The moonlight like silver intertwined with the flickering neon lights.","It shone upon their figures.","Against the backdrop of traffic, it was as if time froze for a moment.","To passersby, they looked like a stunning couple destined to meet.","But to Qi Shaobai, who was fifty meters away under the ginkgo tree, it meant trouble.","He sighed to himself. Things were not looking good.","Dad and Stepmom arrived before Wei Zhaonan.","It seemed he could no longer sneak in early. He could only try to blend into the crowd after most people had entered.","Behind the Rolls-Royce, a black Maybach parked slowly.","Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li got out of the driver's seat and passenger seat respectively.","Qiao Li spotted them at first glance.","\"Cousin, sister-in-law.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes crinkled as she smiled. \"What a coincidence. We just got here too.\"","The four of them stood at the intersection.","Qi Mo's cold eyes briefly glanced at the black Maybach, and his brow twitched almost imperceptibly.","It seemed Cheng Zhuo was no longer trying to hide his wealthy family background.","Unaware of the fleeting emotion in Qi Mo's eyes, Cheng Zhuo grinned brightly and greeted them, \"Sister Sheng, brother-in-law, let's head in.\"","After he spoke, the coldness in Qi Mo's eyes dissipated slightly. He gave a faint nod as a response.","As Sheng Mumu walked in, she jokingly teased Cheng Zhuo, \"Cheng Zhuo, since you're accompanying Li, shouldn't you be calling Qi Mo cousin instead of brother-in-law?\"","Cheng Zhuo was taken aback and at a loss for words temporarily.","Shoot.","It seemed his inner hope for Sheng Mumu to be his real sister was too obvious.","Now was not the time. He had to keep it hidden.","He scratched his head awkwardly and smiled.","Suddenly looking to the composed man beside him, he humbly asked:","\"Mr. Qi, how should I address you? Cousin, brother-in-law, or Mr. Qi?\"","His main purpose of coming with Qiao Li today was to help her get through her aunt.","Mr. Qi and Sister Sheng knew they were pretending to date.","So addressing Mr. Qi made sense too.","Qiao Li had been chatting with Cheng Zhuo frequently lately, getting along like friends.","She rolled her eyes at Cheng Zhuo and took over, \"Are you silly? If you call him brother-in-law, it sounds like you and cousin are family. Calling him cousin makes it seem like you and I are family. But ultimately, no matter how you address them, cousin and brother-in-law are family.\"","Cheng Zhuo originally understood clearly. But after hearing Qiao Li's words, he got confused again, his CPU working furiously, \"Then how should I call him...?\"","\"Just brother-in-law is fine.\" Qi Mo's eyes crinkled slightly as he suddenly spoke up.","Having gotten an answer, Cheng Zhuo quickly responded, \"Alright, brother-in-law.\"","Sheng Mumu was totally oblivious to why they had been agonizing over this for so long. She pulled Qiao Li along towards the entrance. \"Let's get in. I want to buy popcorn.\"","She turned and glanced at Qi Mo. \"Do you want some? If so we can get a large bucket.\"","Qi Mo chuckled softly. \"Sure.\"","Then his gaze shifted, scanning the surroundings lightly as he looked for the entrance and concession signage.","Not far away.","Seeing his father's gaze sweep by, Qi Shaobai nervously shrank back further despite the great distance between them.","He lowered his hat brim again.","Observing in secret.jpg"]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: crush","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai glanced at the time.","8:25 PM.","There were fewer and fewer people at the movie theater entrance.","Almost everyone had already gone in to check their tickets.","But Wei Zhaonan still hadn't arrived.","He called Wei Zhaonan's phone, impatiently urging:","\"Where are you?\"","On the other end of the phone, Wei Zhaonan's voice sounded a little weak.","\"I'm still in the bathroom, I'm afraid I won't make it in time...\"","Qi Shaobai: \"You...\"","\"Sorry sorry! My bad, my bad!\"","Wei Zhaonan thought Qi Shaobai was going to get angry, so he quickly apologized.","But unexpectedly, Qi Shaobai held back his anger and didn't get mad.","His impatient tone carried a caring sentiment, as he asked:","\"Is it serious, do you need your dad to come take a look?\"","Wei Zhaonan: \"It's not serious, just a minor flesh wound, no worries. The movie's about to start, go on in, don't worry about your boy.\"","Hearing that Wei Zhaonan could still joke around, Qi Shaobai didn't chat more. After a couple words of advice, he hung up.","He started walking towards the theater entrance.","Fiddling with the two tickets in his pocket, he felt a slight regret.","Wasting one ticket.","As he walked, his head hung down, not looking left or right, just at the ground beneath his feet.","Suddenly, he heard someone nearby talking on the phone, very close to him.","It was a pleasant female voice.","\"Yeah, didn't run into him.\"","\"I thought there might be last-minute ticket scalpers, so I came to try my luck.\"","The girl sighed, \"Director Qiu's films are so popular, I should've known no one would be selling extra tickets, oh well.\"","Qi Shaobai casually glanced to the side.","He saw that the person next to him wore white sneakers, her calves fair and smooth, with elegant lines.","Qi Shaobai politely averted his gaze, lightly glancing up.","Right at that moment, the girl had also just hung up with her best friend. Her somewhat deflated expression happened to meet Qi Shaobai's glance.","Sensing his gaze, Chi Xia looked up at just the right time.","Her bright limpid eyes blinked, long lush lashes fluttering gracefully through the air.","Both of them froze for a moment.","A breeze blew by.","The light wind lifted the hem of the boy's t-shirt and the girl's skirt.","Although he wore a mask and hat, Chi Xia still recognized him just from the aloofness in the boy's eyes.","Chi Xia couldn't remember anymore how many times this was.","Ever since he had kindly shown her the way after the high school entrance exam rally at No.1 Middle School in Beijing, they kept running into each other in many places.","She didn't know if he had noticed her.","But Chi Xia had noticed him every time.","He didn't talk much, his eyebrows and eyes were cold and piercing, with a hint of defiance in his demeanor.","When he had no expression, his face looked quite unpleasant.","When chatting with his lively good buddy, he would force a perfunctory smile.","The first time was at the bookstore she frequented.","They were four or five shelves apart.","She stood in front of the math study guides, while he was near the English listening materials.","She recognized him and was about to go over to thank him again for helping with directions last time. But she saw him sling his backpack over one shoulder and head downstairs.","The next time was when she and her bestie happened to enter a cafe.","As soon as they walked in, she saw him sitting in the corner with two boys wearing their middle school uniforms.","He lazily leaned back in his seat with his arms crossed, eyes half-closed, brows slightly furrowed.","The two boys next to him were discussing basketball, but he wasn't participating, seeming uninterested.","Chi Xia heard his companions call him Qi Shao.","She couldn't help but laugh softly.","Qi Shao, what a strange name.","Does it have anything to do with being awesome?","The cafe was bustling, no empty tables downstairs, so she and her bestie sat upstairs.","As soon as they went upstairs, her bestie tugged her sleeve, extremely excited as she asked if Chi Xia had seen that handsome guy sitting in the corner downstairs.","Chi Xia nodded, \"He's the one I told you about before, who helped give me directions after the entrance exam rally.\"","Upon hearing this, her curious and thrilled bestie said, \"It's fate, Xiaxia!\"","Fate? Doesn't seem like it.","It was just a coincidence!","After listening to Chi Xia recount their few chance encounters, her bestie's expression grew more and more convinced.","\"Xiaxia, your meet-cute backstory and frequency of chance encounters could practically be written into a novel!\"","\"Maybe that gloomy guy is your crush preordained by the heavens.\"","At the time, Chi Xia just smiled amusedly, \"Don't spout nonsense, we don't even know each other.\"","Moreover, that guy didn't seem gloomy at all.","Her bestie emphatically declared:","\"Things happen in threes. If you run into each other again, it would definitely be fate, do you believe it or not?\"","She stirred the ice cubes in her cup with a straw.","Did she believe it or not?","On a summer night transitioning into early autumn, the air had shed its sweltering heat.","The clear, refreshing breeze blew between the two of them.","Qi Shaobai halted his steps, his gaze sweeping over the girl's pure and fair face.","He recognized her.","It was her.","That directionally-challenged girl.","He had run into her again.","Including today, it was the fourth time.","He still remembered the previous two scenes.","Once was at the bookstore.","He was selecting English listening materials.","There weren't many people at the bookstore late at night.","It was easy to spot her standing in front of the math study guides.","Qi Shaobai's hand gripping the English listening book paused.","For some reason, although he had only seen this girl once before.","Being seen out buying materials after evening self-study somehow seemed too much like a failing student.","Spurred by some inexplicable psychology, he turned and headed downstairs.","The next time was at the cafe.","Wei Zhaonan and Li Wei from the class next door were discussing the NBA preseason, talking about which new rookies the famous Eastern and Western teams had added.","Wei Zhaonan was a Miami Heat fan, Li Wei was a diehard Denver Nuggets fan. As they chatted, they started boasting about their own teams.","Afraid of rekindling his basketball obsession, Qi Shaobai responded halfheartedly with his arms crossed, only interjecting here and there.","In the end, he simply closed his eyes to listen to their discussion.","Just then, the wind chimes above the cafe door jingled out a crisp ring as the door was pushed open.","Qi Shaobai opened his eyes and glanced towards the sound. His eyes subtly tightened.","\"Qi Shao, who do you think will do better this year, the Heat or the Nuggets?\"","Wei Zhaonan suddenly asked him.","\"Either is fine,\" Qi Shaobai lazily responded. He actually thought the 76ers were the best.","His gaze shifted away. Unintentionally, he saw the girl's eyes curve into a smile.","He didn't know what she had heard that amused her."]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: The Breath That made her feel at Ease","paragraphs":["Outside the cinema, the staff were removing the barriers that had been used to separate the queues.","The movie was about to start.","Qi Shaobai, for some inexplicable reason, reached into his pocket.","When he pulled his hand out, he was holding an extra movie ticket.","He handed it to the girl in front of him.","\"I have an extra ticket. Do you want it?\"","Chi Xia lowered her gaze and saw that it was a ticket for the long-awaited movie \"Burning Desires.\" She was momentarily stunned.","Surprise slowly spread across her fair face.","Happiness shimmered in her beautiful eyes as she looked up at him, her smile reaching the corners of her eyes and lips.","\"Thank you. I'll transfer the money for the ticket to you.\"","She rummaged through her bag, searching for her phone.","\"No need,\" Qi Shaobai replied calmly, his expression unchanged. He tilted his chin slightly, his voice as gentle as the breeze that had just passed.","With his hands in his pockets, he walked forward, taking long strides.","As he brushed past her, he left a sentence by her side:","\"The movie is about to start.\"","Chi Xia hadn't even had a chance to take out her phone when she saw the boy had already walked far ahead.","She pursed her lips.","It was always like this. He did a good deed and then ran off, like Lei Feng.","She turned her head and raised her voice slightly.","\"Wait, I have something for you.\"","The ginkgo leaves on both sides of the road blocked most of the streetlights.","Qi Shaobai headed towards the illuminated intersection, his shadow stretching long.","When he heard the girl calling him, he paused.","He turned around, his voice clear.","\"Let's talk later. Walk faster, or we'll miss the ticket check.\"","The girl smiled, picking up her pace and running past him.","\"Thank you, Lei Feng classmate. I'll treat you to a drink.\"","\"...Lei Feng classmate?\"","\"I'll get you whatever flavor you want, Lei classmate.\"","\"My last name is not Lei, it's Qi.\"","The girl smiled with a hint of mischief. \"I know.\"","The summer heat scattered in disarray, and a refreshing breeze carried the scent of grass and trees.","The voices of the two of them faded into the distance, blending into the evening breeze of late summer.","*","Sheng Mumu held a large bucket of popcorn. Before entering the theater, she couldn't resist eating a few pieces enticed by the sweet aroma.","Qi Mo walked behind her, holding her bag and two cups of orange juice.","On the side, Qiao Li widened her eyes.","She had never seen her cousin carrying someone else's bag before.","It was a scene that challenged her perception, and for a moment, her cousin didn't seem like the cousin she knew.","But then she realized it was his sister-in-law's bag.","Everything made sense again.","She couldn't help but wonder what was going on.","Cheng Zhuo noticed her distraction and, after a few seconds of pondering with his own thoughts, asked, \"What's wrong? Are you debating whether to go to the restroom before the movie starts?\"","Qiao Li was snapped back to reality, looking perplexed. \"......?\"","Without another word, Cheng Zhuo took the popcorn from her hand.","\"Go ahead, there's still time. I'll wait for you at the entrance.\"","Qiao Li smiled helplessly and took back the popcorn.","\"Hurry up and go in, you fool.\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"???\"","The screening hall was the VIP theater of the cinema, with spacious seats totaling about fifty to sixty.","The four of them sat together, in seats that were slightly towards the middle and back.","Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li entered first.","Sheng Mumu sat to the right of Qiao Li, and Qi Mo sat to her right, crossing his long legs with his jacket draped over them.","As Sheng Mumu took her seat, she noticed a couple sitting in the front row, their heads leaning against each other with the armrest between them lifted up.","In the cinema, it was not uncommon to see such intimately close couples, so she didn't think much of it.","She turned her gaze back and was about to place the popcorn on the armrest between her and Qi Mo when someone gently took the popcorn away.","\"I'll hold it,\" Qi Mo's voice was deep and magnetic.","In the next moment, he lifted his wrist and moved the armrest between them up.","With the popcorn bucket resting on his forearm, he leaned in a little closer to her.","Sheng Mumu was momentarily stunned. \"...\"","She glanced at him from the corner of her eye, and a shallow dimple formed on her cheek.","Once again, she silently praised the gentlemanly demeanor that Qi Mo, her fake husband, always displayed.","Where else could she find a movie partner who willingly grabbed the popcorn?","The lights in the cinema suddenly dimmed, and the screen lit up.","The bright light carved out the contours of the man's superior profile, making it even more three-dimensional.","In a trance, she caught a fleeting smirk at the corner of his mouth.","But when she looked again, the man's face had returned to its usual calm expression.","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","Maybe she had mistaken it.","The surrounding noise gradually subsided as two latecomers hurriedly bent down and took their seats a few rows ahead.","The movie began to play.","Her attention was completely absorbed in the plot.","The director's techniques were skillful, and the handheld camera shots were not uncomfortable to watch.","The male and female leads, both newcomers, brought a fresh feeling to the audience.","Everyone was engrossed in the movie, and silence filled the air.","In Sheng Mumu's ears, she could hear the faint sound of fabric rubbing when her shoulder brushed against Qi Mo's.","She reached into the popcorn bucket and grabbed a few pieces.","There was a mix of butter and chocolate flavors.","Like a lottery, she didn't know what flavor she would taste next.","She grabbed another one.","Suddenly, her hand felt a warm touch.","In the cramped popcorn bucket, their backs of the hands touched.","She instinctively turned her head to look, and the man looked calm and composed, as if nothing had happened.","Realizing that the man next to her was also \"drawing lots,\" she chuckled inwardly.","Qi Mo, the CEO who liked sweets.","What a contrast.","As the movie approached its climax, the plot took a sharp turn. The details laid out for the main characters earlier by the director became knives that stabbed the audience's hearts.","Sobs and sniffles could be heard in the cinema.","Gradually, more than half of the audience were moved to tears.","Even the tough girl Qiao Li couldn't escape it.","Qiao Li didn't bring tissues, and without thinking about her image, she used her hand to wipe her face.","When her tears blurred her vision, someone poked her arm.","She turned her head and saw Cheng Zhuo handing her a tissue.","Qiao Li's face was blotchy from crying, and her voice was choked, \"Thank you.\"","Cheng Zhuo didn't seem to be affected by the sad plot at all. He even tried his best to hold back a smile when he saw Qiao Li's teary face.","On the other side,","Sheng Mumu also sniffed.","Qi Mo lowered his gaze and looked at her.","The bright light from the screen reflected his concern in his dark eyes.","Sheng Mumu looked back at him, blinked in confusion, and fluttered her long eyelashes.","Realizing that he might have thought she was crying, she rubbed her arms and glanced at the air conditioner blowing cold air above the theater.","Using body language to communicate, Sheng Mumu, with her high sensitivity to tears, indicated that she was just feeling a bit cold.","The plot was mildly intense, but not enough to make her cry.","As she turned her gaze back to the screen, a cool breath enveloped her.","He draped his coat over her.","Naturally, the slender hands of the man reached out and tightened her collar.","After confirming that no cold air could seep in, he withdrew his gaze and continued watching the movie.","Not a single word was spoken.","Wrapped in his expensive and exquisite coat, the chill gradually dissipated.","Sheng Mumu took a shallow breath.","In the dark environment, her senses were amplified.","The scent of pine lingered around her nose.","Although faint, it felt particularly strong at this moment.","It was the scent she would smell every night.","Something she had grown accustomed to.","An aroma that put her heart at ease."]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: The Pupils Quarrel","paragraphs":["Front row of the screening hall.","Qi Shaobai's eyes were calm and cool as he looked at the big screen.","It was not until the sounds of the audience weeping around him grew more and more obvious that he glanced left and right.","He raised his eyebrows puzzledly, truly unable to understand what there was to cry about.","The plot twist was within his expectations.","The director had long hinted to the audience through camera work and even changes in the background music.","Those tear-jerking moments that made other audiences empathize and feel sad seemed to him the inevitable outcomes of meticulous design, the clues long buried.","Rather than being swayed by the emotional ups and downs of the plot, he was more keen on reasoning out the results from the details.","This was exactly why he appreciated this director.","Worried that his parents might see him turning his head, he pulled up his face mask and warily glanced around with the corner of his eyes.","His indifferent eyes suddenly froze.","Unexpectedly, he found that the girl sitting next to him also had a calm, contemplative look, the same as him.","The movie finally ended and the lights came on.","Spontaneous applause rang out in the screening hall.","Amidst the applause,","the leads, important supporting roles, director, and producer slowly walked out from backstage.","They waved at everyone in greeting.","The staff brought chairs and microphones on stage.","Right after that was the meet-and-greet session after the screening.","The director talked about the original intention of making the film, the leads shared funny anecdotes from the shooting process.","Finally the microphone was passed to the producer. Beaming, the host let the producer pick lucky audience members on site who could ask questions of the creative team.","Seeing the situation was unfavorable, Qi Shaobai hurriedly put on his hat,","trying his best to reduce his presence.","While the front row audience actively volunteered, he lowered his head and quietly walked toward the exit.","Chi Xia was puzzled.","She had been wondering all along why he would wear a mask and hat to watch a movie.","His behavior of leaving early was even more bizarre.","On stage, the producer raised the microphone, his eyes scanning the fans below one by one.","Seeing something, his eyes suddenly widened.","Very quickly his expression returned to normal. He picked an enthusiastic fan in the first row to take questions.","When they came out of the theater, the air was no longer as fresh as when they had arrived.","Stuffy, about to rain.","Sheng Mumu was holding unfinished orange juice, still wearing Qi Mo's coat.","Cheng Zhuo touched his stomach and asked everyone,","\"I'm a little hungry. Shall we go eat a midnight snack together?\"","\"Good.\" Qiao Li's heart had been wounded by the sad plot. She urgently needed good food to recuperate, and was the first to agree to Cheng Zhuo's suggestion.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo also nodded.","Cheng Zhuo remembered there was a Cantonese restaurant near the theater. He suggested going there to eat.","Since it was close, they walked over instead of driving.","On the way, Qiao Li and Cheng Zhuo walked in front.","Cheng Zhuo was mocking Qiao Li for her low tear threshold, while Qiao Li retorted that he was hardhearted for not crying at all.","Arguing with each other, the two of them started bickering.","Walking behind them, Sheng Mumu secretly laughed when she heard their quarrel.","Lowering her voice, she said to the man beside her,","\"Don't they seem like elementary school kids fighting? What do you think?\"","Hearing her words, Qi Mo's gaze followed hers to look at the two people.","The corners of his eyes crinkled, his jaw lightly tapped, agreeing with her thought.","Laughing, Sheng Mumu drank up the remaining orange juice in her cup.","After drinking it all, she looked around.","Not finding a trash can, she continued holding it in her hand.","Just then, the man's hand next to her shifted over, his evenly spaced, well-shaped fingers lifted.","Without thinking, she handed over her empty cup.","A completely reflexive reaction.","Qi Mo naturally took her empty drink cup from her.","He held his hands behind his back, continuing to walk as if nothing had happened.","His low, gentle voice asked:","\"Did you think this movie was good?\"","Sheng Mumu was absorbed in the conversation, and didn't notice at all that she had handed her empty cup to him. She answered:","\"It was good. I really liked several of the scene transitions and the soundtrack.\"","Qi Mo accommodated her pace, walking slower than usual.","His tone was relaxed and casual:","\"Yeah, I thought so too.\"","After Sheng Mumu shared her feelings about the movie, she suddenly held up one finger, as if to emphasize:","\"The best, the best part was—\"","\"The abrupt ending,\" Qi Mo turned his head, his eyes laughing as he looked over to complete her sentence.","\"How did you know I was going to mention this part!?\" Sheng Mumu blinked in disbelief. \"The handling of this ending was too good, leaving room for imagination. Everyone can have different interpretations of it. I loved it so much.\"","The corners of Qi Mo's lips curved up faintly, his handsome side profile chiseled and refined in the night.","\"Yeah, this was my favorite part too.\"","The two chatted as they walked.","From the cinematography of the film to the soundtrack, then to Qi Shaobai's monthly exam tomorrow.","When they passed by a trash can, Qi Mo threw away the drink cup in his hand.","Only then did Sheng Mumu come to a belated realization.","When had he taken her empty drink cup from her?","Strange.","She didn't even notice.","At the Cantonese restaurant Cheng Zhuo recommended, Qiao Li took charge of ordering dishes.","Not because she was good at ordering food.","But because she saw cousin and cousin's wife were still chatting, and didn't want to interrupt them.","Their conversation had somehow swerved back to the movie from Qi Shaobai's monthly exam.","When the dishes arrived, Sheng Mumu rested her cheek on her hand. She tapped her finger on her cheek.","Her brows knitted slightly, pondering as she asked Qi Mo:","\"In your judgment, how much would it cost to invest in this movie?\"","Cheng Zhuo's hand froze in the midst of unwrapping the cutlery when he heard her words.","A familiar feeling from work surfaced.","Sister Sheng was Sister Sheng after all.","Even when watching a movie, she didn't forget to consider its commercial value.","Such entrepreneurial spirit was truly admirable.","Qi Mo's posture was lazy and casual. He leaned back in his chair.","His eyes held obvious appreciation and laughter as he replied in his deep voice:","\"Around there.\"","Just then, a group of people walked into the Cantonese restaurant.","It was the creative team for the movie \"Burning Delusion\".","The four people at the table looked over.","Except for Qi Mo, obvious excitement and delight showed in the eyes of the other three.","They didn't expect to run into celebrities even when getting a midnight snack.","How lucky.","Under the table, Qiao Li squeezed Sheng Mumu's hand.","\"Sister-in-law, I really want to ask Director Qiu for an autograph. I'm his fan.\"","Sheng Mumu squeezed her hand back. \"I also want the leads' autographs. I feel like they're going to become big stars.\"","Autographs were definitely worth a lot of money.","Right at this moment, one person in the creative team caught sight of them and his eyes suddenly brightened.","After saying a few words to the people behind him, the producer came straight over with the director and leads.","As they drew closer and closer, Sheng Mumu and Qiao Li tightened their gripped hands.","Sheng Mumu lowered her voice:","\"Li Li, were we talking too loudly just now? Did they overhear us?\"","Qiao Li's palms grew slightly sweaty:","\"I'm so nervous, sister-in-law. They really seem to be walking this way!\"","The producer approached their table and gave the man with the composed, calm demeanor a polite, respectful smile.","\"Chairman Qi, I was startled to see you in the audience earlier. Didn't expect to run into you again here.\"","\"Thank you so much for investing in our film.\""]}]);
